r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.2776%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Pay Exam Fee</strong></span></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 151.079%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://upsssc.gov.in/Default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.2776%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Submit Final Form</strong></span></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 151.079%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://upsssc.gov.in/Default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.2776%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 151.079%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://upsssc.gov.in/UploadNotices/ADVT_1317.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.2776%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 151.079%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://upsssc.gov.in/Default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here </strong></a></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710066466-UPSSSC Mandi Parishad Various Post Recruitment 2015 Supplementary Result.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-07 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(68, 'Rajasthan RPSC Physical Training Instructor  Librarian Recruitment 2024 Apply Online for 40 Post', 'Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC) has released the Advt. 18/2023-24 for PTI and Librarian (Sanskrit College Education) - 2024 Recruitment 2024. Those Candidates Are Interested with Vacancy Can Apply Online from 12/03/2024 to 10/04/2024. For', '<table border=\"2\" width=\"70%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 210.967%;\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ab0e1ebd;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</strong></span></h1>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #0aa7eb;\"><strong><strong>RPSC </strong>Rajasthan Physical Training Instructor &amp; Librarian Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #111592bc;\"><strong>RPSC Exam Advt No. : 16/2023-24 :&nbsp; Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.9419%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌Important Dates</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Application Begin :<strong> 12/03/2024 </strong></li>\r\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 10/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<strong> 10/04/2024 </strong></li>\r\n<li>Exam Date : <strong>as per Schedule </strong></li>\r\n<li>Admit Card Available : <strong>Notified Soon</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.025%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌Application Fee</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>General / Other State : <strong>600/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>OBC / BC : <strong>400/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>SC / ST : <strong>400/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>Correction Charge : <strong>500/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Cash at Rajasthan E Mitra Portal or Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking<strong> </strong></li>\r\n<li>From 19 April 2023 onwards only one time fee will be charged for all the exams of Rajasthan</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 210.967%;\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌Rajasthan PTI / Librarian Notification 2024: </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on</strong><strong> 01/01/2025</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years</strong></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years</strong></li>\r\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per Rajasthan Public Service Commission RPSC&nbsp;Advt. 18/2023-24 for PTI and Librarian (Sanskrit College Education) - 2024 Exam Recruitment Rules.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 210.967%;\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌RPSC PTI / Librarian Recruitment 2024 : </strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Vacancy Details Total : 40 Post</span> </strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.4144%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Post Name</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 55.5264%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Total Post</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.026%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>RPSC PTI and Librarian Eligibility</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.4144%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Physical Training Instructor PTI</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 55.5264%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">20</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.026%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Master Degree in Physical Education and Sports OR Physical Education OR Sports Science with 55% Marks.</li>\r\n<li>NET / SLET / SET Exam Passed</li>\r\n<li>Knowledge of Rajasthani Culture.</li>\r\n<li>More Details Read the Notification.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.4144%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Librarian</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 55.5264%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">20</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.026%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Master Degree in Library Science / Information Science / Documentation Science with Minimum 55% Marks.</li>\r\n<li>Passed / NET / SLET / SET Exam.</li>\r\n<li>Knowledge of Rajasthani Culture.</li>\r\n<li>More Details Read the Notification.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 210.967%;\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">RPSC PTI &amp; Librarian Jobs 2024 :&nbsp;</span> Category Wise Vacancy Details </strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<p><strong>PTI : General : 10 | EWS : 01 | SC : 03 | ST : 02 | OBC : 04 |&nbsp; MBC : 0 |&nbsp; Total : 20 Post</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Librarian : General : 10 | EWS : 01 | SC : 03 | ST : 02 | OBC : 04 |&nbsp; MBC : 0 |&nbsp; Total : 20 Post</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 210.967%;\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\"><center><!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 300px; height: 0px;\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9222595088627935\" data-ad-slot=\"5663