;oid=2&amp;pvsid=2911352361134963&amp;tmod=1547055080&amp;wsm=1&amp;uas=0&amp;nvt=1&amp;fc=1920&amp;brdim=0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C1536%2C0%2C1536%2C816%2C1488%2C708&amp;vis=1&amp;rsz=d%7C%7CeEbr%7C&amp;abl=CS&amp;pfx=0&amp;fu=0&amp;bc=31&amp;bz=1.03&amp;psd=W251bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDNd&amp;ifi=3&amp;uci=a!3&amp;btvi=1&amp;fsb=1&amp;dtd=97\" name=\"aswift_2\" width=\"300\" height=\"0\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" sandbox=\"allow-forms allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation\" data-google-container-id=\"a!3\" data-google-query-id=\"CNH_uM3f4YQDFQgtewcdABkPSQ\" data-load-complete=\"true\" data-gtm-yt-inspected-6=\"true\"></iframe></div>\r\n</ins></center>\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔎How to Fill RPSC PTI / Librarian Exam Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></em></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Rajasthan Public Service Commission RPSC Physical Training Instructor PTI and LIbrarian Recruitment 2024, Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>12/03/2024 to 10/04/2024.</strong></li>\r\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Vacancies Application Form in Govt. Jobs of RPSC Advt. 18/2023-24 for PTI and Librarian (Sanskrit College Education) - 2024 Latest Govt. Recruitment Online Form 2024</li>\r\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\r\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\r\n<li>Before Apply Online / Submit Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Columns Carefully.</li>\r\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If you have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\r\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 210.967%;\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>🔗&nbsp; &nbsp;Some Useful Important Links &nbsp; 👇</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.9407%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"359\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.026%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online RPSC PTI and Librarian 2024 Registration through SSO ID\" href=\"https://sso.rajasthan.gov.in/signin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Link Activate 12/03/2024</a></strong></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.9407%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"359\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.026%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"RPSC PTI and Librarian Notification 2024\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/Static/RecruitmentAdvertisements/70CF848680DB4ED0A9AE0B879CE9D61C.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.9407%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"359\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 132.026%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"RPSC Rajasthan Public Service Commission Official Website\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/advertisements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RPSC Official Website</a></strong></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710066748-Rajasthan RPSC Physical Training Instructor Librarian Recruitment 2024 Apply Online for 40 Post.webp', '17', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-07 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(69, 'SSC One Time Registration OTR Online Form 2024', 'Staff Selection Commission has launched its new website SSC.GOV.in, in which all the candidates will have to do Fresh One Time Registration (OTR). Now applications for all future recruitments will be through this OTR. Any candidate who had registered', '<table border=\"2\" width=\"70%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #1d07e7;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓Staff Selection Commission (SSC) </strong></span></h1>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #e809b4;\"><strong>SSC One Time Registration OTR Registration 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #a6cd0ad1;\"><strong>SSC OTR 2024 | Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌Important Dates</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>22/02/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Last Date for Registration : <strong>NA</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌Application Fee</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <strong>0/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>SC / ST : <strong>0/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>No Application Fees</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SSC OTR Eligibility</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>One time registration is necessary only for those who want to appear in any SSC recruitment in future. With the help of this registration, the candidate will save a lot of time while applying.</li>\r\n<li>No Age Limit in SSC OTR Registration.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">SSC Popular Vacancy&nbsp;</span> </strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>SSC Combined Graduate Level CGL Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC Multi Tasking Staff MTS Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC Selection Post Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC Constable GD Recruitment Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC Delhi Police Constable Recruitment Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC Delhi Police Sub Inspector Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC CPO SI Recruitment Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC CHSL 10+2 Recruitment Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC Stenographer Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC Junior Engineer JE Exam</li>\r\n<li>SSC Junior Hindi Translator JHT Exam</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔎How to Apply SSC <strong>One Time Registration OTR Online Form 2024</strong> </strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Staff Selection Commission SSC issued a notice on 22 February 2024 saying that they have launched a new website SSC Gov in, in which all the candidates will have to do fresh one time registration (OTR)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 1 :</strong> Open the Website ssc.gov.in or Direct Link Will be in this Page Some Useful Important Links Section</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 2 : </strong>Click on New Registration Tab<strong> </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 3 : </strong>Students will have to give their basic information such as: Name, Father\'s Name, Mother\'s Name, Mobile Number, Email Id and High School Class 10 Roll Number.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 4 :</strong> Verify Your OTR Profile Details &amp; Submit Registration.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 5 : </strong>An OTP will be received on the registered email and registered mobile number of the candidate, he will have to enter it.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 6 : </strong>The registration Part I process will be completed, the candidate will see the OTR Registration No. on the screen.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 7 :&nbsp;</strong>In the next step, you will have to change the default password which has been received on your email, after that you will have to login by writing the registration number along with the password which has been received on the email.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 9 :&nbsp;</strong>Candidates should change the default password of OTR registration number with their custom password. Use capital letters, small letters, numbers and special characters while creating the new password which should be at least 08 digits.&nbsp;Additionally, two security questions will also have to be selected, so that if you forget your password in future, you can recover your password with the help of the security question.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 10 : &nbsp;</strong>After changing the password, the candidate will have to login again, after that the information about his nationality, category, Visible Identification Mark and information about permanent and local address will be entered in the form.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 11 : </strong>The last step is that here you have to first double check all the information by clicking on the preview button of OTR, after checking, if there is any error then correct it, otherwise click on the declare button and submit the form finally.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 12 : </strong>The registration process of SSC OTR has now been completed, the candidate will be able to see the dashboard whenever any new recruitment comes, or the candidate can also get the information about admit card and result by logging into the SSC dashboard.</li>\r\n<li>Our team has also shown a video on how to do SSC one time registration, which you can watch and do your new registration by following the step by step process: <strong>SSC OTR Registration Kaise Kare Video Dekhe</strong> <a title=\"SSC OTR Registration Kaise Kare 2024\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WRhTrWKJ6As\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>(Watch Video)</strong></a></li>\r\n<li>For more information, you have to complete the notice issued to SSC OTR.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔗🔗&nbsp; Some Useful Important Links&nbsp; &nbsp;👇👇</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"379\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Apply Online (OTR) </strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"SSC OTR Registration 2024\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/candidate-portal/one-time-registration/home-page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Registration</a> | <a title=\"SSC OTR Registration 2024\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Login</a></strong></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"379\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>How to SSC OTR Registration (Video Hindi)</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"SSC OTR Registration Kaise Kare 2024\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WRhTrWKJ6As\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here </a></strong></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"379\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Download OTR Notification</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"SSC OTR Notification PDF \" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/SSCFileServer/PortalManagement/UploadedFiles/OTR_Notice_22022024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here </a></strong></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"379\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<h3 align=\"center\"><a title=\"SSC Official Website \" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>SSC Official Website</strong></a></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710066769-SSC One Time Registration OTR Online Form 2024.webp', '17', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-07 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(71, 'UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Recruitment 2024 Apply Online for 1930 Posts', 'Union Public Service Commission (UPSC) Employees State Insurance Corporation ESIC Nursing Officer Examination 2024. Those candidates who are interested in this UPSC Nursing Officer in ESIC recruitment can apply online from 07 March 2024 to 27 March 2', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\" width=\"70%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(7, 99, 226);\"><strong>Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</strong></span></h1>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #e6b70b;\"><strong>UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(7, 26, 234);\"><strong>UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Advt No. : 52/2024 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>07/03/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>27/03/2024 upto 06 PM Only.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<strong> 27/03/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Correction Date :<strong> 28/03/2024 to 03/04/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Pen &amp; Paper Based Exam Date : <strong>07/07/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Admit Card Available : <strong>Before Exam</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>General / OBC / EWS: <strong>25/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>SC / ST : <strong>0/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>PH <strong>: 0/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>All Category Female :<strong> 0/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI / Offline E Challan Only.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Notification 2024 : <span style=\"color: red;\">Age Limit as on 27/03/2024</span></strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years</strong></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>30 Years </strong></li>\r\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per UPSC Employees State Insurance Corporation ESIC Nursing Officer Recruitment Rules 2024.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Recruitment 2024 : </span>Vacancy Details </strong><strong>Total : 1930 Post</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Post Name</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Total Post</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Eligibility </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Nursing Officer in Employees State Insurance Corporation ESIC</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">1930</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"10\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Nursing (B.Sc Nursing) University in India <strong>OR</strong> Diploma in General Nursing Mid-Wifery GNM with 1 Year Experience.</li>\r\n<li>Registered in State Nursing Council.</li>\r\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Exam 2024 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: red;\">Category Wise Details</span></strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Post Name</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>UR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>OBC</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>EWS</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>SC</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>ST</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>PH</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Total</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Nursing Officer in ESIC</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">892</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">446</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">193</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">235</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">164</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">168*</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">1930</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>How to Fill UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Vacancy 2024 Online Form</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Photo Instruction :</strong> The photo of the candidate should not be more than 10 days old and the name of the candidate and the date of taking the photo should also be written on the photo.</li>\r\n<li>Union Public Service Commission UPSC &nbsp;Employees State Insurance Corporation ESIC Nursing Officer&nbsp; Recruitment 2024 Advt No. 52/2024 (Special) . Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>07/03/2024 to 27/03/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Jobs Application Form in UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Latest UPSC Job Recruitment 2024.</li>\r\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\r\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\r\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\r\n<li>If Candidate Are Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Pay and Complete Your Form</li>\r\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Apply Online (OTR)</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online UPSC EESIC Nursing Officer Registration\" href=\"https://upsconline.nic.in/upsc/OTRP/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>How to Registration (Video Hindi)</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"UPSC OTR Registration Kaise Kare 2022\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GXuJ_raAsIU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Notification PDF\" href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/sites/default/files/AdvtNo-52-2024-Spcl-NrsngOfcr-engl-070324.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>UPSC Official Website</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"UPSC Official Website 2024\" href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/whats-new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here </a></strong></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710066678-UPSC ESIC Nursing Officer Recruitment 2024 Apply Online for 1930 Posts.webp', '15', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-08 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(72, 'Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024', 'Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024 ', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024&nbsp;</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content cf\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024: </strong></span>यदि आपने भी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;जवाहर नवोदय विघालय मे, 9वीं कक्षा में दाखिले हेतु&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;प्रवेश परीक्षा दी थी और अपने &ndash; अपने&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिजल्ट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के जारी होने का&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;बेसब्री&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;से&nbsp;<strong>इंतजार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर रहे है तो आपके इंतजार की घड़िया समाप्त हो चुकी है क्योंकि&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिजल्ट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को जारी कर दिया गया है और इसीलिए हम, आपको विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>NVS Class 9th Result 2024</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बतायेगें जिसकी पूरी विस्तृ़त जानकारी प्राप्त करने हेतु हमारे साथ बने रहना होगा।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">यहां पर हम, आपको बताना चाहते है कि,&nbsp;<strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya 9th Result 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक करने के लिए हमारे सभी स्टूडेंट्स को अपने साथ अपना&nbsp;<strong>रोल नंबर व जन्म तिथि&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को तैयार रखना होगा ताकि आप बिना किसी समस्या के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिजल्ट&nbsp;</strong> को चेक कर सके और इसका पूरा &ndash; पूरा लाभ प्राप्त कर सके तथा</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">अन्त,&nbsp; आर्टिकल के अन्ति चरण मे हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong> प्रदान करेगें ताकि आप सुविधापूर्वक इसी प्रकार के&nbsp; आर्टिकल्स को&nbsp; प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Navodaya_Vidyalaya_Class_9th_Result_2024_%E2%80%93_Overview\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 46.7911%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Name of the Samiti</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 53.2222%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Jawahar Navoday Vidyalay Samiti</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 46.7911%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Name of the Article</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 53.2222%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 46.7911%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Type of Article</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 53.2222%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Result</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 46.7911%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Class</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 53.2222%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>9th</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 46.7911%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Live Status of Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 53.2222%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Released and Live to Check &amp; Download</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 46.7911%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024 Release On?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 53.2222%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>31st March, 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इस आर्टिकल मे हम, आप सभी स्टूडेंट्स का <strong>हार्दिक स्वागत&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना चाहते है जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नवोदय विद्यालय समिति&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;9वीं कक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;स्टूडेंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;है और&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिजल्ट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के जारी होने का&nbsp;<strong>इंतजार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर रह है तो हम, आपको इस आर्टिकल की मदद से विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024&nbsp;</strong>को लेकर तैयार&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिपोर्ट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बतायेगे जिसकी पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त करने हेतु हमारे साथ बने रहना होगा ताकि आप इस पूरे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिपोर्ट&nbsp;</strong> का लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">दूसरी तऱफ हम, आपको बताना चाहते है कि,<strong>&nbsp;NVS Class 9th Result 2024&nbsp;</strong>को चेक करने हेतु हमारे सभी&nbsp; स्टूडेंट्स को&nbsp;<strong>ऑनलाइन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;फॉलो&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा जिसमे आपको कोई समसया ना हो इसके लिए हम, आपको विस्तार से&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>पूरी प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बतायेगे ताकि आप बिना किसी समस्या के&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>9वीं कक्षा</strong>&nbsp; के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिजल्ट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक कर सके और इसका लाभ&nbsp; प्राप्त कर सके तथा</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">अन्त,&nbsp; आर्टिकल के अन्ति चरण मे हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong> प्रदान करेगें ताकि आप सुविधापूर्वक इसी प्रकार के&nbsp; आर्टिकल्स को&nbsp; प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Check_Downlaod_Navodaya_Vidyalaya_Class_9th_Result_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Check &amp; Downlaod Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">आप सभी विद्यार्थी आसानी से अपने &ndash; अपने कक्षा 9वीं के रिजल्ट को चेक कर सकते है जिसकी पूरी ऑनलाइन प्रक्रिया कुछ इस प्रकार से हैं &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya&nbsp;<a href=\"https://biharhelp.in/bihar-police-constable-recruitment-exam-new-date-2024/\">Class 9th Result 2024</a></strong>&nbsp;को चेक&nbsp;व डाउनलोड करने के लिए सबसे पहले आप सभी विद्यार्थियो को इसकी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://navodaya.gov.in/nvs/en/Home1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">ऑफिशियल वेबसाइट</a>&nbsp;</strong>के होम &ndash; पेज पर आना होगा जो कि, इस प्रकार का होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इस पेज पर आने के बाद आपको<strong>&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://cbseit.in/cbse/2024/NVS_RST/ResClsIX.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click here to check the result of class IX Lateral Entry Selection Test-2024</strong></a>&nbsp;का विकल्प मिलेगा जिस पर आपको क्लिक करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">क्लिक करने के बाद आपके सामने इसका&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिजल्ट पेज&nbsp;</strong>खुल जायेगा जो कि, इस प्रकार का होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">अब यहां पर आप सभी स्टूडेंट्स को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;अपनी कुछ जानकारीयो को दर्ज करना होगा औऱ</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">अन्त में, आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;चेक रिजल्ट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के विकल्प पर क्लिक कर देना होगा जिसके बाद आपको आपका रिजल्ट दिखा दिया जायेगा जिसे आप आसानी से चेक करके डाउनलोड कर सकते है और इसका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकते है।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">अन्त, इस प्रकार आप सभी विद्यार्थी आसानी से अपने &ndash; अपने रिजल्ट को चेक व डाउनलोड कर सकते है।</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Conclusion\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></span></em></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इस आर्टिकल मे हमने,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नवोदय विद्यालय&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>9वीं कक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;स्टूडेंट्स&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को विस्तार से ना केवल&nbsp;<strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बताया बल्कि हमने आपको विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;9वीं कक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिजल्ट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक करने की पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी&nbsp; प्रदान की ताकि आप सुविधापूर्वक&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिजल्ट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक कर सकें और&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;सफलता&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;प्राप्त कर सके तथा</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">अन्त, परीक्षा मे, आपकी निश्चित सफलता की कामना करते हुए हम उम्मीद करते है कि, आपको हमारा यह आर्टिकल बेहद पंसद आया होगा जिसके लिए आप हमारे इस आर्टिकल को लाइक, शेयर व कमेंट करेगे।</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A3_%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B8\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>महत्वपूर्ण लिंक्स</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.097%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Direct Link to Check Navodaya Vidyalaya Class 9th Result 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.9164%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://cbseit.in/cbse/2024/NVS_RST/ResClsIX.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.097%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Direct Link of 6th Result Download</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.9164%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://biharhelp.in/navodaya-6th-class-result-2024/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a>&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.097%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.9164%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://navodaya.gov.in/nvs/en/Home1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1711872931-navoday.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-08 00:00:00', '2024-04-03 03:36:49', NULL, NULL),
(74, 'NTA Uttarakhand High Court UKHC Junior Assistant and Stenographer Recruitment 2024 Admit Card for 139 Post', 'National Testing Agency and High Court of Uttarakhand has relased Junior Assistant and Stenographer Recruitment 2024. Those candidates who are interested in this UKHC Junior Assistant and Stenographer recruitment can Download Admit Card. Read the not', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgba(9, 48, 223, 0.67); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>National Testing Agency | High Court of Uttarakhand </strong></span></h1>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 192, 13); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>NTA Uttarakhand High Court Junior Assistant / Stenographer Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(11, 189, 224); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>NTA NHB Recruitment 2023-24 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>25/01/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 22/02/2024 upto 5PM </strong></span></li>\r\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong>23/02/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Exam Date : <strong>17/03/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Admit Card Available : <strong>08/03/2024</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Gen (UR) / OBC : <strong>1000/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>EWS : <strong>500/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>SC / ST : <strong>500/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Only.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>NTA Uttarakhand High Court Junior Assistant and Stenographer Notification 2024 : <span style=\"color: red;\">Age Limit as on 01/01/2024</span></strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years </strong></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>35 Years </strong></li>\r\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per NTA Uttarakhand High Court, Nainital Junior Assistant and Stenographer Recruitment Rules.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>NTA Uttarakhand High Court Junior Assistant / Stengorapher Recruitment 2024: </strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Vacancy Details Total : 139 Post </strong></span></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Post Name</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Total Post</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>NTA Uttarakhand High Court Eligibility</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Junior Assistant</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">57</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\r\n<li>Computer Hindi Typing 25 WPM</li>\r\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Stenographer</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">82</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</li>\r\n<li>Stenographer Hindi Speed : 80 WPM</li>\r\n<li>Computer Hindi Typing 25 WPM</li>\r\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Uttarakhand High Court JA / Steno Exam 2024 : District Details </strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Almoda, Ranikhet, Champawat, Pithorgarh, Nainital, Haldwani, Rudrapur, Khatima, Bageshwar, Podi, Shrinagar, Kotdwar, Gopeshwar, Tehri, Rudra Prayag, Uttar Kashi, Dehradun, Rishikesh, Haridwar &amp; Roorke.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>How to Fill NTA Uttarakhand High Court Exam Online Form 2024</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>National Testing Agency NTA Conducted Uttarakhand High Court, Nainital Various Post Recruitment Examination 2024 Online Form Candidate Apply Between <strong>25 January 2024 to 18 February 2024.</strong></li>\r\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in NTA Uttarakhand High Court Junior Assistant and Stenographer Latest Career Jobs.</li>\r\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\r\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to National Horticulture Board Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\r\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\r\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\r\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NTA UK High Court Recruitment Admit Card 2024\" href=\"https://uhcrec.ntaonline.in/admitcard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a> </strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online NTA UK High Court Recruitment Registration 2024\" href=\"https://uhcrec.ntaonline.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a> </strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><a title=\"NTA Uttarakhand High Court JA Steno Notification 2024\" href=\"https://uhcrec.ntaonline.in/public/uploads/High-Court-Uttarakhand-Information-Bulletin.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>NTA UK High Court Official Website</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><a title=\"NTA UK HC Official Website\" href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/UKHC/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>NTA UK High Court Website</strong></a></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Uttarakhand High Court Official Website\" href=\"https://highcourtofuttarakhand.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Uttarakhand High Court Official Website</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710066413-NTA Uttarakhand High Court UKHC Junior Assistant and Stenographer Recruitment 2024 Admit Card for 139 