=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><em><a title=\"Rajasthan PTET 2024 Registration\" href=\"www.ptetvmou2024.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></em></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 61.5667px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(45, 194, 107); width: 24.762%; height: 61.5667px;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">Download Notification</span> </strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(45, 194, 107); width: 75.2796%; height: 61.5667px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><em><strong><a title=\"Rajasthan PTET 2024 Notification PDF\" href=\"http://www.ptetvmou2024.com/pTet2024/pTet2024/JnVDownlaod.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></em></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 61.5667px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(45, 194, 107); width: 24.762%; height: 61.5667px;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Official Website</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(45, 194, 107); width: 75.2796%; height: 61.5667px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><em><a title=\"MVOU Official Website\" href=\"www.ptetvmou2024.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>PTET Official Website</strong></a></em></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710066701-MVOU Kota Rajasthan PTET 2 Year BEd and 4 Year BEd Courses Admissions 2024 Apply Online Form.webp', '15', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-08 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
