</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.5081%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">from 2.96 Meter</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.7441%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">from 2.04 Meter</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.7732%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Gola Fek</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.5081%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">from 3.83 Meter</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 69.7441%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">from 2.85 Meter</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.025%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">For MP Police Constable 2023 Post Wise PET Details Read the Rule Book</span> </strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.025%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong> MPESB MP Police Constable Recruitment</strong><strong> Test 2023 Exam District Details</strong></span></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Anuppur, Alirajpur, Ashok Nagar, Aagar Malwa, Indore, Ujjain, Umaria, Katni, Khandwa, Khargaon, Guna, Gwalior, Chatarpur, Chindwada, Jabalpur, Jhabua, Tikamgarh, Dindori, Datia, Damoh, Dhar, Narsinghpur, Niwadi, Neemach, Panna, Badhwani, Balaghat, Burhanpur, Betul, Bhind, Bhopal, Mandla, Mandsaur, Murena, Rajgarh, Raesen, Rewa, Ratlam, Vidisha, Shahdol, Shahjahanpur, Govt Rail Police Indore, Jabalpur, Bhopal, Shivpuri, Seoyoh, Satna, Sagar, Singrauli, Siwani, Sidhi, Sehore, Harda &amp; Hoshangabad</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.025%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔎 How to Fill MP Police Constable Online Form 2023</strong></span></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Madhya Pradesh Employee Selection Board for the Constable Recruitment Test- 2023 The applications of Recruitment will be online from <strong>26 June 2023 to 10 July 2023</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">To apply in Madhya Pradesh Professional Board, the candidate has to first create a profile of himself. To create a profile, the candidate wants to have Aadhar card number and also want to have registered mobile number in it, only then there will be E-KYC in the profile, those whose mobile number is not registered, they will have to create a profile through biometric through MP Online Kiosk.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">For the application of recruitment in Madhya Pradesh Professional Board, along with the profile, all the candidates will also have to register in the Madhya Pradesh Employment Office.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">For More Details Read the Full Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.025%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔗&nbsp; Some Useful Important Links &nbsp;👇</strong><