(78, 'UPSC Combined Geo Scientist Examination 2024 Pre Result for 56 Post', 'Union Public Service Commission UPSC has released the Combined Geo Scientist Examination 2024. Those Candidate Are Enrolled with Vacancy Can Download the Result. Read the notification for recruitment eligibility, post information, selection procedure', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px double rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\" width=\"50%\" cellspacing=\"1px\" cellpadding=\"3px\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 86, 240); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</strong></span></h1>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPSC Combined Geo Scientist CGSE Recruitment 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPSC Exam Notice No.. 02/2024 GEOL Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"338\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌Important Dates</strong></span></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>20/09/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>10/10/2023 06:00 PM Only</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Last Date for Fee Payment : <strong>10/10/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Correction / Modification : <strong>11-17 October 2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Pre Exam Date : <strong>18/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Admit Card Available :<strong>&nbsp; 09/02/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Pre Result Available : <strong>08/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Mains Exam Date<strong> : 22/06/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"300\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">📌Application Fee</span></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">General / OBC : <strong>200/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">SC / ST / PH : 0/- <strong>(Nil)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">All Category Female : <strong>0/- (Exempted)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking in Various State Bank and E Challan Fee Mode</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>UPSC Geologist 2024 Exam <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Total : 56 Post :<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"> Age Limit as on</span> 01/01/2024</span> </strong></span></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Cat</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Age Limit</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>UPSC Geologist Eligibility 2024 </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">I</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Geologist Group A</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">34</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">21-32</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Passed / Appearing Master Degree Geological Science or Geology or Applied Geology or Geo-Exploration or Mineral Exploration or Engineering Geology or Marine Geology or Earth Science or Any Other Equivalent Degree</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">I</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Geophysicist Group A</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">01</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">21-32</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Passed / Appearing Master Degree in Science in Following Stream Physics / Applied Physics / Geophysics / Marine Geophysics or Any Other Equivalent Degree</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">I</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Chemist Group A</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">13</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">21-32</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Master Degree in Science M.Sc Chemistry / Applied Chemistry / Analytical Chemistry Passed / Appearing in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">II</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Scientist B (Hydrogeology, Chemical, Geophysics)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">08</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">21-32</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Passed / Appearing (Final Year) Master degree&nbsp; in&nbsp; Geology&nbsp; or&nbsp; Applied&nbsp; Geology&nbsp; or&nbsp; Marine&nbsp; Geology or Any Equivalent Degree in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h4 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">🔎&nbsp; How to Fill UPSC Geo-Scientist Exam 2024 Online Form&nbsp;</span></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Union Public Service Commission UPSC Geo Scientist 2024 Examination. Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>20/09/2023 to 10/10/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Jobs Application Form in UPSC Geo Scientist Pre Exam