r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1709949297-Railway Recruitment Board RRB Technician CEN 02-2024 Apply Online for 9144 Post.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-09 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(82, 'Bihar BSPHCL Technical Grade 3 Junior Account Clerk Store Assistant Junior Engineer Assistant Engineer Recruitment 2024 Apply Online for 2610 Post', 'Bihar State Power Holding Company Ltd BSPHCL has released the advertisement of Technical Grade 3, Junior Account Clerk, Store Assistant, Junior Engineer, Assistant Engineer Recruitment Exam Vacancy 2024. Those Candidates Are Interested with Vacancy C', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 80%; border-spacing: 0px; border: 2px ridge rgb(126, 140, 141); height: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"13\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(132, 63, 161); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓&nbsp; Bihar State Power Holding Company Ltd BSPHCL</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 19, 19); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong>Bihar BSPHCL Technical Grade III &amp; Other Various Post Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 45, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong>BSPHCL Advt No. 01-05/2024 &nbsp;:&nbsp; Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace;\">Application Begin : <strong>01/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 30/04/2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<strong> 30/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace;\">Exam Date :<strong> May / June 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace;\">General / BC / EBC : <strong>1500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace;\">SC / ST : <strong>375/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking.<strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"13\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Bihar BSPHCL Notification 2024: </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 31/03/2024</strong></span></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><spa