(92, 'PRL Assistant  Junior Personal Assistant Recruitment 2024', 'Physical Research Laboratory PRL has released the advertisement of Assistant and Junior Personal Assistant JPA Post Recruitment Exam Vacancy 2024. Those Candida', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px dotted rgb(185, 106, 217);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(16, 213, 197, 0.601);\">👨&zwj;🎓&nbsp; Physical Research Laboratory PRL</span> </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 240, 52); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>PRL Assistant &amp; Junior Personal Assistant Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 71, 207); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>PRL Advt No. : 05/2024 Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Application Begin <strong>: 09/03/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Last Date for Apply Online <strong>:<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> 31/03/2024 upto 05 PM</span> </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Pay Examination Fee Last Date : <strong>31/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Exam Date <strong>: as per Schedule</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Admit Card Available <strong>: Before Exam </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">General / OBC / EWS<strong> : 500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">SC / ST PH: <strong>500</strong><strong>/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">All Category Female : <strong>500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Fees OR UPI.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong>Note : After the Appear Stage I Exam Application Fee Refunded.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">General / OBC / EWS Refund : <strong>400/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">SC / ST / Female / EXs : <strong>500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>PRL Assistant &amp; JPA Notification 2024 : </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 31/03/2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp; <strong>18 Years. </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Maximum Age :<strong> 28 Years. </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Physical Research Laboratory PRL Assistant &amp; JPA Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>PRL Assistant and JPA Recruitment 2024 : </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy Details Total : 16 Post</strong></span></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong>PRL Assistant and JPA Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Assistant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">10</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Bachelor Degree with Minimum 60% Marks in Any Recognized University in India with Proficiency Use of Computers.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Junior Personal Assistant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">06</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Bachelor Degree with Minimum 60% Marks in Any Recognized University in India with English Stenographer 60WPM and&nbsp; Proficiency Use of Computers. <strong>OR</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Diploma in Commercial / Secretarial Practice with 60% Marks, 1 Year Experience as Steno Typist / Stenographer and English Stenographer 60WPM and Proficiency Use of Computers.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>PRL Assistant / JPA Recruitment 2024 :<span style=\"color: rgb(244, 13, 25); text-decoration: underline;\">&nbsp; Exam District Details </span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Lucknow, Delhi, Ahmedabad, Bangalore, Chandigarh, Hyderabad, Kolkata, Shillong, Thruvananthapuram and Udaipur.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔎 How to Fill&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(244, 13, 25); text-decoration: underline;\">PRL Assistant &amp; JPA</span> Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Physical Research Laboratory PRL Ahemdabad Are Issued Notification for Assistant &amp; Junior Personal Assistant Recruitment in Assistant and JPA Jobs 2024 Candidate Can Apply Between<strong> 09/03/2024 to 31/03/2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in PRL Latest Recruitment 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔗&nbsp; Some Useful Important Links &nbsp;👇<br></strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong><a title=\"PRL Assistant and JPA Registration Link\" href=\"https://www.prl.res.in/OPAR/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong><a title=\"PRL Assistant and JPA Notification PDF\" href=\"https://www.prl.res.in/~notices/websitedocs/2024/03/08/Advertisement_Assistant_JPA-2024-08-03-2024-15-57-38.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace;\"><strong><a title=\"PRL Official Website 2024\" href=\"https://www.prl.res.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PRL Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1709999172-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-09 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, 'Bihar SHS Community Health Officer CHO Recruitment 2024', 'Bihar State Health Society SHS has released the advertisement of Community Health Officer CHO 4500 Post Recruitment Exam Vacancy 2024. Those Candidates Are Inte', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px groove rgb(241, 196, 15);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgba(114, 223, 85, 0.552); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓 Bihar State Health Society (SHS)&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgba(46, 219, 167, 0.29); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Bihar Community Health Officer CHO Recruitment 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(209, 204, 57); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Bihar SHS CHO Exam Advt No. : 03/2024 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Application Begin <strong>: 01/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Last Date for Apply Online <strong>:<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> 30/04/2024 upto 06 PM Only. </span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Pay Examination Fee Last Date : <strong>30/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Exam Date <strong>: As per Schedule </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Admit Card Available <strong>: Notified Soon </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">General / OBC / EWS<strong> : 500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>250/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">All Category Female : <strong>250/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Pay the Exam Fees Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Mode.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Bihar CHO Notification 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Age Limit as on</span> <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">01/01/2024</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Minimum Age <strong>: 21 Years.&nbsp; </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Maximum Age <strong>: 42 Years. </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Bihar SHS Community Health Officer CHO Jobs 2027 Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SHS </strong>Bihar CHO Recruitment 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Vacancy Details</span></span> </strong><strong>Total : 4500 Post</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>UR :</strong> 0 | <strong>EWS :</strong> 145 | <strong>EWS (F) :</strong> 78 | <strong>EBC :</strong> 1345 | <strong>EBC (F)</strong> 331 | <strong>BC :</strong> 702 | <strong>BC(F) :</strong>&nbsp; 259 | <strong>SC :</strong> 1279 |<strong> SC (F)</strong> : 230 | <strong>ST :</strong> 95 | <strong>ST (F) :</strong> 36 | <strong>Total :</strong> 4500 Post</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Total</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Bihar CHO Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Community Health Officer (CHO)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">B.SC Nursing / Post Basic B.SC Nursing with CCH Course <strong>OR</strong> General Nurse and Midwifery GNM with Certification Course in Community Health <strong>OR</strong> B.SC Nursing / Post Basic B.Sc Nursing with Certificate Course in Community Health.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔎&nbsp; How to<span style=\"color: rgb(244, 13, 25); text-decoration: underline;\"> Fill Bihar SHSB CHO </span>Recruitment 2024 Online Form</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">State Health Society SHSB Bihar, Community Health Officer CHO Recruitment Advt NO. : 03/2024 Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>01/04/2024 to 30/04/2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Vacancies Application Form in Govt. Jobs of Bihar SHSB Latest Govt. Recruitment Online 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Before Apply Online / Submit Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If you have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔗&nbsp; Some Useful Important Links &nbsp;👇<br></strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online Bihar CHO Exam 2024\" href=\"https://shs.bihar.gov.in//advertisement_details?id=MTQz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Link Activate 01/04/2024</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"Download Bihar State Health Society  Notification \" href=\"https://shs.bihar.gov.in//shs/advertisement/1709965728.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Bihar SHS Official Website\" href=\"https://shs.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bihar SHS Official Website</a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710000389-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-09 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(94, 'VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 202124', 'VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2024 Download Link (Out) For UG BA, B.Sc, B.Com.', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2021-24</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2024:</span> </strong>हमारे वे सभी&nbsp;<strong>वीर कुंवर सिंह यूनिवर्सिटी&nbsp;</strong>के&nbsp;<strong>स्टूडेंट्स</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;पार्ट 3&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की&nbsp;<strong>परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे बैठने वाले है और अपने&nbsp;<strong>एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>इंतजार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर रहे है उनके लिए&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;धमाकेदार खुशखबरी&nbsp;</strong>है कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2021-24&nbsp;</strong>को&nbsp;<strong>जारी&nbsp;</strong>कर दिया गया है अर्थात्&nbsp;<strong>VKSU Part 3 Admit Card Download का लिंक [घोषित]&nbsp;</strong>कर दिया है जिसकी&nbsp;<strong>Live Update&nbsp;</strong>हम, आपको प्रदान कर रहे है जिसके लिए आपको हमारे साथ अन्त तक बने रहना होगा।</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content cf\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">इसके साथ ही साथ हम, आपको बता देना चाहते है कि, आप सभी&nbsp;<strong>पार्ट 3&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>विद्यार्थियो&nbsp;</strong>को अपने &ndash; अपने&nbsp;<strong>VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करने के लिए अपने साथ अपना&nbsp;<strong>Registration Number व जन्म तिथि&nbsp;</strong>को रखना होगा ताकि आप आसानी से अपने&nbsp;<strong>एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>को&nbsp;<strong>डाउनलोड</strong>&nbsp;कर सके तथा</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">आर्टिकल के अन्त में हम आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स</strong> प्रदान करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"VKSU_Part_3_Admit_Card_2024_Overview\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px ridge rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Name of the University</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Veer Kunwar Singh University, Ara</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Live Status of VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2024?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Released and Live to Check &amp; Download</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2024 Release On?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>25th March, 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Programme</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UG</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Part</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>3</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Session</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2021 &ndash; 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Requirements</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration Number of Student</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">अपने इस आर्टिकल में हम, अपने सभी <strong>वीर कुंवर सिंह विश्वविघालय</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;पार्ट 3</strong>&nbsp;की&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे बैठने वाले सभी&nbsp;<strong>छात्र &ndash; छात्राओं&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;हार्दिक स्वागत&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना चाहते है जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;बेसब्री&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के साथ अपने &ndash; अपने&nbsp;<strong>पार्ट 3&nbsp;</strong>के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;इतंजार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर रहे है और इसीलिए हम, आपको अपने इस आर्टिकल की मदद से विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>VKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2021-24 Download Link</strong> के बारे मे बताना चाहते है।</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">आपको बता दें कि, <strong>VVKSU Part 3 Admit Card 2021 24&nbsp;</strong>को चेक एंव डाउनलोड करने के लिए आप सभी परीक्षार्थियो को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;ऑनलाइन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को अपनाना होगा जिसमे हमारे किसी भी छात्र&nbsp; या छात्रा को कोई असुविधा ना हो इसके लिए हम आपको पूरी&nbsp; जानकारी प्रदान करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से अपने &ndash; अपने&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक एंव डाउनलोड कर सके व</span>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">आर्टिकल के अन्त में हम आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स</strong>&nbsp;प्रदान करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A3_%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%82_%E2%80%93_VKSU_Part_3_Admit_Card_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>महत्वपूर्ण तिथियां&nbsp;</strong></span></em></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px double rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\