rong>&nbsp;2.5 Km in 12 Minutes.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Running Female :</strong>&nbsp;1 KM in 6 Minutes.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More PET Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 291.455px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.9255%; height: 291.455px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"15\" valign=\"top\" width=\"793\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill HSSC Constable Recruitment Online Form 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Haryana Staff Selection Commission (HSSC) Constable General Duty GD Male / Female Recruitment Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the HSSC Recruitment 2024 Candidate Can Apply Online for&nbsp;<strong>20/02/2024 to 21/03/2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the HSSC Latest Haryana Police Constable (Sipahi) Post Recruitment 2024 Application Form in Sarkari Result Recruitment Latest Job Section.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.4545px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.9255%; height: 67.4545px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"15\" valign=\"top\" width=\"793\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification before Apply Online.</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.4545px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.9255%; height: 67.4545px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"15\" valign=\"top\" width=\"793\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 18, 19); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.4545px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 41.5262%; height: 67.4545px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"352\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.3993%; height: 67.4545px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"442\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"HSSC Constable Recruitment 2024\" href=\"https://adv012024.hryssc.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.4545px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 41.5262%; height: 67.4545px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"352\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.3993%; height: 67.4545px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"442\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Haryana Police Constable Recruitment Notification PDF Download\" href=\"https://hssc.gov.in/hssccms/uploads/advt/58949-Police%20Advt.%201.2024%20dated%2012.02.2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.4545px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 41.5262%; height: 67.4545px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"352\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.3993%; height: 67.4545px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"442\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"HSSC Official Website 2024\" href=\"https://hssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HSSC Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710086052-Haryana Police Constable Online Form 2024.webp', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-10 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(102, 'RPSC Senior Teacher Recruitment 2024', 'Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC) has released the advertisement of Senior Teacher TGT Teacher (Sanskrit Education Department) Recruitment 2024.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; border: 3px ridge rgb(194, 224, 244); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(60, 64, 198); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \'andale mono\', monospace; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>RPSC Senior Teacher (TGT) Sanskrit Education Department Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>06/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> <strong>06/03/2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Pay Exam Fee : <strong>06/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date: <strong>As per Schedule </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee (OTR) </strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / Other State : <strong>600/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">EWS / OBC / BC : <strong>400/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>400/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Cash at Rajasthan E Mitra Portal or Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking.<strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If you have already paid the one time registration OTR fee then you do not need to pay again.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RPSC Senior Teacher Notification 2024 :&nbsp; </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 01/07/2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age <strong>: 40 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per RPSC Senior Teacher TGT Sanskrit Education Department Recruitment 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Rajasthan Senior Teacher Recruitment 2024 :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"> TGT Teacher </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy Details Total 347 Post</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>RPSC Senior Teacher TGt Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Senior Teacher (Sanskrit Education Department)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">347</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Related Subject ,</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Degree / Diploma in Education</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Final Year Appearing Candidate Also Eligible.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">More Details &amp; Subject Wise Eligibility Read the Full Notification</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RPSC Senior Teacher Exam 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Subject Wise Vacancy Details </span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Subject Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Subject Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Sanskrit</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">79</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Hindi</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">39</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">English</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">49</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Social Science</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">65</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mathematics</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">68</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Science</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">47</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill RPSC Senior Teacher TGT 2024 Recruitment Online Form </strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">One time registration has become necessary to apply for Rajasthan Public Service Commission, so whichever candidate wants to apply, it is mandatory to register on Rajasthan Government\'s SSO portal sso.rajasthan.gov.in.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission Released Senior Teacher (TGT) Sanskrit Education Recruitment Examination 2024 Online Form Candidate &nbsp;Apply Between <strong>06 February 2024 to 06 March 2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in RPSC Senior Teacher TGT 2024 Latest Career Jobs.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to National Horticulture Board Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"RPSC TGT  Registration 2024\" href=\"https://sso.rajasthan.gov.in/signin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Exam Notice</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"RPSC Senior Teacher Notification 2024\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/Static/PressNotes/1857AF5A-665E-4FE2-8B4B-40D8D3CA568A.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"RPSC Senior Teacher Notification 2024\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/Static/RecruitmentAdvertisements/5429407983BF4A58AF98CBCB289E55CE.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"RPSC Official Website 2024\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RPSC Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710087491-pic.webp', '15', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-10 00:00:00', '2024-03-26 05:50:42', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(103, 'OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024', 'OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content cf\">\r\n<aside id=\"widgets-wrap-before-post-content\" class=\"cf\"></aside>\r\n<div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_64 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction\">\r\n<div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</span>&nbsp; Odisha Staff Selection Commission (OSSC</strong>)&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>ने<strong>&nbsp; Assistant Training Officer&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>के कुल मिलाकर<strong>&nbsp;250&nbsp;</strong>रिक्तियों पर भर्ती के लिए विज्ञापन की अधिसूचना (<strong>Vacancy Advertisement) &nbsp;</strong>जारी की है।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी&nbsp;<strong>16 April, 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>से 15 May, 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>तक</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Online</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Registration</strong>&nbsp;और&nbsp;<strong>16 April, 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>से 18 May, 2024&nbsp; तक Online Application Submit</strong>&nbsp;कर सकते हैं। इस विज्ञापन की विस्तृत जानकारी जैसे&nbsp;<strong>Post Name, No. of Vacancies, Eligibility Criteria, Pay Scale, Application Fee, Selection Process, How to Apply Instructions, Important Dates, Useful Web Links</strong> इत्यादि इस प्रकार है &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"OSSC_Assistant_Training_Officer_Recruitment_2024_Overview\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024 Overview&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 280px; border: 2px solid rgb(35, 111, 161);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Recruitment Organization</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Odisha Staff Selection Commission (OSSC)&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Title of the Article</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024 Apply Online for 250 Vacancies</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Post</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Assistant Training Officer&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Number of Vacancies</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">250 Vacancies</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Type of Article</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Latest Govt Jobs</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Who can Apply</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Indian Citizen</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Read the full Article</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Mode</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Online only</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Starting Date to&nbsp; Online Registration &amp; Apply Online&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">16/04/2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Closing Date to&nbsp; Online Registration&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">15/05/2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Closing Date to Submission of Online Application&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">18/05/2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Editing of Online Application form&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">16/04/2024 to 21/05/2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Date&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;(Tentative)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website &ndash;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.ossc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.ossc.gov.in/</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"OSSC_Assistant_Training_Officer_Recruitment_2024_Notification_Details\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>Notification Details&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Odisha Staff Selection Commission (OSSC) ने&nbsp; Assistant Training Officer&nbsp;</strong>के कुल मिलाकर<strong>&nbsp;250 Vacancies</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;पर&nbsp;<strong>Selection&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के लिए&nbsp;<strong>Suitable and Eligible Candidates</strong>&nbsp;से&nbsp;<strong>Online Application</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;की मांग की है .इस&nbsp;<strong>Recruitment Notification</strong>&nbsp;की विस्तृत जानकारी इस प्रकार है &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px dashed rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Post &amp; Pay Matrix Level&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total No. of Vacancies&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Training Officer&nbsp; (NTC/NAC holders)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Level &ndash; 9 of ORSP, 2017</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">125 (Women &ndash; 43)</span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Training Officer&nbsp;(Diploma / Degree holders)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Level &ndash; 9 of ORSP, 2017</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">125 (Women &ndash; 39)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"OSSC_Eligibility_Criteria_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>OSSC Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px dotted rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center; width: 29.2355%;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Name of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center; width: 47.2968%;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Educational Qualification (As on 30/03/2024)&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center; width: 23.4278%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Age Limit (As on 01/01/2024)&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 29.2355%;\" width=\"50%\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Training Officer (NTC/ NAC holders</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.2968%;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Essential &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate must have passed High School Certificate or equivalent examination and must possess National Trade Certificate (NTC)/National Apprenticeship Certificate (NAC)/ ITI Pass in the relevant trade under the aegis of NCVT, New Delhi</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Passed Craft Instructor Training Scheme (CITS), and certified as Trained Instructors under the aegis of NCVT, New Delhi</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 23.4278%;\" rowspan=\"2\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">21 to 38 years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">should be born not&nbsp; earlier than 2/01/1986 and not later than 01/01/2003.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 29.2355%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Training Officer (Diploma / Degree holders)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.2968%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate must have passed High School Certificate or equivalent examination and must possess Diploma / B.E/ B.Tech from an AICTE approved Institute / recognized Council / Board / State &amp; Statutory University in the relevant branch of Engineering .</span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Passed Craft Instructor Training Scheme (CITS) and certified as Trained Instructors under the aegis of NCVT, New Delhi.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Note_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Important Note&nbsp;</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate must be able to read, write and speak Odia fluently and also Passed &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Middle School Examination with Odia as language subject or</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">HSC Examination or equivalent with Odia as Medium of examination in non-language subject</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Check official notification for&nbsp; more information.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Age_Relaxation_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Relaxation</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation in upper limit will be given to only reserved categories as per government rules and regulations</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px outset rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Relaxation in Upper Limit&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST /SEBC Category&nbsp; and All&nbsp; Category Women</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">05 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">PwD</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10 years in their respective Category</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">EXSM</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">total period of service rendered in defence service</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Reservation_and_Relaxation_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Reservation and Relaxation&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Reservation &amp; Relaxation will be given to only reserved categories as per government rules and regulations.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Location_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Job Location&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Directorate of Technical Education &amp; Training , Cuttack , Government of Odisha, Across Odisha.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Employment_type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Job Employment type &ndash;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Regular Basis</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Period_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Job Period &ndash;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Permanent</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Who_can_apply_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Who can apply &ndash;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Indian Citizen (Male /Female)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Selection_Process_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Selection Process &ndash;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Written Test (Preliminary and/or Mains)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Practical Test</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification &amp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Form_Type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Form Type &ndash;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Online&nbsp; Application Form</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Apply_Mode_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Apply Mode &ndash;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Only Online</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Application_Fee_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee &ndash;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">No Fee (NIL)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-169916 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-latest-jobs category-all-india-job category-new-updates\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\r\n<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-187985 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-all-india-job tag-kurukshetra-university-non-teaching-recruitment\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">\r\n<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-189703 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-all-india-job tag-iit-madras-non-teaching-recruitment\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-post__text\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Apply Pre Requisite -/Enclosure -/ Documents &ndash;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Valid &amp; Active Email Id</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mobile No.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Educational Qualification Certificates with Marks sheet</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Proof</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Photograph</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Signature</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Left / Right thumb Impression</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Id &amp; Address Proof</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Caste /Category / PH/ Domicile / EXSM/ EWS / NOC (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_for_OSSC_Assistant_Training_Officer_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply for OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी को चाहिए कि &nbsp;वे&nbsp;<strong>Online Apply&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>करने से पहले&nbsp;<strong>OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>की&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility criteria&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>Applying process</strong>&nbsp;की विस्तृत जानकारी के लिए&nbsp;<strong>Official Notification&nbsp;</strong><strong>का&nbsp;</strong><strong>full details</strong>&nbsp;जरूर पढ़ लें।&nbsp;<strong>Online Apply</strong>&nbsp; करने के लिए निम्नलिखित&nbsp;<strong>steps&nbsp;</strong><strong>को&nbsp;</strong><strong>follow</strong>&nbsp;करें &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Fill_Online_Application_Form_for_OSSC_Assistant_Training_Officer_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;How to Fill Online Application Form for OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के आवेदन के लिए आपको सबसे पहले&nbsp;<strong>Official Website&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ossc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.ossc.gov.in/</a></strong>&nbsp;पर जाना होगा। जो कुछ इस प्रकार होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Home Page</strong>&nbsp;पर &lsquo;<strong>What&rsquo;s New &lsquo;&nbsp;</strong>के अंतर्गत&nbsp;<strong>available Link</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Search</strong>&nbsp;करने के बाद आपको&nbsp;<strong>OSSC Assistant Training Officer Recruitment 2024 Vacancy Notification</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>Link</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;दिखाई देगा। उसे वहां से&nbsp;<strong>download</strong>&nbsp;करके पूरा पढ़ लें &nbsp;ताकि आपको&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>Online applying</strong>&nbsp;<strong>procedure</strong>&nbsp; की विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त हो सके।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>उसी&nbsp; Official&nbsp; Web Page&nbsp;</strong><strong>या इस&nbsp;</strong><strong>Article&nbsp;</strong><strong>के</strong>&nbsp;इसी पेज पर नीचे उपलब्ध&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;&ldquo;Online Apply &rdquo; link</strong>&nbsp;को क्लिक करें&nbsp; अपने&nbsp;<strong>Email Id&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>mobile number</strong>&nbsp;का प्रयोग करते हुए&nbsp;<strong>Registration</strong>&nbsp;करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद&nbsp;<strong>Login</strong>&nbsp;करके&nbsp;<strong>Online Application</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>Correctly &amp; Carefully fill up&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Required Documents, Photograph , Signature, Thumb Impression</strong>&nbsp; को<strong>&nbsp;scan&nbsp;</strong><strong>करके&nbsp;</strong><strong>upload</strong>&nbsp; करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Application Form&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>को&nbsp;</strong><strong>final submit&nbsp;</strong><strong>करके&nbsp;</strong><strong>Print out</strong>&nbsp; प्राप्त कर लें।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"_Important_Links_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px dotted rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Apply Link &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://ossc.gov.in/Public/Pages/Post_detail_information.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(Apply Link will be available on 16/04/2024)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.ossc.gov.in/Public/OSSC/Default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1712052194-ossc.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-11 00:00:00', '2024-04-02 10:03:14', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(104, 'Jharkhand JPSC Civil Services Exam Recruitment 2024', 'Jharkhand Public Service Commission has relased Combined Civil Services Recruitment 2024. Those candidates Are Enrolled with Vacancy Can Download the Admit Card', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px double rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 1645px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 168.667px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 168.667px;\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(227, 21, 86); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> Jharkhand Public Service Commission (JPSC)&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>JPSC Combined Civil Services Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>JPSC Pre 2024&nbsp; Advt No. : 01/2024 :&nbsp; Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 178.833px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 178.833px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>01/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 29/02/2024 Upto 5 PM</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date <strong>: 01/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date <strong>: 17/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>12/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 178.833px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌&nbsp; Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS: <strong>100</strong>/-</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>50/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fees &nbsp;Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Fees Mode Only.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 140.833px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 140.833px;\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Jharkhand Civil Services Notification 2024 : </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 01/08/2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age <strong>: 21 Years</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age <strong>: 35 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Jharkhand JPSC Civil Services Prelim Exam Recruitment Rules.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.8333px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 67.8333px;\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>JPSC Civil Services Recruitment 2024 : </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy Details</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Total : 342 Post</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 51px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 51px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 51px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>JPSC Civil Services Exam Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 70px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 70px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"c