erminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Jobs Application Form in Jharkhand JPSC Civil Services PCS Pre Latest Vacancy 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Are Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Pay and Complete Your Form</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.8333px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 67.8333px;\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔎 Some Useful Important Links 👇</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.8333px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 67.8333px;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); height: 67.8333px;