(106, 'Rajasthan RSMSSB Junior Instructor  Recruitment 2024', 'Rajasthan Staff Selection Board RSSB / RSMSSB has released the advertisement of 09/2024 Junior Instructor Recruitment Exam Vacancy 2024. Those Candidates Are In', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px solid rgb(149, 165, 166);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; color: rgb(132, 63, 161);\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓 Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)&nbsp; | RSMSSB </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>RSMSSB Rajasthan Junior Instructor (1821 Post) Recruitment 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Rajasthan Jr Instructor Advt No. : 09/2024 :&nbsp; Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>13/03/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 11/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li>Complete Form Last Date :<strong> 11/04/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Exam Date :<strong> As per Schedule</strong></li>\r\n<li>Admit Card Available : <strong>Before Exam</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>General / OBC : <strong>600/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>OBC NCL : <strong>400/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>SC / ST : <strong>400/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>Correction Charge <strong>: 300/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>This fee is for one time registration, now after paying the OTR fee once, the candidate will not have to pay the application fee again and again.</li>\r\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Emitra CSC Center, Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking.<strong> </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RSMSSB Junior Instructor 1821 Post Notification 2024: </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 01/01/2025</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years</strong></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years</strong></li>\r\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per RSSB Junior Instructor 1821 Post Recruitment Exam 2024 Recruitment Rules<strong>. </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Rajasthan Junior Instructor 09/2024 Recruitment 2024 : </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy Details Total : 1821 Post</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Area</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Total </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>RSMSSB Junior Instructor Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Junior Instructor</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Non TSP</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">1542</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">10+2 Intermediate Exam in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Engineering Degree / Engineering Diploma / National Trade Certificate in Related Trade</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Experience Details :</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Degree : 1 Years, Diploma 2 Years, Certificate 3 Years.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">More Details and Trade Wise Eligibility Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">TSP</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">279</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RSMSSB Junior Instructor Exam 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Trade Wise Vacancy Details</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(149, 165, 166);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, 