(107, 'Student NIELIT CCC Admit Card March 2024 Exam', 'The admit card for the Course on Computer Concepts (CCC) exam conducted by the National Institute of Electronics and Information Technology has been released. C', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px dashed rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; color: rgb(132, 63, 161);\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓 National Institute of Electronics and Information Technology (NIELIT) </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Course on Computer Concepts (CCC) Exam 2024 Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 14pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>NIELIT CCC Exam 2024 Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Exam Date: <strong>March 2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Admit Card Available : <strong>11/03/2024</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>General / Other State : <strong>0/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>OBC / BC : <strong>0/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>SC / ST : <strong>0/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>No Application Fee to Download the Admit Card. <strong> </strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CCC Exam Conducted By:</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">The CCC exam is organized by the National Institute of Electronics and Information Technology (NIELIT), Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology, Government of India.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Download CCC Admit Card 2024</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\">You can easily download the admit card of CCC exam from your mobile and desktop. You just have to follow some steps.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Step 1 :</strong> First of all, you will see the link of download admit card in the Some Useful Important Link section at the bottom of this page, you have to click on it.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Step 2 :</strong> A new page https://student.nielit.gov.in/ will open.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Step 3 :</strong> In the new page that has been opened, on the right side you will get the link of download admit card, you have to click on it.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Step 4 :</strong> Now you see the name of all the courses organized by NIELIT, in that you have to select Course on Computer Concepts (CCC) in IT Literacy Program section.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Step 5 :</strong> Now you will see an undertaking, you have to read it and then acce</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Step 6 :</strong> Now you have to select the exam year, after that you have to select the month of the exam. In the last, you have to enter your application number along with your date of birth, after filling the Captcha code given on the wow, you will see the button of View and then you will get the button of print admit card, you have to click on it.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Step 7 :</strong> The admit card of CCC exam will now be shown on your screen, now you can print it in color or black and white. Also, if you do not have a printer available, you can save it and take a print out before the exam.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Step 8 :</strong> Before going to CCC exam, read carefully all the instructions given in the admit card such as exam date, reporting time, gate closing time, original valid photo identity card related information and other CCC exam instructions you will get in the admit card. will.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><a title=\"Download CCC Admit Card 2024\" href=\"https://student.nielit.gov.in/WEB/DownloadAdmitCard.aspx?qs=TZ5h711O2yvsUka4UwJKUrMNmkDNSRCG/cNzAt4OIa+reKN9JjAGFg==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>How to Download Admit Card (Video Hindi) </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><a title=\"Download Kaise Kare CCC Admit Card 2024\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2tx2zgEsXHk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Download Syllabus</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong><a title=\"NIELIT CCC Exam Syllabus PDF Download\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/CCC-Syllabus.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: terminal, monaco, monospace;\"><strong><a title=\"Student NIELIT CCC Official Website\" href=\"https://student.nielit.gov.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here </a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710168761-pic.webp', '14', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-11 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
