rline;\"><strong>🔎&nbsp; How to Fill : CBSE Board Various Post Recruitment Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Central Board of Secondary Education CBSE Board Recruitment 2024. Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>12 March 2024 to 11 April 2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in RSMSSB Apply Online for CBSE Various Post Latest Vacancy 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔗&nbsp; Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"CBSE Various Post Registration 2024\" href=\"https://www.cbse.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Link Activate 12/03/2024</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"CBSE Various Post Notification PDF 2024\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/sarkariresult.com-CBSE-Various-Post-Detailed-Notification-PDF.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"CBSE Official Website\" href=\"https://www.cbse.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CBSE Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710170320-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-11 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(109, 'SSC JE Recruitment 2024', 'The Staff Selection Commission (SSC) has just announced a fantastic opportunity for aspiring engineers.', '<header class=\"entry-header\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">SSC JE Recruitment 2024</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Apply Online For 966 Posts Vacancies</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The Staff Selection Commission (SSC) has just announced a fantastic opportunity for aspiring engineers. If you&rsquo;re passionate about civil, mechanical, or electrical engineering, keep reading. In this article, we&rsquo;ll delve into the details of the SSC Junior Engineer Recruitment 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Every year, the Staff Selection Commission (SSC) administers the SSC Junior Engineer examination to recruit individuals for various roles within Indian Ministries and Departments. This exam focuses on engineering fields such as Civil, Electrical, Mechanical, Quantity Surveying, and contract work. Candidates are required to complete both an objective and a descriptive paper as part of the examination process.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-detail-about-ssc-je-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Detail_About_SSC_JE_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Detail About SSC JE Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Examination Conducting body :&nbsp;</strong>Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name:&nbsp;</strong>SSC Junior Engineer</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Branches :&nbsp;</strong>Civil Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering etc.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam level :&nbsp;</strong>National Level Exam</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancy:</strong>&nbsp;966</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Start Date:&nbsp;</strong>March 28, 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application End Date:&nbsp;</strong>April 18, 2024 (until 23:00 hrs)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application mode :&nbsp;</strong>Online</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Dates:&nbsp;</strong>June 4, 2024, to June 6, 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC Official Website :&nbsp;</strong>sssc.nic.in</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SSC_JE_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC JE Eligibility Criteria 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\">Age Limit:</span></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Upper Age Limit for CPWD:&nbsp;</strong>30 years (born between August 2, 1994, and August 1, 2006)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Upper Age Limit for Others:&nbsp;</strong>32 years (born between August 2, 1992, and August 1, 2006)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age relaxation available for SC/ST/OBC/PH/Ex-servicemen candidates as per rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Qualification\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\">Qualification:</span></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Junior Engineer (Civil):&nbsp;</strong>Diploma/Degree in Civil Engineering</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Junior Engineer (Electrical &amp; Mechanical):&nbsp;</strong>Diploma/Degree in Electrical, Automobile, or Mechanical Engineering</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"SSC_JE_Vacancy_Details_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SSC JE Vacancy Details 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1. Border Road Organization BRO :&nbsp;</strong>475 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2. Brahmaputra Board, Ministry of Jal Shakti :&nbsp;</strong>02 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>3. Central Public Works Department CPWD :&nbsp;</strong>338 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>4. Central Water and Power Research Station :&nbsp;</strong>05 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>5. Central Water Commission CWC :&nbsp;</strong>132 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>6. Directorate of Quality Assurance Naval :&nbsp;</strong>06 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>7. Farkka Barrage Project :&nbsp;</strong>04 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>8. Military Engineer Services (MES) :&nbsp;</strong>To Be Announced</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>9. National Technical Research Organization (NTRO) :&nbsp;</strong>06 Posts<span id=\"Check_More_Recruitments_Here\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Application_Fees_For_SSC_JE_Online_Form_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fees For SSC JE Online Form 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>General/EWS/OBC Candidates:</strong>&nbsp;Rs. 100/-</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SC/ST/PWD Candidates:&nbsp;</strong>Nil</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode:&nbsp;</strong>BHIM UPI, Net Banking, or Debit/Credit card</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Starting Date for Apply Online:&nbsp;</strong>March 28, 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date to Apply Online:&nbsp;</strong>April 18, 2024 (until 23:00 hrs)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date for Fee Payment:&nbsp;</strong>April 19, 2024 (until 23:00 hrs)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Correction Dates:&nbsp;</strong>April 22, 2024, &amp; April 23, 2024 (until 23:00 hrs)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Dates:&nbsp;</strong>June 4, 2024, to June 6, 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SSC_JE_Selection_Process_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC JE Selection Process 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The SSC JE selection process consists of three stages. Candidates who meet the cut-off marks in the written exam proceed to the next stage. The stages are:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC JE Tier 1:</strong>&nbsp;This stage involves a written examination with objective questions.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC JE Tier 2:&nbsp;</strong>Candidates face a descriptive paper containing subject-specific questions only.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC JE Tier 3:&nbsp;</strong>This stage includes Document Verification (DV) and a Medical Examination.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The final selection for SSC JE 2024 recruitment is based on the marks obtained in Tier 1 and Tier 2. Candidates are encouraged to practice SSC JE question papers to familiarize themselves with the exam pattern.</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_For_SSC_JE_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply For SSC JE Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Visit the official SSC website sssc.nic.in.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Click on the &lsquo;Apply&rsquo; button under the &lsquo;Quick Links&rsquo; section.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Look for the SSC JE posts and click on the apply tab.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Click on the &ldquo;Register&rdquo; or &ldquo;New User&rdquo; button.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fill in the required details to create your account.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Complete the application form with accurate details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Upload scanned copies of your photograph and signature.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Application Fee.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Click on the &ldquo;Submit&rdquo; button to complete your application.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Save a copy application form in PDF format and take a printout for your records.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-32e6ef795d5fb0c78d4fe09cd45bab56\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<span id=\"For_Registration_Apply_HereOfficial_Notification_Check_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; For Registration:<a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/candidate-portal/one-time-registration/home-page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Apply Here</a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Official Notification:<a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/api/attachment/uploads/masterData/NoticeBoards/notice_28032024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Check Here</a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Official Website:<a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></span></div>', '1711722332-sscje.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-12 00:00:00', '2024-03-29 02:25:32', NULL, NULL),
(110, 'UP Polytechnic UPJEE Admission Test JEECUP Online', 'Uttar Pradesh Join Entrance Exam UPJEE Polytechnic 2024 has been released. Any student who wants to take admission in polytechnic course in any government / non', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(230, 126, 35);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(132, 63, 161); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓&nbsp; UP Joint Entrance Examination JEECUP 2024 Online Form</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh Polytechnic Diploma Admission 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 73, 94); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>UPJEE Exam 2024&nbsp; : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Application Begin&nbsp;<strong> 08/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>10/05/2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<strong>&nbsp; 10/05/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Exam Date : <strong>16-22 March 2024 (Postponed) </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">New Exam Date : <strong>May 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>As per Schedule</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Answer Key Available : <strong>As per Schedule</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Result Declared : <strong>As per Schedule </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Application Fee&nbsp;</strong></span><strong> </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Gen / OBC / EWS : <strong>300/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">SC / ST :<strong> 200/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit / Credit Card / Net Banking / Mobile Wallet / Cash Card or Offline E Challan Fee Mode</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>JEECUP UPJEE Notification 2024 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Age Limit as on 01/07/2024</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Minimum Age : <strong>14 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Maximum Age : <strong>NA</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Candidate Date of Birth for Admission 2024 Should be on or <strong>Before 01/07/2010.</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>JEECUP 2024 Entrance Exam <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">: Course Wise Eligibility Details</span></strong></span><strong> </strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Group</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Course Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;