"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">J</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">PG Diploma in Information Technology</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">1 Yr</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Diploma in Engineering (Any Branch)</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">K</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Diploma in Engineering (Lateral Entry)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">2 Yr</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">10+2 Exam with Science Stream or Class 10 Exam with ITI Certificate</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">L</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Post Diploma in Industry Safety</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">1 Yr</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">BE / B.Tech Degree in Any Stream with 2 Year Experience OR Diploma in Engineering with 5 Year Experience.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔎&nbsp; How to Fill UPJEE JEECUP Polytechnic Admission 2024</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Photo Instruction : Upload Color Passport Size Photo with Candidates Name and Photo Taken Date (Photo Not Be Older Than 3 Month)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Thumb Impression : Uploaded Left Hand Thumb Impression</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">Signature Instruction : Candidates Signature in Running Hand (Capital Letter Signature Not Accepted)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\">No Need to Send Confirmation Page to JEECUP 2024</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>For More Details Must Read the Notification. </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔗&nbsp; Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span><strong> </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Apply Online JEECUP 2024 Registration \" href=\"https://admissions.nic.in/jeecup/Applicant/Root/Home.aspx?boardid=129012411\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Apply Online (Post Diploma in Industrial Safety)</strong></span><strong> </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Apply Online JEECUP 2024 Registration \" href=\"https://admissions.nic.in/jeecup/Applicant/Root/Home.aspx?enc=Nm7QwHILXclJQSv2YVS+7nwSdMZBGmYwwGqVpf7YrhZdCbl/MsjQ3OvQ5g3RCARi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>For Correction / Edit Form</strong></span><strong> </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Apply Online JEECUP 2024 Registration \" href=\"https://jeecup.admissions.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"JEECUP 2024 Detailed Notification\" href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s325db67c5657914454081c6a18e93d6dd/uploads/2024/01/2024012254.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'trebuchet ms\', geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"JEECUP Admission 2024 Official Website\" href=\"https://jeecup.admissions.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UPJEE 2024 Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>', '1710222145-pic.webp', '15', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-12 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(111, 'Bihar Legislative Council Recruitment 2024 Apply for 26 post', 'Bihar Legislative Council Vidhan Parishad Sachivalaya has released the advertisement for recruitment under Assistant Branch Officer, DEO and Stenographer in whi', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px dotted rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓 Bihar Legislative Council (Sachivalaya)</strong><strong> </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Sachivalaya Various Post Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(227, 21, 86); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Bihar Vidhanparishad Advt No. : 02/2024 :&nbsp; Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Important Dates</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Application Begin <strong>:&nbsp; 12/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 02/04/2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date <strong>: 02/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Exam Date<strong>:&nbsp; 14/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Admit Card Available <strong>: Before Exam </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌 Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">General / OBC/ EWS / Other State : <strong>600/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">SC / &nbsp;ST / PH : <strong>150/- </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Female (Bihar Domicile) : <strong>150/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, E Challan Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Various Post Notification 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Age Limit as on 01/01/2024</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years for Data Entry Operator</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Minimum Age <strong>: 21&nbsp; Years for Other Post </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Maximum Age <strong>: 37 Years for Male </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Maximum Age :<strong> 40 Years for Female</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Bihar Vidhan Parishad Assistant Branch Officer, Data Entry Operator and Stenographer Recruitment Rules 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad Various Post Recruitment 2024 :</span> Vacancy Details &nbsp;</strong><strong>Total :&nbsp; 26 Post</strong><strong> </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Various Post Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Assistant Branch Officer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">19</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Stream in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Computer Typing : 30 WPM in Hindi and English (Both)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">O Level Or Equivalent Degree</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Data Entry Operator DEO</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">05</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">10+2 Inter Exam in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Computer Typing :8000 Key Depression Per Hour.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">O Level Or Equivalent Degree</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Stenographer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">07</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Stream in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Stenographer Speed : 80 WPM in Hindi</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Computer Typing : 30 WPM in Hindi and English (Both)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">O Level Or Equivalent Degree</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">🔎&nbsp; How to Fill Bihar Vidhan Parishad Recruitment Online Form 2024</span></strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bihar Legislative Council (Sachivalaya)&nbsp;Are Issued Various Post Recruitment 2024. Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the Bihar Vidhan Sabha Advt No 02/2024 Candidate Can Apply Online for <strong>12 March 2024 to 02 April 2024. </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Bihar Vidhan Sabha Assistant Branch Officer, DEO and Stenographer Post Recruitment 2024 Application Form in Sarkari Result Latest Job Section.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔗&nbsp; Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Bihar Vidhan Parishad Registration 2024\" href=\"https://blcsrecruitment.com/Advertisement-02.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here </strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Bihar Vidhan Parishad 02/2024 Notification 2024\" href=\"https://biharvidhanparishad.gov.in//Recruitment%202024/02-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here </strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Exam Notice </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Bihar Vidhan Parishad 02/2024 Exam Notice 2024\" href=\"https://biharvidhanparishad.gov.in//Recruitment%202024/02-2024-EED.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here </strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Bihar Vidhan Parishad Official Website\" href=\"https://biharvidhanparishad.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710224084-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-12 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(112, 'UPPSC Medical Officer and Other Post Recruitment 2024', 'Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission UPPSC Medical Officer Allopathy and Other Post Recruitment 2024. Those candidates who are interested in this Uttar Prade', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px inset rgb(126, 140, 141);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(132, 63, 161); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓&nbsp; Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer &amp; Other Post Examination 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>UPPSC MO Exam D-1/E-1/2024: Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌&nbsp; Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Application Begin : <strong>15/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>12/04/2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date :&nbsp;<strong> 12/04/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Correction Last Date : <strong>23/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Exam Date <strong>: As per Schedule </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Admit Card Available <strong>: Before Exam </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>📌&nbsp; Application Fee (Tentative)&nbsp;</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>125/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">SC / ST : <strong>95/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">PH Candidates : <strong>25/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay Offline Through E Challan<strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>UPPSC</strong><strong> <strong>Medical Officer </strong>Notification 2023 : </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 01/07/2023 </strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Minimum Age :<strong> 21 Years </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Maximum Age: <strong>40 </strong><strong>Years </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per UPPSC&nbsp;Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer Recruitment Examination Rules 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>UPPSC Medical Officer Recruitment 2024 : <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">Vacancy Details Total : 2535 Post </span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>UPPSC Medical Officer Eligibility 2024 </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Medical Officer Allopathy</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">2532</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Eligibility Details Available Soon</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Regional Prohibition and Social Development Officer</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">01</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Eligibility Details Available Soon</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Divisional Publication Officer</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">01</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Eligibility Details Available Soon</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Regional Tourist Officer/Publicity Officer</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">01</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Eligibility Details Available Soon</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">🔎&nbsp; How to Fill UPPSC Medical Officer &amp; Other Post Recruitment 2024 Online Form</span> </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission UPPSC Call For New Application for UPPSC Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer, Social Development Officer SDO, Divisional Publication Officer, Publicity Officer Examination 2024 Recruitment Candidate Can Apply Between<strong> 15/03/2024 to 12/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">It is mandatory to have OTR i.e. <strong><a title=\"UPPSC OTR Registration 2023\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/2023/uppsc-otr-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">One Time Registration</a></strong> for UPPSC Recruitment.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Pay attention, the registration number is received only after 72 hours of OTR registration - that\'s why OTR should be done first and only then the application will be made.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Uttar Pradesh UPPSC Latest&nbsp;Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer Examination 2024- UP Government Jobs 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>🔗 Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online UPPSC Medicial Officer Recruitment Registration 2024\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/CandidatePages/Notifications.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Link Activate 15/03/2024</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Download Short Notification </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a title=\"UPPSC Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer MO Notification 2024\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/sarkariresult-uppsc-medical-officer-short-notice-scaled.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>UPPSC DashBoard Login</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><a title=\"UPPSC OTR DashBoard\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/CandidatePages/OTRAppForm/Applicant_OtrAuthentication.aspx?WEqGEem9m0+8Y4tNQqJiNYurmbKsjJR/fgSlThSTh6o=#no-back\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UPPSC OTR DashBoard</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>For UPPSC OTR Registration </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><a title=\"UPPSC OTR Registration 2023\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/2023/uppsc-otr-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UPPSC OTR Registration</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><a title=\"UPPSC Official Website 2023\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UPPSC Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710238153-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-12 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(113, 'Bihar SHS CHO Recruitment 2024 Cancelled Notice for 4500Post', 'Bihar State Health Society SHS has released the advertisement of Community Health Officer CHO 4500 Post Recruitment Exam Vacancy 2024.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(126, 140, 141);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓 Bihar State Health Society (SHS)&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar Community Health Officer CHO Recruitment 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar SHS CHO Exam Advt No. : 03/2024 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin <strong>: 01/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online <strong>:<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> 30/04/2024 upto 06 PM Only. </span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Examination Fee Last Date : <strong>30/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Cancelled Notice <strong>: 12/03/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date <strong>: As per Schedule </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available <strong>: Notified Soon </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS<strong> : 500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>250/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female : <strong>250/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fees Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Mode.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Bihar CHO Notification 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Age Limit as on</span> <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">01/01/2024</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age <strong>: 21 Years.&nbsp; </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age <strong>: 42 Years. </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Bihar SHS Community Health Officer CHO Jobs 2027 Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SHS </strong>Bihar CHO Recruitment 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Vacancy Details</span></span> </strong><strong>Total : 4500 Post</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UR :</strong> 0 | <strong>EWS :</strong> 145 | <strong>EWS (F) :</strong> 78 | <strong>EBC :</strong> 1345 | <strong>EBC (F)</strong> 331 | <strong>BC :</strong> 702 | <strong>BC(F) :</strong>&nbsp; 259 | <strong>SC :</strong> 1279 |<strong> SC (F)</strong> : 230 | <strong>ST :</strong> 95 | <strong>ST (F) :</strong> 36 | <strong>Total :</strong> 4500 Post</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar CHO Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Community Health Officer (CHO)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">4500</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">B.SC Nursing / Post Basic B.SC Nursing with CCH Course <strong>OR</strong> General Nurse and Midwifery GNM with Certification Course in Community Health <strong>OR</strong> B.SC Nursing / Post Basic B.Sc Nursing with Certificate Course in Community Health.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill Bihar SHSB CHO Recruitment 2024 Online Form</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">State Health Society SHSB Bihar, Community Health Officer CHO Recruitment Advt NO. : 03/2024 Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>01/04/2024 to 30/04/2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Vacancies Application Form in Govt. Jobs of Bihar SHSB Latest Govt. Recruitment Online 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Apply Online / Submit Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If you have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"17\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Cancelled Notice</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download Bihar State Health Society  Cancelled Notice \" href=\"https://shs.bihar.gov.in//shs/notice_board/CANCELLATION%20ORDER%2003_2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download Bihar State Health Society  Notification \" href=\"https://shs.bihar.gov.in//shs/advertisement/1709965728.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Bihar SHS Official Website\" href=\"https://shs.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bihar SHS Official Website</a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710289439-pic.webp', '17', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-13 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(114, 'UPSC CDS First Exam OTA Final Result with Marks 2024', 'Union Public Service Commission (UPSC) has issued the notification of Combined Defence Services CDS I Exam 2023,', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px inset rgb(53, 152, 219);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>👨&zwj;🎓&nbsp; Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(132, 63, 161); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPSC Combined Defence Services Exam First 2023 (CDS I 2023)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPSC Exam Notice No. 04/2023, CDS-I Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>21/12/2022</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date of Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> <strong>12/01/2023 Till 06:00 PM</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment&nbsp;Last Date : <strong>12/01/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Modify / Edit Form : <strong>18-24 January 2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>16/04/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>24/03/2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Declared : <strong>04/05/2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Final Result Declared : <strong>27/10/2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">OTA Final Result Declared : <strong>24/01/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Marks Available : <strong>01/02/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Not Qualified Candidate Marks Available : <strong>12/03/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC : <strong>200/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / Female : <strong>0/- (Exempted)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Challan or Net Banking, Debit Card, Credit Card Fee Mode.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">UPSC CDS First 2023 Exam </span>Vacancies Details Total 341 Post</span> </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>CDS I Age Limit </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPSC CDS First Eligibility 2023 </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Indian Military Academy( IMA)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">100</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">02/01/2000 to 01/01/2005</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Passed / Appearing Bachelor Degree in Any Stream at Any Recognized University.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Indian Naval Academy (INA)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">22</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">02/01/2000 to 01/01/2005</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Passed / Appearing Bachelor Degree in Engineering at Any Recognized University.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Air Force</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">32</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">02/01/2000 to 01/01/2005</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Stream with Physics, Mathematics in 10+2 Level <span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>OR </strong></span> Bachelor Degree in Engineering</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Officers Training Academy (OTA)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">170</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">02/01/1999 to 01/01/2005</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Passed / Appearing Bachelor Degree in Any Stream at Any Recognized University.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">OTA Women</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">17</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill UPSC CDS I Exam 2023 Online Form </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Union Public Service Commission UPSC Are Issued Today Combined Defense Service CDS I Recruitment 2023. Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the Latest Defence Jobs 2023 Candidate Can Apply Online for <strong>21 December 2022 to 12 January 2023. </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">UPSC has implemented OTR i.e. One Time Registration system for all other types of recruitment including Combined Defence Services.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Any candidate who is going to apply or thinking of applying in Combined Defence Services CDS First Exam 2023, they will have to do their One Time Registration immediately. Only after that you will be able to apply.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the UPSC CDS I Latest Recruitment 2023 Application Form in Sarkari Result Latest Job Section.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Marks (Not Qualified Candidate) </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\