 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Admission Entrance Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\" colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"957\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"439\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Final Result </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"518\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Bihar DLRS Various Post Final Result 2023\" href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/pdf_Adv/ADV_DLRS23_15.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click</strong> Here</a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"439\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Rank Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-w