);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Class 12th Result Download</span></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.4524%; height: 22.4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" title=\"Exam Info Result 2024\" href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click here</a></span></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.5055%; height: 22.4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Class 10th Result Date</span></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.4524%; height: 22.4px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" title=\"Exam Info Result 2024\" href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click here</a></span></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</figure>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\">How to Download BSEB Result 2024 Class 10th, Class 12th</span></span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">To download Bihar Board class result, you will have to go to its official website, the link of which is given above.</span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">After that click on the result option. Here you will see the option of&nbsp;Class 10th Result and Class 12 Result.</span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Click on the result of any class you want to download. After that a new page will open in front of you.</span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Where you have to fill the roll number received in your admit card in the box and fill the date of birth.</span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">After that you have to click on&nbsp;Get Result.</span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Your result will be downloaded</span></strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\">Bihar Board Selection Process Education Qualification Recruitment</span></span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">33% Marks Obtained in Each Subject</span></strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Bihar Board 10th 12th Result 2024 Links</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Exam Info Result 2024\" href=\"https://www.results.biharboardonline.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bihar Board 10th Result 2024 Link</a></span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><a title=\"Exam Info Result 2024\" href=\"https://www.results.biharboardonline.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BSEB 12th Result 2024 Link</a></span></strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Bihar Board 10th 12th Result 2024 FAQs</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n<div class=\"schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<div id=\"faq-question-1709955279555\" class=\"schema-faq-section\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><span class=\"schema-faq-question\">When will Bihar Board result be released?</span></span></strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"schema-faq-answer\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Probably the result of class 19 and 20 march be released in the month of March.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"faq-question-1709955355483\" class=\"schema-faq-section\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><span class=\"schema-faq-question\">How to Check BSEB Result 2024 Class 10th &amp; 12th?</span></span></strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"schema-faq-answer\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Visit the official website &amp; go to result section.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '1710419635-Bihar Board 10th 12th Result 2024.webp', '13', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-14 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(131, 'NIC Scientific and Technical Post Result 2024', 'National Information Center (NIC) has issued an Scientific and Technical Posts Recruitment 2023 Notification. Technical Post Result 2024', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\" width=\"720\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.953%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 12, 195);\"><strong>National Information Center (NIC)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 255, 39);\"><strong>NIC Scientific and Technical Posts Recruitment 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 12, 195);\"><strong>NIELIT NIC Advt No: NIELIT/NIC/2023/1 Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" title=\"Exam Info Result 2023\" href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 57.2958%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"385\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 255, 19); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin :&nbsp;<strong>04/03/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>04/04/2023 upto 05:30 PM</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>04/04/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date :<strong>&nbsp;12-14 December 2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available<strong>&nbsp;: Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Available<strong>&nbsp;: 05/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Result Available<strong>&nbsp;: 14/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 42.6572%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"335\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 255, 19); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC/ EWS :&nbsp;<strong>800/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH :&nbsp;<strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female :&nbsp;<strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Online Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking /UPI Only.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.953%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 12, 195);\"><strong>NIC Scientific and Technical Posts Notification 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 255, 19);\">Age Limit as on 04/04/2023</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per National Information Center Scientific and Technical Posts Recruitment Rules 2023.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.953%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>NIC Scientific &amp; Technical Posts Recruitment 2023&nbsp;Vacancy Details Total : 598 Post</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 13.193%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 11.2873%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"153\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 75.4728%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"388\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>NIC&nbsp;</strong><strong>Scientific and Technical Posts Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 13.193%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Scientist-&lsquo;B</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 11.2873%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"153\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">71</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 75.4728%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"388\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BE / B.Tech / ME / M.Tech / M.Sc / M.Phill Degree</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Single or in Combination with : Electronics, Electronics and Communication, Computer Sciences, Communication, Computer and Networking Security, Computer Application, Software System, Information Technology, Information Technology Management, Informatics, Computer Management, Cyber law, Electronics and Instrumentation.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 13.193%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Scientific Officer/Engineer &ndash; SB</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 11.2873%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"153\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">196</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 75.4728%;\" colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"388\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">M.Sc. /MS/MCA/B.E./B.Tech Degree</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Single or in Combination with : &nbsp;Electronics, Electronics and Communication, Electronics &amp; telecommunications, Computer Sciences, Computer and Networking Security, Software System, Information Technology, Informatics.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 13.193%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"179\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Scientific/Technical Assistant - &lsquo;A&rsquo;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 11.2873%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"153\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">331</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.953%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>NIC Various Post Recruitment 2023&nbsp;Exam District Details 2023</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Lucknow, Delhi, Patna, Dehradun, Jaipur, Bhopal,&nbsp; Agartala, Ahmedabad, Aizawl , Bengaluru , Bhubaneswar , Chandigarh ,Chennai ,&nbsp; Gangtok , Guwahati , Hyderabad , Imphal , Itanagar , Jammu , Kochi , Kohima , Kolkata , Mumbai ,&nbsp; Raipur , Ranchi , Shillong , Shimla , Port-Blair &amp; Visakhapatnam</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.953%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\"><center></center>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill NIC Scientific &amp; Technical Recruitment Online Form 2023</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">National Information Center NIC Are Issued Scientific and Technical<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Recruitment Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the NIC Recruitment 2023 Candidate Can Apply Online for&nbsp;<strong>04/03/2023 to 04/04/2023.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the NIC Latest Recruitment 2023 Application Form in Sarkari Result Recruitment Latest Job Section.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.953%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(0, 255, 39);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.953%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 56.5657%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 12, 195);\"><strong>Download Result</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 43.3874%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"354\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NIC Various Post Exam Result 2023\" href=\"https://www.calicut.nielit.in/nic23/documentformats/ProvisinalList_STA.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 56.5657%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 12, 195);\"><strong>Download Answer Key</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 43.3874%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"354\">\r\n<h2 align