ration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">How To Download Bihar DElEd Admit Card 2024</span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li class=\"pt-3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">There are following simple steps for online downloading of Bihar DElEd Joint Entrance Test 2024 admit card as under described:</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">At first open&nbsp;<strong>BSEB</strong>&nbsp;official website&nbsp;<strong>https://www.deledbihar.com/</strong>&nbsp;into your computer or phone browser.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Navigate to middle of the web page, under important link section click on the given link as&nbsp;<strong><u>Download D.EL.Ed. Joint Entrance Test 2024 Admit Card</u></strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You will be redirected to&nbsp;<strong>Admit Card Login page</strong>&nbsp;of Bihar D.EL.Ed. JET 2024</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">In the Admit Card login page enter your&nbsp;<strong>Mobile Number and Password</strong>&nbsp;correctly in the specified field.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Finally click on&nbsp;<strong>Log In</strong>&nbsp;button to download your admit card. You can take print out of it for future references.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"apply-online-link\" class=\"job-footer\">\r\n<div class=\"job-row\">\r\n<div class=\"job-col-1 bl-0 br-0 bb-0\">\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\">Bihar DElEd Admit Card 2024 Download Links</span></span></em></h2>\r\n<table class=\"table job-table-link\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; border: 2px dashed rgb(251, 238, 184); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 57.6px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td class=\"w-2\" style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Download Exam Notice</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"w-2\" style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.fastjobsearchers.com/pdf/notification/bihar-deled-exam-notice.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here For Exam Notice</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td class=\"w-2\" style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Download Admit Card</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"w-2\" style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"http://202.191.140.165/bsebregjan24/cloea_mar24/login.php?appid=2b31753d286a255bac775d3e6d23a6a6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CLICK HERE</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td class=\"w-2\" style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Official Website</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"w-2\" style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.deledbihar.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here To Open Official Website</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '1710424758-Bihar DElEd Admit Card 2024 Download.webp', '14', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-14 00:00:00', '2024-04-06 01:35:40', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(135, 'UPPSC Additional Private Secretary Recruitment', 'UPPSC Additional Private Secretary APS Online Form 2023 :(UPPSC) has issued an Additional Private Secretary APS Examina', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 1944.67px; border: 3px dotted rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" width=\"741\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 166.05px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 166.05px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UPPSC Additional Private Secretary (APS) Recruitment 2023 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UPPSC&nbsp; 328 Post&nbsp; Advt No.&nbsp;&nbsp;A-5/E-1/2023 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 244.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 244.625px;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"377\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>19/09/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>02/11/2023</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong>02/11/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date <strong>: 07/01/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available <strong>: 22/12/2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">pre Result Available <strong>: 04/03/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Stage II Mains Form Available : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>14-29 March 2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Reciept Form Last Date <strong>: 05/04/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 244.625px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"365\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee&nbsp; </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>185/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>95/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">PH Candidates : <strong>25/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay Offline Through E Challan<strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 144.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 144.625px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>UPPSC</strong><strong>&nbsp;<strong>Additional Private Secretary </strong>Notification 2023 : </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 01/07/2023 </strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :<strong> 21 Years </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age: <strong>40 </strong><strong>Years </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per UPPSC Additional Private Secretary Examination Rules 2023.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>UPPSC&nbsp;Additional Private Secretary Recruitment 2023 : <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">Vacancy Details Total : 328 Post </span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 52px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 52px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 52px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 52px;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"445\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPPSC&nbsp;Additional Private Secretary APS Eligibility 2023 </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 92px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 92px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"170\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Additional Private Secretary</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 92px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">328</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 92px;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"445\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Stream in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Hindi Shorthand 80 WPM, Computer 25 WPM.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">CCC Exam Passed OR Equivalent .</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 284.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 284.625px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">How to Fill UPPSC&nbsp;<strong>Additional Private Secretary APS </strong>Exam 2023 Online Form</span> </strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission UPPSC Call For New Application for Uttar Pradesh UPPSC Additional Private Secretary APS Exam Recruitment 2023 Candidate Can Apply Between<strong> 19/09/2023 to 02/11/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">It is mandatory to have OTR i.e. <strong><a title=\"UPPSC OTR Registration 2023\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/2023/uppsc-otr-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">One Time Registration</a></strong> for UPPSC Recruitment.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay attention, the registration number is received only after 72 hours of OTR registration - that\'s why OTR should be done first and only then the application will be made.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Uttar Pradesh UPPSC Latest Additional Private Secretary APS Examination Recruitment 2023 - UP Government Jobs 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online (Mains)</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"pre Result UPPSC Additional Private Secretary  Examination 2023\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/CandidatePages/OTRAppForm/Applicant_OtrAuthentication.aspx?WEqGEem9m0+8Y4tNQqJiNYurmbKsjJR/fgSlThSTh6o=\" target=\"_blank\"