 font-size: 12pt;\">200</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"470\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Welder (G&amp;E)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">230</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"470\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Machinist</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">05</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"470\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Painter (G)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">20</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"470\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Carpenter</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">05</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"470\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Electrician</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">75</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"470\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Ac &amp; Ref Mechanic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"284\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">15</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"754\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill Railway ACT Apprentice Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rail Coach Factory Kapurthala RCF, Ministry of Railway Are Released Notification for Trade Apprentice Recruitment 2024. Under Advt. No : Notice No. A-1/2024 Post Candidate Can Apply Between<strong> 11/03/2024 to 09/04/2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in RCF Kapurthala Apprentice in Various Branch 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"754\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some <em>Useful</em> Important Links</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"393\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"361\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"RCF Apprentice Recruitment 2024\" href=\"https://pardarsy.railnet.gov.in/apprentice/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"393\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"361\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download RCF ACT Apprentice 2024 Notification PDF\" href=\"https://rcf.indianrailways.gov.in/uploads/files/act-app/act.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"393\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"361\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"RCF Kapurthala Official Website\" href=\"https://rcf.indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>RCF Kapurthala Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1710427322-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-14 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(137, 'Punjab Police Recruitment 2024 Apply Online', 'Punjab police has relased District and Armed Cadre of Punjab Police 2024 Advt No. 01/2024 Recruitment 2024.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px outset rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" width=\"699\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"699\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong>Punjab Police&nbsp; </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(132, 63, 161); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>District and Armed Cadre of Punjab Police 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Punjab Police Constable Advt No. 01/2024 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"368\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin <strong>: 14/03/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online <strong>: <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">04/04/2024</span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Examination Fee <strong>: 04/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date<strong>:&nbsp; As per Schedule </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available <strong>: Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"332\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General : <strong>1150/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">EWS: <strong>650/- </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>650/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode - </strong>Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"699\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Punjab Police Constable Recruitment 2024 : </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 01/01/2024</strong></span></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>28 Years. </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Punjab Police&nbsp;Constables Recruitment Rules 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"699\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Punjab Police Constable Exam 2024 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy Details Total : 144 Post </strong></span></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"182\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"111\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"406\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Chandigarh Police Constable IT Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"182\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Punjab Police Constables</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">District Police : 970 Post</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Armed Police : 776 Post</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"111\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1746</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"406\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 Intermediate Exam in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Punjabi As a Subject in Class 10th Matric Level.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Height</strong> Male : 5 Feet 7 Inch, Female 5 Feet 2 Inch</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Running :</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Male : 1600 Meter Race in 6 min 30 Second</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Female : 800 meter Race in 4 Min 30 Second</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Long Jump :</strong> Male 3.80 Meter, Female : 3 Meter</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>High Jump :</strong> Male 1.10 Meter, Female : 0.95 Meter</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"699\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Punjab Police Constable Exam 2024 <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Category Wise Vacancy Details Read the Notification </span></strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"699\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill Punjab Police Constable Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Punjab Police Constable (Sipahi) Latest Jobs Recruitment 2024. Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>14/03/2024 to 04/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Punjab Police PP Constable 2024 Jobs.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Admission Entrance Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(2