(141, 'MP Van Rakshak  Kshetra Rakshak  Jail Prahari  2022 Result', 'MPESB Which was earlier named Professional Examination Board PEB has released Van Rakshak & Kshetra Rakshak, Jail Prahari Direct Recruitment Test- 2023.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 1884.58px; border: 3px dashed rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 166.05px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 166.05px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Madhya Pradesh Employee Selection Board (MPESB)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>MP ESB Forest Guard / Jail Prahari, Field Guard Recruitment 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>MPPEB Forest / Field Guard, Jail Prahari Exam 2023 Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 244.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 244.625px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"387\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>25/01/2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>08/02/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<strong> 08/02/2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>Correction Last Date : <strong>13/02/2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>Exam Date : <strong>25 May to 20 June 2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>Admit Card Available :<strong> 18/05/2023 </strong></li>\r\n<li>Answer Key Available :<strong> 22/06/2023 </strong></li>\r\n<li>Result Available :<strong> 14/03/2024 </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 244.625px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span><strong> </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>General / Other State : <strong>560/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>SC / ST / OBC : <strong>310/-</strong></li>\r\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Cash at KIOSK Or Pay Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Fee Mode Only</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 153.425px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 153.425px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>MPESB Forest Guard, Jail Prahari, Field Guard 2023</strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong> Age Limit as on 01/01/2023</strong></span></span><strong> </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Maximum Age : <strong>33 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per MP PEB Van Rakshak &amp; Kshetra Rakshak (Karyapalik) (Van Vibhag), Jail Prahari Other Various Post Recruitment Rules 2023.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>MP ESB Forest Guard, Jail Prahari, Field Guard </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy Details Total : 2112 Post</strong></span></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"172\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Recruitment Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"87\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"466\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>MP Forest Guard, Field Guard, Jail Prahari Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 76.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 252.8px;\" rowspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"172\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Van Rakshak &amp; Kshetra Rakshak (Karyapalik) (Van Vibhag), Jail Prahari (Karyapalik)(Jail Vibhag) Direct Recruitment Test- 2023</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"87\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Forest Guard</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">1772</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 131.2px;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"466\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Class 10th High School Exam Passed in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Height :</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Male : 163 CMS, Female : 150 CMS</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Chest Male : 79-84 CMS</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"87\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Field Guard</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">140</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 121.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 121.6px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"87\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Jail Prahari</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 121.6px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">200</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 121.6px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Class 10th High School Exam Passed in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Height :</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Male : 165 CMS, Female : 158 CMS</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Chest Male : 83 CMS (Without Expand)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 107.025px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 107.025px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>MP ESB Forest / Field Guard / Jail Prahari 2023 </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Notification Exam District Details</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Bhopal, Indore, Jabalpur, Gwalior, Ujjain, Ratlam, Sagar, Satna, Khandwa, Sidhi &amp; Rewa.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 287.825px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 287.825px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill MP Jail Prahari, Forest Guard Recruitment Online Form 2022</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Recruitment of Madhya Pradesh PEB for the posts of Van Rakshak &amp; Kshetra Rakshak (Karyapalik) (Van Vibhag), Jail Prahari (Karyapalik)(Jail Vibhag) Direct Recruitment Test- 2023 The applications of Recruitment will be online from <strong>25 January 2023 to 08 February 2023</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Along with Madhya Pradesh, candidates from other states can also apply (As per Forest Guard, Field Guard &amp; Jail Prahari Recruitment Rules) .</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">To apply in Madhya Pradesh Professional Board, the candidate has to first create a profile of himself. To create a profile, the candidate wants to have Aadhar card number and also want to have registered mobile number in it, only then there will be E-KYC in the profile, those whose mobile number is not registered, they will have to create a profile through biometric through MP Online Kiosk. .</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">For the application of recruitment in Madhya Pradesh Professional Board, along with the profile, all the candidates will also have to register in the Madhya Pradesh Employment Office.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Candidates who have registered their profile and employment, now they have to apply which will run from <strong>20/01/2023 to 03/02/2023.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">For More Details Read the Full Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"310\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Result</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"488\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"MP ESB Forest Field Guard Jail prahari Result 2022\" href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/results/RESULT_23/JAIL_VAN_RES23/default_Results.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"310\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Answer Key</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"488\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"MP ESB Forest Field Guard Jail prahari Admit Card 2022\" href=\"https://mppeb.cbexams.com/MPPEB_Cand_Objections/JailVanrakshakesb2023candresponses/appstart.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"310\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"cent