0% Marks.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For SC : 50% Marks</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Account Assistant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"122\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">08</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"390\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Commerce with Minimum 60% Marks.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For ST Candidates : 50% Marks</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Office Assistant HR</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"122\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"390\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Stream with Minimum 60% Marks.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Public Relation Assistant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"122\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"390\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Mass Communication and Journalism with Minimum 60% Marks.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC Candidate : 50% Marks.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maintainer / Electrical</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"122\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">78</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"390\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">ITI Certificate in Electrical Trade with Minimum 60% Marks</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : 50% Marks.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maintainer / S&amp;T</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"122\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">26</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"390\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">ITI Certificate in Electronic Mechanic Trade with Minimum 60% Marks.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : 50% Marks.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"742\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh Metro Recruitment 2024 :&nbsp; Exam District Details</strong></span><strong> </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Agra, Aligarh, Bareilly, Ghaziabad, Gorakhpur, Jhansi, Kanpur, Lucknow, Mathura, Meerut, Moradabad, Muzaffarnagar, Noida, Prayagraj, Varanasi, Ayodhya, Basti and Sitapur Only.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"742\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"742\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill UP Metro Recruitment Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>OBC certificate</strong> should not be more than 01 year old from the last date of application.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>EWS certificate</strong> should be made on or after the last date of application, 01 April 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Uttar Pradesh Metro Rail Corporation UPMRC Latest Various Post Recruitment 2024 Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>20/03/2024 to 19/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in UP Metro Rail Recruitment Online Form 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"742\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"370\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"372\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UP Metro Recruitment 2024 Online Registration\" href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com/per/g01/pub/1139/ASM/WebPortal/11/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Link Activate 20/03/2024</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"370\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"372\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download UP Metro Various Post Notification 2024\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/sarkariresult.com-UP-Metro-Various-Post-Notification-2024_compressed.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"370\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"372\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UP Metro Official Website\" href=\"https://www.lmrcl.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>UPMRC Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710487706-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-15 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(147, 'PDUSU Recruitment 2024', 'Pandit Deendayal Upadhyaya Shekhawati University  2024 Apply Online for 29 Junior Clerk Post', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><a style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://biharhelp.in/pdusu-recruitment/\">PDUSU Recruitment 2024 Apply Online for 29 Junior Clerk Post</a></span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content cf\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">PDUSU Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</span>&nbsp; Pandit Deendayal Upadhyaya Shekhawati University (PDUSU), Sikar (Rajasthan</strong>) ने &nbsp;<strong>Junior Clerk</strong> के कुल मिलाकर<strong> 29</strong>&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>रिक्तियों पर भर्ती के लिए विज्ञापन की अधिसूचना (<strong>Vacancy Advertisement)</strong> &nbsp;जारी की है। इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी <strong>11 March, 2024 </strong><strong>से 10 April, </strong><strong>2024 </strong><strong>तक</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Online</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Apply</strong> &nbsp;कर सकते हैं।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इस विज्ञापन की विस्तृत जानकारी जैसे <strong>Post Name, No. of Vacancies, Eligibility Criteria, Pay Scale, Application Fee, Selection Process, How to Apply Instructions, Important Dates, Useful Web Links</strong> इत्यादि इस प्रकार है &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"PDUSU_Recruitment_2024_Overview\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>PDUSU Recruitment 2024 Overview&nbsp;</strong></span></span></em></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 234.8px; border: 3px inset rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Recruitment Organization</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Pandit Deendayal Upadhyaya Shekhawati University, Sikar (Rajasthan)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Advertisement No. &amp; Notification Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">03/2024 Dated &ndash; 10/03/2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 23.6px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Name of Recruitment</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 23.6px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Vacancies for Non-Teaching Staff (Clerical)</span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Advertisement for the Post of Non Teaching Staff (Clerical)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Name of Post</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Clerk</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Total Number of Vacancies</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">29 Vacancies</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Type of Article</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Latest Govt Jobs</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Who can Apply</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Indian Citizen</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Eligibility Criteria</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Read the full Article</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Apply Mode</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Online</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Starting Date to Apply Online</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">11/03/2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Closing Date to Apply Online</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10/04/2024 (11.59 PM)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date to receipt of Printed Copy of Online Application along with documents</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">20/04/2024 (5.00 P.M)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"PDUSU_Recruitment_2024_Notification_Details\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>PDUSU Recruitment 2024 Notification Details&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Pandit Deendayal Upadhyaya Shekhawati University (PDUSU), Sikar (Rajasthan</strong>) ने &nbsp;<strong>Junior Clerk</strong> के कुल मिलाकर<strong> 29</strong> &nbsp;<strong>Vacancies </strong>&nbsp;पर <strong>Selection&nbsp;</strong> के लिए <strong>Suitable and Eligible Candidates</strong> से <strong>Online Application</strong> &nbsp;की मांग की है .इस <strong>Recruitment Notification</strong> की विस्तृत जानकारी इस प्रकार है &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 122.2px; border: 3px ridge rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.314%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center; height: 20px;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Post &amp; Pay Scale&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 27.6681%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center; height: 20px;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total No. of Vacancies&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.0313%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center; height: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category Wise Reservation Status&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 102.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.314%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); height: 102.2px;\" width=\"50%\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Junior Clerk</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Matrix : Level -5, Rs.5200-20200/- GP -Rs.2400/-</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 27.6681%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); height: 102.2px;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">29 Vacancies</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.0313%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); height: 102.2px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General: 13 posts</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">EWS: 02 Posts</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">BC: 06 Posts</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">MBC: 01 Post</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC: 04 Posts</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">ST: 03 Posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"PDUSU_Eligibility_Criteria_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>PDUSU Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px ridge rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 107.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.6022%; height: 107.2px; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Post &amp; Pay Scale&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.3813%; height: 107.2px; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Educational Qualification </strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(As on 10/04/2024)&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.9945%; height: 107.2px; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(As on 10/04/2024)&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 125px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.6022%; height: 125px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Junior Clerk</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.3813%; height: 125px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Intermediate (10+2) or equivalent&nbsp; passed. and</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">DOEACC &lsquo;O&rsquo; Level Certificate or Certificate ITI in COPA trade&nbsp; or Diploma or Certificate Course in Computer Science or Computer Application and Good Knowledge of&nbsp; Typing in English and Hindi.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.9945%; height: 125px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">18 to 40 years.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Age_Relaxation_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Relaxation&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation in upper limit will be given to only reserved categories candidates of Rajasthan only as per government rules and regulations</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px outset rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Relaxation in Upper Limit&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST /BC Category Male Candidates of only&nbsp; Rajasthan</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">05 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST/BC Category Female Candidates of Only Rajasthan</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General Category Female</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">05 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">EXSM</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Up to 50 years of Age</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">PwBD</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10 years in Each Category</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Reservation_and_Relaxation_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Reservation and Relaxation&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Reservation &amp; Relaxation will be given to only reserved categories&nbsp; Candidates of Rajasthan having domicile certificate as per government rules and regulations. The reserved category candidates of other States shall be treated as General Candidates</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Location_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Job Location&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rajasthan</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Employment_type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Job Employment type&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Regular&nbsp; Basis</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Period_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Job Period&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Permanent</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Who_can_apply_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Who can apply&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Indian Citizen (Male /Female)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Selection_Process_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Selection Process&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Written Test and</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Computer Typing Test</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview ,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification &amp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Exam_Date_Centre\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Exam Date /Centre</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">will be notified on official website later.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Form_Type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Form Type&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Application Form</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Apply_Mode_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Apply Mode</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Online</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Application_Fee_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px ridge rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 36px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 36px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Amount of Fee&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 58px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 58px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">BC-NCL /MBC-NCL/EWS/SC/ST Category of Only Rajasthan State</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 58px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rs.500/-</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 36px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;All Other Category of Rajasthan</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 36px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rs.1000/-</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 36px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Candidates of Other States</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 36px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rs.1000/-</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 36px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All PwBD Category</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 36px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rs.100/-</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 81px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 81px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Payment Mode &ndash;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 81px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Method (Debit /Credit Card / Net Banking/IMPS/Cash Cards/ Mobile Wallets/UPI</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Apply_Pre_Requisite_-Enclosure_-_Documents_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Apply Pre Requisite -/Enclosure -/ Documents&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Self attested photocopies of the following should be enclosed with application form</strong> &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Valid &amp; Active Email Id</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mobile No.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Educational Qualification Certificates with Marks sheet</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Proof</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Photograph</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Signature</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Id &amp; Address Proof</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Caste /Category / PH/ Domicile / EXSM/ EWS / NOC (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_for_PDUSU_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply for PDUSU Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी को चाहिए कि &nbsp;वे <strong>Online Apply&nbsp; </strong>करने से पहले <strong>PDUSU Recruitment 2024 </strong>&nbsp;की <strong>Eligibility criteria </strong><strong>और </strong><strong>Applying process</strong> की विस्तृत जानकारी के लिए <strong>Official Notification </strong><strong>का </strong><strong>full details</strong> जरूर पढ़ लें। <strong>Online Apply</strong>&nbsp; करने के लिए निम्नलिखित <strong>steps </strong><strong>को </strong><strong>follow</strong> करें &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Fill_Online_Application_Form_for_PDUSU_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;How to Fill Online Application Form for PDUSU Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PDUSU Recruitment 2024 </strong>&nbsp;के आवेदन के लिए आपको सबसे पहले <strong>Official Website</strong> <a href=\"https://shekhauni.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://shekhauni.ac.in/</a> पर जाना होगा। जो कुछ इस प्रकार होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Home Page</strong> पर &lsquo;<strong>Recruitment&gt;Ongoing Recruitments&nbsp;&lsquo; menu</strong> पर <strong>Click</strong> कर &nbsp;के <strong>Search</strong> करने के बाद आपको <strong>PDUSU Recruitment 2024 -Vacancy for Non Teaching Post (Clerical) &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Junior Clerk Vacancy Notification</strong> का <strong>Link</strong> &nbsp;दिखाई देगा। उसे वहां से <strong>download</strong> करके पूरा पढ़ लें &nbsp;ताकि आपको <strong>Eligibility Criteria&nbsp; </strong><strong>और </strong><strong>Online applying</strong> <strong>procedure</strong>&nbsp; की विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त हो सके।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">उसी <strong>Official Page </strong><strong>या इस </strong><strong>Article </strong><strong>के</strong>&nbsp;इसी पेज पर नीचे उपलब्ध&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;&ldquo;Online Apply &rdquo; link</strong>&nbsp;को क्लिक करें&nbsp; अपने&nbsp;<strong>Email Id </strong><strong>और </strong><strong>mobile number</strong>&nbsp;का प्रयोग करते हुए&nbsp;<strong>Registration</strong>&nbsp;करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद&nbsp;<strong>Login</strong> करके <strong>Online Application</strong> को <strong>correctly &amp; Carefully fill up&nbsp;</strong> करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Required Documents, Photograph and Signature</strong>&nbsp; को<strong>&nbsp;scan </strong><strong>करके </strong><strong>upload</strong>&nbsp; करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Pay Application Fee through Online mode.&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Application Form&nbsp; </strong><strong>को </strong><strong>final submit </strong><strong>करके </strong><strong>Print out</strong>&nbsp; प्राप्त कर लें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The Sealed envelope containing the print out of duly filled in online application form along with all necessary and self attested supporting documents must reach th<strong>e &ldquo;Office of The Registrar, Pandit Deendayal Upadhyaya Shekhawati University, Sikar (Rajasthan) </strong>latest by<strong> 20th April 2024 up to 5.00 P.M</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Links_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links&nbsp;</strong></span></em></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 82.2px; border: 3px inset rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Apply Link&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://shekhaunirecruitment.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 42.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); height: 42.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PDUSU Recruitment 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); height: 42.2px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://shekhauni.ac.in/Uploadfile/News/News_b828c797-f389-4965-a7c9-365f36e722f7_VACANCY%20FOR%20NON%20TEACHING%20STAFF%20(NON%20CLERICAL).pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); height: 20px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://shekhauni.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1711709695-pdusu.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-15 00:00:00', '2024-03-29 10:54:55', NULL, NULL);
