"color: red; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Bihar Police SI  Notification PDF\" href=\"https://bpssc.bih.nic.in/Advts/Advt-02-2023-SI.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"BPSC Official Website\" href=\"http://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BPSSC Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1710507996-pic.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-15 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(150, 'UPPSC Medical Officer and Other Post Recruitment 2024', 'Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission UPPSC Medical Officer Allopathy and Other Post Recruitment 2024', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\" width=\"741\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer &amp; Other Post Examination 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UPPSC MO Exam D-1/E-1/2024: Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"377\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>15/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>12/04/2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date :&nbsp;<strong> 12/04/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Last Date : <strong>23/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date <strong>: As per Schedule </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available <strong>: Before Exam </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"365\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>105/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>65/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">PH Candidates : <strong>25/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay Offline Through E Challan<strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>UPPSC</strong><strong> <strong>Medical Officer </strong>Notification 2023 : </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 01/07/2023 </strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :<strong> 21 Years </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age: <strong>40 </strong><strong>Years </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per UPPSC&nbsp;Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer Recruitment Examination Rules 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>UPPSC Medical Officer Recruitment 2024 : <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">Vacancy Details Total : 2535 Post </span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"445\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPPSC Medical Officer Eligibility 2024 </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"170\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Officer Allopathy</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2532</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"445\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">MBBS Degree with PG Degree in Related Branch / Stream</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For Trade Wise Vacancy Details Read the Notification</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"170\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Prohibition and Social Uplift Officer</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"445\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Economics and Sociology</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"170\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Regional Publicity Officer</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"445\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree with Hindi Lit and / OR English Lit with Second Division Marks, Diploma in Journalism or Experience at least 3 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"170\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Regional Tourist Officer/Publicity Officer</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"445\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">How to Fill UPPSC Medical Officer &amp; Other Post Recruitment 2024 Online Form</span> </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission UPPSC Call For New Application for UPPSC Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer, Social Development Officer SDO, Divisional Publication Officer, Publicity Officer Examination 2024 Recruitment Candidate Can Apply Between<strong> 15/03/2024 to 12/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">It is mandatory to have OTR i.e. <strong><a title=\"UPPSC OTR Registration 2023\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/2023/uppsc-otr-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">One Time Registration</a></strong> for UPPSC Recruitment.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay attention, the registration number is received only after 72 hours of OTR registration - that\'s why OTR should be done first and only then the application will be made.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Uttar Pradesh UPPSC Latest&nbsp;Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer Examination 2024- UP Government Jobs 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online UPPSC Medicial Officer Recruitment Registration 2024\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/CandidatePages/Notifications.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPPSC Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer MO Notification 2024\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/OuterPages/View_Enclosure.aspx?ID=550&amp;flag=E&amp;FID=832\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>English</strong></a> | <a title=\"UPPSC Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer MO Notification 2024\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/OuterPages/View_Enclosure.aspx?ID=550&amp;flag=H&amp;FID=831\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Hindi</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Short Notification </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPPSC Uttar Pradesh Medical Officer MO Notification 2024\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/sarkariresult-uppsc-medical-officer-short-notice-scaled.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPPSC DashBoard Login</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UPPSC OTR DashBoard\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/CandidatePages/OTRAppForm/Applicant_OtrAuthentication.aspx?WEqGEem9m0+8Y4tNQqJiNYurmbKsjJR/fgSlThSTh6o=#no-back\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UPPSC OTR DashBoard</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For UPPSC OTR Registration </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UPPSC OTR Registration 2023\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/2023/uppsc-otr-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UPPSC OTR Registration</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UPPSC Official Website 2023\" href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UPPSC Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710508873-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-15 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(151, 'Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering GATE Result card', 'IISc Bengaluru will conduct Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering (GATE 2024) this year, candidates who are Enrolled in this Exam Can Download Result .', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px dotted rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering (GATE 2024)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Conducted By : Indian Institute of Science IISc Bengaluru </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>IIT GATE 2024 | Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Application Begin :<strong> 30/08/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Last Date for Apply Online Phase I : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>05/10/2023</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Last Date for Apply Online Phase II<strong> (Extended Period)</strong> : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>13/10/2023</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Correction Date : <strong>07-11 November 2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Exam Date :<strong> 03-04, 10-11 February 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Admit Card Available :<strong> 03/01/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Test Paper Responses Available :<strong> 16/02/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Result Declared : <strong>16/03/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>1800/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>900/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">All Category Female : <strong>900/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Phase II with Late Fees:</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>2300/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>1400/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">All Category Female : <strong>1400/-</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>GATE 2024 Eligibility</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Passed / Appearing B.E / B.Tech / B.Pharm / B.Arch / B.Sc. Research / B.S. M.Sc. / MA / MCA / M.E. / M.Tech / Dual Degree / Integrated Courses</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">For Complete Details See Brochure<strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>GATE Photo Instruction </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Good Quality Latest Passport Size Color Photo&nbsp; with White Background.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Face Should Occupy at Least 75% of Photograph</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Instruction of Thumb Impression</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Draw Rectangular Box 3 cm X 5 Cm on A4 Size, Mark Your Left Thumb Impression within Draw Box</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Instruction of Signature</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Draw Rectangular Box 2 Cm X 7 CM on&nbsp; A4 Size Paper, Sign Within Draw Box on Black / Blue Pen in Running Hand.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill IIT GATE 2024 Online Form</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Indian Institute of Science IISc Bengalurur Are Issued Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the GATE 2024 Candidate Can Apply Online for <strong>24 August 2023 to 05 October 2023. </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the IIT GATE 2024 Application Form in Sarkari Result Admission Section.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>IIT GATE 2023 Exam Cities Details </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>IIT Kanpur : UP -</strong> Aligarh, Prayagraj (Allahabad), Bareilly, Gorakhpur, Jhansi , Kanpur, Lucknow, Varanasi<strong>, MP - </strong>Bhopal, Gwalior, Jabalpur, Sagar, Satna.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>IIT Roorkee : Haryana -</strong> Ambala &amp; Kurukshetra, <strong>Himachal Pradesh -</strong> Bilaspur, Hamirpur, Kangra, Mandi, Shimla-Solan, <strong>Punjab -</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Amritsar, Bathinda, Jalandhar, Ludhiana, Mohali-Chandigarh, Patiala, Pathankot , <strong>Uttar Pradesh -</strong>&nbsp;Ghaziabad, Meerut, Moradabad, Muzaffarnagar, NOIDA, Saharanpur , <strong>Uttarakhand -</strong> Dehradun, Haldwani, Roorkee.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>IIT Delhi : Haryana </strong>Faridabad, Gurugram, Hisar, <strong>Jammu and Kashmi</strong>r Jammu-Samba, Srinagar, <strong>Ladakh</strong>: Leh, <strong>Madhya Pradesh&nbsp;</strong>Indore, Ujjain ,<strong> New Delhi -</strong> New Delhi , <strong>Rajasthan -</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Ajmer, Alwar, Bikaner, Jaipur, Jodhpur, Kota, Sikar, Udaipur , <strong>Uttar Pradesh -</strong> Greater NOIDA, Mathura.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">For Other IIT Exam Cities Details <strong><a title=\"IIT GATE 2024 Exam Cities\" href=\"https://gate2024.iisc.ac.in/exam-cities/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here </a></strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Result / Score Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"GATE 2024 Test Paper Responses Download\" href=\"https://gate2024.iisc.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Link Activate 16/03/2024</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Master Question Paper with Answer Key</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"GATE 2024 Test Paper Responses Download\" href=\"https://gate2024.iisc.ac.in/question-papers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Test Paper Responses</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"GATE 2024 Test Paper Responses Download\" href=\"https://goaps.iisc.ac.in/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"GATE 2024 Information Brochure PDF Download\" href=\"https://goaps.iisc.ac.in/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Exam Schedule</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"GATE 2024 Information Brochure PDF Download\" href=\"https://gate2024.iisc.ac.in/examination-schedule/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>For Mocktest Practice</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"GATE 2024 Information Brochure PDF Download\" href=\"https://gate2024.iisc.ac.in/mock-test-links/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 