-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"GATE 2024 Syllabus PDF Download\" href=\"https://gate2024.iisc.ac.in/papers-and-syllabus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>GATE 2024 Syllabus</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a title=\" GATE 2024 Conducted Website\" href=\"https://gate2024.iisc.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>GATE 2024 Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1710509938-pic.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-15 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
