style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"493\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Commissioner State Tax</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"236\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">16</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"493\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">State Tax Officer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"236\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">53</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"493\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Municipal Commissioner / Executive Officer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"236\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">07</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"729\"><center></center>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>UKPSC Pre 2024 : Pre Exam Center Details</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Almora, Ranikhet, Champavat, Pithorgarh, Nainital, &nbsp;Ramnagar, Haldwari, Rudrapur, Kashipur, &nbsp;Khatima, Bageshwar, Podi, Shrinagar, Kotdwar, Gopeshwar, Karn Prayag, New Tehri, Narendra Nagar, Rudraprayag, Uttar Kashi, Badhkot, Dehradun, Vikasnagar, Rishikesh, Haridwar, Luxar and Roorkee. .</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"729\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill Uttarakhand UKPSC Combined State Civil Upper Subordinate Exam Online Form 2024</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Uttarakhand Public Service Commission UKPSC Combined State Civil Upper Subordinate Service Examination UKPSC Pre 2024 Latest Jobs Recruitment 2024. Candidate Can Apply Between&nbsp;<strong>14/03/2024 to 03/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in UKPSC PCS Pre &nbsp;Exam 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Exam Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"729\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 0, 255); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"729\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"365\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"364\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UKPSC PCS Pre Online Registration 2024\" href=\"https://ukpscnet.in/upcs/exam.html#/prt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"365\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"364\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UKPSC PCS Pre Exam 2024 Notification PDF\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/sarkariresult.com-ukpsc-pre-2024-notification_compressed.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"365\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"364\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UKPSC Official Website for Latest Jobs\" href=\"https://psc.uk.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UKPSC Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710515721-ugnybrtyht.webp', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-15 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(159, 'Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti NVS Non Teaching Recruitment 2024', 'Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti has relased Under The Recruitment Drive for Non Teaching Various Post 2024', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px dotted rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"786\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\"><strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti (NVS)</strong><strong> </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>NVS Various Non Teaching Post Recruitment 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>NVS Recruitment Drive 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"379\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>Soon</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> Soon</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date <strong>: Soon</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date <strong>: As per Schedule</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available :<strong> Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"407\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For Female Staff Nurse : <strong>1500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For All Other Post : <strong>1000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>50</strong><strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Only.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"786\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya NVS Various Post 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy <em>Details</em> Total&nbsp; 1377 Post</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"cen