if; font-size: 12pt;\">Class 10 High School Exam Passed in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit : 18-30 Years</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"786\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill Navodaya Vidyalaya Non Teaching Post Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti NVS Various Non Teaching Recruitment 2024. Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>Dates Available Soon.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Jobs Application Form in NVS Non Teaching MTS, Junior Secretarial Assistant, Staff Nurse, Lab Attendant, Electrician &amp; Other Various Non Teaching Post Recruitment 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Are Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Pay and Complete Your Form</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"786\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"369\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"417\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"NVS Non Teaching Registration 2024\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.app.app14f269771c01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Link Activate Soon</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"369\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"417\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download NVS Non Teaching Post Notification PDF\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/