: 12pt;\"><strong>Download GATE Syllabus</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"GATE 2024 Syllabus PDF Download\" href=\"https://gate2024.iisc.ac.in/papers-and-syllabus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>GATE 2024 Syllabus</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\" GATE 2024 Conducted Website\" href=\"https://gate2024.iisc.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>GATE 2024 Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710599979-HTYFUYJ.webp', '14', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-16 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(162, 'IBPS Specialist Officer  13th Recruitment 2023 Result', 'Institute of Banking Personal Selection (IBPS) has released the Recruitment of Common Recruitment Specialist Officer SO in IT Officer, Agriculture Field Officer', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px dashed rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"710\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Institute of Banking Personal Selection (IBPS)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>IBPS CRP SPL XII Specialist Officer SO Recruitment 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>IBPS SO SPL 13 Exam 2023 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"374\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin :<strong>01/08/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> <strong>21/08/2023</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Fee Payment :&nbsp;<strong> 21/08/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Prelim Exam Date : <strong>30-31</strong> <strong>December 2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>21/12/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Prelim Exam Result : <strong>30-31</strong> <strong>16/01/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam Date <strong>: 28/01/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>18/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam Result : <strong>30-31</strong> <strong>13/02/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC : <strong>850/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>175/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or E Challan Fee Mode Only</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"710\