(166, 'BSF Group B  C Various Post Online Form 2024', 'Information :	Border Security Force (BSF) has released the detailed notification of Constable, Head Constable, Assistant Sub Inspector ASI and Sub Inspector SI', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px ridge rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\"><strong>Border Security Force (BSF)</strong><strong> </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BSF Group B &amp; Group C Constable, HC, ASI, SI Various Post Recruitment 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BSF Group B &amp; C Exam 2024&nbsp; |&nbsp;</strong> <strong>Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>17/03/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>15/04/2024 </strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong>15/04/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>As per Schedule</strong> <strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"440\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>147.2/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>47.2/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female : <strong>47.2/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BSF Group B &amp; Group C Notification 2024 :&nbsp; </strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 15/04/2024 </strong></span></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit :&nbsp; <strong>Max 30 Years for SI Works &amp; SI Electrical </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : <strong>18-25 Years for Advt No. : Combatised_C/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : <strong>Max 20-25 Years (Post Wise) Advt No. :&nbsp; Air_Wing/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per BSF Head Constable, ASI &amp; Constable Recruitment 2023 Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>BSF Group B &amp; Group C Various Post Recruitment 2024 : </strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Vacancy Details Total : 82 Post</strong></span></span><strong> </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"185\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"143\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"470\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BSF Group B and Group C Various Post Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202