/span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 71.0187%; border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"304\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>For SSC OTR Registration</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 28.9484%; border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"300\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" title=\"Download SSC OTR Registration 2024\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/ssc/ssc-one-time-registration-otr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Click Here</span></a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 71.0187%; border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"304\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 28.9484%; border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"300\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" title=\"SSC Official Website 2024\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SSC Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710823553-fuifmymni.webp', '17', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-19 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(173, '12th Result  2024 Bihar Board  Google Search', 'BSEB Bihar Board 12th Result 2024 Live Updates: BSEB Intermediate result 2024 Students can check the official', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; border: 1px ridge rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 1329.83px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 255.133px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 255.133px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>BSEB Bihar Board Class 12th Inter Result 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Bihar Board BSEB XIIth Results 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Exam Info 2024\" href=\"../../\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</span></span> </strong></span></a></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 224.183px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 224.183px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Class 12 Inter Exam : -<strong><br></strong></li>\r\n<li>Result Declared :<strong>&nbsp; Results Live 20-Mar-2024<br></strong></li>\r\n<li>Scrutiny Result Declared :<strong> -<br></strong></li>\r\n<li>Compartment Result Declared :<strong> -<br></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 224.183px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Exam Conducted By</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>BSEB Patna &ndash; Bihar School of Examination Board Will be Conducted the Examination of&nbsp; Inter Class 12th Annual Board Examination 2024.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 283.383px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 283.383px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>How to Check Bihar Board 12th Result 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>In this year 2024 around 18 lakhs are registered in Bihar Board Intermediate Class 12th Exam.</li>\r\n<li>This year Bihar Board Inter Class 12 Exam was held from .</li>\r\n<li>This year the result of Bihar Board Inter XIIth examination will be released on --, 2024 at 05 PM by Bihar Board</li>\r\n<li>What documents / details will be required to check the result of Bihar Board Inter class 12th exam this year.</li>\r\n<li>To check the result of Bihar Board Class 12 Inter Examination 2024, the candidate will need the roll code and roll number.</li>\r\n<li>Candidates who do not have roll number and roll code available or not known can check it in their admit card or can check from their school/college/board.</li>\r\n<li>Bihar Board Class 12 Result of all stream Result will be released on<strong> 2024 </strong>together.</li>\r\n<li>Candidates can also check their subject wise result of the exam.</li>\r\n<li>Stream Wise Toppers information will also be released by the Bihar Board.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 283.383px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 283.383px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Bihar Board 12th Inter Result 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bihar Board Class 12 Result 2024 will also be available on these website. The direct link to check the result will also be available in some useful important links at the bottom of this page.</li>\r\n<li>biharboardonline.bihar.gov.in</li>\r\n<li>onlinebseb.in</li>\r\n<li>secondary.biharboardonline.com</li>\r\n<li>biharboardonline.com</li>\r\n<li>interbseb.com/</li>\r\n<li>Direct Link Also Available at <a title=\"Exam Info Blog 2024\" href=\"../../\"><strong>ExamInfo.Blog</strong></a></li>\r\n<li>In the last year <strong>2022</strong> of Bihar Board BSEB Inter Class 12th, a total of <strong>80.15</strong> percent students passed.</li>\r\n<li>In the this year <strong>2023 </strong>of Bihar Board BSEB Inter Class 12th, a total of <strong>88.7</strong> percent students passed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 94.5833px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 94.5833px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>12th Results Live</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"http://results.biharboardonline.com/secondary23\">Click here</a>&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>12<sup>th </sup>Result Backup Link<br></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Exam Info BSEB 12th Result 2024\" href=\"http://bihar.indiaresults.com/\">Click Here</a><br></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 94.5833px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 94.5833px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Class 12<sup>th</sup> Inter Result </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 94.5833px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Check Bihar Board 12th Inter Result 2024\" href=\"http://results.biharboardonline.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 94.5833px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 94.5833px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BSEB Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 94.5833px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Bihar Board Official Website\" href=\"http://biharboardonline.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710839485-12th_result_2024.webp', '13', 1, 'Y', '2024-03-19 00:00:00', '2024-03-20 06:23:27', NULL, NULL);
