size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"365\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"388\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Apply Online DSSSB Various Post 2024 Registration\" href=\"http://dsssbonline.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Link Activate on 19/03/2024</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"365\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"388\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"DSSSB Advt No 05/2024 Notification Download\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/DSSSB/circulars-orders/final_advt._no_05-2024_1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"365\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"388\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"DSSSB Official Website\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>DSSSB Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710902606-Delhi DSSSB Delhi District Court Safai Karamchari, Chowkidar, Driver, Process Server, Peon, Orderly Recruitment 2024 Apply Online.webp', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-20 00:00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(178, 'Rajasthan High Court RHC System Assistant Recruitment 2023', 'Rajasthan High Court, RHC Jodhpurhas released the notification for recruitment to 230 posts of System Assistant', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; border: 3px dotted rgb(236, 202, 250); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" width=\"686\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"15\" valign=\"top\" width=\"686\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 12, 195); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Rajasthan High Court, RHC Jodhpur</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Rajasthan High Court RHC System Assistant (SA) Recruitment 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Rajasthan HC System Assistant Exam 2024 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Exam Info Result 2024\" href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin&nbsp;<strong>:&nbsp; 04/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for&nbsp; Apply Online :&nbsp;<strong>03/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date<strong>&nbsp;: 04/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date CBT :&nbsp;<strong>03/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available :&nbsp;<strong>21/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Result Available :&nbsp;<strong>19/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"358\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / Other State&nbsp;<strong>: 750/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OBC / EWS :<strong>&nbsp;600/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH<strong>&nbsp;: 450/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay the Exam Fee Through Offline Payment &nbsp;E Challan Fee Mode</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"15\" valign=\"top\" width=\"686\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Rajasthan High Court System Assistant Notification 2024:&nbsp;Age Limit as on 01/01/2025</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation As per Rajasthan High Court System Assistant Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"15\" valign=\"top\" width=\"686\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Rajasthan High Court System Assistant Recruitment 2023 :&nbsp;Vacancy Details</strong><strong>&nbsp;Total : 230 Post</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"347\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Rajasthan High Court System Assistant Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">System Assistant</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"126\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">230</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"347\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BE / B.Tech / B.Sc Degree in Computer Science OR Equivalent Degree OR Bachelor Degree in Any Subject with PGDCA OR A Level Exam OR Diploma in Computer Science and Engineering / I.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"15\" valign=\"top\" width=\"686\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 12, 195); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Rajasthan High Court System Assistant Exam 2024 :&nbsp;Category Wise Vacancy Details</strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UR : 85 | OBC NCL : 48 | MBC : 11 | EWS : 23 | SC : 36 | ST : 27 | Total 230 Post</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"15\" valign=\"top\" width=\"686\"><center></center>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill Rajasthan High Court System Assistant Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Rajasthan High Court, RHC Jodhpur Latest Job Recruitment for System Assistant Recruitment 2023 Batch Vacancies. Candidate Can Apply Between<strong>&nbsp;04/01/2024 to 03/02/2024 Apply Online.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Rajasthan High Court Recruitment 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"15\" valign=\"top\" width=\"686\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><sup><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></sup></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(