=\"color: rgb(255, 12, 195); font-size: 12pt;\">Form 6</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">New registration for general electors</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"108\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Form 6 Guidlines Notification\" href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/guidelines/Form-6_en.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"164\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 12, 195); font-size: 12pt;\">Form 6A</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">New registration for overseas(NRI) electors</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"108\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Form 6A Guidlines \" href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/guidelines/Form-6a_en.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"164\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 12, 195); font-size: 12pt;\">Form 6B</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Aadhaar collection&nbsp; Fill Form 6B to get Aadhaar and EPIC.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"108\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Form 6B Aadhar Download\" href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"164\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 12, 195); font-size: 12pt;\">Form 7</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Objection for proposed inclusion/deletion of name in existing roll</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"108\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Form 7 Guidliens \" href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/guidelines/Form-7_en.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"164\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 12, 195); font-size: 12pt;\">Form 8</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Shifting of residence/correction of entries in existing electoral roll/replacement of EPIC/marking of PwD</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"108\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Form 8 Guidlines\" href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/guidelines/Form-8_en.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\"><center></center>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill Voter ID Form 6A New Registration Form (Desh ka Form)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Open the New Voters ID Online Registration and Fill Form 6.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Enter Your Mobile No.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Enter&nbsp; Your OTP / SMS Password</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fill Your Basic Details</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Upload Photo and Related Docs.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Submit Document to Concerned Authority</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\">How to&nbsp; Download E Voter ID Card E- EPIC 2024</span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Using this you can download Digital Version of Electrol Photo Identity Card (Voter ID Card) online.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">To download online the candidate should register mobile no./Email ID/EPIC no. Must login with Password.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">After login, the candidate will see the option to download Epic in his dashboard, click on it and download.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who are facing difficulty in logging in can also forget the password, the option of which is given.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online (Desh ka Form)</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"318\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Voter ID Online Registration 2024\" href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download E Epic Voter ID Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"318\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Voter ID E Download 2023\" href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Track Application Status (All Form)</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"318\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Voter ID Check Form Status\" href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Search in Electoral Roll Check Your Name in Voter List</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"318\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Electrorol Search 2024\" href=\"https://electoralsearch.eci.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Know Your Polling Station / Officer / BLO Details</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"318\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"BLO Polling Station Search\" href=\"https://electoralsearch.eci.gov.in/pollingstation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"318\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Voter Service Portal\" href=\"https://voters.eci.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Voters Service Portal Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710950953-Voter Service Portal 2024 New Voter Registration, E EPIC Download, Correction.webp', '17', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-20 00:00:00', '2024-03-20 04:09:13', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(186, 'DSSSB Various Post Recruitment 2024', 'Delhi Subordinate Services Selection Board DSSSB has released the advertisement for recruitment to 414 posts of Lab Technician, Pharmacist, Draftsman Grade-III', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; border: 3px outset rgb(194, 224, 244); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" width=\"753\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1277px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 12, 195); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Board (DSSSB)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(7, 255, 237); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>DSSSB Driver, Pharmacist, Staff Nurse and Other Post Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 899px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"375\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 255, 39); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin :<strong>21/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>19/04/2024 upto 11 PM&nbsp;</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Pay Exam Fee :&nbsp;<strong>19/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date :&nbsp;<strong>As per Schedule &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available :&nbsp;<strong>Before Exam&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 378px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"378\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 255, 39); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS :&nbsp;<strong>100/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH&nbsp;<strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female&nbsp;<strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1277px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DSSSB Pharmacist, Nurse and Other Various Post Notification 2024 :&nbsp;</strong><strong>Age Limit as on 19/04/2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18-21 Years</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>27</strong>-<strong>3</strong><strong>2 Years (Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per DSSSB Delhi Lab Technician (Group-Iii) , Lab Technician (Group-Iv) , Lab Technician , Pharmacist (Allopathic) , Junior Pharmacist , Draftsman Grade-III (Civil) , Store Keeper , Store Supervisor , Auxiliary Nurse Midwife, Assistant Sanitary Inspector , Driver , Staff Car Driver (Ordinary Grade) , Driver (LMV) , Staff Car Driver Recruitment Advt No. 06/2024 Vacancy Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1277px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Delhi DSSSB 06/2024 Recruitment 2024 :&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;Vacancy Details Total : 414 Post</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 167px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Code</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 624.102px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"99\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 390.898px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"392\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DSSSB Delhi District Court Various Post Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 167px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Driver</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">813/24</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 624.102px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"99\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 390.898px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"392\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 10th Exam Passed with LMV Driving License and 2 Year Experience.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit : 18-27 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td sty