>date of taking the photograph</strong>&nbsp;should be written (<a title=\"Sarkari Result Tools\" href=\"https://sarkariresult.tools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Photo Date and Name Online Maker Click Here</strong></a>)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The photo should not be more than 03 months old.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The background of the photo should be white or light colored.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 266.763%; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"14\" valign=\"top\" width=\"738\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.4748%; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"346\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Exam Notice</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 189.288%; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"392\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"MPPSC Edit Form 2024\" href=\"https://mppsc.mp.gov.in/uploads/advertisement/Vigyapti_State_Service_State_Forest_Service_Exam_2024_Dated_20_03_2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.4748%; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"346\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 189.288%; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); border-width: 3px;\" colspan