olor: rgb(255, 12, 195); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Fill NIACL Assistant Recruitment Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The New India Assurance Company Ltd (NIACL) Invited For New Application for Assistant 300 &nbsp;Post Recruitment 2024 Candidate Can Apply Online&nbsp;<strong>01 February 2024 to 15 February 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in NIACL Assistant Latest Govt. Post Recruitment 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"680\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"335\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Phase I Pre Result</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"345\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"NIACL Assistant Recruitment Result 2024\" href=\"https://www.newindia.co.in/assets/docs/recruitment/RECRUITMENT-OF-ADMINISTRATIVE-OFFICERS2023/Result%20of%20Tier%20I%20Exam%20-%20Assistant%20RE%202023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"335\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"345\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"NIACL Assistant Recruitment Admit Card 2024\" href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/niacljan24/oecla_febr24/login.php?appid=198e61b6393ffb5465d24a25853c41b8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"335\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"345\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"NIACL Assistant Recruitment Registration 2024\" href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/niacljan24/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"335\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"345\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NIACL Assistant Recruitment 2024 Notification\" href=\"https://www.newindia.co.in/assets/docs/recruitment/RECRUITMENT-OF-ADMINISTRATIVE-OFFICERS2023/DETAILED%20ENGLISH%20ADVERTISEMENT%20-%20ASSISTANT%20RECRUITMENT%202023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"335\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 3px;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"345\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NIACL Official Website\" href=\"https://www.newindia.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NIACL Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1710993452-New India Assurance NIACL Assistant Recruitment 2024 Result for 300 Post.webp', '13', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-21 00:00:00', '2024-03-21 04:32:47', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(189, 'NIFT Admissions Test Download Result with Score Card 2024', 'National Testing Agency (NTA) will conduct National Institute of Fashion Technology NIFT 2024 this year, candidates who are Enrolled in this Exam Can Download R', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>National Testing Agency (NTA)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>NTA National Institute of Fashion Technology Admissions 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>NTA NIFT Admissions 2024 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Application Begin : <strong>05/12/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 03/01/2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Last Date Online Payment : <strong>03/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">With Late Payment Last Date : <strong>08/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Correction Date : <strong>10-12 January 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Exam Date : <strong>05/02/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>01/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Result Declared :<strong> 21/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"414\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>3000</strong>/-</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>1500</strong>/-</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Late Fees :<strong> 5000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Pay Additional Fee if Add More Papers</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Online Debit Card, Credit Card or Net Banking, UPI Fee Mode</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">NTA NIFT Admissions Notification 2024 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: red;\">Age Limit as on 01/08/2024 </span></span></strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">For B.Des &amp; B.F.Tech : Maximum Age : 24 Years.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">No Age Limit in NIFT M.Des, M.F.M and M.F.Tech and PHd Courses</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per NIFT Admissions 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong>NTA NIFT Entrance Test 2024 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: red;\">Admission Details</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"245\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong>NIFT Course Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"508\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong>NTA NIFT Entrance Test Eligibility 2023 </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"245\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">B.Des &amp; B.F.Tech</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"508\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Passed / Appearing 10+2 Intermediate Exam in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"245\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">M.Des, M.F.M and M.F.Tech and PHd</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"508\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Passed / Appearing Under Graduate Degree in Any Recognized University / Institute in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">More Course Wise Eligibility Details Read the Notification</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong>How to Fill NTA NIFT 2024 Admissions Online Form </strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">National Testing Agency NTA Conducted&nbsp;National Institute of Fashion Technology NIFT UG / PG Courses&nbsp; Admission Test&nbsp; Examination 2024 Online Form Candidate &nbsp;Apply Between <strong>05 December 2023 to 03 January 2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Admissions Application Form in NTA NIFT Latest Admissions.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to NIFT Admissions 2024- Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">Download Result / Score Card </span> </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"425\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><a title=\"NIFT NTA Online Result 2023\" href=\"https://nift.ntaonline.in/frontend/web/scorecard/index\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">Download Result Notice </span> </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"425\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><a title=\"NIFT NTA Online Result 2023\" href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/NIFT/images/public-notice-for-results-of-stage-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">Download Admit Card </span> </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"425\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><a title=\"NIFT NTA Online Admit Card 2023\" href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/NIFT/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">Check Exam City </span> </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-co