<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">81</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 32.5033%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"63\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">32</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 4.0645%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"59\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">86</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 26.7781%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"64\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">44</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 5.46375%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"80\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">NA</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 4.46429%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"65\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">68</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 3.79797%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"55\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">07</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 7.66258%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"113\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">318</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 99.7265%;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill BPSC Block Horticulture Officer Online Form 2024</strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar Public Service Commission BPSC Are Issued Block Horticulture Officer Recruitment Notification 2024 and Invited Online Application Form for the BPSC Bihar Assistant Architect Jobs 2024 Candidate Can Apply Online for <strong>01/03/2024 to 21/03/2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the BPSC Latest Block Horticulture Officer Recruitment Exam 2024 Application Form in Sarkari Result Recruitment Latest Job Section.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - ID, DOB Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Live Photo and Hindi / English Signature Required in BPSC Form 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 99.7265%;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 60.482%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.2445%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online BPSC Block Horticulture Officer Registration 2024\" href=\"https://onlinebpsc.bihar.gov.in/main/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 60.482%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Date Extended Notice</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.2445%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online BPSC Block Horticulture Officer Notice 2024\" href=\"https://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/Notices/NB-2024-03-21-01.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 60.482%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.2445%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download BPSF BHO Recruitment Notification 2024 \" href=\"https://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/Notices/NB-2024-02-23-17.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Notification</a> | <a title=\"Download BPSC BHO Recruitment Syllabus 2024\" href=\"https://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/Notices/NB-2024-02-23-18.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Syllabus</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 60.482%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Recruitment Notice </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.2445%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"BPSC Notice for Recruitment Notification PDF Download\" href=\"https://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/Notices/NB-2024-02-15-01.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here </a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 60.482%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.2445%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"BPSC Official Website\" href=\"http://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BPSC Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711034883-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-21 00:00:00', '2024-03-21 03:28:03', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(194, 'ISRO URSC Admit Card 2024', 'ISRO URSC Admit Card 2024', '<div class=\"newpage-row2\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<table style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 209.558%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>ISRO URSC Admit Card 2024</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.3019%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">IMPORTANT DATES</span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Date of Examination &ndash; </strong>18 April 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.256%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">VACANCY DETAILS</span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Exam Name &ndash;</strong> ISRO URSC Recruitment 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.3019%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">STATUS OF ADMIT CARD</span></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"table-centeralign\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Available&nbsp;<br></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 159.256%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">MODE OF EXAM</span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Computer Based Test</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 209.558%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: auto !important;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><u>ISRO URSC Exam Date 2024</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO) has invited applications for the Scientist, Engineer, Technician B &amp; Various Other Posts in February &ndash; March 2024.The ISRO is going to organize the ISRO URSC Exam 2024 on 18 April 2024.<br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><u>ISRO URSC Admit Card 2024</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">As per the official notification, it is to be hereby inform that the ISRO URSC Various Posts Exam 2024 will be conducted on 18 April 2024 &amp; the admit card link has been released few days before the examination. Candidates may download their ISRO URSC Various Posts Admit Card 2024 (Sarkari Result) from this page. For getting more information regarding ISRO URSC Various Posts Exam 2024, candidates need to maintain a frequent check on the Portal .</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Now, All the candidates are advised to maintain the decorum of Examination Hall &amp; be on time as their will be pre examination formalities over there. SarkariExam.com&nbsp; wishes all the very best to all candidates, Study well and practice as much as possible.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Instructions for Downloading the ISRO URSC Admit Card 2024 </strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">1. In order to download their ISRO URSC Admit Card 2024, Candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">2. After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their ISRO URSC Admit Card 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">3. Candidates will be redirected to Login Page, Here they have to provide their following details-:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Registration No. / Login ID / Roll No.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Password / DOB</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Verification Code (if specified)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">4. After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to download their ISRO URSC Admit Card 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">5. Candidates can also download their ISRO URSC Admit Card from official site of the ISRO.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr id=\"downloadadmitcard\">\r\n<td class=\"important-linkstable\" style=\"width: 209.558%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\">Important Links</span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 50.9672%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Download Admit Card</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 158.59%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><a href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1258/87675/login.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CLICK HERE</a></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 50.9672%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Download Exam Date Notice</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 158.59%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 320px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://www.isro.gov.in/media_isro/pdf/recruitmentNotice/2024_March/URSCNotice1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a><strong style=\"color: #ff0000; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 50.9672%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Apply Online</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 158.59%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 320px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1258/87675/Index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 50.9672%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Download Notification</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 158.59%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 320px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://www.isro.gov.in/media_isro/pdf/recruitmentNotice/2024_February/URSCISTRACADVT2024ENGLISH.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 50.9672%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Official website</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"width: 158.59%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 320px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://www.isro.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1711544198-isro.webp', '14', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-22 00:00:00', '2024-04-06 02:26:15', NULL, NULL),
(195, 'UP Combined Agriculture and Technology Entrance Test', 'S.V.P. University of Agriculture & Technology, Meerut (Conducted University) has relased Uttar Pradesh Combined Agriculture and Technology Entrance Test UPCATET', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px dashed rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 197.979%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">S.V.P. University of Agriculture &amp; Technology, Meerut (Conducted By) </span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>U.P. Combined Agriculture and Technology Entrance Test 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UP CATET Exam 2024 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 39.7804%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"350\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>17/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>07/05/2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date<strong> : 08/05/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>09-14 May 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>11-12</strong> <strong>June 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Issue : <strong>27/05/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Declared : <strong>22/06/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Counselling Start : <strong>July 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 158.199%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"370\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>1350/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>1100/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay Offline Through E Challan Fee Mode Only</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 197.979%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPCATET Admission 2024 : <span style=\"color: red;\">Age Limit as on</span> <span style=\"color: red;\">31/12/2024</span></strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">BVSc &amp; AH Course : <strong>17-25 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Other Ug Courses : <strong>16-22 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">PG Courses : <strong>No Age Limit </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 197.979%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPCATET 2023 Admissions Course List with Eligibility &nbsp;</strong></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Course Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPCATET Course Wise Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.Sc Agriculture</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 with PAG, PCM, PCB, PCMB</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.Sc Horticulture</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.Sc Forestry</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Do.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.F.S.c (Fisheries Science)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 with PAG, PCB, PCMB</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.V.Sc &amp; AH</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 with PCB / PCMB with English and 50% Aggregate Marks in Each Group Subject</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.Sc Community Science (Girls)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 in Arts Stream with Home Science As a Subject / PAG /PCB/PCM/PCMB</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.Tech Biotechnology</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 with PAG, PCM, PCB, PCMB</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.Tech Agriculture</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 with PAG, PCM, PCMB</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.Tech Dairy / Food Technology</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 with PAG, PCB, PCMB</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.Tech Sugarcane Science and Technology</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 with PAG, PCB &amp; PCM</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B.Tech &nbsp;Food Nutrition and Dietetics</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">10+2 with PHS , PCB &amp; PCM</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Post Graduate Courses</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree Passed / Appearing</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4425%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">PHd Courses</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 157.537%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Master Degree Passed / Appearing</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 197.979%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill UPCATET 2024 Admission Online Form</strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Step 1 : New Registration at https://upcatet.org/</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Step 2 : Login (Filling Information, Qualification Details, Upload Document)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Step 3 : Application Fees Payment</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Step 4 : Print Application Form</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Photo Instruction :</strong> Recently Passport Size Photograph with Name, Photo Taken Date and Aadhar Card No</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take a 15 Print of Photograph (For Sample Read the Notification Page No. 25)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Signature Scan in Black Ball Pen Only</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>University List :</strong> ANDUA&amp;T Kumarganj Ayodhya, CSAUA&amp;T Kanpur, SVPUA&amp;T Meerut &amp; BUA&amp;T, Banda</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 197.979%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UP CATET Admission Exam City / District Details 2024 </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Ayodhya, Agra, Bareilly, Banda, Kanpur, Meerut, Varanasi, Azamgarh, Jhansi, Gorakhpur &amp; Lucknow</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 197.979%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 49.0794%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"368\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">Apply Online</span> </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 148.9%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"351\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UPCATET 2024 Registration\" href=\"https://upcatet.org/site/application.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Registration</a> | <a title=\"UPCATET Admission 2024 Login\" href=\"https://upcatet.org/frm_student_login.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Login</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 49.0794%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"368\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 148.9%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"351\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download UPCATET 2024 Notification PDF \" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nLFu8WuRaWjTtOSs4MKh-3PKgQKuBk6S/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 49.0794%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"368\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 148.9%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"351\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SVPUAT Official Website\" href=\"https://www.svpuat.edu.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>UPCATET 2024 Offical Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711081647-pic.webp', '15', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-22 00:00:00', '2024-03-22 04:27:27', NULL, NULL),
(196, 'Veer Kunwar Singh University UG 1st Sem Result 2024', 'VKSU UG 1st Sem Result 2024: नमस्कार दोस्तों, स्नातक (कला/विज्ञान/वाणिज्य) सत्र (2023-2027) सेमेस्टर-I का परीक्षा परिणाम घोषित कर दिया गया है।', '<div class=\"inside-article\" style=\"height: auto !important;\"><header class=\"entry-header\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">VKSU UG 1st Sem Result 2024</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">VKSU UG 1st Sem Result 2024: नमस्कार दोस्तों, स्नातक (कला/विज्ञान/वाणिज्य) सत्र (2023-2027) सेमेस्टर-I का परीक्षा परिणाम घोषित कर दिया गया है। महाविद्यालय द्वारा आन्तरिक एवं प्रायोगिक परीक्षा के अंक न उपलब्ध होने के कारण रुके हुवे परिणाम शीघ्र ही घोषित किये जायेंगे। आइए जानते हैं विस्तार से कि रिजल्ट कैसे और किस लिंक से चेक कर पाएंगे।</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Date_VKSU_UG_1st_Sem_Result_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Important Date: VKSU UG 1st Sem Result 2024</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">वीर कुंवर सिंह आरा यूनिवर्सिटी के द्वारा 28 मार्च 2024 को यूजी फर्स्ट सेमेस्टर यानी की बीए बीएससी बीकॉम फर्स्ट सेमेस्टर सत्र 2023 से 27 का रिजल्ट प्रकाशित कर दिया गया है प्रैक्टिकल विषय के कारण जिसका रिजल्ट पेंडिंग है उसका रिजल्ट भी जल्द ही घोषित कर दिया जाएगा।</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\">Important Link</span></span></em></strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 67.8px; border: 3px ridge rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.6154%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Check Result</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.4786%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"http://new.vksuexams.com/results.aspx\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.6154%; height: 29.4px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Download Notification</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.4786%; height: 29.4px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://vksuexams.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.6154%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Official Websit️e</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.4786%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://vksuexams.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">Click_Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1711690113-vksu.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-22 00:00:00', '2024-03-29 06:42:07', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(197, 'Chhattisgarh CGPSC State Service Exam SSE 2023 Result', 'Chhattisgarh Public Service Commission (CGPSC) has released the notification for the recruitment of 242 Various State Service Exam 2023 posts.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px dashed rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"688\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\"><strong>Chhattisgarh Public Service Commission (CGPSC)</strong><strong> </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Chhattisgarh State Service Examination CGPSC Pre SSE 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>CGPSC SSE Advt No. : 11/2023 Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"361\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>01/12/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>30/12/2023</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<strong>30/12/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Last Date :<strong> 02-03 January 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Exam Date : <strong>11/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Available : <strong>16/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Result Available : <strong>22/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Main Exam : <strong>13-16 June 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available :<strong> Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"327\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Other State : <strong>400/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Chhattisgarh Domicile : <strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Charge : <strong>500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Fee Mode Only</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"688\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>CGPSC State Service Recruitment 2023 : </strong><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Age Limit as on</strong><strong> </strong><strong>01/01/2023</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum : <strong>21 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum : <strong>28</strong>-<strong>40 Years. (Post Wise) </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Chhattisgarh Public Service Commission CGPSC SSE 2023 Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"688\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Chhattisgarh State Service Exam 2023 : </strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Vacancy Details Total : 242 Post</strong></span></span><strong> </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"403\">\r\n<p align