, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC CHSL 2023 Exam Notice 2023\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/SSCFileServer/PortalManagement/UploadedFiles/Schedule%20of%20Examination_19082023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 53.0298%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 46.9083%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"298\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC CHSL 2023 Registration 2023\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 53.0298%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill Form (Video Hindi)</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 46.9083%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"298\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC Form Kaise Bhare 2023\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lvlwLRVRniA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 53.0298%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Registration (Video Hindi)</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 46.9083%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"298\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC Registration Kaise Kare 2023\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=itZLsQlhdzY&amp;t=20s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 53.0298%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Syllabus</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 46.9083%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"298\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download SSC CHSL 2023 Full Syllabus PDF\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/SSC-CHSL-Tier-I-Syllabus-2023_compressed.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CHSL Tier I</a> | <a title=\"Download SSC CHSL 2023 Full Syllabus PDF\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/SSC-CHSL-Tier-II-Syllabus-2023_compressed.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CHSL Tier II</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 53.0298%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 46.9083%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"298\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download SSC CHSL 2023 Full Notification PDF\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/SSCFileServer/PortalManagement/UploadedFiles/Notice_chsl_09052023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 53.0298%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 46.9083%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"298\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"SSC Official Website 2023\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SSC Official Website </a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711180199-pic.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-23 00:00:00', '2024-03-23 07:49:59', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(201, 'BSF Air Wing Recruitment 2024', 'The Border Security Force (BSF), one of India’s premier paramilitary forces, has recently announced recruitment openings for Group B and Group C posts.', '<header class=\"entry-header\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">BSF Air Wing Recruitment 2024</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Apply Online For Group B, C Posts</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The Border Security Force (BSF), one of India&rsquo;s premier paramilitary forces, has recently announced recruitment openings for Group B and Group C posts in its Air Wing. If you&rsquo;re interested in serving your country and being part of a dynamic team, this could be a great opportunity for you!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">BSF has conducted recruitment to fill vacant positions for Constable, Head Constable, ASI, SI, and other Group B and Group C posts. Individuals aspiring to join BSF, serve the nation, and secure a government job can submit their applications by the deadline of April 15, 2024. Applications must be completed exclusively through the online platform.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><strong>Recruitment: </strong></span>BSF Air Wing and Engineering Recruitment 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">Recruitment Body:</span> </strong>BSF</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">Number of Vacancies:</span> </strong>82</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">Application mode:</span> </strong>Online</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">Application open date:</span> </strong>16 March 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">Application Closing date:</span> </strong>15 April 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">Exam Date:</span> </strong>To Be Announced</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BSF_Air_Wing_Vacancies_Details_For_Group_B_C\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BSF Air Wing <strong>Vacancies</strong> Details For Group B &amp; C&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1.<span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"> Group B Posts</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"> </span>(Combatized) (Non-Gazetted, Non-Ministerial) in BSF Engineering Setup for the Vacancy Year 2024</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Advertisement Number: combatised_b/2024</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date of Submission: 15th April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2.<span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"> Group C Posts</span></strong> (Combatized) (Non-Gazetted, Non-Ministerial) in BSF Engineering Setup for the Vacancy Year 2024</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Advertisement Number: combatised_c/2024</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date of Submission: 15th April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>3. <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Group C Posts </span></strong>(Combatized) (Non-Gazetted, Non-Ministerial) in BSF Air Wing for the Vacancy Year 2024</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Advertisement Number: air_wing/2024</span><br><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date of Submission: 15th April 2024</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BSF_Air_Wing_Placements_Details_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BSF Air Wing Placements Details 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Assistant Aircraft Mechanic &ndash; </strong>8 posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Asst Radio Mechanic &ndash;</strong> 11 posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Constable (Storeman) &ndash;</strong> 03 posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Sub-Inspector (Works) &ndash;</strong> 13 Posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>JE (Electrical) &ndash;</strong> 09 posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Plumber &ndash;</strong> 01 posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Head Constable Carpenter &ndash;</strong> 01 posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Constable (Generator Operator) &ndash;</strong> 13 posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Generator Mechanic &ndash; </strong>14 posts</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Lineman &ndash;</strong> 09</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BSF_Air_Wing_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BSF Air Wing Eligibility Criteria 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Limit:</span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Air Wing:</strong> Not Exceeding 28 Years, Constable &ndash; 20-25 years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Engineering:</strong> HC &amp; Constable &ndash; 18 to 25 years &amp; SI &ndash; Maximum &ndash; 30 years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Education_Qualification\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Education Qualification:</span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Assistant Aircraft Mechanics: </strong>Candidates require a 3-year Diploma in a relevant Trade.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Assistant Radio Mechanic: </strong>Applicants must hold a Diploma in Radio Mechanics.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Constable: </strong>Candidates need to have cleared the matriculation exam with science and possess two years of work experience.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SI (Sub-Inspector): </strong>Candidates must have completed a 3-year Diploma in Civil Engineering.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SI/JE (Sub-Inspector/Junior Engineer): </strong>Candidates should have completed a 3-year Diploma in Electrical Engineering.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Head Constables:</strong> Candidates must have cleared the matriculation exam or possess an ITI certificate in the trade of carpenter/plumber.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Constables in Group C: </strong>Candidates must have passed the 10th grade or possess an ITI certificate in a relevant trade.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-background has-medium-font-size\"><span id=\"Salary\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Salary :</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Air Wing &ndash;</strong> 29200-92300/- &amp; 21700-69100/-</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Engineering &ndash;</strong> 35400-112400/- &amp; 25500-81100/-</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Application_Fees_For_BSF_Air_Wing_Online_Form_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fees For BSF Air Wing Online Form 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1. Gen/OBC &ndash;</strong> 100/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2. SC/ST &ndash;</strong> No fee</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BSF_Air_Wing_Selection_Process_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BSF Air Wing Selection Process 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Written Test</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Trade Test</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Physical Standards Test (PST)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Physical Efficiency Test (PET)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_For_BSF_Air_Wing_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply For BSF Air Wing Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Follow_these_simple_steps_to_apply_for_the_BSF_Air_Wing_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Follow these simple steps to apply for the BSF Air Wing Recruitment 2024:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Visit the official website www.bsf.nic.in.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Here&rdquo; link against the relevant Group C or Group B posts.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fill in the required details, upload necessary documents, and complete the payment process.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Submit the form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Download and keep a printout for future reference.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-06eeba8f0c356f477c94e2bdade27b16\" style=\"color: rgb(198, 57, 57); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"To_Apply_Visit_HereOfficial_Notification_Check_HereOfficial_Website_bsfnicin\" style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>To Apply:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Visit Here</a><br>Official Notification:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/static/bsf/pdf/GROUP-%20C%20POSTS%20(COMBATISED)%20(NON%20GAZETTED-NON%20MINISTERIAL)%20IN%20BSF%20AIR%20WING%20FOR%20THE%20VACANCY%20YEAR-2024.pdf?rel=2024031601\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Check Here</a><br>Official Website:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">bsf.nic.in</a></strong></span></h4>', '1711625071-airwing.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-23 00:00:00', '2024-03-28 11:24:31', NULL, NULL),
(202, 'IIT Madras Joint Admission Test for Masters Result 2024', 'Indian Institute of Technology IIT Madras will conduct Joint Admission Test for Masters this year, candidates who are Enrolled in the JAM 2024.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Conducted by Indian Institute of Technology , IIT Madras</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>IIT Joint Admission Test for Masters 2024 (JAM 2024)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>IITM JAM Exam 2024 : Short Detail of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>05/09/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>13/10/2023 </strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Pay Exam Fee :<strong> 13/10/2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>11/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>08/01/2024 at 5 PM </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Declared :<strong> 23/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Single Paper</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>1800/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH / Female : <strong>900/-</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Double Paper</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>2500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH/ Female : <strong>1250/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Online or Offline Fee Mode Only<strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>IIT JAM 2024 Eligibility</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Any Recognized University in India</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC : <strong>55</strong>% Marks</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>50</strong>% Marks<strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>JAM 2024 Details</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">M.Sc. Two Year, M.Sc PHd Dual Degree Course, Other Post Bachelor Degree Courses in Various IIT in India and Integrated PHD Course. JAM 2023 Exam Conducted by IIT Guwahati.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Apply IIT JAM 2024 : Admission Online Form </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Passed / Appearing Both Interested Candidates Are Filled the JAM 2024 Application</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Step 1 :</strong> Open the Registration Link and Filled the Basic Details</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Step 2 :</strong> Note Down Your Registration / Enrollment No.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Step 3 :</strong> Login to Portal and Complete the Form, Upload Photo Signature and Paid the Examination Fee to Complete the Form</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Instruction of Photo :</strong> Clear Recently Passport Size Photo with White Background<strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Result / Score Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Result / Score Card for JAM 2024\" href=\"https://joaps.iitm.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"