ign=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Apply Online Registration for JAM 2024\" href=\"https://joaps.iitm.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"IIT JAM 2024 Information Brochure Download PDF\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1q9gV8tW3M8OoNJJjY7bUkZUlUVjkZbRG/view?pli=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>JAM 2024 Information Brochure</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"IIT JAM 2024 Official Website\" href=\"https://jam.iitm.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>JAM 2024 Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711181236-pic.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-23 00:00:00', '2024-03-23 08:07:16', NULL, NULL),
(203, 'Bihar Board Class 12th Intermediate Results 2024', 'Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) Bihar School Examination Board Chairman Shri Anand Kishore ji will release the result of Bihar Board Intermediate .', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px double rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 99.8844%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BSEB Bihar Board Class 12th Inter Result 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Bihar Board BSEB XIIth Results 2024 :&nbsp; Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 38.9792%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Class 12 Inter Exam : <strong>01-12 February 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Declared :<strong> 23/03/2024 at 01:30 PM </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 60.9052%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Exam Conducted By</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">BSEB Patna &ndash; Bihar School of Examination Board Will be Conducted the Examination of&nbsp; Inter Class 12th Annual Board Examination 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 99.8844%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Check Bihar Board 12th Result 2024 </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">In this year 2024 around 13 lakhs are registered in Bihar Board Intermediate Class 12th Exam.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">This year Bihar Board Inter Class 12 Exam was held from 01-12 February 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">This year the result of Bihar Board Inter XIIth examination will be released on March 23, 2024 at 01:30 PM by Bihar Board</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">What documents / details will be required to check the result of Bihar Board Inter class 12th exam this year.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">To check the result of Bihar Board Class 12 Inter Examination 2024, the candidate will need the roll code and roll number.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who do not have roll number and roll code available or not known can check it in their admit card or can check from their school/college/board.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar Board Class 12 Result of all stream Result will be released on<strong> 23 March 2024 </strong>together.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also check their subject wise result of the exam.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Stream Wise Toppers information will also be released by the Bihar Board.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 99.8844%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar Board 12th Inter Result 2024 : <span style=\"color: red;\">Direct Link / Website List</span> </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar Board Class 12 Result 2024 will also be available on these website. The direct link to check the result will also be available in some useful important links at the bottom of this page.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">biharboardonline.bihar.gov.in</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">secondary.biharboardonline.com</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">biharboardonline.com</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Direct Link Also Available at <strong>SarkariResult.Com</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">In the year <strong>2022</strong> of Bihar Board BSEB Inter Class 12th, a total of <strong>80.15</strong> percent students passed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">In the Last year <strong>2023 </strong>of Bihar Board BSEB Inter Class 12th, a total of <strong>83.70 </strong>percent students passed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">In the this year <strong>2024 </strong>of Bihar Board BSEB Inter Class 12th, a total of <strong>Available Soon </strong>percent students passed.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 99.8844%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 49.687%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Class 12th Inter Result </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.1974%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"http://bsebinter.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CLICK HERE</a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 49.687%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Check Result (Video Hindi) </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.1974%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Check Bihar Board 12th Inter Result 2023\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yMrmHp4PDHc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 49.687%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.1974%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Bihar Board Official Website\" href=\"http://biharboardonline.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BSEB Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711181791-pic.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-23 00:00:00', '2024-03-24 06:03:11', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(204, 'Sashastra Seema Bal SSB ASI SI HC Recruitment 2024', 'Sashastra Seema Bal (SSB) has released the notification for the recruitment of Constable Tradesman, Head Constable, Assistant Sub Inspector ASI Paramedical.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\" width=\"766\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 763.818px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"766\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Sashastra Seema Bal (SSB)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SSB Constable / Head Constable HC / Sub Inspector / ASI &nbsp;Recruitment 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 12, 255); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SSB Various Post 2023 Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Exam Info Result 2023\" href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 437.886px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"425\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Application Begin&nbsp;<strong>: 20/05/2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online&nbsp;<strong>:&nbsp;18/06/2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>Pay Examination Fee Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>18/06/2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>Constable Tradesman Exam Date&nbsp;<strong>: 13/07/2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>PET / PST Exam Date&nbsp;<strong>: 29/09/2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>ASI(Pharmacist &amp; Stenographer), HC Electrician &amp; Communication, Constable Non-GD Posts CBT Exam Date&nbsp;<strong>: 26-27 December 2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>Assistant Commandant Veterinary CBT Exam Date&nbsp;<strong>: 22/01/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>ASI Dental Technician, Operation Theatre Technician, Radiographer CBT Exam Date&nbsp;<strong>: 22/01/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Head Constable Mechanic, Steward, Veterinary CBT Exam Date&nbsp;<strong>: 22/01/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Sub Inspector SI Communication, Draughtsman, Pioneer, Staff Nurse Female CBT Exam Date&nbsp;<strong>: 22/01/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Admit Card Available&nbsp;<strong>: 20/12/2023</strong></li>\r\n<li>SI / HC Result Available&nbsp;<strong>: 15/03/2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>ASI / HC Result Available&nbsp;<strong>: 23/03/2024</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 325.932px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"341\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS&nbsp;<strong>: 100/- / 200/- (Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH :&nbsp;<strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female :&nbsp;<strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fees Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Mode.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 763.818px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"766\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSB Constable, HC, SI, ASI&nbsp;Notification 2023 Age Limit</strong><strong>&nbsp;Details</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : 18 Years&nbsp;<strong>(Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li 