 Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.136%; height: 51px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>22 February 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.864%; height: 51px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Answer Key Issue Date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.136%; height: 51px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>18 March 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.864%; height: 51px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.136%; height: 51px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://biharboardonline.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Bihar Board Online</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Apply Online Start Date: 01 February 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Apply Online: 22 February 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment the Last Date: 22 February 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Issue Date: February 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date: 26 February to 03 March 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Issue Date: <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>19 March 2024</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date of Answer Key Objection:&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>22 March 2024</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Application_Fee\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Candidates: Rs. 1100/-</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Payment Mode:</strong></span> </span>Pay the application fee through a Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, or UPI fee mode only.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Objection Fee: <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Rs. 50/-</strong></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Age_limit\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Age limit</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age: Not Available</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age: Not Available</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Teachers working in Primary/Middle/Secondary/Higher Secondary Schools/Librarians Appointed by the state by local bodies.</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"How_to_Answer_Key_DownloadObjection\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">How to Answer Key Download/Objection</span></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Step 1: Go to the official website @https://www.bsebsakshamta.com</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Step 2: Click the given link or click here for objection.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Step 3: Given their criteria and download the answer key.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Step 4: If you doubt any question then objection now.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-14616  lazyloaded\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" title=\"बिहार सक्षमता परीक्षा (ctt) उत्तर कुँजी (answer key) 2024 3\" src=\"https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/bihar-board-CTT-answer-key-2024.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 847px) 100vw, 847px\" srcset=\"https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/bihar-board-CTT-answer-key-2024.jpg 464w, https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/bihar-board-CTT-answer-key-2024-300x228.jpg 300w, https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/bihar-board-CTT-answer-key-2024-150x114.jpg 150w\" alt=\"बिहार सक्षमता परीक्षा (ctt) उत्तर कुँजी (answer key) 2024\" width=\"847\" height=\"643\" loading=\"lazy\" data-srcset=\"https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/bihar-board-CTT-answer-key-2024.jpg 464w, https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/bihar-board-CTT-answer-key-2024-300x228.jpg 300w, https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/bihar-board-CTT-answer-key-2024-150x114.jpg 150w\" data-src=\"https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/bihar-board-CTT-answer-key-2024.jpg\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 847px) 100vw, 847px\"></span></p>\r\n<noscript><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-14616 \" src=\"https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/bihar-board-CTT-answer-key-2024.jpg\" alt=\"बिहार सक्षमता परीक्षा (ctt) उत्तर कुँजी (answer key) 2024\" wid