/span> </a></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#Selection_Process\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">2.1.2.4.2</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Selection Process</span> </a></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SSC_Sub_Inspector_Delhi_Police_and_CAPF_Online_Form_2024\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong>SSC Sub Inspector Delhi Police and CAPF Online Form 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Sub Inspector Delhi Police and CAPF Online Form 2024: The Staff Selection Commission has recently invited the online application form for the SSC Sub Inspector Delhi Police and CAPF Online Form 2024. All eligible/interested candidates can apply online application form between 04 March 2024 to 28 March 2024. Candidate read the official notification before applying for the recruitment application form in SSC Sub Inspector Delhi Police and CAPF Online Form 2024. Kindly check and collect all Documents &ndash; Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, and Basic details. Kindly read scan document related to the online form &ndash; Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc. Before submitting the application form must check the preview and all columns carefully.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SSC_Sub_Inspector_Delhi_Police_and_CAPF_Online_Form_20241\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(132, 63, 161);\"><strong>SSC Sub Inspector Delhi Police and CAPF Online Form 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px groove rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>04 March 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Title of the Post</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC Sub Inspector Delhi Police and CAPF Online Form 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Sub Inspector</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancy</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>4187 Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online Start Date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>04 March 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date Apply Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>28 March 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Category</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Latest Jobs</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>20-25 Years</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC.GOV.IN</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Apply Online Start Date: 04 March 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Apply Online: 28 March 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment the Last Date: 29 March 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For Correction Date: 30-31 March 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Schedule of Computer Based Examination (CBE): 09, 10 &amp; 13 May 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Application_Fee\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General/EWS Candidate: Rs. 100/-</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">OBC Candidates: Rs. 100/-</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST Candidates: Rs. 00/-</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Female Candidates: Rs. 00/-</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Payment Mode: Pay the application fee through a Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, or UPI Fee Mode.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Age_limit_as_of_01_August_2024\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Age limit as of 01 August 2024</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age: 20 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age: 25 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation: Read the official notification (Page No. 3 or 4)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">i.e. Candidate must have been born not earlier than 02.08.1999 and not later than 01.08.2004 to be eligible to apply.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Education_Qualification_as_on_01_August_2024\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Education Qualification as on 01 August 2024</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Educational Qualification for all posts is a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university or equivalent.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Note:</strong></span> The candidates who have appeared in their Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or equivalent examination can also apply.</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Total_Vacancy_4187_Posts\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Vacancy: 4187 Posts</strong></span></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Vacancy Details</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Sub-Inspector (Exe.) in Delhi Police-Male</strong></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: #0da148;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 30.6342%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Details</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5411%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UR</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.9444%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>OBC</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.5865%; text-a