yle=\"width: 15.8235%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">77</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.3007%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">82</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42482%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">03</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.8329%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Female Candidates</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.61808%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">157</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.8235%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&ndash;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.3007%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&ndash;</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42482%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.8329%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Female Candidates</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.61808%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">154</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.8235%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&ndash;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.3007%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&ndash;</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42482%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Weight: Corresponding to height (for all Posts)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Physical_Endurance_Test_PET_For_all_posts\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>Physical Endurance Test (PET) (For all posts)</strong></span></span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Male Candidates</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">100 Metre Race in 16 Seconds</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1.6 Kms Race in 6.56 Minutes</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Long Jump: 3.65 Metre in 03 Chances</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">High Jump: 1.2 Metre in 03 Chances</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Short Put (16 Lbs): 4.5 Metre in 3 Chances</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Female Candidates</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">100 Metre Race in 18 Seconds</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">800 Metre Race in 04 Minutes</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Long Jump: 2.7 Metre in 03 Chances</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">High Jump: 0.9 Metre in 03 Chances.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"How_To_Apply_for_SSC_Sub_Inspector_Delhi_Police_and_CAPF_Online_Form_2024\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>How To Apply for SSC Sub Inspector Delhi Police and CAPF Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Applications are required to be submitted in online mode only at the official website of SSC Headquarters, i.e., https://ssc.nic.in.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The application module has been designed to capture live photographs of the candidate filling up the application form. The candidates should ensure that the photograph captured is clear, without cap or spectacles, and with a full frontal view.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last date and time for submission of online applications is 28.3.2024 (2300 hours).</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are advised, in their interest, to submit online applications much before the closing date of receipt of online applications and not to wait till the last date.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before submitting the online application, candidates must check through the Preview/Print option that they have filled correct details in each field of the Online Application Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Pay_Scale\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Pay Scale</strong></span></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Sub-Inspector (GD) in CAPFs:</strong></span> The post carries a pay scale of Level-6 (Rs.35,400-Rs.1,12,400/-) and is classified as Group &lsquo;B&rsquo; (Non-Gazetted), Non-Ministerial.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Sub-Inspector (Executive) &ndash;</strong> </span>(Male/Female) in Delhi Police: The post carries a pay scale of Level-6 (Rs.35,400 Rs.1,12,400/-) and is classified as Group &lsquo;C&rsquo; by Delhi Police.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Selection_Process\" style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Selection Process</strong></span></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Paper-I, Physical Standard Test (PST)/Physical Endurance Test (PET), Paper-II and Detailed Medical Examination (DME). All these stages of the examination are mandatory.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(35, 111, 161);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/candidate-portal/one-time-registration/home-page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Registration</a> || <a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Login</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://resultlives.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/final-notice-cpo-2024-04.03.2024.pdf\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1711247262-pic.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-24 00:00:00', '2024-03-24 01:04:24', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(208, 'Bihar Board Scrutiny Online Form 2024', 'Bihar Board Scrutiny Online Form 2024', '<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc lwptoc-autoWidth lwptoc-light lwptoc-notInherit\" data-smooth-scroll=\"1\" data-smooth-scroll-offset=\"24\" data-lwptoc-initialized=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_i\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_items\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#Bihar_Board_Scrutiny_Online_Form_2024\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Bihar Board Scrutiny Online Form 2024</span> </a></span>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#How_to_Apply_Scrutiny_Form_Online_Exam_2024\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1.1</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">How to Apply Scrutiny Form Online Exam 2024</span> </a></span>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#Bihar_Board_Scrutiny_Online_Form_20241\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1.1.1</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Bihar Board Scrutiny Online Form 2024</span> </a></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Bihar_Board_Scrutiny_Online_Form_2024\" style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\"><strong>Bihar Board Scrutiny Online Form 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\" href=\"https://resultlives.com/\">Bihar Board Scrutiny Online Form 2024</a>:</span> The result of Intermediate Annual Examination, 2024 was released today on 23.03.2024 by Shri Anand Kishore, Chairman, Bihar School Examination Committee. If any student is not satisfied with the results of the released examination, then an opportunity for scrutiny has been provided to them by the committee. Such students can apply online for scrutiny of their answer book for that subject from 28.03.2024 to 04.04.2024.</span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 3px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 62px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Bihar School Examination Board, Patna</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Update</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>24 March 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Title of the Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar Board Scrutiny O