elvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Date : 21-04-2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 46.0038%;\" width=\"45%\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>APPLICATION FEE</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Gen / OBC : <strong>Rs.300/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PwD :<strong> Rs.150/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Female :&nbsp;<strong>Rs.150/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Online Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Mode.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.9841%;\" colspan=\"5\" width=\"100%\">\r\n<h4><em><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Total Post : 26</span></span></strong></span></em></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 24.1205%;\" width=\"14%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-width: 3px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 14.7255%;\" width=\"22%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; fon