ment 2023 : <span style=\"color: red;\">Post Wise Vacancy Details</span></strong></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Haryana Civil Service (Executive Branch)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">03</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Block Development &amp; Panchayat Officer (BDPO)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">37</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Assistant Employment Officer (AEO)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">12</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Excise &amp; Taxation Officer (ETO)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">08</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Deputy Superintendent of Police (DSP)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">06</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">District Food &amp; Supplies Controller (DFSC)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">02</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Assistant Excise &amp; Taxation Officer (AETO)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">19</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Naib Tehsildar</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">28</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Traffic Manager (TM)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">04</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">District Food &amp; Supplies Officer (DFSO)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">01</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"564\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Assistant Registrar Cooperative Societies (ARCS)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"180\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">01</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"744\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>How to Fill Haryana PSC HCS Pre 2023 Online Form</strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Haryana Public Service Commission HPSC Latest Civil Services Various Post Recruitment 2023 Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>01/12/2023 to 21/12/2023.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Haryana Civil Services Recruitment Online Form 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"744\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"404\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Admit Card (Mains)</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"HPSC HCS 2023 Pre Result\" href=\"https://regn.hpsc.gov.in/hcsexecutive/site/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"404\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Pre Result</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"HPSC HCS 2023 Pre Result\" href=\"https://hpsc.gov.in/Portals/0/RESULT_HCS_PRE_27_02_2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"404\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"HPSC HCS 2023 Admit Card\" href=\"https://regn.hpsc.gov.in/hcsexecutive/site/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Server I</a> | <a title=\"HPSC HCS 2023 Admit Card\" href=\"http://164.100.137.189/admit/index\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Server II</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"404\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"HPSC HCS 2023 Registration\" href=\"https://regn.hpsc.gov.in/hcs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"404\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"HPSC Civil Services 2023 Notification\" href=\"https://hpsc.gov.in/Portals/0/Advt_58_2023_HCS_EX_BR_17_11_2023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"404\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"HPSC Official Website\" href=\"https://hpsc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>HPSC Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711352620-pic.webp', '17', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-25 00:00:00', '2024-03-25 07:43:40', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(213, 'SSC Constable GD Recruitment 2023 Re Exam Admit Card', 'Staff Selection Commission (SSC) has released the notification of Constable GD in BSF, CISF, ITBP, CRPF, NCB, SSF, Assam Rifles Examination 2023.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px dotted rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"21\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SSC Constable GD in BSF, CISF, ITBP, CRPF, NCB, SSF, Assam Rifles Recruitment 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SSC GD Constable Exam 2023 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"423\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates </strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>24/11/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 31/12/2023 upto 11 PM </strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong>01/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>04-06 January 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date CBT : <strong>20 February to 12 March 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Re Exam Date CBT : <strong>30 March 2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>25/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Available : <strong>After Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>100/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female : <strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or E Challan</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"21\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC GD Constable Recruitment 2023 : <span style=\"color: red;\">Age Limit as on</span></strong><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong> 01/01/2024</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>23 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Staff Selection Commission SSC GD Constable 2023 Exam Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"21\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC GD Constable Notification 2023 : <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details Total : 26146 Post</span></strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong> </strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"237\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Force Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"223\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"338\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC GD Constable Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"237\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Border Security Force BSF</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"223\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">6174</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"338\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Class 10 High School Exam in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"237\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, s