\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Chest</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"206\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">80-85 CMS</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">76-80 CMS</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">NA</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">NA</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Running</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"206\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5 KM in 24 Minutes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5 KM in 24 Minutes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1.6 Km in 8.5 Minutes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1.6 Km in 8.5 Minutes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"21\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill SSC Constable GD Recruitment Online Form 2023</strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Staff Selection Commission SSC Constable GD Recruitment 2023, Candidate Can Apply Between<strong> 24/11/2023</strong><strong> to 31/12/2023.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Constable GD Vacancy&nbsp; 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"21\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"423\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Re Exam Admit Card (CR Region)</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC GD Constable Re Exam Notice 2023\" href=\"https://www.ssc-cr.org/const_gd_capfs_nia_ssf_assam_rifle_2024_0214.php?proceed=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"423\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Re Exam Admit Card (NR Region)</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC GD Constable Re Exam Notice 2023\" href=\"https://sscnr.nic.in/newlook/Status_CAPFS_GD_ReExam_2024/Instructions.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Status</strong></a> | <a title=\"SSC GD Constable Re Exam Notice 2023\" href=\"https://sscnr.nic.in/newlook/Site/admit_card.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Admit Card</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"423\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Re Exam Notice with Center List</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC GD Constable Re Exam Notice 2023\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/CT-GD-2024-Rexam-Notice.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"423\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC GD Constable Registration 2023\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"423\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Answer Key</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC GD Constable Answer Key 2023\" href=\"https://ssc.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/2207/87626/login.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Link Activate Soon</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"423\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Tentative Vacancy Details</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC GD Constable 2023 Notification\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/SSCFileServer/PortalManagement/UploadedFiles/Tentative_Vacancies_15122023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"423\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC GD Constable 2023 Notification\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/SSCFileServer/PortalManagement/UploadedFiles/Notice_24112023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"423\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"10\" valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"SSC Official Website\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SSC Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711353265-pic.webp', '14', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-25 00:00:00', '2024-03-25 07:54:25', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(214, 'Bihar DELEd Admission Test 2024', 'Bihar School Examination Board BSEB has relased DELED Joint Entrance Test 2024 Admissions Notification.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px inset rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 99.9398%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\"><strong>Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB)&nbsp; </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Bihar DELEd (BTC) Admission 2024 Online Form </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Bihar DELED Joint Entrance Test 2024 :&nbsp; Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.6516%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"387\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>02/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Registration :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 15/02/2024 upto 06:00 PM Only</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Fee Deposit : <strong>15/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date :<strong> <strong>30/03/2024 to 28/04/2024 </strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>23/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 49.2882%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee </strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS: <strong>960</strong>/-</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>760/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through E Challan or Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking, SBI I Collect Fee Mode</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 99.9398%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar DELED Admissions Notification 2024 : <span style=\"color: red;\">Age Limit as on 01/01/2024</span></span></strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>17 Years</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>NA Years</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation As per Bihar Joint Entrance Exam DELED 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 99.9398%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Bihar BSEB DELED (BTC)</span> <span style=\"color: red;\">Exam 2024</span> : Admission Details</span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 15.5917%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"232\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Course Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 84.3481%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"521\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar DELEd Eligibility 2024 </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 15.5917%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"232\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar DELEd (2 Year BTC)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 84.3481%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"521\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">+2 Senior Secondary with at Least 50% Minimum Marks.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For SC / ST Candidates : 45%.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">More Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 99.9398%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Apply Bihar Board DELEd 2 Years Admission Online Form 2024 </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar School Examination Board BSEB Released Detailed Notification for 2 years DELED whose old name was BTC.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">This year the online applications for admission will start from <strong>02 February 2024,</strong> the last date is <strong>15 February 2024.</strong> for Apply Online Visit Sarkari Result.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar DELED 2024 Scan Document Required : </strong>Class 10th Matric Marksheet &amp; Certificate, Class 12th Inter Certificate, Category Certification Only for Reserve Category Candidates, Any Other Special Document if Required.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Photo Instruction : </strong>Latest passport size photograph with white background and no dark glasses, cap and clothes. Both eyes should be clearly visible in the photo and the photo should be straight.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The entrance exam will not be held this year, this year the admission in Bihar DELED Admission Test 2024 will be on the basis of Entrance Test.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Applying the Recruitment Application Form in Bihar DELED Admission 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 99.9398%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.6516%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"387\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 49.2882%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Bihar DELED Admission Admit Card 2024\" href=\"http://202.191.140.165/bsebregjan24/cloea_mar24/login.php?appid=2b31753d286a255bac775d3e6d23a6a6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopen