n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</figure>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Bihar Board 12th Compartment Form 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-b3bb068b2435d86af79a51a2cc1c8604\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar Board 12th Compartmental Apply Online 2024&nbsp;</strong>के अंतर्गत आवेदन करने के लिए सबसे पहले आपको अपने संकाय&nbsp;<strong>Faculty&nbsp;</strong>का</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-b3bb068b2435d86af79a51a2cc1c8604\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Intermediate Compartmental-Cum-Special Examination-2024&nbsp;</strong>डाउनलोड करना होगा जो कि इस प्रकार का होगा.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6539fc5f06efb903c58b3b4213877547\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">अब इस आवेदन फॉर्म को सावधानीपूर्वक&nbsp;<strong>भरना&nbsp;</strong>होगा.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3cb8f6e8d783cc97747f6418810c0d79\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar Board 12th Compartment Form 2024 उसके बाद आपको अपने एडमिट कार्ड व मार्कशीट की&nbsp;<strong>स्व-अभिप्रमाणित छायाप्रति</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>अटैच&nbsp;</strong>करना होगा.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-cb2b55266dcd4e86b4add117e8c47cdb\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>कंपार्टमेंट परीक्षा 2024&nbsp;</strong>में आवेदन करने के लिए आवेदन फार्म को तैयार रखने के बाद सीधे आपको अपने विद्यालय के&nbsp;<strong>प्रधानाचार्य&nbsp;</strong>से संपर्क करना होगा.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a3e5f5f9fb28bbd1f96660b7fdebc54d\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">उसके बाद उन्हें आपको अपने आवेदन&nbsp;<strong>फार्म&nbsp;</strong>को&nbsp;<strong>दे देना&nbsp;</strong>होगा,उसके साथ ही आपको निर्धारित&nbsp;<strong>शुल्क&nbsp;</strong>भी देना होगा.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-ca3ba587b3128544567ff813103ce206\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar Board 12th Compartment Form 2024 अंत में,आपको प्रधानाचार्य के द्वारा आपका&nbsp;<strong>आवेदन&nbsp;</strong>कर दिया जाएगा.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-ca3ba587b3128544567ff813103ce206\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Bihar_Board_12th_Compartmental_Form_2024_Important_Links\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Bihar Board 12th Compartmental Form 2024</strong>: Important Links</span></em></span></span></h2>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\">\r\n<table class=\"has-ast-global-color-4-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(45, 29, 255);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); width: 47.5503%;\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Compartmental Exam Form</strong></span></td>\r\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); width: 52.4075%;\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://biharboardonline.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Science Special Exam Form Application,2024</a></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://biharboardonline.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Commerce Special Exam Form Application,2024<br></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://biharboardonline.com/\" t