an style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Official Websit️e</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 51.2393%; padding-left: 40px; height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://biharboardonline.bihar.gov.in/\">Click_Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '1711811877-bseb.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-26 00:00:00', '2024-03-31 08:17:24', NULL, NULL),
(221, 'NICL Administrative Officer AO Recruitment 2024', 'NICL AO Scale I Online Form 2024 National Insurance Company Limited (NICL) has released the advertisement for recruitment to 274 Various Administrative Officer', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 2099.15px; border: 3px ridge rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" width=\"680\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 166.05px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 166.05px; width: 100.004%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"680\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>National Insurance Company Limited (NICL) </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>NICL Various Administrative Officer (AO) Scale I Recruitment 2024 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>NICL AO Exam 2024 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 247.025px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 247.025px; width: 49.6975%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"348\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin <strong>: 02/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online <strong>: <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">22/01/2024</span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong>22/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Phase I Exam Date <strong>: 04/03/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available <strong>: 26/02/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Result Available <strong>: 27/03/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Phase II Exam Date :<strong> As per Schedule </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 247.025px; width: 50.3065%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"332\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS<strong> : 1000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>250/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 153.425px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 153.425px; width: 100.004%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"680\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>National Insurance NICL AO Notification 2024 : </strong><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Age Limit as on 01/12/2023</strong></span></span><strong> </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age <strong>: 21 Years</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age <strong>: 30 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per National Insurance Company Ltd (NICL) Administrative Officer AO Scale I Recruitment Rules 2023-2024.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 100.004%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"680\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>National Insurance AO Recruitment 2024 : </strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Vacancy Details Total : 274 Post</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px; width: 15.7818%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px; width: 16.2011%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px; width: 68.0211%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"456\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>National Insurance NICL AO Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 76.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px; width: 15.7818%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Generalist</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px; width: 16.2011%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">132</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px; width: 68.0211%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"456\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor / Master Degree in Any Stream from Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">UR / OBC / EWS 60% Marks, (55% for SC / ST)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px; width: 15.7818%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Doctors (MBBS)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px; width: 16.2011%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">28</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px; width: 68.0211%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"456\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">MBBS / MD / MS OR PG Medical Degree</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 76.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px; width: 15.7818%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Automobile Engineer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px; width: 16.2011%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">20</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px; width: 68.0211%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"456\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">BE / B.Tech / ME / M.Tech in Automobile Engineering</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS 60% Marks (55% for SC / ST)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px; width: 15.7818%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Legal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px; width: 16.2011%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">20</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px; width: 68.0211%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"456\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor / Master Degree in Law with 60% Marks (55% for SC / ST)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px; width: 15.7818%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Finance</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px; width: 16.2011%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">30</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 55.2px; width: 68.0211%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"456\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Chartered Accountant ICAI / ICWA <strong>OR</strong> B.Com / M.Com with 60% Marks (55% for SC / ST )</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px; width: 15.7818%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Actuarial</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px; width: 16.2011%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">02</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 54.4px; width: 68.0211%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"456\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor / Master Degree in Statistics / Mathematics / Actuarial Science with 60% Marks (SC / ST 55% Marks)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 76.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px; width: 15.7818%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Information Technology&nbsp; IT</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px; width: 16.2011%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">20</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 76.8px; width: 68.0211%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"456\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">BE / B.Tech / ME / M.Tech in IT or Computer Science OR MCA</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">UR / OBC / EWS 60% Marks (55% for SC / ST)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 145.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 145.6px; width: 15.7818%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Hindi (Rajbhasha) Officers</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 145.6px; width: 16.2011%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">22</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 145.6px; width: 68.0211%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"456\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Master Degree in Hindi with English as a Compulsory Subject Or Elective subject or As the Medium of Exam</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>OR</strong> Master Degree in English with Hindi as a Compulsory Subject OR Elective subject or As the Medium of Exam</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>OR</strong> Master Degree in Any Subject Other Than Hindi OR English with Hindi Medium and English as Compulsory or Elective or Medium of Exam.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">UR / OBC / EWS 60% Marks (55% for SC / ST)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 265.425px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 265.425px; width: 100.004%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"680\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill NIAL AO Recruitment Online Form 2023</strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">National Insurance Company Ltd (NICL) Invited For New Application for Administrative Officer AO Various 274 Post Recruitment 2024 Candidate Can Apply Online <strong>02 January 2024 to 22 January 2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in NICL AO Latest Govt. Post Recruitment 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 100.004%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"680\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 49.0355%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Pre Result</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 50.9685%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"344\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NICL AO Recruitment Pre Result 2024\" href=\"https://nationalinsurance.nic.co.in/sites/default/files/LIST%20OF%20ROLL%20NUMBERS%20OF%20PROVISIONALLY%20SHORTLISTED%20CANDIDATES%20FOR%20PHASE%20II%20%28MAIN%29%20EXAMINATION%20-%20%28AO%202023-24%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 49.0355%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 50.9685%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"344\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NICL AO Recruitment Admit Card 2024\" href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/niclnov23/oecla_febr24/login.php?appid=16ecd703f4e216425681213b9d021657\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 49.0355%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Exam Notice</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 50.9685%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"344\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NICL AO Recruitment Exam Notice 2024\" href=\"https://nationalinsurance.nic.co.in/sites/default/files/Notice%20-%20Intimation%20of%20date%20of%20Preliminary%20Examination%20%28Online%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 49.0355%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 50.9685%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"344\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NICL AO Recruitment Registration 2024\" href=\"https://nationalinsurance.nic.co.in/en/recruitments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 49.0355%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 50.9685%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"344\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NICL AO Recruitment 2023 Notification\" href=\"https://nationalinsurance.nic.co.in/sites/default/files/NICL%20AO%20Recruitment%20Advertisment%202023-24.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 49.0355%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 68.625px; width: 50.9685%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"344\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NIACL Official Website\" href=\"https://nationalinsurance.nic.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">National Insurance Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711515661-pic.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-26 00:00:00', '2024-03-27 05:01:01', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(222, 'CUET UG Online Form 2024', 'CUET UG Online Form 2024 Online Apply Now – Links Available Till 31st March, Check Notification, Dates, Eligibility & Syllabus', '<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 226); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>CUET UG Online Form 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam name</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET Full form</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Central Universities Entrance Test</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Conducting Authority</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">NTA (National Testing Agency)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Level</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">National</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 27.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 27.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Frequency of exam</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 27.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Once a year</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 124px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 124px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Total number of participating universities</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 124px; border-width: 3px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">46 central universities,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">44 state universities,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">32 deemed universities,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">134 private universities</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">And 3 Others</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Courses offered</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">UG</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mode of application</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam mode</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Computer-based test</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam centers</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Over 388 within India, and 24 outside India</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.125px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 22.125px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET UG Date 2024</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 22.125px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Between 15<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;May 2024 and 31 May 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET Application Form Start Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>27/02/2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last date to submit the CUET application form</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><mark>05/04/2024</mark></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET UG Result 2024</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; border-width: 3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3 weeks of the conclusion of exam</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"CUET_UG_Online_Form_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CUET UG Online Form 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">एनटीए ने आधिकारिक तौर पर अपनी आधिकारिक वेबसाइट पर&nbsp;<strong>सीयूईटी यूजी 2024</strong>&nbsp;के लिए परीक्षा कार्यक्रम जारी कर दिया है। CUET 2024 प्रवेश परीक्षा लगभग 44 केंद्रीय विश्वविद्यालयों, राज्य संस्थानों, निजी विश्वविद्यालयों, डीम्ड विश्वविद्यालयों और अन्य प्रतिष्ठित शैक्षणिक संस्थानों के लिए दरवाजे खोलती है। जो लोग&nbsp;<strong>सीयूईटी यूजी 2024</strong> के लिए उपस्थित होने की योजना बना रहे हैं, उन्हें आवेदन पत्र भरने से पहले पात्रता मानदंड की जांच करनी चाहिए।</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CUET UG Exam Date 2024</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\">छात्र नीचे&nbsp;<strong>CUET UG 2024</strong>&nbsp;तिथियां देख सकते हैं। NTA has started the online form filling process for under graduate program.&nbsp;<strong>सीयूईटी&nbsp;</strong><strong>यूजी 2024</strong>&nbsp;की अपेक्षित तारीखें नीचे दी गई हैं</span>।</span></em></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong><u>Events</u></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong><u>Dates</u></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET Application Form Start Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>27/02/2024 (upto 11:00 pm)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 25.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 25.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last date to submit the CUET application form</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 25.4px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">31/03/2024 (upto 09:50 pm)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 50.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 50.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application correction Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 50.4px;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Postponed; Dates announced later</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Announcement of city of CUET exam</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>30/04/2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET Admit card release</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>May 2024&nbsp;(2nd Week)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET (UG) Exam</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>15-05-2024 to 31-05-2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Release Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">June 2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET Result Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>30 June 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Counselling session</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">July 2024 onwards</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"CUET_UG_Eligibility_Criteria\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CUET UG Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>CUET UG Application Form</strong>&nbsp;जमा करने से पहले, उम्मीदवारों को सभी सीयूईटी पात्रता आवश्यकताओं की जांच करनी होगी। भाग लेने वाले संस्थान प्रत्येक कार्यक्रम के लिए पात्रता आवश्यकताओं को निर्धारित करते हैं, जबकि&nbsp;<strong>National Testing Agency सीयूईटी यूजी टेस्ट</strong>&nbsp;में उपस्थित होने के लिए आवश्यकताओं को निर्धारित करती है।</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(35, 111, 161); text-decoration: underline;\">Check Here for complete CUET UG eligibility criteria&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age requirement:</strong>&nbsp;No age limit for the CUET entrance examination.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Nationality:</strong>&nbsp;Indian citizens are eligible for the CUET Entrance test 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Educational qualifications:</strong>&nbsp;Must have qualified Class 10+2 from a recognized board with a minimum of 50% marks obtained.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Subjects studied:</strong>&nbsp;Must have studied any of the following subjects during Class 12th: Accountancy, Agriculture, Anthropology, Art Education Sculpture, Biology, Entrepreneurship, Business Studies, Chemistry, Computer Science, Economics/Business Economics, Engineering Graphics, Environmental Studies, Geography, General Test, History, Home Science, Languages, Legal Studies, Mass Media/ Mass Communication, Mathematics, Performing Arts, Physical Education, Physics, Psychology, Political Science, Sanskrit, Sociology and others.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Qualification exam marks:</strong>&nbsp;Must score a minimum of 50% in the last qualifying examination. For SC, ST, and OBC-NCL categories candidates, the minimum mark requirement is 45%.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"CUET_UG_Application_Fee\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 12, 255); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CUET UG Application Fee</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 226);\"><strong>CUET UG application fees</strong>&nbsp;छात्रों द्वारा चुने गए विषयों की संख्या के अनुसार होगा।&nbsp;<strong>CUET UG 2024</strong>&nbsp;Application fee के लिए नीचे दी गई तालिका देखें।</span></em></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\"><strong><u>Number of Subjects</u></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\"><strong><u>Candidate Category</u></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong><u>Application Fee (in INR)</u></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" rowspan=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Up to 3 Subjects</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General (UR)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OBC-NCL (EWS)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Rs. 900/-</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST/PwBD/Third Gender</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Rs. 800/-</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" rowspan=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Additional Subject:</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General (UR)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Rs. 400</strong>/-&nbsp;<strong>Each</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OBC-NCL (EWS)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Rs. 375/- Each</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST/PwBD/Third Gender</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Rs. 350</strong>/-&nbsp;<strong>Each</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"CUET_UG_Exam_Pattern_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CUET UG Exam Pattern 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Students can check the structure of CUET UG in terms of the number of questions in each section along with the exam duration.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Mode: Computer-Based Test/ Pen &amp; Paper</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Question Type: Objective (MCQ)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CUET UG Exam Pattern</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 3px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\">CUET UG Exam Pattern 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong><u>Sections</u></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong><u>Subjects/ Tests</u></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong><u>No. of Question</u></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong><u>To be Attempted</u></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong><u>Duration</u></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Section IA</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">13 Languages</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">50</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">40 in each language</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">45 minutes for each language</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Section IB</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">20 Languages</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Section II</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">27 Domain-specific Subjects</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">45/50</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">35/40</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">45 minutes for each subject</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Section III</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General Test</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">60</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">50</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">60 minutes</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"CUET_UG_Syllabus_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CUET UG Syllabus 2024</strong></span></em></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CUET UG 2024 परीक्षा की तैयारी करने वाले छात्रों को CUET UG सिलेबस 2024 से गुजरना होगा। उम्मीद है कि&nbsp;<strong>NTA CUET UG 2024</strong>&nbsp;सिलेबस में कोई बदलाव नहीं करेगा। डोमेन-विशिष्ट विषयों का पाठ्यक्रम एनसीईआरटी पाठ्यक्रम के समान होगा। छात्रों को सलाह दी जाती है कि वे एनसीईआरटी की किताबें पढ़ें।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The following table shows the section-wise CUET UG syllabus 2024.</span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 342.8px; border: 2px solid rgb(255, 19, 219);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 32.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(255, 19, 219); height: 32.4px; text-align: center; width: 34.4124%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong><u>Section</u></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(255, 19, 219); height: 32.4px; text-align: center; width: 65.6143%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong><u>CUET Syllabus or Question Types</u></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 124.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(255, 19, 219); height: 124.8px; width: 34.4124%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Section I &ndash; Language</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(255, 19, 219); height: 124.8px; width: 65.6143%;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Factual,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Literary and Narrative,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Literary Aptitude and Vocabulary</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(255, 19, 219); height: 19.2px; width: 34.4124%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Section II &ndash; Domain Subject</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(255, 19, 219); height: 19.2px; width: 65.6143%; text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 12 Board Exam Syllabus of the Subject</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 166.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(255, 19, 219); height: 166.4px; width: 34.4124%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Section III &ndash; General Test</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(255, 19, 219); height: 166.4px; width: 65.6143%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General Knowledge,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Current Affairs,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General Mental Ability,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Numerical Ability,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Quantitative Reasoning (Simple application of basic mathematical concepts arithmetic/ algebra geometry/ mensuration/ statistic taught till Grade 8),</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Logical and Analytical Reasoning</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Link\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Link</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 167.675px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Form Apply Link</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 230.525px; padding-left: 40px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://cuetug.ntaonline.in/frontend/web/registration/index\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Registration</strong>&nbsp;</a>|&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://cuetug.ntaonline.in/frontend/web/site/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Login</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 167.675px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Official Notifications</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 230.525px; padding-left: 40px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/CUET-UG/images/cuet-ug-ib.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 167.675px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Official Website</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 230.525px; padding-left: 40px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/CUET-UG/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 167.675px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>NTA CUET UG Exam Schedule PDF</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 230.525px; padding-left: 40px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.nta.ac.in/Download/Notice/Notice_20230919120012.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"CUET_Books_for_Preparation\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"CUET_Previous_Years_Statistics\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CUET Previous Year&rsquo;s Statistics</strong></span></em></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 195.6px; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.9623%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">NTA CUET UG Exam for 2023</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.3114%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">May 21 to June 23, 2023, except June 3 and 4 2023</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.9623%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Total registered students</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.3114%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">16.85 lakhs</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 24.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.9623%; height: 24.4px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">No. of applicants paid the CUET application fee</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.3114%; height: 24.4px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">13.995 lakhs</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.9623%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Total number of universities</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.3114%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Over 240</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.9623%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Applications received from Jammu and Kashmir</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.3114%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">82,655</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.9623%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Applications received from foreign students</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.3114%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.9623%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application received in the second edition of CUET-UG</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.3114%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">14 lakhs</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.9623%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum applications for CUET-UG</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.3114%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Uttar Pradesh, followed by Delhi and Bihar</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.9623%; height: 36.8px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The highest number of CUET-UG applications received</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.3114%; height: 36.8px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Delhi University, followed by BHU and Allahabad University</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711463191-pic.webp', '15', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-26 00:00:00', '2024-04-01 06:54:26', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(223, 'ECIL Technician Jobs 2024 Apply Online', 'ECIL Technician Jobs 2024 Apply Online', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\">ECIL Technician Jobs 2024 Apply Online for 30 Vacancies</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content cf\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<aside id=\"widgets-wrap-before-post-content\" class=\"cf\"></aside>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>ECIL Technician Jobs 2024</strong>&nbsp;&ndash;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Electronics Corporation of India Limited (ECIL), Hyderabad</strong>&nbsp;ने<strong>&nbsp;Technician&nbsp;</strong>के कुल मिलाकर<strong>&nbsp;30</strong>&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>रिक्तियों पर भर्ती के लिए विज्ञापन की अधिसूचना&nbsp;<strong>(Vacancy Advertisement)</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;जारी की है। इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी&nbsp;<strong>23 March, 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>से 13 April,</strong><strong>&nbsp;2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>तक</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Online</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Apply</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;कर सकते हैं। इस विज्ञापन की विस्तृत जानकारी जैसे&nbsp;<strong>Post Name, No. of Vacancies, Eligibility Criteria, Pay Scale, Application Fee, Selection Process, How to Apply Instructions, Important Dates, Useful Web Links</strong> इत्यादि इस प्रकार है &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"ECIL_Technician_Jobs_2024_Overview\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>ECIL Technician Jobs 2024 Overview&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px ridge rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Recruitment Organization</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Electronics Corporation of India Limited (ECIL), A Govt. of India Enterprise (Department of Atomic Energy)&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Name of Recruitment</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Recruitment of Technician (GR-II)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Name of Post</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Technician (GR-II) (WG-III)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Total Number of Vacancies</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">30 Vacancies</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Who can Apply</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" 