(224, 'JEE Main Session 2 Admit Card 2024', 'The National Testing Agency (NTA) has recently uploaded the online application forms for the NTA JEE Main Session 2 Admit Card 2024.', '<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc lwptoc-autoWidth lwptoc-light lwptoc-notInherit\" data-smooth-scroll=\"1\" data-smooth-scroll-offset=\"24\" data-lwptoc-initialized=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_i\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_items\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#JEE_Main_Session_2_Admit_Card_2024\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">JEE Main Session 2 Admit Card 2024</span> </a></span>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#JEE_Main_2024_Session_2_Admit_Card\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1.1</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">JEE Main 2024 Session 2 Admit Card</span> </a></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#JEE_Main_Session_2_Admit_Card_20241\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1.2</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">JEE Main Session 2 Admit Card 2024</span> </a></span>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#JEE_Main_2024_Session_2\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1.2.1</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">JEE Main 2024 Session 2</span> </a></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#Age_Limit\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1.2.2</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Age Limit</span> </a></span>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#Education_Qualification\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1.2.2.1</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Education Qualification</span> </a></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#Important_Instructions\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1.2.2.2</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Important Instructions</span> </a></span>\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\">\r\n<div class=\"lwptoc_item\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"#JEE_Main_2024_Session_2_Admit_Card1\"> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_number\">1.2.2.2.1</span> <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">JEE Main 2024 Session 2 Admit Card</span> </a></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"JEE_Main_Session_2_Admit_Card_2024\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>JEE Main Session 2 Admit Card 2024</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">JEE Main Session 2 Admit Card 2024: </span>The National Testing Agency (NTA) has recently uploaded the online application forms for the NTA JEE Main Session 2 Admit Card 2024. National Testing Agency i.e. NTA JEE Main 2024 for session 2 will be held from April 4 to 15 examination. Candidates can visit the official website nta.ac.in.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All eligible and interested candidates can read the official full notification before applying online through the important link given below. Please check and collect all the documents &ndash; Eligibility, ID proof, address details, and basic details. Please read the scanned documents related to the online form &ndash; Photo, Sign, ID proof, etc. Preview and check all the columns carefully before submitting the application form.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"JEE_Main_2024_Session_2_Admit_Card\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>JEE Main 2024 Session 2 Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 3px inset rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 48.2125px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 48.2125px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong>National Testing Agency (Joint Entrance Examination) (Main) &ndash; 2024 Session 2</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 48.2125px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 48.2125px; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Title of the Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 48.2125px; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>JEE Main 2024 Session 2 Admit Card</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 48.2125px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 48.2125px;