 border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1000</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.711%; height: 23.2px; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 33.4019%; height: 23.2px; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Third Gender</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.76701%; height: 23.2px; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1000</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.711%; height: 23.2px; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Payment Mode:</strong></span> Pay the application fee through a Credit Card/Debit Card except for Master/Visa Card)/Net Banking/UPI fee mode.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Processing charges and Goods &amp; Service Taxes (GST) are to be paid by the candidate, as applicable.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; height: auto !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For appearing in the JEE (Main) &ndash; 2024, there is no age limit for the candidates. The candidates who have passed the class 12/equivalent examination in 2022, 2023, or appearing in 2024 irrespective of their age can appear in JEE (Main) &ndash; 2024 examination.</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Education_Qualification\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Education Qualification</strong></span></span></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Only those candidates who have passed the class 12th/equivalent examination in 2022, 2023: Or appearing in the class 12th/equivalent examination in 2024, are eligible for JEE main 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Read the Official full notification for more details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Instructions\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Instructions</strong></span></span></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The candidates who have applied and successfully paid the Examination Fee for JEE (Main) &ndash; 2024 Session 1 and wish to appear for JEE (Main) &ndash; 2024 Session 2, are required to log in with their previous Application Number and Password as provided in Session 1. They may only choose the Paper, Medium of the Examination, State code of Eligibility, Cities for Session 2, educational qualification details, and pay the Examination Fees. </span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Those candidates who have not applied earlier, need to apply afresh as per the schedule given. The Candidates are advised to keep visiting the official websites of NTA (www.nta.ac.in) and (https://jeemain.nta.ac.in/) for the latest updates.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The process for registration and Application will remain the same as followed for Session 1.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px double rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 417.6px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 40px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 57px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 57px;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 57px;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://jeemainsession2.ntaonline.in/frontend/web/advancecityintimationslip/admit-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CLICK HERE</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 75.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 75.8px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam City Information</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 75.8px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://jeemainsession2.ntaonline.in/frontend/web/advancecityintimationslip/index\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://jeemainsession2.ntaonline.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 40.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 40.8px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date Notice</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 40.8px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://jeemain.nta.ac.in/images/public-notice-for-extension-and-correction-of-jee-main-2024-session-2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://jeemain.nta.ac.in/images/public-notice-for-jee-main-session-2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Notification</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bulletin Download</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://jeemain.nta.ac.in/images/information-bulletin-for-jee-main-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Download Bulletin</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 51px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://jeemain.nta.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Main Website</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1711602721-jeemain.webp', '14', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-28 00:00:00', '2024-04-01 06:50:41', NULL, NULL),
(225, 'Haryana Police Constable Recruitment 2024', 'Haryana Police Constable Recruitment 2024', '<div class=\"newpage-row2\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px ridge rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 208.674%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 class=\"table-posttitle\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Haryana Police Constable Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.3837%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">IMPORTANT DATES</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>&bull;</strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span>Starting Date&nbsp;&ndash;<strong> 20 February 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&bull; Last Date of Registration &ndash;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 28 March 2024</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>&bull;</strong> Last Date of Fee Payment &ndash;<strong> 28 March 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>&bull;</strong> Exam Date &ndash;<strong>&nbsp;Available Soon</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 154.291%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">APPLICATION FEE</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>&bull; No Application Fee</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: auto !important; width: 54.3837%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">JOB LOCATION</span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Haryana</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: auto !important; width: 154.291%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">AGE LIMIT</span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>As On 01 February 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Minimum &ndash; </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 300;\">18 Years</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Maximum &ndash; </strong>25 Years</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Age Relaxation (Upper Age Limit) &ndash;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">As per Rules</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"M907906ScriptRootC1510620-additional\">\r\n<div id=\"M907906ScriptRootC1510620_03536\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: auto !important; width: 208.674%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<div id=\"custom_html-2\" class=\"widget_text widget widget_custom_html widget-shortcode area-arbitrary \"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy Details for Haryana Police Constable Recruitment 2024 :&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><strong>Important Information &ndash;</strong></span> According to the latest updates from the official, HSSC Police has released the notification for the recruitment of Constables GD Posts on the official website of the HSSC. Check More Details on As per the latest reports, Chandigarh Police has expedited the recruitment process for 6,000 posts in department.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">According to the latest information, The process of recruitment is going on for a total of 6,000 posts for the Constable GD posts amongst the department. It is being told that the Haryana Police Constable Recruitment 2024 has started the application process by issuing the IT Constable Recruitment Notification on 12 February 2024. And the Chandigarh Police IT Constable recruitment application process has started from 20 February 2024 while the last date to apply for the aforesaid post will be 21 March 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><strong>Post Name &ndash;</strong></span> Constables GD (Male/Female)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Category Wise Vacancy Details &ndash;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Constable GD Male- 5,000 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Constable GD Female- 1,000 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><strong>Pay Scale &ndash; </strong></span>As per rules</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Educational Qualification for Haryana Police Constable Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Candidates who have passed their Class 12th Examination from any recognised Board with Hindi/Sanskrit as a subject in Matric level <span style=\"font-weight: 300;\">will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">How to Apply for Haryana Police Constable Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</span> </strong></span>Candidates can apply through link provided below or they can also apply through official site of the HSSC Haryana Police before the 28 March 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Mode of Selection for Haryana Police Constable Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</span>&nbsp;</strong></span>Selection will be based on-:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Written Examination,</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Physical Efficiency and Measurement Test (PE&amp;MT),</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Document Verification &amp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Medical Examination</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px ridge rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"important-linkstable\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 244.651%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 id=\"applyimg\" class=\"postapplya\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-decoration: underline;\">Important Links</span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.01%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Download Date Extended Notice</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 194.641%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://www.hssc.gov.in/hssccms/uploads/publicnotice/18233-Public%20notice%20of%201.2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a><strong style=\"color: #ff0000; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.01%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Apply Online</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 194.641%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://adv012024.hryssc.com/hssc/employeeOnboardingHomepage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a><strong style=\"color: #ff0000; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.01%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Download Notification</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 194.641%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://hssc.gov.in/hssccms/uploads/advt/58949-Police%20Advt.%201.2024%20dated%2012.02.2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.01%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Download Syllabus &amp; Exam Pattern</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 194.641%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://chandigarhpolice.gov.in/pdf/Recruitment/2024/IT/TierIISyllabus_IT_2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.01%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Official website</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 194.641%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://hssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1711603980-police.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-28 00:00:00', '2024-03-28 05:33:00', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(226, 'SSC CPO Recruitment 2024', 'SSC CPO Recruitment 2024', '<div class=\"newpage-row2\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 99.9867%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 2256.74px; border: 2px solid rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 80.475px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.997%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 80.475px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SSC CPO Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 275.825px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.2533%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 275.825px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">IMPORTANT DATES</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull;&nbsp;</strong>Starting Date &ndash; <strong>04 March 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&bull;</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;Last Date</span></span><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> &ndash; <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">28 March 2024</span></span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Fee Payment Last Date &ndash; <strong>28 March 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull;</strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span>Form Correction Date<strong> &ndash; 30 -31 March 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Admit Card<strong> &ndash;&nbsp;</strong><strong>Available Soon</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"M907906ScriptRootC1510620-additional\">\r\n<div id=\"M907906ScriptRootC1510620_004cd\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Exam Date<strong> &ndash; 09, 10 &amp; 13 May 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 48.7437%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 275.825px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">APPLICATION FEE</span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&bull; General / OBC / EWS &ndash; </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Rs. 100/-&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&bull; SC / ST / Ex. Serv. &ndash;</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> No Fee</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&bull; Female &ndash;</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">No Fee</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The candidate can pay the fee through online via Credit Card / Debit Card Or&nbsp; Net Banking or through SBI Challan.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 167.825px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.2533%; height: 167.825px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">AGE LIMIT (Tentative)</span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age as on 01-August-2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum &ndash; <strong>20 Years</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum &ndash; <strong>25 Years</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.7437%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); height: 167.825px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">JOB LOCATION</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Over India &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 1732.62px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.997%; height: 1732.62px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Vacancy Details for SSC CPO Recruitment 2024 :</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><strong>Important Information &ndash;</strong> </span>The Staff Selection Commission (SSC) has released the notification for the recruitment of CPO Sub Inspector (SI) on the official website of the SSC on 04 March 2024.There are 4,187 vacancies has been issued for the SSC CPO SI Recruitment 2024 for Sub-Inspector in Delhi Police and Central Armed Police Forces (Male / Female) Posts. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">As per the notification released by the SSC, it stated that the Online registration process for SSC CPO Sub Inspector (SI) Recruitment 2024 has started from 04 March 2024. Candidates must check the complete details for SSC CPO Recruitment 2024 which has given below.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong> &ndash;</span> </span>Sub-Inspector in Delhi Police and Central Armed Police Forces</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Wise &amp; Category Wise Vacancy Details &ndash;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(A) Delhi Police &ndash; </strong>141 Posts&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(B) Border Security Force (BSF) &nbsp;&ndash; </strong>892 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(C) Central Industrial Security Force (CISF) &ndash;</strong> 1,597 Posts&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(D) Central Reserve Police Force (CRPF) &ndash; </strong>1,172 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(E) Indo Tibetan Border Security Police Force &ndash;</strong> 278 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(F) Shashtra Seema Bal (SSB) &ndash;</strong> 68 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><strong>Pay Scale &ndash;</strong></span>&nbsp;As Per Rules<br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Educational Qualification for SSC CPO Recruitment 2024</span>&nbsp;&ndash;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SI (Delhi Police) &ndash;&nbsp;</strong>Candidates having Graduation Degree in any stream from any recognized university along with having&nbsp; Vehicle Driving License for LMV will be eligible for this post.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Rest All Posts</strong>&ndash; Candidates having Graduation Degree in any stream from any recognized university will be eligible for this post.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Physical Eligibility for SSC CPO Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</span>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(1) Height-:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Male:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Gen / OBC / SC &ndash; 170 cm</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">ST &ndash; 162.5 cm</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Female:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Gen / OBC / SC &ndash; 157 Cm</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">ST &ndash; 154 cm</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(2) Chest-:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Male:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Gen / OBC / SC &ndash; 80 &ndash; 85 Cm</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">ST &ndash; 77 &ndash; 82 Cm</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(3) Weight &ndash;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For both Male &amp; Female Applicants- Corrected with Height</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Physical Endurance Test Details-:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(4) Running :</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Male &ndash; 100 Meteres in 16 Seconds</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Female &ndash; 100 Meters in 18 Seconds</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(5) Shot Put :</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Male &ndash; 4.5 Meters in 03 Chances</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(6) Long Jump :</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Male &ndash; 3.65 Meters in 03 Chances</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Female &ndash; 2.7 Meters in 03 Chances</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(7) High Jump</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Male &ndash; 1.2 Meters in 03 Chances</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Female &ndash; 0.9 Meters in 03 Chances</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>How to Apply for SSC CPO Recruitment 2024</strong></span>&nbsp;&ndash;</span>&nbsp;Interested candidates can apply through the link provided below on the link section or they can also apply through the official website of SSC before Last Date<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are suggested to read full Official Notification before applying.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Mode of Selection for SSC CPO Recruitment 2024 </strong>&ndash; </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Selection will be based on Written Exam, PET, PST, Interview &amp; Personality Test.</span></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><a title=\"Exam Info Website Home Page Direct Link\" href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../assets/files/examinfo-website-info-image.webp\" alt=\"Exam Info Website Welcome image / abouts image\" width=\"446\" height=\"270\"></span></a></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px double rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"important-linkstable\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 252.522%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 id=\"applyimg\" class=\"postapplya\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">Important Links</span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.0865%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Apply Online</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 202.435%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.0865%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Download Notice (Exam Calendar)</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 202.435%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/SSCFileServer/PortalManagement/UploadedFiles/Annual_Calendar_2024-25_07112023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 50.0865%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Official website</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 202.435%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1711605665-ssc cpo.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-03-28 00:00:00', '2024-03-28 06:14:27', NULL, NULL),
(227, 'West Bengal  Police Online Form 2024 ', 'The West Bengal Police Recruitment Board (WBPRB) has announced openings for Constable positions within the West Bengal Police Department.', '<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(255, 0, 226); font-size: 14pt;\"><span id=\"WB_Police_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\"><strong>WB Police Eligibility Criteria 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Application_Fees_For_WB_Police_Online_Form_2024\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(36, 12, 255);\"><strong>Application Fees For WB Police Online Form 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(36, 12, 255);\"><strong><a title=\"Exam Info \" href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</a></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Authority:&nbsp;</strong>West Bengal Police Recruitment Board (WBPRB)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name:&nbsp;</strong>Constable</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Posts:</strong>&nbsp;10255</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Advt No.:</strong>&nbsp;WBPRB/NOTICE &ndash; 2024/13 (CONS._WBP_24)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date to Apply:&nbsp;</strong>05 April 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Male Candidates:&nbsp;</strong>7,228 vacancies</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Female Candidates:&nbsp;</strong>3,027 positions</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Correction:</strong>&nbsp;April 8 to April 14</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website:&nbsp;</strong>prb.wb.gov.in</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><span id=\"WB_Police_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>WB Police Eligibility Criteria 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Educational_Qualification\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">Educational Qualification:</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Individuals aiming for WB Police Constable positions need to have cleared the Madhyamik Examination from the West Bengal Board of Secondary Education or its equivalent. Proficiency in speaking, reading, and writing Bengali is essential. However, this language requirement doesn&rsquo;t extend to permanent residents of the hill sub-divisions of Darjeeling and Kalimpong Districts, as they are subject to different linguistic provisions.</span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">Age Limit:</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must be at least 18 years old and no more than 30 years old as of January 1, 2024, to meet the age criteria. The recruitment process provides relaxation in the upper age limit for certain categories:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SC/ST:&nbsp;</strong>5 years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>OBC-A/OBC-B:&nbsp;</strong>3 years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Transgender:</strong>&nbsp;3 years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Civic Volunteers:&nbsp;</strong>5 years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Application_Fees_For_WB_Police_Online_Form_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fees For WB Police Online Form 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">For applicants from West Bengal in&nbsp;<strong>all other categories</strong>, the fee is<strong>&nbsp;₹170,</strong>&nbsp;comprising an&nbsp;<strong>application fee</strong>&nbsp;of<strong>&nbsp;₹150&nbsp;</strong>and a&nbsp;<strong>processing fee of ₹20.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>SC/ST candidates&nbsp;</strong>from West Bengal are exempt from the application fee and only need to pay a&nbsp;<strong>processing fee of ₹20</strong>.</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Benefits_Of_WB_Police_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(35, 111, 161); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Benefits Of WB Police Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Service to Society:&nbsp;</strong>As a police constable, you&rsquo;ll play a crucial role in maintaining law and order, ensuring safety, and serving the community.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Career Growth:&nbsp;</strong>The West Bengal Police offers opportunities for advancement and specialization.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Stability:&nbsp;</strong>A government job provides stability and job security.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Pride and Honor:</strong>&nbsp;Wear the uniform with pride and uphold the values of integrity and courage.</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_For_WB_Police_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(186, 55, 42); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply For WB Police Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Visit the Official Website: Head over to the official website to start your application.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fill in the Details: Provide accurate information about yourself, your qualifications, and any relevant experience.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Upload Documents: Attach scanned copies of your educational certificates, ID proof, and recent photograph.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Fee: The application fee is Rs. 170 for all categories except SC/ST, who pay Rs. 20.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>+</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Submit and Print: Once you&rsquo;ve double-checked everything, hit that submit button. Don&rsquo;t forget to print your application receipt for future reference.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"WB_Police_Selection_Process_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(230, 126, 35); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>WB Police Selection Process 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The selection process for the Constable positions in the West Bengal Police consists of several stages designed to thoroughly evaluate candidates&rsquo; suitability for the role:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Written Examination:&nbsp;</strong>Candidates are assessed on their knowledge and understanding relevant to the duties of a police constable.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Physical Measurement Test (PMT):&nbsp;</strong>Candidates&rsquo; physical attributes are measured to ensure they meet the required physical standards.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Physical Efficiency Test (PET):&nbsp;</strong>This stage evaluates candidates&rsquo; physical fitness and agility, essential for the demanding nature of police work.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Interviews:&nbsp;</strong>The final stage involves personal interviews to assess candidates&rsquo; overall suitability for the position. This includes evaluating their communication skills, personality, and motivation for joining the police force.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-23dc8b89dd9690267f7de6af20294dcd\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"To_Apply_Visit_HereOfficial_Notification_Check_HereOfficial_Website_prbwbgovin\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>To Apply:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://wbprb.applythrunet.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Visit Here</a><br>Official Notification:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://prb.wb.gov.in/uploads/recruitment/170962950186600.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Check Here</a><br>Official Website:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://prb.wb.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">prb.wb.gov.in</a></strong></span></h4>', '1711635808-wb.webp', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-28 00:00:00', '2024-03-28 02:23:28', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(228, 'TNPSC Group I Notification 2024', 'तमिलनाडु लोक सेवा आयोग ने अपने आधिकारिक वेब पोर्टल पर संयुक्त सिविल सेवा परीक्षा (समूह I) के संबंध में आधिकारिक अधिसूचना जारी की है।', '<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Apply Online for TNPSC Group I </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Notification 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</a></strong></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px ridge rgb(236, 202, 250); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1287%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Recruitment Board</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8979%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tamil Nadu Public Service Commission</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1287%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Name</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8979%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Combined Civil Services Examination</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1287%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Post Name</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8979%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Deputy Collector,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Deputy Superintendent of Police (Category-1),</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Commissioner(Commercial Taxes),</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Deputy Registrar of Co-operative Societies,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Director of Rural Development,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">District Employment Officer,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">District Officer (Fire and Rescue Services)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1287%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Article Type</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8979%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">TNPSC Group I Notification 2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1287%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Total Post</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8979%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">90</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1287%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Apply Mode</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8979%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1287%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Selection Process</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8979%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Preliminary Exam</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Personal Interview</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1287%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Official Website</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8979%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">tnpsc.gov.in</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"TNPSC_Group_I_Notification_2024_Apply_Online_Now\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Notification 2024: Apply Online Now</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tamilnadu Public Service Commission has released the official TNPSC Group I Notification 2024 regarding the 90 Combined Civil services posts. Individuals who are interested in the latest vacancies can check the TNPSC Group I Notification PDF from the direct link available below. The date for Prelims examination has been scheduled to be held on 13th July 2024 from 09:30 am to 12:30 pm.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"TNPSC_Group_I_Important_Dates\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Important Dates</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 2px inset rgb(236, 202, 250); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Event</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Date of TNPSC Group I Notification 2024</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">28th March 2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last date and time for submission of online application</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">27th April 2024 11.59 P.M</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Correction Window period</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2nd May (12.01 A.M) to 4th May 2024 (11.59 P.M)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Prelims Admit Card</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">One week before the exam</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Date and time of preliminary examination</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>13th July 2024 09.30 A.M. to 12.30 P.M.</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Provisional Answer Key Release Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Will be announced soon</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Raise Objections</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Will be announced soon</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Final Answer Key Release Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Will be announced soon</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Admit Card</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Will be announced soon</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 47.1539%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Date of main examination</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.8728%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Will be announced soon</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"TNPSC_Group_I_Vacancy\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Vacancy</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 2px inset rgb(251, 238, 184); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 25.8286%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Code</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.3019%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 34.8961%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Number of Vacancies</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 25.8286%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1001</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.3019%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Deputy Collector</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 34.8961%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">16</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 25.8286%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1002</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.3019%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">DSP (Category I)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 34.8961%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">23</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 25.8286%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1003</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.3019%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Commissioner (Commercial Taxes)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 34.8961%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">14</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 25.8286%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1004</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.3019%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Deputy Registrar of Cooperative Societies</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 34.8961%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">21</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 25.8286%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1006</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.3019%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Director of Rural Development</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 34.8961%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">14</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 25.8286%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1007</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.3019%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">District Employment Officer</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 34.8961%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 25.8286%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1008</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 39.3019%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">District Officer (Fire and Rescue Services)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 34.8961%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 65.1305%;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancy</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 34.8961%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>90</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Educational_Qualification\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">As per the TNPSC Group I Notification 2024, Candidates who wish to apply for the available posts of TNPSC must have a degree from any University. For more detailed information check the official notification</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Limit&nbsp;</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must be within the age limit as of 01-07-2024 to be eligible for TSPSC Group 1 Vacancies &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age: 21 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age:</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Deputy Collector: 34 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">DSP (Category I): 34 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Commissioner (Commercial Taxes):</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">(i) For candidates possessing any degree: 34 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">(ii) For candidates possessing a B.L. degree: 35 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Deputy Registrar of Cooperative Societies: 34 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Director of Rural Development: 34 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">District Employment Officer: 34 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">District Officer (Fire and Rescue Services): 34 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\"><strong>Note:</strong></span>&nbsp;Candidates belonging to MBCs/DCs, BC(OBCM)s, BCMs SCs, SC(A)s, STs, and Destitute Widows of all Communities will be relaxed for up to 5 years.</em></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Registration_Fee\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong>Registration Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">For the &ldquo;One Time Registration&rdquo; candidates have to pay the registration fees of Rs. 150 as per the TNPSC Group I Notification 2024. Successfully registered OTR is valid for 05 years from registration date.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Then candidates have to pay Rs. 100 as examination fees at the time of submitting the online application form. Then those who have not claimed fee exemption will have to Rs. 200 when they have been shortlisted for the Main Exam and Interview.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Selection_Procedure\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong>Selection Procedure</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">According to TNPSC Group I Notification 2024<strong>,&nbsp;</strong>The selection of individuals for the Combined Civil Services Examination will be based on</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Preliminary Examination (Objective Type)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">On-Screen Certificate Verification</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Main Examination (Written Test and Personal Interview)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"TNPSC_Group_I_Exam_Pattern\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Exam Pattern</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"TNPSC_Group_I_Prelims_Exam_Pattern\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 12, 255);\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Prelims Exam Pattern</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Duration: 3 Hours</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Qualifying Marks (for others): 120</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Qualifying Marks (SCs, SC(A)s, STs, MBCs/DCs, BC(OBCM)s and&nbsp;BCMs): 90</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Preliminary Exam Pattern</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px ridge rgb(248, 202, 198);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 40.6233%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Subject</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 27.9227%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Question</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 31.4806%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Marks</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 40.6233%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General Studies (Degree Standard)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 27.9227%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">175</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 31.4806%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">250</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 40.6233%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Aptitude &amp; Mental Ability Test (SSLC Standard)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 27.9227%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2500</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 31.4806%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">50</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 40.6233%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 27.9227%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>200</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 31.4806%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>300</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"TNPSC_Group_I_Mains_Exam_Pattern\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Mains Exam Pattern</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Paper 1 Qualifying Marks (for all categories): 40 out of 100</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Paper 2, 3, and 4 Qualifying Marks (Out of 750):</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">255 (for SCs, SC(A)s, STs, MBCs/DCs, BC(OBCM)s and</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BCMs) and 340 for Others</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Mains Exam Pattern</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 2px groove rgb(248, 202, 198); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 12.7796%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Papers</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 27.6225%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Subjects</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 32.6191%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Marks</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 26.9523%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Duration</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 12.7796%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">I</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 27.6225%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tamil Eligibility Test (SSLC Standard)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 32.6191%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">100</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 26.9523%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">03 Hours</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 12.7796%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">II</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 27.6225%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General Studies &ndash; 1 (Degree Level)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 32.6191%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">250</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 26.9523%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">03 Hours</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 12.7796%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">III</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 27.6225%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General Studies &ndash; 2 (Degree Level)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 32.6191%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">250</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 26.9523%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">03 Hours</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 12.7796%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">IV</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 27.6225%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General Studies &ndash; 3 (Degree Level)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 32.6191%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">250</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 26.9523%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">03 Hours</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 40.402%; border-width: 2px;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 32.6191%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>850</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 26.9523%; border-width: 2px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 40.402%; border-width: 2px;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Personal Interview</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 32.6191%; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>100</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198); width: 26.9523%; border-width: 2px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Procedure_to_Apply_Online_for_TNPSC_Group_I_Notification_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Procedure to Apply Online for TNPSC Group I Notification 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Individuals who are going to apply for the Tamil Naidu PSC Group I Services can follow these basic steps &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The first step is to go to the official website of&nbsp;<strong>Tamil Naidu PSC</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Now on the homepage, in the &ldquo;Candidate Corner,&rdquo; you have to click on the &ldquo;One Time Registration New User&rdquo; tab</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">First, register yourself by entering the details and your login ID as well as password will be generated</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Then come back to the homepage, you have to click on the &ldquo;Apply Online&rdquo; tab</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You will be directed to the next web page</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">On this web page, you have to click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; tab</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Look for &ldquo;Combined Civil Services Examination-I (Group I Services)&rdquo; and click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; link</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Enter your previously generated login ID and password</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Now start filling out the application form, upload the asked documents, and pay the application fees</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Finally, submit the TSPSC Group I Application Form and also keep a copy of it with yourself for the further recruitment process.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; text-decoration: underline;\">Important Links</strong></span></span></em></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 51.9653%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Apply Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.0614%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://apply.tnpscexams.in/apply-now?app_id=UElZMDAwMDAwMQ==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Apply Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 51.9653%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>TNPSC Group I Notification PDF</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.0614%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.tnpsc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 51.9653%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.0614%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.tnpsc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711696198-TNPSC Group I Notification 2024.webp', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-29 00:00:00', '2024-03-29 07:11:06', NULL, NULL),
(229, 'SSB Odisha PGT Online Form 2024', 'State Selection Board (SSB), Odisha PGT Online Form 2024', '<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SSB_Odisha_PGT_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong>SSB Odisha PGT Eligibility Criteria 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Application_Fee_For_SSB_Odisha_PGT_Online_Form_2024\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(36, 12, 255);\"><strong>Application Fee For SSB Odisha PGT Online Form 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Exam info\" href=\"H\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(36, 12, 255);\">WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</span></a></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Organization:&nbsp;</strong>State Selection Board (SSB), Odisha</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Posts:&nbsp;</strong>Post Graduate Teachers (PGT)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Vacancies:&nbsp;</strong>1061</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Mode:&nbsp;</strong>Online</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Dates:&nbsp;</strong>March 18, 2024, to April 18, 2024 (till 11:45 pm)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Selection Process:</strong>&nbsp;Written Test &amp; Career Assessment</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Job Location:&nbsp;</strong>Odisha</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"SSB_Odisha_PGT_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(22, 145, 121); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SSB Odisha PGT Eligibility Criteria 2024 :</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">To be eligible to apply for the recruitment of Post Graduate Teachers (PGTs), candidates must meet specific criteria regarding their educational background and age limit:</span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Educational_Qualification\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 226); text-decoration: underline;\">Educational Qualification:</span></span></em></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates should hold a Master&rsquo;s Degree in the subject they intend to teach from a recognized university, with a minimum of 50% marks.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Alternatively, they should have completed a six-year integrated Master&rsquo;s course from a Regional College of Education recognized by NCERT.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Additionally, candidates must possess a B.Ed. degree recognized by NCTE. However, for certain subjects like Commerce, Education, Geology, etc., a B.Ed. degree is not mandatory.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\">Age Limit:</span></span></em></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Applicants need to be 21 years old or older but no more than 38 years old by January 1, 2024. There are some special rules:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Some groups like SC, ST, SEBC, women, or ex-servicemen can be up to 5 years older.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If someone has a 40% or more disability, they can be up to 10 years older.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">People with disabilities from SC/ST/SEBC groups can be up to 15 years older.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Application_Fee_For_SSB_Odisha_PGT_Online_Form_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(36, 12, 255); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee For SSB Odisha PGT Online Form 2024 :</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Unreserved Categories/SEBC &ndash;&nbsp;</strong>₹500/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Scheduled Caste (SC)/Scheduled Tribe (ST)/Persons with Disabilities (PwD) &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;₹200/-</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Application_Process_Of_SSB_Odisha_PGT_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 226); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Process Of SSB Odisha PGT Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">To apply for the PGT Recruitment 2024 on the official website of SSB Odisha at ssbodisha.ac.in, follow these steps:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Visit the official website of SSB Odisha at ssbodisha.ac.in.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Look for the &ldquo;Apply Online&rdquo; link on the homepage and click on it.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Once in the application section, locate the link for PGT Recruitment 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Complete the registration process by providing all the necessary details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fill in the application form accurately with the required information.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Upload the necessary documents such as educational certificates, photo, and signature as per the specified guidelines.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Submit the application fee online according to your category.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Review all the details provided in the application form before final submission.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">After verifying the information, submit the application.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Save the confirmation page or receipt generated after submission for future reference.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates :</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Mark_your_calendar_with_these_crucial_dates\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mark your calendar with these crucial dates:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Notification Release Date:&nbsp;</strong>March 7, 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Registration Start Date:&nbsp;</strong>March 18, 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Registration End Date:&nbsp;</strong>April 18, 2024 (11:45 pm)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSB Odisha PGT Exam Date:&nbsp;</strong>To be notified</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"SSB_Odisha_PGT_Selection_Process_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(186, 55, 42); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SSB Odisha PGT Selection Process 2024 :</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Candidates_for_the_Post_Graduate_Teacher_PGT_positions_will_undergo_a_two-stage_selection_process\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates for the Post Graduate Teacher (PGT) positions will undergo a two-stage selection process:</span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Written Test:&nbsp;</strong>This examination, worth 150 marks, assesses candidates&rsquo; subject knowledge and teaching aptitude.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Career Assessment:&nbsp;</strong>This stage, worth 50 marks, evaluates candidates&rsquo; academic and professional accomplishments.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-bd25d3e9296ffd80f94e961a6ef4e5c8\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"To_Apply_Visit_HereOfficial_Notification_Check_HereOfficial_Website_ssbodishaacin\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>To Apply:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://apps.ssbodisha.ac.in/pgt52024/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Visit Here</a><br>Official Notification:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ssbodisha.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Advt.-No.05-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Check Here</a><br>Official Website:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ssbodisha.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">ssbodisha.ac.in/</a></strong></span></h4>', '1711695128-ssb.webp', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-29 00:00:00', '2024-03-29 06:52:08', NULL, NULL);
