(230, 'BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024', 'Banaras Hindu University (BHU), Varanasi has released online admit card for recruitment to the post of Nursing Officer for 221 vacancies under group B.', '<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226);\">BHU Nursing officer Admit card 2024 City Information</span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a title=\"Exam Info\" href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</a></span></strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.7206%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 195.567px; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 66.7667px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 66.7667px; width: 99.9733%;\" colspan=\"2\">\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Banaras Hindu University / BHU</strong></span></h5>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; width: 20.7693%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Name<br></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; width: 79.204%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; width: 20.7693%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Type of Article</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; width: 79.204%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Admit Card</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 36.8px; width: 20.7693%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Live Status of BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 36.8px; width: 79.204%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Not Released Yet&hellip;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 36.8px; width: 20.7693%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Detailed Information of BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 36.8px; width: 79.204%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Please Read the Article Completely.</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; width: 20.7693%; padding-left: 40px;\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 18.4px; width: 79.204%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>www.bhu.ac.in</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%AD%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%AF_%E0%A4%96%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AE_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%97%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%AC%E0%A5%80%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%8F%E0%A4%9A%E0%A4%AF%E0%A5%82_%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%97_%E0%A4%91%E0%A4%AB%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%8F%E0%A4%A1%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%9F_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A1_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%87%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%96%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AE_%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%88_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9F_%E2%80%93_BHU_Nursing_Officer_Admit_Card_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>किसी भी समय खत्म होगा बीेएचयू नर्सिंग ऑफिसर के एडमिट कार्ड का इंतजार खत्म, जाने क्या है पूरी रिपोर्ट &ndash; BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024?</strong></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इस आर्टिकल मे हम, आप सभी परीक्षार्थियो का&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;हार्दिक स्वागत&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना चाहते है&nbsp; और आपको बताना चाहते है कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;बनारस हिंदू विश्वविद्यालय</strong>&nbsp;द्धारा&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नर्सिंग ऑफिसर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के पद पर होने वाली&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे हिस्सा लेने वाले है और&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के जारी होने का&nbsp;<strong>इंतजार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर रहे है उन्हें हम, इस आर्टिकल की मदद से हम, विस्तार स&nbsp;<strong>BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; को लेकर&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिपोर्ट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बतायेगे जिसकी पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त करने हेतु हमारे साथ बने रहना होगा।</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">दूसरी तरफ हम, आपको बताना चाहते है कि,&nbsp;<strong>BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024</strong>&nbsp;को चेक व डाउनलोड करने हेतु आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;ऑनलाइन प्रोसेस&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को फॉलो करना होगा जिसमे आपको कोई समस्या ना हो इसके लिए हम, आपको&nbsp; पूरी &ndash; पूरी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बतायेगे जिसकी पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त करने हेतु साथ बने रहना होगा ताकि आप बिना किसी समस्या के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक व डाउनलोड कर सकें तथा</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आर्टिकल के अन्तिम चरण मे हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स</strong>&nbsp;प्रदान करेगें ताकि आप इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://biharhelp.in/nios-10th-12th-admit-card-2024/\">NIOS 10th 12th Admit Card 2024 Download Link (Out) : NIOS ने 10वीं व 12वीं कक्षा की वार्षिक परीक्षा का एडमिट किया जारी</a></strong></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BHU_Nursing_Officer_Admit_Card_2024_%E2%80%93_%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A3_%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%82\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226);\"><strong>BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024 &ndash; महत्वपूर्ण तिथियां?</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"height: 193.4px; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(45, 29, 255);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 53.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.6475%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); padding-left: 40px; height: 53.6px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>कार्यक्रम</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.3924%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); padding-left: 40px; height: 53.6px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>तिथियां</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 53.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.6475%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); padding-left: 40px; height: 53.6px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>सिटी इन्टीमेशन स्लीप को जारी किया गया</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.3924%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); padding-left: 40px; height: 53.6px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>28 मार्च, 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 53.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.6475%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); padding-left: 40px; height: 53.6px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024 को जारी किया जायेगा</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.3924%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); padding-left: 40px; height: 53.6px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>जल्द ही सूचित किया जायेगा</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 32.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.6475%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); padding-left: 40px; height: 32.6px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>एग्जाम डेट</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.3924%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(45, 29, 255); padding-left: 40px; height: 32.6px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>09 to 15 April 2024&nbsp;(Any Date)</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Check_Download_BHU_Nursing_Officer_Admit_Card_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Check &amp; Download BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024?</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 226);\">हमारे सभी स्टूडेंट्स जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;बीएचयू&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नर्सिंग ऑफिसर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के पद पर&nbsp; होने वाली&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे बैठने&nbsp; वाले वे कुछ&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;स्टेप्स&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;फॉलो&nbsp;</strong>करके&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक व डाउनलोड कर सकते है जो कि, इस प्रकार से हैं &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BHU Nursing&nbsp;<a href=\"https://biharhelp.in/pm-vishwakarma-silai-machine-yojana-online-apply-2024/\">Officer Admit</a>&nbsp;Card 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक व डाउनलोड करने हेतु सबसे पहले आपको इसके&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.bhu.ac.in/Site/Home/1_2_16_Main-Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Official Website</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के होम &ndash; पेज पर आना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">होम &ndash; पेज पर आने के बाद आपको&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Menu&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का विकल्प मिलेगा जिस पर आपको क्लिक करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">क्लिक करने के बाद आपके सामने&nbsp;<strong>BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024 ( लिंक जल्द ही सक्रिय किया जायेगा )&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का विकल्प मिलेगा जिस पर आपको&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>क्लिक&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">क्लिक करने के बाद आपके सामने इसका&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;डाउनलोेड पेज&nbsp;</strong>खुल जायेगा जहां पर आपको मांगे जाने वाली सभी जानकारीयों को&nbsp; दर्ज करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद आपको&nbsp;<strong>सबमिट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>ऑप्शन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;पर क्लिक करना होगा जिसके बाद आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मिल जायेगा जिसे आपको&nbsp;<strong>प्रिंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर लेना होगा आदि।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">उपरोक्त सभी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;स्टेप्स&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;फॉलो&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करके आप बिना किसी समस्या के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक व डाउनलोड कर सकते है और<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे हिस्सा ले सकते है।</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%B6\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>सारांश</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इस आर्टिकल मे हमने आपको विस्तार से ना केवल&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://biharhelp.in/pm-vishwakarma-yojana-online-apply-2024/\">BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;&nbsp;बारे मे बताया बल्कि हमने आपकोे विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक व डाउनलोड करने की पूरी &ndash;&nbsp; पूरी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बताया ताकि आप सभी अभ्यर्थी बिना किसी समस्या के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एडमिट कार्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक व डाउनलोड कर सके और&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे हिस्सा ले&nbsp; सकें तथा</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आर्टिकल के अन्तिम चरण मे हम, आपसे उम्मीद करते है कि, आपको हमारा यह आर्टिकल बेहद पसंद आया होगा जिसके लिए आप हमारे इस आर्टिकल को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;लाईक, शेयर व कमेंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करेगें।</span></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam City Intimation Slip</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"http://bhu.ntaonline.in/downloadCity/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><a href=\"../../\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Click Here ( Link Will Active Soon )</strong></span></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.bhu.ac.in/Site/Home/1_2_16_Main-Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711730934-BHU Nursing Officer Admit Card 2024.webp', '14', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-29 00:00:00', '2024-03-29 04:48:54', NULL, NULL),
(231, 'Bihar Niyojit Shikshak Sakshamta Pariksha Result 2024', 'Niyojit Shikshak can download result online at BSEB Sakshamta official website from 29th March 2024 onwards for Bihar Shikshak Result 2024', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" width=\"698\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 122.768%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"698\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\"><strong>Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB)</strong><strong> </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Bihar&nbsp;Sakshamta Pariksha Examination 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Bihar Sakshamta Pariksha PR No 42/2024 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 70.0683%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>01/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>19/02/2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date: <strong>19/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>February Last Week </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>Before Exam &nbsp; </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Available : <strong>15/03/2024&nbsp; </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Available : <strong>30/03/2024&nbsp; </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.6998%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"332\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">General / BC / EWS : <strong>1100/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH <strong>: 1100/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Online Mode Only : Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 122.768%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"698\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Bihar&nbsp;Sakshamta Pariksha Notification 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Age Limit as on 01/08/2024</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>NA</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>NA</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Bihar Board BSEB Sakshamta Pariksha&nbsp; Local Body Teachers Competency Test - 2024 Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 122.768%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"698\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Bihar Sakshamta Pariksha Exam 2024 : <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\">Eligibility Details</span></span> </strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 11.4606%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"210\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 111.308%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"488\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar BSEB Sakshamta Pariksha Eligibility 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 11.4606%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"210\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Sakshamta Pariksha 2024 / Local Body Teachers Competency Test - 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 111.308%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"488\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Teachers appointed and working in Primary / Middle / Secondary / Higher Secondary schools of the state by Bihar.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 122.768%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"698\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BSEB Sakshamta Examination Online Form 2024 : <span style=\"color: red; text-decoration: underline;\">Document Required</span></strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Passport Size Photo with White or Light Background</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Signature Scan Copy</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Scan Copy Required : </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Class 10th Matric Exam Marksheet &amp; Certificate for DOB</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'courier new\', courier, monospace; font-size: 12pt;\">Intermediate Class 12th Certificate and Marksheet</span></li>\r\n<li>