sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Motivation, Communication, and Leadership</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; height: 73.6px; border: 2px groove rgb(191, 237, 210); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.6889%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); height: 18.4px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">CMAT Apply Online Link</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 27.893%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); height: 18.4px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://cmat.ntaonline.in/frontend/web/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.6889%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); height: 18.4px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">CMAT Notice</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 27.893%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); height: 18.4px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/CMAT/images/Public-Notice-for-CMAT-2024-Registration.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</t