, 17); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>IBPS Professor / Assistant General Manager (Information Technology) / Research Associate / Hindi Officer / Deputy Manager (Accounts) Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px outset rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 46px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Recruitment Organization</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Institute of Banking Personnel (IBPS)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 46px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of the Post</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Professor / Assistant General Manager &amp; Other Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancy</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Various Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 46px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Apply Start Date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>27 March 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 46px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration Last Date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>12 April 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 46px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Selection Process</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Interview</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 46px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 46px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>ibps.in</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"IBPS_Recruitment_2024_Online_Form1\" style=\"color: rgb(132, 63, 161); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IBPS Recruitment 2024 Online Form</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Apply Online Start On <span style=\"color: #14d111;\"><strong>27 March 2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Registration Last Date<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>: 12 April 2024</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Fee Payment&nbsp; Last Date<strong>: 12 April 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Online Examination<strong>: April/ May 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Subsequent Selection process (Item Writing Exercise, Group</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Exercises, Presentation, Skill Test and Personal Interview): <strong>April/ May 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Declaration of Result: <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(20, 209, 17); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">GEN/OBC/EWS Candidates:<strong> Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">SC/ST/PWBD Candidates<strong>: Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"color: #0bb021;\"><strong>Payment Mode:</strong> </span>The payment can be made by using Debit Cards (RuPay/ Visa/ MasterCard/ Maestro), Credit Cards, Internet Banking, IMPS, Cash Cards/ Mobile Wallets by providing information as asked on the screen. Candidates should make the payment of requisite fees/ intimation charges through the ONLINE mode only.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span id=\"IBPS_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\"><strong>IBPS Recruitment 2024</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Age_Limit_as_on_01032024\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255);\"><strong>Age Limit as on 01/03/2024 </strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Minimum Age<strong>: 23, 35, 47 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Maximum Age:<strong> 30, 50, 55 Years</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">Age Relaxation:</span> As Per Rules. Read the Official Notification For More Details.</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"IBPS_2024\"><span style=\"color: rgb(11, 176, 33); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>IBPS 2024</strong></span></span></span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Educational_Qualification\" style=\"background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></span></span></h4>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px inset rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: #850d0d;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.72671%; height: 64px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Sr. No.</span></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.764%; height: 64px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Post Name</span></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.0186%; height: 64px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Minimum Qualification</span></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.4907%; height: 64px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rg