eorgia, palatino, serif;\">should be at the level</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">of Associate Professor (or</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">equivalent)</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">at an institution of</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">repute or equivalent</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Industry/professional</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Experience. </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 363px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.72671%; height: 363px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">2.</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.764%; height: 363px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Assistant</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">General</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Manager</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">(Information</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Technology) </span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.0186%; height: 363px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Bachelor/ Master&rsquo;s Degree in Electronics/</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Electronics &amp; Telecommunication&nbsp;/ Electronics &amp; Communication/ Electronics &amp; Instrumentation/ Computer Science/ Information Technology /Computer Applications and/ or equivalent. Read the full notification. </span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.4907%; height: 363px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">At least 10 years of postqualification hands-on experience in Information</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">The technological function, of which at least 3 years should be as Head/Next to Head of IT function in a mid-size corporation. </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 329px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.72671%; height: 329px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">3.</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.764%; height: 329px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Research Associate </span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.0186%; height: 329px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Post-graduation in Psychology / Education/ Psychological Measurement / Psychometrics / Statistics/ Management (Specialization in HR) with a minimum 55% marks from recognized universities / Institutes. </span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.4907%; height: 329px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Preferably One year of experience in the Academic Research /Test</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Development.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Competency in operating</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">The computer is a must. </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 329px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.72671%; height: 329px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">4.</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.764%; height: 329px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Hindi Officer </span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.0186%; height: 329px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Master&rsquo;s degree from a recognized university in Hindi with English as a major or elective subject at Graduation. </span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.4907%; height: 329px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">One year experience</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">in Hindi translation of various reports/ Documents/ Letters</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">in a bank/financial institution is Desirable.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Competency in operating</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">computers is a must.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 259px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.72671%; height: 259px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">5.</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.764%; height: 259px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Deputy Manager</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">(Accounts) (Chartered</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Accountant)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.0186%; height: 259px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Candidate should be a Chartered Accountant</span>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Read the full notification.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.4907%; height: 259px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Preferably 1 years experience in handling</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Finance, Accounts, Taxation, Investment &amp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Expertise in management of funds etc. </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 190px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.72671%; height: 190px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">6.</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.764%; height: 190px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Analyst Programmer</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">&ndash;ASP.NET</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.0186%; height: 190px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Full-Time B. Tech/ B.E. (Computer Science /Comp. Engineering) / MCA /M.Sc. (IT) /M.Sc. (Comp. Science) from a recognized University/ Institute.</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.4907%; height: 190px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Minimum 3 years post-qualification&nbsp;work experience. Read the full notification.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 190px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.72671%; height: 190px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">7.</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.764%; height: 190px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Analyst Programmer &ndash;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Python</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.0186%; height: 190px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Full-Time B. Tech/ B.E. (Computer Science / Comp. Engineering)/ MCA /M.Sc. (IT)/M.Sc. (Comp. Science) from a recognised University /Institute.</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.4907%; height: 190px; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Minimum 3 years post-qualification&nbsp;work</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">experience. Read the full notification.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"IBPS_Professor_2024\"><span style=\"color: rgb(11, 176, 33); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>IBPS Professor 2024 </strong></span></span></span></h5>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span id=\"Nationality_Citizenship\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>Nationality / Citizenship</strong></span></em></span></h5>\r\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">A candidate must be either &ndash;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">(i) a Citizen of India or</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">(ii) a subject of Nepal or</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">(iii) a subject of Bhutan or</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">(iv) a person of Indian origin who has migrated from Pakistan, Burma, Sri Lanka, East African countries of Kenya, Uganda, the United Republic of Tanzania (formerly Tanganyika and Zanzibar), Zambia, Malawi, Zaire, Ethiopia and Vietnam to permanently settle in India,</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">provided that a candidate belonging to categories (ii), (iii), (iv) &amp; (v) above shall be a person in whose favour the Government of India has issued a certificate of eligibility.</span></p>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Selection_Process\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Selection Process</strong></span></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">The online examination may be conducted online only at IBPS, Mumbai, or in multiple venues across many centres in India depending upon the response to an advertisement. If the online examination is conducted only at IBPS, efforts will be made to complete the entire selection process on the same day. However, it may continue until the end of the day or may get extended to the next day depending on the response received. The schedule of the process for each post will be communicated accordingly. </span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>The candidates will be required to go through the mentioned stages to get selected i.e. :</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Online Examination</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Interview</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"How_To_Apply_for_IBPS_Recruitment_2024_Online_Form\"><strong>How To Apply for IBPS Recruitment 2024 Online Form</strong></span></span></em></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">First of all, visit the IBPS website i.e. ibps.in</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Now, click on &lsquo;Click here to apply Online for Common Recruitment Process for IBPS/2024-25/01</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Then, click &ldquo;CLICK HERE FOR NEW REGISTRATION&rdquo; to register the application by entering their basic information in the online application form. After that, a provisional registration number and password will be generated by the system and displayed on the screen.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Upload a Photograph, Signature, Left thumb impression and a handwritten declaration</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Pay Fee. The payment can be made using Debit Cards (RuPay/Visa/MasterCard/Maestro), Credit Cards, Internet Banking, IMPS, Cash Cards/ Mobile Wallets by providing information as requested on the screen.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Take a printout of the e-receipt and online application form containing fee payment details. Please note that if the same cannot be generated then the online transactions may not have been successful.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h6>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px ridge rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/ibpsvpmarc24/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.ibps.in/wp-content/uploads/Advertisement-Various-posts-for-27.03.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://www.ibps.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1711810385-ibps.webp', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-30 00:00:00', '2024-03-30 02:53:05', NULL, NULL),
(239, 'Jr Assistant Recruitment 2024', 'Jr. Assistant Recruitment 2024 Apply for 760 Posts', '<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Jr. Assistant Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_For_Jr_Assistant_Vacancy_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(36, 12, 255);\"><strong>Jr. Assistant Vacancy 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt;\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</strong></a></span></h3>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-eligibility-criteria\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span id=\"Eligibility_Criteria\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria:</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span id=\"Education_Qualification_for_Delhi_Jal_Board_Jr_Assistant_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Education Qualification for Delhi Jal Board Jr. Assistant Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates should have completed their&nbsp;<strong>12th class</strong>&nbsp;or hold an equivalent qualification from a recognized board.</span></p>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit</strong>:</span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must be between&nbsp;<strong>18 to 25 years</strong>&nbsp;of age. Aspirants will get the age relaxation as per the state government norms.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-how-to-apply-for-jr-assistant-vacancy-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_For_Jr_Assistant_Vacancy_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(14, 244, 231); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Apply For Jr. Assistant Vacancy 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The application process is&nbsp;<strong>offline</strong>. Interested candidates can submit their applications in the prescribed format.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Address for submission:&nbsp;<strong>Assistant Programmer, Urban Development Department, Govt. of NCT of Delhi, 9th Level, &ldquo;C&rdquo; Wing, Delhi Secretariat, I.P. Estate, New Delhi-110002</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The last date to submit your application is&nbsp;<strong>10th April 2024</strong>.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-salary-for-udd-jr-assistant\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span id=\"Salary_For_UDD_Jr_Assistant\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Salary For UDD Jr. Assistant</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Successful candidates will get a monthly salary ranging from&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 19,900 to Rs. 63,200</strong>. Plus, you&rsquo;ll be part of a dynamic team working towards shaping the future of our capital city.</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span id=\"Selection_Process\" style=\"color: rgb(36, 12, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Selection Process:</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Written Test</strong>: Your knowledge will be put to the test. Brush up on your skills!</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong>: Make sure your paperwork is in order.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong>: A clean bill of health is essential.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span id=\"Syllabus_For_UDD_Jr_Assistant_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Syllabus For&nbsp;UDD Jr. Assistant</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Recruitment 2024:</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>General Hindi</strong>: Master the language.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Arithmetic</strong>: Crunch those numbers.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Everyday Science</strong>: Understand the world around you.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.9867%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 49.9933%;\"><col style=\"width: 49.9933%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">\r\n<h6><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>IMPORTENT LINKS</strong></span></h6>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Apply Now</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><a title=\"Jr Assistant Apply Online \" href=\"https://udd.delhi.gov.in/\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Download Notification<br></strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><strong><a title=\"Jr Assistant Apply Online Notification\" href=\"https://udd.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/UD/circulars-orders/new_document_150.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a><br></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Official Website&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><a title=\"UDD Official Website Link\" href=\"https://udd.delhi.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">', '1711862830-Jr. Assistant Recruitment 2024.jpg', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-31 00:00:00', '2024-03-31 06:04:21', NULL, NULL);
