(240, 'Navodaya 6th Class Result 2024', 'Navodaya 6th Class Result 2024 Download Link (Out) – Cut Off Marks, JNV Result 2024 Class 6', '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 226); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Navodaya 6th Class Result 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 12, 255); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>JNV Result 2024 Class 6</strong></span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</strong></a></span></h3>\r\n<hr>\r\n<table style=\"height: 165.6px; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.3196%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Examination Name</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.6538%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya Selection Test (JNVST) 2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.3196%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Examination Type</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.6538%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Entrance Exam</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.3196%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.6538%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">6th</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.3196%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Year</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.6538%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.3196%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Article Name</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.6538%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Navodaya 6th Class Result 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.3196%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Article Category</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.6538%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Result</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.3196%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Navodaya 6th Class Result Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.6538%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>31 March, 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.3196%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Result Download Mode</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.6538%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.3196%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Official Website</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.6538%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 18.4px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>navodaya.gov.in</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"JNV_Result_2024_Class_6\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>JNV Result 2024 Class 6</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आज के इस आर्टिकल में हम आप सभी जो <strong>JNV Result 2024 Class 6</strong> का इंतजार कर रहे है उन सभी को इस आर्टिकल में बहुत- बहुत हार्दिक स्वागत करते है आज हम आप सभी को इस लेख के जरिए <strong>JNV Result 2024 Class 6</strong> के बरे में बताएंगे। आप सभी को बता दे की आप रिजल्ट को ऑनलाइन के माध्यम से <strong>जवाहर नवोदय विधालय</strong> के <strong>ऑफिसियल वेबसाईट</strong> पर जाकर आसानी से डाउनलोड कर सकते है।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">यदि आप भी <strong>JNV Result 2024</strong> के लिए इंतजार कर रहे है तो आप इस आर्टिकल को अंत तक और ध्यान पूर्वक पढ़ें क्योंकि इस लेख में <strong>जवाहर नवोदय विधालय कक्षा 6 रिजल्ट</strong> के बारे&nbsp; में सभी जानकारी को सही सही और विस्तार से बताया गया है। इसलिए आप इसे अंत तक पढ़ें।</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates_of_Navodaya_6th_Class_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 12, 255);\"><strong>Important Dates of Navodaya 6th Class 2024</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 54.3842%; padding-left: 40px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Activity</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 45.6557%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Dates</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 54.3842%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 45.6557%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">19 June, 2023</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 54.3842%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Last Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 45.6557%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">31 August, 2023</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 54.3842%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Phase 1 Exam Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 45.6557%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04 November, 2023</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 54.3842%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Phase 2 Exam Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 45.6557%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">20 January, 2024`</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 54.3842%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Navodaya 6th Class Result 2024 Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 45.6557%; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">31 March, 2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Navodaya_6th_Class_Result_Date_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 226);\"><strong>Navodaya 6th Class Result Date 2024</strong></span></span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">जो भी अभ्यार्थी इस परीक्षा में शामिल हुए थे उन सभी का एक ही सवाल है की <strong>Navodaya 6th Class Result 2024</strong> कब जारी किया जाएगा। ऐसे में हम आप सभी को बता दे की<strong> रिजल्ट को 31 मार्च जारी किया है।</strong> रिजल्ट जारी होने के बाद आप सभी परीक्षार्थी इसके<strong> ऑफिसियल वेबसाईट</strong> पर जाकर अपना <strong>Roll Number</strong> के जरिए चेक कर सकते है। जिसका पूरा प्रक्रिया को नीचे बताया गया है।</span></p>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"JNV_Class_6_Cut_Off_Marks_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 12, 255);\"><strong>JNV Class 6 Cut Off Marks 2024</strong></span></span></h5>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आप सभी को बता दे की Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti Result के साथ में Cut-Off भी जारी करता है। इस साल का अनुमानित Cut marks निम्न&nbsp; है-</span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 90px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Class 6 Cut Off Marks 2024 (Expected)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Un Reserved (UR)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">75 &ndash; 80</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Other Backward Classes (OBC)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">65 &ndash; 70</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Scheduled Caste (SC)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">55 &ndash; 60</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 16.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 16.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Scheduled Tribe (ST)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px; height: 16.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">50 &ndash; 55</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span id=\"How_to_Check_Download_Navodaya_6th_Class_Result_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></span></span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आज के इस आर्टिकल में हम आप सभी को<strong> Navodaya 6th Class Result 2024</strong> के बारे में सभी जानकारी को सही सही और विस्तार से साझा किए है। रिजल्ट जारी होने के बाद सभी अभ्यार्थी ऊपर बताए गए प्रोसेस को फॉलो करके इसके ऑफिसियल वेबसाईट से<strong> Result Download</strong> कर सकते है। इस परीक्षा में सफल होने वाले सभी <strong>अभ्यार्थी को शुभकामनाएं!</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">यदि आपको आज के यह लेख <strong>पसंद</strong> आया हो तो आप इसे अपने <strong>दोस्तों के साथ में साझा करें</strong> ताकि वह भी अपना <strong>Result Download</strong> कर सके। इस लेख से संबधित कोई भी प्रश्न हो तो आप हमें नीचे के कॉमेंट सेक्शन में अपना कॉमेंट करके पूछ सकते है।</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Link\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Link</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 59.3052%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Direct Link of 6th Result Download</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 40.6682%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://cbseit.in/cbse/2024/NVS_RST/Result.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a>&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 59.3052%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Direct Link of 9th Result Download</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 40.6682%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://cbseit.in/cbse/2024/NVS_RST/ResClsIX.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 59.3052%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 40.6682%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://navodaya.gov.in/nvs/en/Home1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711863496-Navodaya 6th Class Result 2024.jpg', '13', 12, 'Y', '2024-03-31 00:00:00', '2024-04-01 07:19:26', NULL, NULL),
(241, 'KVS Class 1 Admission Test Apply Online Form', 'Kendriya Vidyalaya Sangathan KVS Class 1 Admissions 2024 is a common entrance examination conducted for admission to Class 1 in various KVS Schools of India.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px double rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Kendriya Vidyalaya Sangathan (KVS)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Kendriya Vidyalaya KVS Class 1 Admission 2024 Online Form </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>KVS Class 1st Admissions 2024 : Short Details of Notification </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin :<strong> 01/04/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Class 1 Admission Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>15/04/2024 Upto 05:00 Pm Only</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Complete Form Last Date : <strong>15/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS : <strong>0/-.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH / Female : <strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">No Application Fee For the All Category Candidates in KVS Nursery Admission 2024 Eligible Candidates Can Only Filled the Online Application Form and Submit for the Registered School.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">KVS Class I Admission 2024 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Eligibility</span> </span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For KVS Class I Admission 2024 Age Limit <strong>6-8 Years</strong> as on <strong>31/03/2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For KVS Class II to Other Classes Admission 2023: Candidates Must be Read the Notification Regarding Other Courses Admission Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note</strong> If Candidates Date of Birth is <strong>01 April</strong> KVS Also Consider the Following Candidates to Admission Process 2024-2025.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Filled Kendriya Vidyalaya KVS Class 1 Online Form 2024 </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">UIDAI Aadhar Card is Compulsory in KVS Nursery Admission 2024-2025</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Step 1 :</strong> Candidates Must be Read the Detailed Notification Before Apply Online Form in Any Class</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Step 2 :</strong> Click on the Apply Online Link and Choose Your Apply School,Enter Your All Required Details</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Step 3 :</strong> Uploaded the All Required Documents and Photo of Candidates and Parents</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Step 4 :</strong> Review Your All Details Before Submit the Online Application Form</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Step 5 :</strong> Take a Print out of Online Application Form and Wait for the Announced Merit List</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Required for Upload : Birth Certificate and Candidate Photo Only.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"KVS Class 1 Admission Registration\" href=\"https://kvsonlineadmission.kvs.gov.in/instruction.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Registration</a> | <a title=\"KVS Class 1 Login 2024\" href=\"https://kvsonlineadmission.kvs.gov.in/login.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Login</a> </strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"KVS Admission Class 1 Notification\" href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s32d2ca7eedf739ef4c3800713ec482e1a/uploads/2024/03/2024032843.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Official Website</span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"KVS Admission Official Website 2024\" href=\"https://kvsonlineadmission.kvs.gov.in/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>KVS Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1711952151-kvs.webp', '15', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-01 00:00:00', '2024-04-01 06:16:24', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(242, 'IBPS SO 13th Recruitment 2023 Final Result', 'Institute of Banking Personal Selection (IBPS) has released the Recruitment of Common Recruitment Specialist Officer SO.', '<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px groove rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.9095%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"710\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Institute of Banking Personal Selection (IBPS)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>IBPS CRP SPL XII Specialist Officer SO Recruitment 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>IBPS SO SPL 13 Exam 2023 : Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.2005%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"374\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin :<strong>01/08/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> <strong>21/08/2023</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Fee Payment :&nbsp;<strong> 21/08/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Prelim Exam Date : <strong>30-31</strong> <strong>December 2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>21/12/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Prelim Exam Result : <strong>30-31</strong> <strong>16/01/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam Date <strong>: 28/01/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>18/01/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam Result : <strong> <strong>13/02/2024 </strong></strong><strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Score Card Available : <strong>17/03/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Final Exam Result : <strong> <strong>01/04/2024 </strong></strong><strong> </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.709%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC : <strong>850/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>175/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or E Challan Fee Mode Only</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.9095%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"710\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IBPS Specialist Officer SO XIII : <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255);\">Age Limit as on</span> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 255);\"><strong>01/08/2023</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age <strong>: 20 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age <strong>: 30 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per IBPS SO XIII Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.9095%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"710\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>IBPS SO&nbsp;<strong>XIII </strong> Recruitment 2023 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details </span></strong></span><strong>Total : 1402 Post </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.9861%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"192\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.2144%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"182\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.709%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IBPS SO Eligibility 2023 </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.9861%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"192\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">IT Officer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.2144%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"182\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">120</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.709%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"336\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree with B Level Certificate <strong>OR</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Engineering Degree Computer&nbsp; Science/&nbsp; Computer Applications/&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Information Technology /&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Electronics / Electronics &amp; Telecommunications/Electronics&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &amp; Communication/ Electronics &amp; Instrumentation. <strong>OR</strong> Master Degree.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.9861%; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"192\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Agriculture Field Officer (AFO)</span></p>\r\n