ore Assistant Clerk 2024</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 60.95px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><span id=\"Apply_Online_Click_HereTechnician_Notification_2024_Download_HereJr_Account_Clerk_Notification_2024_Download_HereStore_Assistant_Clerk_2024_Download_HereJEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereAEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.bsphcl.co.in/Docs/Recruitment/RN-03-06-03-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Download Here</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 60.95px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 60.95px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><span id=\"Apply_Online_Click_HereTechnician_Notification_2024_Download_HereJr_Account_Clerk_Notification_2024_Download_HereStore_Assistant_Clerk_2024_Download_HereJEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereAEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>JEE GTO Notification 2024</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 60.95px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><span id=\"Apply_Online_Click_HereTechnician_Notification_2024_Download_HereJr_Account_Clerk_Notification_2024_Download_HereStore_Assistant_Clerk_2024_Download_HereJEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereAEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.bsphcl.co.in/Docs/Recruitment/RN-02-06-03-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Download Here</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 60.95px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 60.95px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><span id=\"Apply_Online_Click_HereTechnician_Notification_2024_Download_HereJr_Account_Clerk_Notification_2024_Download_HereStore_Assistant_Clerk_2024_Download_HereJEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereAEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 60.95px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><span id=\"Apply_Online_Click_HereTechnician_Notification_2024_Download_HereJr_Account_Clerk_Notification_2024_Download_HereStore_Assistant_Clerk_2024_Download_HereJEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereAEE_GTO_Notification_2024_Download_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.bsphcl.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1712034232-bphcl.webp', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-04-01 00:00:00', '2024-04-02 05:03:52', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(247, 'IPPB Executive Vacancy 2024', 'IPPB Executive Vacancy 2024, Apply', '<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>IPPB Executive Vacancy 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"../../\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>WWW.EXAMINFO.BLOG</strong></a></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Organization :&nbsp;</strong>India Post Payment Bank (IPPB)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Recruitment Type :</strong> Contract Basis</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Position : </strong>Circle Based Executive</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Department : </strong>Sales &amp; Operations</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancies : </strong>47</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Date : </strong>March 15, 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date to Apply : </strong>5th April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website : </strong>ippbonline.com<span id=\"More_Vacancies\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"IPPB_Executive_Selection_Process_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>IPPB Executive Selection Process 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Candidates_will_be_selected_based_on_their_marks_obtained_in_followings\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\">Candidates will be selected based on their marks obtained in followings:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Preliminary screening based on marks obtained in MBA/Graduation</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assessment/Online Test</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Group Discussion</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Interview</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates_For_IPPB_Executive_Vacancy_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates For IPPB Executive Vacancy 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Date : </strong>March 15, 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date to Apply: </strong>5th April 2024</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"IPPB_Executive_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>IPPB Executive Eligibility Criteria 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before you proceed with the application, make sure you meet the following eligibility requirements:</span></p>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Educational_Qualification\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\">Educational Qualification :</span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">To apply, candidates need a bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any subject. It&rsquo;s better if you have an MBA in Sales or Marketing. That will give you an edge.</span></p>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\">Age Limit:</span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Applicants must be between 21 and 35 years old.</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"IPPB_Executive_Application_Fees_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>IPPB Executive Application Fees 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SC/ST/PWD candidates: </strong>Rs. 150</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>All other candidates: </strong>Rs. 750</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"IPPB_Executive_Vacancy_Details_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>IPPB Executive Vacancy Details 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bihar : </strong>5</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Delhi :</strong> 1</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Gujarat : </strong>8</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Haryana : </strong>4</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Jharkhand : </strong>1</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Karnataka : </strong>1</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Madhya Pradesh : </strong>3</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Maharashtra : </strong>2</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Odisha : </strong>1</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Punjab : </strong>4</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Rajasthan : </strong>4</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Tamil Nadu : </strong>2</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh : </strong>11</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>TOTAL : </strong>47</span><span id=\"How_to_Apply_for_IPPB_Executive_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7947d4b199cad6f59f718b25f0cbad37\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Apply_Online_Visit_HereOfficial_Notification_Check_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online : &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ippbonline.com/web/ippb/current-openings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Visit Here</a><br>Official Notification : &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ippbonline.com/web/ippb/current-openings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Check Here</a><br>Official Website : <a href=\"https://www.ippbonline.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h4>', '1712034547-ippb.webp', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-04-01 00:00:00', '2024-04-02 05:09:07', NULL, NULL),
