h=\"742\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 10, 246); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh Metro Recruitment 2024 :&nbsp; Exam District Details</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Agra, Aligarh, Bareilly, Ghaziabad, Gorakhpur, Jhansi, Kanpur, Lucknow, Mathura, Meerut, Moradabad, Muzaffarnagar, Noida, Prayagraj, Varanasi, Ayodhya, Basti and Sitapur Only.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 319.825px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.5973%; height: 319.825px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"742\"><center></center>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill UP Metro Recruitment Online Form 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>OBC certificate</strong>&nbsp;should not be more than 01 year old from the last date of application.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>EWS certificate</strong>&nbsp;should be made on or after the last date of application, 01 April 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Uttar Pradesh Metro Rail Corporation UPMRC Latest Various Post Recruitment 2024 Candidate Can Apply Between&nbsp;<strong>20/03/2024 to 19/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in UP Metro Rail Recruitment Online Form 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.025px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.5973%; height: 67.025px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"742\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.025px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.6644%; height: 67.025px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"370\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.9329%; height: 67.025px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"372\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"UP Metro Recruitment 2024 Online Registration\" href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com/per/g01/pub/1139/ASM/WebPortal/11/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.025px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.6644%; height: 67.025px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"370\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.9329%; height: 67.025px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"372\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download UP Metro Various Post Notification 2024\" href=\"https://www.sarkariresults.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/sarkariresult.com-UP-Metro-Various-Post-Notification-2024_compressed.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.025px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.6644%; height: 67.025px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"370\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.9329%; height: 67.025px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"372\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UP Metro Official Website\" href=\"https://www.lmrcl.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>UPMRC Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1712041462-sdfdagysfhk.jpg', '14', 12, 'Y', '2024-04-02 00:00:00', '2024-04-02 07:11:06', NULL, NULL);
