(254, 'BECIL Vacancy 2024 Apply Online', 'Broadcast Engineering Consultants India Limited (BECIL) Vacancy 2024 Apply Online', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">BECIL Vacancy 2024 Apply Online</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content cf\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><strong>BECIL Vacancy 2024</strong>&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">&ndash;</span> Broadcast Engineering Consultants India Limited (BECIL) &nbsp;</strong>ने<strong>&nbsp; Medical Officer, Pharmacist, Ward Attendant, Panchakarma Technician, Staff Nurse, Panchakarma Attendant,&nbsp; Lab Attendant, Public Relation Officer (PRO), OT Technician, Garden Supervisor, Museum Keeper, IT Assistant, Assistant Library Officer, Receptionist, and Help Desk Receptionist&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>के कुल मिलाकर<strong>&nbsp;54</strong>&nbsp;रिक्तियों पर भर्ती के लिए विज्ञापन की अधिसूचना&nbsp;<strong>(Vacancy Advertisement)</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;जारी की है। इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी&nbsp;<strong>26&nbsp;March, 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>से 09 April,&nbsp;</strong><strong>2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>तक</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Online</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Apply</strong> &nbsp;कर सकते हैं।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इस विज्ञापन की विस्तृत जानकारी जैसे&nbsp;<strong>Post Name, No. of Vacancies, Eligibility Criteria, Pay Scale, Application Fee, Selection Process, How to Apply Instructions, Important Dates, Useful Web Links</strong>&nbsp;इत्यादि इस प्रकार है &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BECIL_Vacancy_2024_Overview\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></s