dium/large private sector organization</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.6227%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 308px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">45 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 108.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.0964%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 108.8px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Library Officer</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.2543%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 108.8px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;M. Lib from a recognized University</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3 years&rsquo; experience in reputed Institute as Assistant Library Officer.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Familiarity and Experience in Maintenance of Information Data Base on Library Software</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Sound Knowledge of Library Operations and well Developed Computer Skilled</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.6227%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 108.8px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">30 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 71.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.0964%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 71.2px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Receptionist</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.2543%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 71.2px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">A Degree from a recognized University.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Experience</strong>: 2 Years working knowledge with reputed organization</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.6227%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 71.2px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">28 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 71.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.0964%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 71.2px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Help Desk Receptionist</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.2543%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 71.2px;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">A Degree from a recognized University.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Experience:</strong>&nbsp;2 Years working knowledge with reputed organization</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.6227%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); height: 71.2px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">28 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Note &ndash;</strong></span></span></em> Preference will be given to local candidates and who are already working in the same/similar department.</span></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Age_Relaxation_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Age Relaxation&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age relaxation in upper limit will be given to reserved category as per Government rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Location_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Job Location&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All India Institute of Ayurveda (AIIA), Goa</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Employment_type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Job Employment type&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Contractual Basis</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Who_can_apply_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Who can apply&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Indian Citizen (Male /Female)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BECIL_Vacancy_2024_Selection_Process_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>BECIL Vacancy 2024 Selection Process&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Shortlisting</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Test / Skill Test and</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Personal Interaction / Interview ,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification &amp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Form_Type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Form Type&nbsp;</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Application Form</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Apply_Mode_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Apply Mode</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Online</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Application_Fee_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category-wise registration &amp; application processing is given below:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> General- Rs.885/ &ndash; (Rs.590/- extra for every additional post applied)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> OBC- Rs.885/ &ndash; (Rs.590/- extra for every additional post applied)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> SC/ST- Rs.531/ &ndash; (Rs.354/- extra for every additional post applied)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> Ex-Serviceman &ndash; Rs.885/- (Rs.590/- extra for every additional post applied)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> Women- Rs.885/- (Rs.590/- extra for every additional post applied)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> EWS/PH- Rs.531/- (Rs.354/- extra for every additional post applied)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Note:</strong></span> Bank and payment gateway charges on the above amount will be borne by the applicant. Payment should be done through online mode.</span></p>\r\n<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-183587 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-all-india-job tag-aiims-norcet-2024-notification\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-post__text\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>BECIL Vacancy 2024&nbsp;Apply Pre Requisite -/Enclosure -/ Documents &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></div>\r\n</article>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Valid &amp; Active Email Id</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mobile No.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Educational Qualification Certificates with Marks sheet</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Experience</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Proof</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Photograph</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Signature</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Caste Certificate</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_for_BECIL_Vacancy_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply for BECIL Vacancy 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी को चाहिए कि &nbsp;वे&nbsp;<strong>Online Apply&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>करने से पहले&nbsp;<strong>BECIL Vacancy 2024&nbsp;</strong>की&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility criteria&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>Applying process</strong>&nbsp;की विस्तृत जानकारी के लिए&nbsp;<strong>Official Notification&nbsp;</strong><strong>का&nbsp;</strong><strong>full details</strong>&nbsp;जरूर पढ़ लें।&nbsp;<strong>Online Apply</strong>&nbsp; करने के लिए निम्नलिखित&nbsp;<strong>steps&nbsp;</strong><strong>को&nbsp;</strong><strong>follow</strong>&nbsp;करें &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Fill_Online_Application_Form_for_BECIL_Vacancy_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;How to Fill Online Application Form for BECIL Vacancy 2024</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BECIL Vacancy 2024&nbsp;</strong>के आवेदन के लिए आपको सबसे पहले&nbsp;<strong>Official Website</strong>&nbsp;पर&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.becil.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">www.becil.com</a>&nbsp;जाना होगा। जो कुछ इस प्रकार होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Home Page</strong>&nbsp;पर &lsquo;<strong>Career&gt;Vacancies &lsquo; menu</strong>&nbsp;पर&nbsp;<strong>Click</strong>&nbsp;कर &nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>Search</strong>&nbsp;करने के बाद आपको&nbsp;<strong>BECIL Vacancy 2024 Recruitment</strong><strong>&nbsp;Notification</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>Link</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;दिखाई देगा। उसे वहां से&nbsp;<strong>download</strong>&nbsp;करके पूरा पढ़ लें &nbsp;ताकि आपको&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>Online applying</strong>&nbsp;<strong>procedure</strong>&nbsp; की विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त हो सके।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Page (Go the Career Section and then click &ldquo;Registration Form (Online)&rdquo; )&nbsp;</strong><strong>या इस&nbsp;</strong><strong>Article&nbsp;</strong><strong>के</strong>&nbsp;इसी पेज पर नीचे उपलब्ध&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;&ldquo;Online Apply &rdquo; link</strong>&nbsp;को क्लिक करें&nbsp; अपने&nbsp;<strong>Email Id&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>mobile number</strong>&nbsp;का प्रयोग करते हुए&nbsp;<strong>Registration</strong>&nbsp;करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद&nbsp;<strong>Login</strong>&nbsp;करके&nbsp;<strong>Online Application</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>correctly &amp; Carefully fill up&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Required Documents, Photograph and Signature</strong>&nbsp; को<strong>&nbsp;scan&nbsp;</strong><strong>करके&nbsp;</strong><strong>upload</strong>&nbsp; करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Pay Application Fee through Online mode.&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Application Form&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>को&nbsp;</strong><strong>final submit&nbsp;</strong><strong>करके&nbsp;</strong><strong>Print out</strong>&nbsp; प्राप्त कर लें।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Links_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links&nbsp;</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px ridge rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BECIL Vacancy 2024</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Apply Link &ndash;</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://becilregistration.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BECIL Vacancy 2024</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Notification Pdf Link</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.becil.com/uploads/vacancy/444-AIIA-Goapdf-9c1a542c99b7f9e9183a78172849cfc6.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"http://www.becil.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1712042657-bpsc.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-02 00:00:00', '2024-04-02 09:42:59', NULL, NULL);
