dth: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">01 Post (UR)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rs.45,000/</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>6. Lower Division Clerk&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;01 Post (UR)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rs.25,000/-</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>7. Ward Boys&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;03 Posts (UR)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rs.22,000/-</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>8. Quarter Master (Regular)&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">01 Post (UR)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rs.29,200/-</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Rs. 29,200/- + DA per month</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(Level &ndash;5, Index-1 in Pay Matrix, As per 7th CPC.)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Sainik_School_Eligibility_Criteria_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Sainik School Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px inset rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1098%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 59.586%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Educational Qualification &amp; Desirable Qualification&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.2916%; text-align: center; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(As on 01/01/2024)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1098%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1. TGT- English</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 59.586%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Essential &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i) Four years Integrated Graduate course in concerned subject from Regional College of Education, NCERT, with at least 50% marks in aggregate.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>OR</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree in&nbsp; concerned subject in all the three years with at least 50% Marks in aggregate from a recognized University.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">and</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">B. Ed. or equivalent degree from a recognized University/ Institute.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii)&nbsp; CTET/TET qualified (conducted by Central/State Govt).</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i)&nbsp; Higher qualification in respective subject.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii) Teaching experience at Higher/ Secondary level in CBSE affiliated English Medium Residential School.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iii)Proficiency/ achievement in Games / Sports and other extra co-curricular activities/ hobbies.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iv) Proficiency in Computer Application.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(v) Aptitude for Residential School life.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.2916%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">21 to 35 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1098%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2. Lab Assistant (Physics)&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 59.586%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Essential &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Should have passed 12th/ Intermediate with Science (Physics) subjects</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">i) &nbsp;Higher Qualification (with Physics as one of the subject).</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii) Working experience in a Residential English Medium CBSE school with good communication skills in English and proficiency in games/ sports/ extra curricular activities.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.2916%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Between 18 to 35 years of age.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1098%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>3. Band Master&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 59.586%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Essential &ndash;</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Band Master/ Band Major/ Drum Major Course at the AEC Training College and Centre, Pachmarhi</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">OR</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Equivalent Naval /Air Force Course.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i)&nbsp; Previous experience in Military training institution / military schools/ Sainik schools/Boarding Schools</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii) Candidates having PG Diploma in Brass Band conducting.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iiI)&nbsp; Ability to speak in English and Hindi/Tamil fluently.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iv)&nbsp; Achievement in co-curricular/ art/sports activities.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.2916%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Between 21 to 50 years of age</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1098%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>4. Art Master&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 59.586%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Essential &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i) Master degree in Fine Art (with Painting specialization)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">OR</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Graduate with Fine Art/Art/Drawing and Painting as one of the subjects with minimum 4 years Diploma from a recognized Institute/ University.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">OR</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Higher Secondary/ Intermediate/ Sr. Sec. School Certificate Examination with minimum 5 years (full time)/ 7 year (Part time) diploma in Fine Art/ Painting/ Drawing and Painting from a recognized Institute/ University.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i)&nbsp; Previous experience in Military training institution / Military schools/ Sainik schools/Boarding Schools</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii)&nbsp; Ability to speak in English and Hindi/Tamil fluently.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iii)&nbsp; Achievement in co-curricular/ art/sports &nbsp;activities.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.2916%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Between 21 to 35 years of age.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1098%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>5. Medical Officer (Part-time)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 59.586%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Essential &ndash;</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">M.B.B.S</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i) Specialization in Paediatrics.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii) Minimum five years&rsquo; experience after obtaining specialist / UG degree.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iii)&nbsp; Should be able to take responsibility of the School Infirmary and ready to attend to medical emergencies round the clock.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iv)&nbsp; Previous medical experience of treating children of age group 10-18 years in a&nbsp; Boarding School</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(v) Ability to speak in English and Hindi/ Tamil</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(vi) Willingness to stay inside the campus.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.2916%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Between 21 to 50 years of age.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1098%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>6. Lower Division Clerk&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 59.586%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Essential &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i) Matriculation&nbsp; &nbsp;from&nbsp; &nbsp;a recognized board.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii) Typing speed of at least 40 words per minute.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iii) Knowledge of short hand and ability to correspond in English will be considered an additional qualification.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i) UG/PG with commerce background with office experience in a Government or commercial establishment.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii)&nbsp;&nbsp; Proficiency in Computer, MS Word, MS Excel, Power Point and Internet.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.2916%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Between 18&nbsp; to 50 years of age.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1098%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>7. Ward Boys&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 59.586%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Essential &ndash;</span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i) Should have passed Matriculation or equivalent examination and should possess the ability to converse in English and Hindi/Tamil fluently.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii)&nbsp; Should be willing to carry out all works related to cadets well being and hostel maintenance.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i)&nbsp; Ex-servicemen will be given preference.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii) Candidates with higher qualification from a recognised Institution.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iii) Previous experience in Military Training Institution/ Military Schools/ Sainik schools/ Boarding Schools.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iv) Candidates with proficiency in games as well as in co-curricualr activities.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iv) Aptitude for Residential school life style. (v) Achievement in sports/ Art/ Music/ Co Curricular activities.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.2916%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Between 21 to 50 years of age.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1098%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>8. Quarter Master&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 59.586%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Essential &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i) B.A./ B.Com</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii) At least five years&rsquo; experience as UDC stores or as Quarter Master or An ex-serviceman preferably a JCO with at least 10 years&rsquo; experience in handling and accounting of stores.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(i) Should have undergone a Quarter Master&rsquo;s Course.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(ii)&nbsp; Basic knowledge of Computer Application.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iii)&nbsp; Degree/ Diploma in Fire Fighting and Disaster Management Security,&nbsp; Motor Vehicle Maintenance,&nbsp; Knowledge of Stores/Inventory Management/ Material Management.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(iv)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Previous Experience.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.2916%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Between 21 to 50 years of age.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Age Relaxation &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation in upper limit will be given to only reserved categories as per government rules and regulations</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Reservation and Relaxation &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Reservation &amp; Relaxation will be given to only reserved categories as per government rules and regulations.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Location\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Job Location-</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Amar Sainik Primary School, Amaravathinagar (Tamil Nadu)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Employment_type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Job Employment type &ndash;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Quarter Master Post &ndash; Regular&nbsp; Basis</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Other Posts &ndash; Contractual Basis</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Period_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Job Period &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">One Year</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Who_can_apply_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Who can apply &ndash;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Indian Citizen (Male /Female)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Sainik_School_Amaravathinagar_Recruitment_2024_Selection_Process_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Sainik School Amaravathinagar Recruitment 2024 Selection Process &ndash;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Shortlisting</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Written Test</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Class Demonstration (Post Serial No. 01 to 4)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Skill Test / Trade Test ( Post Serial No. 06&amp; 07)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Personal Interview ,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification &amp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Exam_Date_Centre\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Exam Date /Centre- &nbsp;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">will be notified on official website later.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">परीक्षा की तिथि और परीक्षा केंद्र की जानकारी बाद में ऑफिसियल वेबसाइट पर सूचित की जाएगी</span></p>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Form_Type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Form Type &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Offline Application Form</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Apply_Mode_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Apply Mode &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Offline</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Application_Fee_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Application Fee &ndash;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px ridge rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Amount of Fee&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;General/ OBC Candidate</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For the Post of Quarter Master &ndash; Rs.500/-</span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For all other Posts &ndash; Rs.300/-</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;SC/ ST Candidates.</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For the Post of Quarter Master&nbsp; -Rs.300/-</span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">For all other Posts &ndash; Rs.200/-</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Payment Mode &ndash;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">In Form of Demand Draft drawn in favour of &lsquo;PRINCIPAL, SAINIK SCHOOL, AMARAVATHINAGAR&rsquo; payable at State Bank of India (SBI),&nbsp; Amaravathinagar (Code 2191) Udumalpet Taluk, Tiruppur District.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Apply_Pre_Requisite_-Enclosure_-_Documents_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Apply Pre Requisite -/Enclosure -/ Documents</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Self attested photocopies of the following should be enclosed with application form</strong>&nbsp;&ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Valid &amp; Active Email Id</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mobile No.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">All Educational Qualification Certificates with Marks sheet</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Proof</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Photograph (should be pasted on application form)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Signature (on application)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">DD Receipt of Application Fee</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">A Self Addressed envelope (9&Prime;*4&Prime;) duly affixing Rs.25/- worth postal stamp.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Id &amp; Address Proof</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Caste /Category / PH/ Domicile / EXSM/ EWS / NOC (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_for_Sainik_School_Amaravathinagar_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply for Sainik School Amaravathinagar Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी को चाहिए कि &nbsp;वे&nbsp;<strong>Offline Apply&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>करने से पहले&nbsp;<strong>Sainik School Amaravathinagar Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>की&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility criteria&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>Applying process</strong>&nbsp;की विस्तृत जानकारी के लिए&nbsp;<strong>Official Notification&nbsp;</strong><strong>का&nbsp;</strong><strong>full details</strong>&nbsp;जरूर पढ़ लें।<strong>Apply</strong>&nbsp; करने के लिए निम्नलिखित&nbsp;<strong>steps&nbsp;</strong><strong>को&nbsp;</strong><strong>follow</strong>&nbsp;करें &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Fill_Offline_Application_Form_for_Sainik_School_Amaravathinagar_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;How to Fill Offline Application Form for Sainik School Amaravathinagar Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Sainik School Amaravathinagar Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के आवेदन के लिए आपको सबसे पहले&nbsp;<strong>Official Website</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.sainikschoolamaravathinagar.edu.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.sainikschoolamaravathinagar.edu.in/</a>&nbsp;पर जाना होगा। जो कुछ इस प्रकार होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Home Page</strong>&nbsp;पर &lsquo;<strong>Careers&nbsp;&lsquo; menu</strong>&nbsp;पर&nbsp;<strong>Click</strong>&nbsp;कर &nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>Search</strong>&nbsp;करने के बाद आपको&nbsp;<strong>Sainik School Amaravathinagar Recruitment 2024</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Vacancy&nbsp;Notification</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>Link</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;दिखाई देगा। उसे वहां से&nbsp;<strong>download</strong>&nbsp;करके पूरा पढ़ लें &nbsp;ताकि आपको&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>applying</strong>&nbsp;<strong>procedure</strong>&nbsp; की विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त हो सके।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">उसी&nbsp;<strong>Official web page</strong>&nbsp;पेज पर&nbsp;<strong>या</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>इस</strong><strong>&nbsp;Article&nbsp;</strong><strong>के</strong>&nbsp;इसी पेज पर नीचे उपलब्ध&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;&ldquo;Application format&rdquo;&nbsp; link</strong>&nbsp;को क्लिक करें&nbsp; और उसका प्रिंट आउट निकाल लें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद&nbsp;<strong>Offline</strong>&nbsp;आवेदन को&nbsp;<strong>Correctly &amp; Carefully fill up&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Self Attested Required Documents, Photograph, Fee Receipt</strong>&nbsp; को<strong>&nbsp;attach</strong>&nbsp;करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Duly filled&nbsp;<strong>offline application along with self attested photo copies of certificate&nbsp;</strong>should be sent to below&nbsp;<strong>given address by post.</strong>&nbsp;Envelope containing application should be super scribed with name of applied post on top of cover of it.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Address for sending Application form &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Principal, Sainik School, Amaravathinagar, Pin -642102, Udumalpet Taluk, Tiruppur District (Tamil Nadu)&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date to receipt of Application form &ndash; 30/04/2024&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Links_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px double rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 127.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 127.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Sainik School Amaravathinagar Recruitment 2024</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Notification Pdf Link</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 127.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>LINK I &ndash;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.sainikschoolamaravathinagar.edu.in/careersCom.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>LINK II &ndash;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.sainikschoolamaravathinagar.edu.in/careersQM.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here&nbsp;</a></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 127.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 127.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Sainik School Amaravathinagar Recruitment 2024</strong></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application form Download Link&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 127.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sainikschoolamaravathinagar.edu.in/Docs/Application.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here&nbsp;</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sainikschoolamaravathinagar.edu.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1712121238-sainikschool.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-03 00:00:00', '2024-04-03 05:13:58', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(261, 'UPSC NDA II Examination 2023 Final Result 2024', 'Union Public Service Commission UPSC has released the National Defence Academy & Naval Academy NDA NA Second II Examination 2023.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 3px ridge rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(185, 106, 217);\"><strong>UPSC National Defence Academy &amp; Naval Academy Exam II 2023 </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UPSC Advt No.&nbsp;10/2023-NDA-II Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>17/05/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<strong> 06/06/2023 </strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>upto 06:00 PM only </strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment&nbsp;Last Date : <strong>06/06/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Form: <strong>07-13 June 2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Held on : <strong>03/09/2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>11/08/2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Available : <strong>26/09/2023 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Final Result Available : <strong>03/04/2024 </strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC : <strong>100/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Net Banking, Debit Card, Credit Card and Offline Fee Mode Through E Challan</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>NDS II Eligibility</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Army Wing :</strong> Passed /Appearing 10+2 Exam in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Airforce &amp; Naval Wing :</strong> Passed /Appearing 10+2 Exam with Physics &amp; Math Subjects</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>NDA II Age Limit</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Not be Born Before <strong>: 02/01/2005 </strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Not be Born After<strong> : 01/01/2008</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per NDA II Exam Notification 2023 Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPSC NDA II Exam 2023 <span style=\"color: red;\">Vacancy Details Total : 395 Post </span></strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Army : <span style=\"color: red;\">208</span> | Navy : <span style=\"color: red;\">42</span> | Airforce : <span style=\"color: red;\">120</span> <span style=\"color: #008000;\">| </span>Naval Academy : <span style=\"color: red;\">25</span></strong></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill NDA II Exam Online Form 2023 </strong></span></em></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">One time registration has become necessary for all the applications of Union Public Service Commission, so all the candidates will be able to apply only after OTR.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Union Public Service Commission UPSC NDA II Recruitment 2023. Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>17/05/2023 to 06/06/2023.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the NDA II Notification Before Apply the <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Recruitment </span></span>Application Form in NDA Apply Online 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Admission Entrance Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></span></em></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Final Result</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Final Result 2023\" href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/sites/default/files/FR-NDA-NA-II-23-engl-020424.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Result (Name Wise)</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Result 2023\" href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/sites/default/files/WR-NameList-NDA-II-23-engl-231123.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Result</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Result 2023\" href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/sites/default/files/WRITTEN-RESULT-NDA-NA-II-2023-engl-260923.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Admit Card 2023\" href=\"https://upsconline.nic.in/eadmitcard/admitcard_NDAII_2023/admit_card.php#hhh1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Apply Online UPSC NDA II Registration 2023\" href=\"https://upsconline.nic.in/upsc/OTRP/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Notification 2023\" href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/sites/default/files/Notif-NDA-II-23-engl-170523.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: red; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Official Website\" href=\"http://upsc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>UPSC Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1712129492-nda.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-03 00:00:00', '2024-04-03 07:31:32', NULL, NULL),
(262, 'OSSC CGL Recruitment 2024', 'The Odisha Staff Selection Commission (OSSC) has recently announced an exciting opportunity for job seekers.', '<header class=\"entry-header\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">OSSC CGL Recruitment 2024</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Apply Online For 595 Junior Assistant Vacancy</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">The Odisha Staff Selection Commission (OSSC) has recently announced an exciting opportunity for job seekers. If you&rsquo;re looking for a government job in Odisha, pay close attention. The OSSC CGL Recruitment 2024 is here, and it brings with it 586 vacancies across various Group B and C posts. Let&rsquo;s dive into the details without further ado.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-ossc-cgl-notification-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span id=\"OSSC_CGL_Notification_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>OSSC CGL Notification 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">The Odisha Government has issued a notification for the Combined Graduate Level 2024 exam, inviting applications for Group B and C positions across different departments and HODs. If you&rsquo;ve been eagerly anticipating this announcement, note that the application window is open from April 5th to May 2nd, 2024.</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Auditor</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Assistant</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Inspector of Endowments &amp; Co-operative Societies</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Junior Assistant</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-about-ossc-cgl-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span id=\"About_OSSC_CGL_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>About OSSC CGL Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Exam Name:&nbsp;</strong>OSSC CGL Recruitment Examination 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Conducting Authority:&nbsp;</strong>Odisha Staff Selection Commission (OSSC)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Notification :&nbsp;</strong>15th March 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Starting Date of Application:</strong>&nbsp;5th April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Last Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>2nd May 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Total Vacancies:&nbsp;</strong>586</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Male:&nbsp;</strong>300 Vacancies</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Female:</strong>&nbsp;195 Vacancies</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Prelims Exam Date:&nbsp;</strong>July to September 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Mains Exam Date:&nbsp;</strong>December 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Official Website:&nbsp;</strong>ossc.gov.in</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-dates-for-ossc-cgl-vacancy-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates_For_OSSC_CGL_Vacancy_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates For OSSC CGL Vacancy 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Notification Release:&nbsp;</strong>March 15, 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Online Registration Starts:&nbsp;</strong>April 5, 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Last Date for Registration:</strong>&nbsp;May 2, 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Last Date to Submit Applications Online:</strong>&nbsp;May 5, 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Correction Form Window:&nbsp;</strong>April 5 to April 17, 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>OSSC CGL Exam Date 2024:&nbsp;</strong>July to September 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-ossc-cgl-placement-details-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span id=\"OSSC_CGL_Placement_Details_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>OSSC CGL Placement Details 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-here-s-a-breakdown-of-the-vacancies\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Heres_a_breakdown_of_the_vacancies\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Here&rsquo;s a breakdown of the vacancies:</span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Inspector of Endowments:&nbsp;</strong>21 vacancies</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Assistant CT and GST Officer:</strong>&nbsp;61 vacancies</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Auditor:</strong>&nbsp;3 vacancies</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Auditor (Department of Water Resources):&nbsp;</strong>6 vacancies</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Inspector of Cooperative Societies:&nbsp;</strong>15 vacancies</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Junior Assistant (HOD):&nbsp;</strong>8 vacancies</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Junior Assistant:</strong>&nbsp;3 vacancies</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Junior Assistant (Department of Water Resources):&nbsp;</strong>469</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-ossc-cgl-eligibility-criteria-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span id=\"OSSC_CGL_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>OSSC CGL Eligibility Criteria 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-education-qualification\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Education_Qualification\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Education Qualification:</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Applicants must possess a bachelor&rsquo;s degree from an accredited university. Additionally, they should have fundamental computer skills, encompassing internet usage, email, word processing, data analysis, and presentation software. Proficiency in the Odia language is essential; candidates must demonstrate fluency in reading, writing, and speaking Odia.</span></p>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-age-limit\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Age Limit:</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">The age limit for applicants is set between 21 to 38 years as of 1st April 2024 with certain relaxations for various categories:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">SEBC, SC, ST, and all Women: Up to 5 years.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">PWD: Up to 10 years.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">PWD in the ST &amp; SC: Up to 10 years in addition to normal relaxation.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Ex-servicemen: Total years of service rendered.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-ossc-cgl-recruitment-application-fees-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span id=\"OSSC_CGL_Recruitment_Application_Fees_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>OSSC CGL Recruitment Application Fees 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">A notable feature of the OSSC Combined Graduate Level Recruitment Examination 2024 (CGLRE) is that no application fee is required.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-how-to-apply-for-ossc-cgl-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_For_OSSC_CGL_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply For OSSC CGL Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Visit the official website of OSSC: OSSC Official Website.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Starting from April 5, 2024, you can begin the online registration process.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Fill out the application form with accurate details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Upload any required documents as per the instructions.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">Submit your application online before the deadline, which is May 5, 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-ossc-cgl-posts-selection-process-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><span id=\"OSSC_CGL_Posts_Selection_Process_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>OSSC CGL Posts Selection Process 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-the-selection-process-involves-three-stages\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"The_selection_process_involves_three_stages\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\">The selection process involves three stages:</span></h4>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Preliminary Examination:&nbsp;</strong>Candidates who qualify in the preliminary exam proceed to the next stage.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Mains Examination:&nbsp;</strong>The main exam assesses candidates&rsquo; knowledge in depth.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Certificate Verification:&nbsp;</strong>Shortlisted candidates undergo document verification.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-links\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-929ad4f7075d67cf1d7d447031e9a5e9\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-for-registration-visit-hereofficial-notification-check-hereofficial-website-click-here\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"For_Registration_Visit_HereOfficial_Notification_Check_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'comic sans ms\', sans-serif;\"><strong>For Registration :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ossc.gov.in/Public/OSSC/Default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Visit Here</a><br>Official Notification :<a href=\"https://www.wbhrb.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Addendum-Notice-No.1292_0001.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">&nbsp;Check Here</a><br>Official Website :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ossc.gov.in/Public/OSSC/Default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</div>', '1712130150-ossccgl.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-03 00:00:00', '2024-04-03 07:42:30', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(263, 'Munger University Part 2 Admission 2024', 'Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024  For B.A, B.Sc and B.Com.', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;For B.A, B.Sc and B.Com </span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\">Munger University Part 2 Admission 2024</span></span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content cf\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\"><strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024:</strong></span>&nbsp;<strong>फर्स्ट सेमेस्टर&nbsp;</strong>को&nbsp;<strong>सफलतापूर्वक&nbsp;</strong>पास कर चुके हमारे सभी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;मुंगेर विश्वविघालय&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के स्टूडेंट्स जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>सेकेंड सेमेस्टर&nbsp;</strong>मे&nbsp;<strong>दाखिला&nbsp;</strong>लेना चाहते है और<strong>&nbsp;दाखिला प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>के शुरु होने का कर रहे है तो आपका&nbsp;<strong>इंतजार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;खत्म हो चुका है क्योंकि&nbsp;<strong>Munger University Part 2 Admission 2024&nbsp;</strong>की प्रक्रिया को शुरु कर दिया गया है जिसकी पूरी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;विस्तृत जानकारी&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;हम, आपको प्रदान करेगे।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">आपको बता दें कि,&nbsp;<strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>के तहत सभी&nbsp;<strong>सेकेंड सेमेस्टर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>दाखिला&nbsp;</strong>हेतु&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन&nbsp;प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>को &nbsp;<strong>03 अप्रैल, 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>से शुरु किया जायेगा जिसमे आप सभी आवेदक&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>13 अप्रैल, 2024&nbsp;( ऑनलाइन आवेदन की अन्तिम तिथि )&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;तक&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;दाखिला&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;हेतु&nbsp;<strong>अप्लाई&nbsp;</strong>कर सकते है औऱ</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">और आर्टिकल के अन्त में हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक&nbsp;लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong> प्रदान करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से इसी&nbsp; प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Munger_University_UG_Semester_2_Admission_2024_Highlights\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024 : Highlights</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px inset rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Name of the University</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Munger University</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Name of the Article</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Type of Article</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Admission</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Session</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2023 &ndash; 2027</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Semester</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>02nd Semester</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Courses</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>B.A, B.Sc and B.Com Etc.</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Mode of Application</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Application Starts From?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>03rd April, 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 40px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date of Online Application?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 40px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>13th April, 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8175%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.1425%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>mungeruniversity.ac.in</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%A1_%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9F_%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%96%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%81_%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%97%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%AF%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%9F%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%B6%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%81_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%B5%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE_%E2%80%93_Munger_University_UG_Semester_2_Admission_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">अपने इस आर्टिकल में हम, आप सभी&nbsp;<strong>विद्यार्थियो&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>स्वागत&nbsp;</strong>करना चाहते है जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;मुंगेर विश्वविघालय&nbsp;</strong>के&nbsp;<strong>सेकेंड सेमेस्टर&nbsp;</strong>मे&nbsp;<strong>दाखिला&nbsp;</strong>लेने हेतु<strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;आवेदन&nbsp; करना चाहते है और&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>आवेदन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>के शुरु होने का&nbsp;<strong>इंतजार&nbsp;</strong>कर रहे है&nbsp; उन्हे&nbsp; हम, इस आर्टिकल की मदद से विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>के&nbsp; बारे मे बतायेगे जिसके लिए आपको अन्त तक हमारे साथ बने रहना होगा।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">साथ ही साथ हम, आप सभी&nbsp;<strong>विद्यार्थियो&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को बता देना चाहते है कि, आपको&nbsp;<strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>दाखिला&nbsp;</strong>हेतु&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;ऑनलाइन आवेदन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को अपनाते हुए&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;अप्लाई&nbsp;</strong>करना होगा जिसमे आपको कोई समस्या ना हो इसके लिए हम, आपको पूरी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>की जानकारी प्रदान करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से&nbsp;<strong>दाखिला&nbsp;</strong>हेतु&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;अप्लाई&nbsp;</strong>कर सके और</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">और आर्टिकल के अन्त में हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong> प्रदान करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से इसी&nbsp; प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A3_%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%82_%E2%80%93_Munger_University_UG_Semester_2_Admission_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>महत्वपूर्ण तिथियां&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px ridge rgb(191, 237, 210);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); text-align: center; width: 56.8272%;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>कार्यक्रम</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); text-align: center; width: 43.1994%;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>तिथि</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); width: 56.8272%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024 &ndash;&nbsp; आवेदन प्रक्रिया को शुरु किया जायेगा</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); width: 43.1994%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>03 अप्रैल, 2024 ( बुधवार )</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); width: 56.8272%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024 &ndash;&nbsp; दाखिला हेतु ऑनलाइन आवेदन की अन्तिम तिथि</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210); width: 43.1994%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>13 अप्रैल, 2024 ( शनिवार )</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_Online_In_Munger_University_UG_Semester_2_Admission_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply Online In Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>मुंगेर विश्वविघालय&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;सेकेंड सेमेस्टर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;दाखिला&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;हेतु आपको इन स्टेप्स को फॉलो करके&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन&nbsp;</strong>करना होगा जो कि, इस प्रकार से हैं &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Munger University 2nd Admission 2024&nbsp;</strong>मे<strong>&nbsp;दाखिला&nbsp;</strong>हेतु&nbsp;<strong>ऑनलाइन आवेदन&nbsp;</strong>करने के लिए सबसे पहले आपको इसकी&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.mungeruniversity.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">आधिकारीक वेबसाइट</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के होम &ndash; पेज पर आना होगा जो कि, इस प्रकार से हैें &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">होम &ndash; पेज पर आने के बाद आपको&nbsp;<a href=\"https://mungeruniversity.ac.in/page/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Admission login</strong>&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;का&nbsp;टैब&nbsp;मिलेगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इसी टैब मे आपको&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"http://application.mungeruniversity.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Application &amp; Registration</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का विकल्प मिलेगा जिस पऱ आपको&nbsp; क्लिक करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">क्लिक करने के बाद&nbsp; आपके सामने इसका एक नया पेज खुलेगा जो कि, इस प्रकार का होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">अब यहां पर आपको&nbsp;<strong>Admission Sem-2</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;आगे ही&nbsp;<strong>Action&nbsp;</strong>का टैब मिलेगा जिसमे आपको&nbsp;<strong>Login&nbsp;</strong>का विकल्प मिलेगा जिस पर आपको क्लिक करना होगा और&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;पोर्टल मे लॉगिन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">पोर्टल में&nbsp;<strong>लॉगिन&nbsp;</strong>करने के बाद आपके सामने इसका&nbsp;<strong>Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024</strong>&nbsp; का<strong>&nbsp;एप्लीकेशन फॉर्म&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;खुल जायेगा जिसे आपको ध्यानपूर्वक भरना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">मांगे जाने वाले सभी दस्तावेजो को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;स्कैन करके अपलोड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन शुल्क&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>ऑनलाइन पेमेंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा और</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">अन्त मे, आपको&nbsp;<strong>सबमिट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के विकल्प पर क्लिक करना होगा जिसके बाद आपको आपके आवेदन की&nbsp;<strong>रसीद&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मिल जायेगी जिसे आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;प्रिंट&nbsp;</strong>करके&nbsp;<strong>सुरक्षित&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;रखना होगा आदि।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">उपरोक्त सभी स्टेप्स को फॉलो करके आप आसानी से इस&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;दाखिला प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;दाखिला&nbsp;</strong>हेतु&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;अप्लाई&nbsp;</strong> कर सकते है।<span id=\"%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%B6\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%95_%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B8\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>क्विक लिंक्स</strong></span></em></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px dashed rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 55.571%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 44.3891%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.mungeruniversity.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 55.571%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Direct Link To Download Official Notice</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 44.3891%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://mungeruniversity.ac.in/images/document/UG_(CBCS)_Semester_II_(2023-27)_Admission_Notice.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 55.571%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Direct Link To Apply Online For&nbsp;Munger University UG Semester 2 Admission 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 44.3891%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://application.mungeruniversity.ac.in/User/Login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1712131719-munger.webp', '15', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-03 00:00:00', '2024-04-03 08:08:39', NULL, NULL),
(264, 'Bihar Board 10th Compartmental 2024', 'Bihar Board 10th Compartmental and Special Exam Form 2024', '<div class=\"inside-article\" style=\"height: auto !important;\"><header class=\"entry-header\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Bihar Board 10th Compartmental and Special Exam Form 2024</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar Board 10th Compartmental and Special Exam Form 2024: हेलो दोस्तों बिहार बोर्ड के द्वारा मैट्रिक कंपार्टमेंटल एग्जाम फॉर्म और मैट्रिक स्पेशल एग्जाम फार्म जारी किया गया. जानते हैं मैट्रिक कंपार्टमेंटल एग्जाम फॉर्म और मैट्रिक स्पेशल एग्जाम फॉर्म में कौन से स्टूडेंट भाग ले सकते हैं और इसका कितना फीस होगा और एग्जाम फॉर्म कैसे भरा जाएगा.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">मैट्रिक का रिजल्ट 31 मार्च 2024 को जारी किया गया. कुछ स्टूडेंट किसी कारणवश एग्जाम फॉर्म नहीं भर पाए थे जिस कारण से वह एग्जाम ही नहीं दे पाए और कुछ स्टूडेंट्स एग्जाम में किसी कारण से फेल हो गए. उन सभी स्टूडेंट्स के लिए मैट्रिक कंपार्टमेंटल एग्जाम फॉर्म और मैट्रिक स्पेशल एग्जाम फॉर्म जारी किया गया है.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Date\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">Important Date</span></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Declared: 31 March 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Compartmental Exam Form: 03 April 2024 to 09 April 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Special Exam Form: 03 April 2024 to 09 April 2024</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Bihar_Board_10th_Compartmental_and_Special_Exam_Form_2024_Kab_Se_Start_Hogi\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Bihar Board 10th Compartmental and Special Exam Form 2024 Kab Se Start Hogi</span></em></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar Board 10th Compartmental and Special Exam Form 2024 आवेदन करने की तिथि दिनांक 03.04.2024 से करने की घोषणा की गई है।</span></p>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_apply_Bihar_Board_10th_Compartmental_and_Special_Exam_Form_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">How to apply Bihar Board 10th Compartmental and Special Exam Form 2024</span></em></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">मैट्रिक कंपार्टमेंटल एग्जाम फॉर्म और मैट्रिक स्पेशल एग्जाम फार्म के लिए ऑफलाइन स्कूल और कॉलेज के द्वारा एग्जाम फॉर्म भरा जाता है, 03 April से अपने स्कूल और संबद्ध कॉलेजों में जाकर ऑफलाइन एग्जाम फॉर्म भरवा लें.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\">Important Links</span></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px inset rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 54.4392%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Compartmental/ Special Application for Exam 2024&nbsp;(For School use only)</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 45.5875%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://appsecondary.biharboardonline.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 54.4392%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Official Website</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 45.5875%;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://biharboardonline.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '1712139368-compartmental.webp', '17', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-03 00:00:00', '2024-04-03 10:16:08', NULL, NULL),
(265, 'RRB Group D Recruitment 2024', 'The Government of India has not officially confirmed the commencement of the recruitment drive for various Group D posts by the RRBs.', '<header class=\"entry-header\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">RRB Group D Recruitment 2024</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The Railway Recruitment Board (RRB) is all set to roll out the red carpet for aspiring candidates. In this article, we&rsquo;ll cover everything you need to know about the RRB Group D Recruitment 2024. Buckle up, because this could be your ticket to a rewarding career.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The Government of India has not officially confirmed the commencement of the recruitment drive for various Group D posts by the RRBs. However, there is strong speculation that it may be initiated between October and December 2024. Eligible candidates will likely have the opportunity to apply online by furnishing the necessary details.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-about-rrb-group-d-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"About_RRB_Group_D_Recruitment_2024\"><strong>About RRB Group D Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The RRB Group D exam opens doors to various posts within the Indian Railways. From Track Maintainer Grade-IV to Assistant Pointsman, this recruitment drive offers a golden opportunity to join the prestigious Government Sector.<span id=\"Check_More_Vacancies\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-rrb-group-d-recruitment-notification-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"RRB_Group_D_Recruitment_Notification_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RRB Group D Recruitment Notification 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The notification for Group D positions is anticipated to be released between October and December 2024, although official confirmation is still pending. Reliable sources suggest that the release may occur in the coming weeks. Prospective candidates are encouraged to monitor the regional RRBs&rsquo; websites closely, as the official advertisement will be published there.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-rrb-group-d-application-form-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"RRB_Group_D_Application_Form_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RRB Group D Application Form 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Recruiter:&nbsp;</strong>Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Vacancy Name:&nbsp;</strong>Group D</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Vacancies:</strong>&nbsp;1.5 Lakh+ (Expected)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Notification:</strong>&nbsp;October &ndash; December 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Mode of Applications:&nbsp;</strong>Online</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Application Dates:&nbsp;</strong>To Be Announced</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website:&nbsp;</strong>indianrailways.gov.in</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-posts-included-in-rrb-group-d-vacancy-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Posts_Included_in_RRB_Group_D_Vacancy_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Posts Included in RRB Group D Vacancy 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Track Maintainer Grade-IV:</strong>&nbsp;These unsung heroes ensure the smooth functioning of railway tracks.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Helper/Assistant:</strong> Vital cogs in the technical departments (Electrical, Mechanical, and S&amp;T).</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Assistant Pointsman:&nbsp;</strong>The friendly faces who guide passengers at stations.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Level-1 Posts:</strong>&nbsp;A diverse range of roles across various departments.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-dates-for-rrb-group-d-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates_For_RRB_Group_D_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates For RRB Group D Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Notification Release:&nbsp;</strong>Expect the official notification between October and December 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Window:&nbsp;</strong>Expected to be released soon.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Dates:</strong>&nbsp;Stay tuned for updates on the Computer-Based Test (CBT) schedule.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-rrb-group-d-posts-eligibility-criteria-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"RRB_Group_D_Posts_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RRB Group D Posts Eligibility Criteria 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-education\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Education\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Education:</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">A minimum of 10th pass is required, or</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must either hold an ITI certificate approved by NCVT/SCVT or possess an equivalent certification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-age-limit\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit:</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must be between 18 and 30 years (or 18 and 33 years for specific categories).</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-rrb-group-d-placements-selection-process-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"RRB_Group_D_Placements_Selection_Process_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RRB Group D Placements Selection Process 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Computer-Based Test (CBT)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Physical Efficiency Test (PET)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-rrb-group-d-recruitment-application-fees-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"RRB_Group_D_Recruitment_Application_Fees_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RRB Group D Recruitment Application Fees 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1. For General/OBC Candidates,</strong>&nbsp;the application fee is ₹500, out of which ₹400 is refundable upon appearing in the Computer Based Test (CBT).</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2. For SC, ST, EWS, Women, Ex-Servicemen, and PwBD Candidates,</strong>&nbsp;the application fee is reduced to Rs. 250, which is fully refundable after the candidate appears in the CBT.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-rrb-group-d-vacancy-details-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"RRB_Group_D_Vacancy_Details_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>RRB Group D Vacancy Details 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">As per the last year RRB Group D recruitment, zone wise vacancy details has been mentioned below from which you can analyse the vacancy distribution amongst all the RRB&rsquo;s Or RRC&rsquo;s:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>North Central Railway (Allahabad) &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;4730</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Northern Railway (New Delhi</strong>) &ndash;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>13153</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>North Eastern Railway (Gorakhpur)</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; 4002</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>North Western Railway (Jaipur)&nbsp;</strong>&ndash; 5249</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>West Central Railway (Jabalpur</strong>) &ndash; 4019</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Western Railway (Mumbai</strong>) &ndash; 10734</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Central Railway (Mumbai)</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; 9345</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>South Eastern Railway (Kolkata)</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; 4914</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eastern Railway (Kolkata)</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; 10873</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>South East Central Railway (Bilaspur</strong>) &ndash; 1664</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>South Western Railway (Hubli)</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; 7167</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Southern Railway (Chennai)&nbsp;</strong>&ndash; 9579</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>South Central Railway (Secunderabad)</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; 9328</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>North East Frontier Railway (Guwahati)</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; 2894</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>East Central Railway (Hajipur</strong>) &ndash; 3563</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>East Coast Railway (Bhubanewar)&nbsp;</strong>&ndash; 2555</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">According to various media reports, it has been said that this time the number of vacancies for Level I will be more than 1.5 lakhs. While the exact number of vacancies will be announced by the Railway Recruitment Board in the official notification.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-how-to-apply-for-rrb-group-d-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_To_Apply_For_RRB_Group_D_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How To Apply For RRB Group D Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Keep an eye out for the official RRB Group D Notification, which is expected to be released between October and December 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Once the notification is out, visit the official RRB website.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Look for the &ldquo;Apply Online&rdquo; link.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fill out the application form with accurate details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Upload any required documents as per the instructions.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If applicable, make the payment for the application fees according to the provided payment mode.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Submit your application.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Remember to take a printout for your records.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-links\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-eda09db25436d84480cb4b216f178738\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-short-notice-tentative-exam-calendar-check-hereofficial-website-click-here\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Short_NoticeTentative_Exam_Calendar_Check_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Short Notice(Tentative Exam Calendar) :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.rrbahmedabad.gov.in/Images/RRB%20Tentative%20Calendar1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Check Here</a><br>Official Website :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</div>', '1712139969-rrb.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-03 00:00:00', '2024-04-03 10:26:09', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(266, 'SECR Railway Recruitment 2024', 'South East Central Railway, Raipur has released the official notification for the recruitment of Various Apprentice Posts on the official website of the SECR.', '<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px ridge rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 196.168%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 class=\"table-posttitle\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SECR Railway Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n<h4 class=\"table-h4title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>(South East Central Railway, Raipur (SECR) )</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1304%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">IMPORTANT DATES</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull;</strong>&nbsp;Starting Date&nbsp;&ndash;<strong>&nbsp;02 April 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Last Date of Registration &ndash;<strong>&nbsp;01 May 2024 (11:59 PM)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull;</strong>&nbsp;Exam Date &ndash;&nbsp;<strong>Available Soon</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.037%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">APPLICATION FEE</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; Not Specifed</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1304%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">JOB LOCATION</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">South East Central Railway, Raipur Zone</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.037%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">AGE LIMIT</span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>As On 02 April 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Minimum &ndash;&nbsp;</strong>15 Years</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Maximum &ndash;&nbsp;</strong>24 Years</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Relaxation (Upper Age Limit) &ndash;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">As per Rules</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 196.168%; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<div id=\"text-160\" class=\"widget widget_text widget-shortcode area-submit-resume-inner-top \"></div>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy Details for SECR Railway Recruitment 2024 :&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Important Information &ndash;</strong></span>&nbsp;According to the latest updates from the official, South East Central Railway, Raipur (SECR) has released the official notification for the recruitment of Various Apprentice Posts on the official website of the SECR.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">According to the latest information, The process of recruitment is going on for a total of 1113 posts for the Apprentice posts amongst the region. It is being told that the SECR Apprentice Recruitment 2024 has started the application process by issuing the SECR Apprentice Recruitment Notification on 02 April 2024. And the SECR Railway Apprentice Recruitment application process has started from 02 April 2024 while the last date to apply for the aforesaid post will be 01 May 2024.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Division Wise &amp; Trade Wise Vacancy Details &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DRM Office, Raipur DIvision : 844 Posts</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Welder (Gas &amp; Electric)&nbsp; &ndash; 161 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Turner&nbsp; &ndash; 54 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fitter&nbsp; &ndash; 207 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Electrician&nbsp; &ndash; 212 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Stenographer (English)&nbsp; &ndash; 15 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Stenographer (Hindi)&nbsp; &ndash; 08 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Computer Operator &amp; Programmer Assistant (COPA)&nbsp; &ndash; 10 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Health &amp; Sanitary Inspector&nbsp; &ndash; 25 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Machinist&nbsp; &ndash; 15 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mechanic Diesel&nbsp; &ndash; 81 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mechanic Refrigeration &amp; Air Conditioner&nbsp; &ndash; 21 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mechanic Auto Electrical &amp; Electronics &ndash;&nbsp;35 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Wagon Repair Shop, Raipur : 269 Posts</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Fitter&nbsp; &ndash; 110 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Welder&nbsp; &ndash; 110 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Machinist&nbsp; &ndash; 15 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Turner&nbsp; &ndash; 14 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Electrician&nbsp; &ndash; 14 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Computer Operator &amp; Programmer Assistant (COPA)&nbsp; &ndash; 04 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Stenographer (English)&nbsp; &ndash; 01 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Stenographer (Hindi)&nbsp;&nbsp;&ndash; 01 Posts</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Educational Qualification for RRC SR Apprentice Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their Class 10th Examination from Any Recognized Board in India with with ITI Certificate in relevant Trade&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Training Duration For SECR Railway Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">01 Year Apprenticeship Training</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>How to Apply for RRC SR Apprentice Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link provided below or they can also apply through official site of the SECR Railway from the 02 April 2024.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Mode of Selection for RRC SR Apprentice Recruitment 2024 &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\">Selection will be based on-:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Merit List</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px inset rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"important-linkstable\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 246.707%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 id=\"applyimg\" class=\"postapplya\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\">Important Links</span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.1224%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Apply Online</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 194.584%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.apprenticeshipindia.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 52.1224%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Official website</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 194.584%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"http://www.secr.indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1712140788-scer.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-03 00:00:00', '2024-04-03 10:39:48', NULL, NULL),
