pan></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available :<strong>&nbsp;Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"346\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 10, 246); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Gen / OBC/ EWS :&nbsp;<strong>1180/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST :&nbsp;<strong>708/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PH (Divyang) :<strong>&nbsp;0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, E Challan</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"733\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DRRMLIM Nursing Officer Recruitment 2024 :&nbsp;Age Limit as on 21/04/2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation As per Dr Ram Manohar Lohia IMS Lucknow Uttar Pradesh Nursing Officer Recruitment Rules 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"733\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 195); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DR Ram Manohar Lohia IMS Nursing Officer Recruitment 2024 :&nbsp;Vacancy Details Total : 665 Post</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(6, 225, 250); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UR : 252 | EWS : 81 | OBC : 177 | SC : 143 | ST : 12 | Total : 665</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"429\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DR RML IMS Nursing Officer Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"189\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Nursing Officer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">665</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"429\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree B.Sc Hone Nursing / B.Sc Nursing OR B.SC (Post Certificate / Post Basic B.Sc Nursing&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma in General Nursing Midwifery GNM with 2 Year Experience</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Registration in Nursing Council.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"733\"><center></center>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 10, 246); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill Dr RML IMS Nursing Officer Recruitment Online Form 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Doctor Ram Manohar Lohia Institute of Medical Sciences Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh Nursing Officer 2024 Exam. Candidate Can Apply Between&nbsp;<strong>22/03/2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;to 21/04/2024</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in&nbsp; DR RML IMS Lucknow Nursing Officer Group B Level Jobs 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"733\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"422\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online Dr RML IMS Lucknow Nursing Officer 2024\" href=\"https://rmlrecruit.cbtexamportal.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"422\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Dr RML IMS Lucknow Nursing Officer Notification PDF\" href=\"https://www.drrmlims.ac.in/pdf/Nursing-_merged.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"422\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"DR RMLIMS Official Website\" href=\"https://www.drrmlims.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1712155928-Dr RMLIMS Lucknow Nursing Officer Online Form 2024 v.jpg', '1', 12, 'Y', '2024-04-03 00:00:00', '2024-04-03 02:52:08', NULL, NULL);
