84\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">76-80 CMS</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">NA</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">NA</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"129\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Running</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"206\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5 KM in 24 Minutes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"184\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5 KM in 24 Minutes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1.6 Km in 8.5 Minutes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1.6 Km in 8.5 Minutes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"21\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill SSC Constable GD Recruitment Online Form 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Staff Selection Commission SSC Constable GD Recruitment 2023, Candidate Can Apply Between<strong> 24/11/2023</strong><strong> to 31/12/2023.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Constable GD Vacancy&nbsp; 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" colspan=\"21\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; bor