(289, 'Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024', 'Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024 Apply for 17 Teacher Post', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt;\">Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024 Apply for 17 Teacher Post</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content cf\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024 &ndash;</span>&nbsp; Kalakshetra Foundation, Chennai &nbsp;</strong>ने&nbsp;<strong>Post Graduate Teachers</strong>&nbsp;<strong>,&nbsp;</strong><strong>और Secondary Graduate Teacher (Lower Class Supporting Staff)&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>के कुल मिलाकर<strong>&nbsp;17</strong>&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>रिक्तियों पर भर्ती के लिए विज्ञापन की अधिसूचना (<strong>Vacancy Advertisement)</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;जारी की है। इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी&nbsp;<strong>04 April, 2024</strong>&nbsp;<strong>से Offline Apply कर सकते हैं। Last Date of Receipt of Offline Application form&nbsp; 16 April, 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>तक है।इस विज्ञापन की विस्तृत जानकारी जैसे&nbsp;<strong>Post Name, No. of Vacancies, Eligibility Criteria, Pay Scale, Application Fee, Selection Process, How to Apply Instructions, Important Dates, Useful Web Links</strong> इत्यादि इस प्रकार है &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Kalakshetra_Foundation_Chennai_Recruitment_2024_Overview\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024 Overview&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px dashed rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 100px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 100px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Recruitment Organization</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 100px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;The Besant Theosophical Higher Secondary School, A unit of Kalakshetra Foundation, An Autonomous body under Ministry of Culture, Govt. of India, Chennai&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 38.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 38.4px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Name of Recruitment</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 38.4px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Applications are invited for Teachers on contract for BTHS School</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 57.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 57.6px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Title of the Article</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 57.6px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024 Apply for 17 Teacher Post</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 57.6px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 57.6px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Name of Post</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 57.6px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Post Graduate Teacher, Secondary Graduate Teacher (Lower Class Supporting Staff)</span></td>\r\n</t