yle=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Starting Date to Apply Offline</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04/04/2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date to receipt of Offline Application</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">16/04/2024 till 5.00 PM.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Official Website &ndash;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5177%; height: 19.2px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">www.kalakshetra.in</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Kalakshetra_Foundation_Chennai_Recruitment_2024_Notification_Details\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024 Notification Details&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Kalakshetra Foundation, Chennai &nbsp;</strong>ने&nbsp;<strong>Post Graduate Teachers</strong>&nbsp;<strong>,&nbsp;</strong><strong>और Secondary Graduate Teacher (Lower Class Supporting Staff)&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>के कुल मिलाकर<strong>&nbsp;17</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Vacancies&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;पर&nbsp;<strong>Selection&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के लिए&nbsp;<strong>Suitable and Eligible Candidates</strong>&nbsp;से&nbsp;<strong>Offline Application</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;की मांग की है .इस&nbsp;<strong>Recruitment Notification</strong>&nbsp;की विस्तृत जानकारी इस प्रकार है &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 43.5535%; text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Post &amp; Pay Scale&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 23.0508%; text-align: center;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total No. of Vacancies&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 33.3557%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Salary (Fixed) per Month&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 43.5535%;\" width=\"50%\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Graduate Teacher</strong>&nbsp;(For Class XI and XII)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 23.0508%;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">13</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 33.3557%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Rs. 25,000 to Rs.35, 000</span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">(As per qualification &amp; Experience)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 43.5535%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Secondary Graduate Teacher (Lower Class Supporting Staff)(</strong>&nbsp;for Class 1 to 8)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 23.0508%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 33.3557%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Rs. 20,000 to Rs.25,000 for Degree holder</span>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Rs. 10,000 to 15,000/- for Diploma holder</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">(As per qualification &amp; Experience)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Kalakshetra_Foundation_Eligibility_Criteria_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Kalakshetra Foundation Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center; width: 40.4235%;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Post &amp; Pay Scale&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center; width: 37.6328%;\" width=\"50%\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Educational Qualification&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center; width: 21.9037%;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Upper Age Limit&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4235%;\" width=\"50%\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Post Graduate Teacher (For Class XI and XII)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 37.6328%;\" width=\"50%\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Master Degree in relevant Subject with B.Ed.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">B.PEd/M.PEd. for Physical Education Subject</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 21.9037%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Below 50 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 40.4235%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Secondary Graduate Teacher (Lower Class Supporting Staff) for Class 1 to 8</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 37.6328%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Degree with B.Ed or D.T.Ed. for Maths. / Science /SS Subject.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma in relevant field for Tailoring / Hindi / Lib. Asst.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 21.9037%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Below 50 years</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Reservation and Relaxation &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Reservation &amp; Relaxation will be given to only reserved categories as per government rules and regulations.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"_Teaching_Medium_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Teaching Medium &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tamil and English Medium</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Location_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Job Location &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Besant Theosophical Higher Secondary School, Arundale Nagar, Chennai- 600 090</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Employment_type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Job Employment type &ndash;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Contractual (Temporary) Basis</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Job_Period_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Job Period &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">01/06/2024 to 30/04/2025</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Who_can_apply_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Who can apply &ndash; &nbsp;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Indian Citizen (Male /Female)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Selection_Process_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Selection Process &ndash;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Merit Basis</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Form_Type_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Form Type &ndash;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Offline Application Form</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Apply_Mode_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Apply Mode &ndash;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Offline</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Application_Fee_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><em><strong>Application Fee &ndash;</strong></em></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">NO Fee (NIL)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<article class=\"elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-191838 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-all-india-job tag-iit-delhi-non-teaching-recruitment\"></article>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Apply_Pre_Requisite_-Enclosure_-_Documents_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Apply Pre Requisite -/Enclosure -/ Documents &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Self attested photocopies of the following should be enclosed with application form</strong>&nbsp;&ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Valid &amp; Active Email Id</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mobile No.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Educational Qualification Certificates with Marks sheet</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Experience Certificate</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Proof</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Photograph (Should be pasted on application form)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Signature (on the application form)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Id &amp; Address Proof</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Caste /Category / PH/ Domicile / EXSM/ EWS / NOC (if applicable)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_for_Kalakshetra_Foundation_Chennai_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply for Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इच्छुक और योग्य अभ्यर्थी को चाहिए कि &nbsp;वे&nbsp;<strong>Offline Apply&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>करने से पहले&nbsp;<strong>Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>की&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility criteria&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>Applying process</strong>&nbsp;की विस्तृत जानकारी के लिए&nbsp;<strong>Official Notification&nbsp;</strong><strong>का&nbsp;</strong><strong>full details</strong>&nbsp;जरूर पढ़ लें।&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;Apply</strong>&nbsp; करने के लिए निम्नलिखित&nbsp;<strong>steps&nbsp;</strong><strong>को&nbsp;</strong><strong>follow</strong>&nbsp;करें &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Fill_Offline_Application_Form_for_Kalakshetra_Foundation_Chennai_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;&shy;How to Fill Offline Application Form for Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के आवेदन के लिए आपको सबसे पहले&nbsp;<strong>Official Website</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kalakshetra.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.kalakshetra.in/</a>&nbsp;पर जाना होगा। जो कुछ इस प्रकार होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Home Page</strong>&nbsp;पर&nbsp;<strong>Search</strong>&nbsp;करने के बाद आपको&nbsp;<strong>Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024 Vacancy&nbsp;</strong><strong>Notification</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>Link-&nbsp;<a class=\"popuphome\" href=\"https://kalkbuckmedi21.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/2024/04/Advt-BTHS-Contract-Staff-dt-03.04.2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Applications are invited for Teachers on contract for BTHS School</a></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;दिखाई देगा। उसे वहां से&nbsp;<strong>download</strong>&nbsp;करके पूरा पढ़ लें &nbsp;ताकि आपको&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>और&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;applying</strong>&nbsp;<strong>procedure</strong>&nbsp; की विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त हो सके।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">उसी&nbsp;<strong>Official web page</strong>&nbsp;पेज पर&nbsp;<strong>या</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>इस</strong><strong>&nbsp;Article&nbsp;</strong><strong>के</strong>&nbsp;इसी पेज पर नीचे उपलब्ध&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;Application format&rdquo;&nbsp; link</strong>&nbsp;को क्लिक करें&nbsp; और उसका प्रिंट आउट निकाल लें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद&nbsp;<strong>Offline</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Application form</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>correctly &amp; Carefully fill up&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Self Attested Required Documents, Photograph&nbsp;</strong>को<strong>&nbsp;attach</strong>&nbsp;करें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Duly filled&nbsp;<strong>offline application in prescribed format along with self attested photo copies of certificate&nbsp;</strong>should be sent to below&nbsp;<strong>given address by post.</strong>&nbsp;Envelope containing application should be super scribed with name of applied post on top of cover of it.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Address for sending Application form &ndash;&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Secretary, Besant Theosophical Hr.&nbsp; Sec School, 2. Arundale Beach Road,</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Arundale, Chennai- 600090</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date to receipt of Application form &ndash; 16/04/2024 , 5.00 PM.&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Links_%E2%80%93\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links&nbsp;</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Notification Pdf Link with Application form&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://kalkbuckmedi21.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/2024/04/Advt-BTHS-Contract-Staff-dt-03.04.2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" width=\"308\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.kalakshetra.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1712298568-Kalakshetra Foundation Chennai Recruitment 2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 06:29:28', NULL, NULL),
(290, 'IPPB Executive Recruitment 2024', 'India Post Payment Bank  has recently published the official notification for the recruitment of Circle Based Executive Posts on the official website of IPPB.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 1394.75px; border: 2px dotted rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 121.75px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 192.873%; height: 121.75px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 class=\"table-posttitle\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>IPPB Executive Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n<h4 class=\"table-h4title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>(India Post Payment Bank (IPPB))</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 203.825px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 49.4153%; height: 203.825px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\">IMPORTANT DATES</span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Starting Date &ndash;<strong>&nbsp;15 March 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull;&nbsp;</strong>Last Date for Registration &ndash;<strong>&nbsp;05 April 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull;</strong>&nbsp;Fee Payment Last Date &ndash;<strong>&nbsp;05 April 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull;&nbsp;</strong>Exam Date&nbsp;<strong>&ndash; Available Soon</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 143.458%; height: 203.825px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">APPLICATION FEE (Tentative)</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; General / OBC / EWS :&nbsp;</strong>Rs. 750/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; SC / ST :&nbsp;</strong>Rs.150/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; PH :&nbsp;</strong>Rs. 150/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 203.825px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 49.4153%; height: 203.825px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\">JOB LOCATION</span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Anywhere in India</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 143.458%; height: 203.825px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\">AGE LIMIT</span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>As on 01 March 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Minimum &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;21 Years</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Maximum &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;35 Years</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Relaxation : As per rules</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 865.35px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 192.873%; height: 865.35px;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Vacancy Details for IPPB Executive Recruitment 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;:</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Important Information &ndash;</strong></span>&nbsp;India Post Payment Bank (IPPB) has recently published the official notification for the recruitment of Circle Based Executive (On Contractual Basis) Posts on the official website of IPPB.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online applying process for IPPB Executive Recruitment 2024 has started from 15 March 2024 &amp; the candidates can apply till the 05 April 2024. Candidates must check the complete details for IPPB Executive Recruitment 2024 which has given below.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Posts Name &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Circle Based Executive (On Contractual Basis) Posts</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Category Wise Vacancy Distribution &ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General &ndash; 21 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">EWS &ndash; 04 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OBC &ndash; 12 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC &ndash; 07 Posts</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">ST &ndash; 03 Posts</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Educational Qualification for IPPB Executive Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>&ndash;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from any recognized University in India will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Note:</strong></span>&nbsp;<strong>The candidate with prior experience in sales operations of financial products would be preferred.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">NOTE:</span> Candidates are advised to must read the official notification carefully for the posts wise eligibility criteria &amp; educational qualification.</strong></span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>How to Apply&nbsp;for IPPB Executive Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>&ndash;</strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link provided below or they can also apply through official site of the IPPB before the 05 April 2024.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>Mode of Selection for IPPB Executive Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>&ndash;</strong></em></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\">Selection will be based on-:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online Exam / Written Exam.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(248, 202, 198);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"important-linkstable\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 id=\"applyimg\" class=\"postapplya\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\">Important Links</span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Apply Online</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/ipppblfeb24/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Download Notification</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.ippbonline.com/documents/31498/132994/1710478221579.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Official website</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.ippbonline.com/web/ippb/current-openings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1712299779-IPPB Executive Recruitment 2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 06:49:39', NULL, NULL),
(291, 'BSF SI  Constable Recruitment 2024 online Form', 'BSF SI & Constable Recruitment 2024 Online Form', '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"BSF_SI_Constable_Recruitment_2024_Online_Form\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt;\">BSF SI &amp; Constable Recruitment 2024 Online Form</span></h1>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">BSF SI &amp; Constable Recruitment 2024 Online Form:</span> Border Security Force (BSF) has invited online applications for recruitment to 82 posts for the post of Sub Inspector and Constable under GROUP- B &amp; C POSTS (COMBATISED) (NON GAZETTED-NON MINISTERIAL) IN BSF ENGINEERING &amp; AIR WING. Let us tell you that the application process for this recruitment of BSF SI &amp; Constable Recruitment 2024 has started from 16 March 2024. The last date for application is 15 April 2024. All interested and eligible candidates will be able to apply online by visiting the official website of the Border Security Force (BSF) https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/ by 15th April.</span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 52px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.4057%; height: 52px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\">\r\n<p class=\"head\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>GROUP- B &amp; C POSTS (COMBATISED) (NON GAZETTED-NON MINISTERIAL) IN BSF ENGINEERING &amp; AIR WING SETUP FOR THE VACANCY YEAR 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.5129%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Update</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.8927%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>16 March 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.5129%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Title Name</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.8927%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BSF Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.5129%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.8927%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Air Wing/ GROUP- B &amp; C POSTS SI, ASI &amp; Constable</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.5129%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancy</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.8927%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>82 Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.5129%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Onlne Start On</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.8927%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>16 March 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.5129%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Last Date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.8927%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;15 April 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.5129%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.8927%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>rectt.bsf.gov.in</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.5129%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Go To Home</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.8927%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://resultlives.com/\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Date\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Date</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online Apply Start Date:&nbsp;<strong>16 March 2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Of Apply Online:&nbsp;<strong>15 April 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date<strong>: 15 April 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Dates for Download Admit Card<strong>: Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The tentative Date of the Online Examination (CBT):<strong>&nbsp;Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General/ EWS/ OBC candidates:<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST/PWD candidates:<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode:</strong> The payment can be made by using only Master/ Visa /RuPay Debit or Credit cards or Internet Banking.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\"><strong>Age Limit&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age:<strong>&nbsp;21 years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age:<strong>&nbsp;25/ 28 / 30 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Relaxation:</strong>&nbsp;SC/ST Candidates -05 Years. &amp; OBC Candidates -03 Years. (Read the official notification for more details)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div id=\"aswift_1_host\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Educational_Qualifications\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Educational Qualifications</strong></span></span></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">To apply for various posts in this recruitment, candidates should have the prescribed qualification as per the post like engineering degree/bachelor or master degree in the relevant field as per the post, matriculation + ITI pass/ and diploma in the relevant field as per the post.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are requested to read the complete notification of the BSF SI &amp; Constable Recruitment 2024 Online Form before applying.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\">Total Vacancy:</span> 82 Posts</strong></span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BSF_Vacancy_Detail\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BSF&nbsp;</strong><strong>Vacancy Detail</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of the Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Toal Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Air Wing Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>22</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Group B Posts</strong><strong><br></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>22</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Group C Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>38</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>82</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Selection Process</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Written Examination (Phase- I &amp; II)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Physical Standard Test (PST)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Physical Efficiency Test (PET)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Merit List</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Read the Official Full Notification.</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BSF_Pay_Scale\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BSF&nbsp;</strong><strong>Pay Scale</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>As Per Rules. Read the Official Full Notificaiton For More Details.</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Link\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Link</strong></span></span></em></span></h5>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px dashed rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/#bsf-current-openings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/static/bsf/pdf/GROUP-%20C%20POSTS%20(COMBATISED)%20(NON%20GAZETTED-NON%20MINISTERIAL)%20IN%20BSF%20AIR%20WING%20FOR%20THE%20VACANCY%20YEAR-2024.pdf?rel=2024031601\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Air Wing</a>&nbsp;||<a href=\"https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/static/bsf/pdf/GROUP-%20B%20POSTS%20(COMBATISED)%20(NON%20GAZETTED-NON%20MINISTERIAL)%20IN%20BSF%20ENGINEERING%20SETUP%20FOR%20THE%20VACANCY%20YEAR%202024.pdf?rel=2024031601\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">&nbsp;Group &lsquo;B&rsquo;</a>&nbsp;||&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/static/bsf/pdf/GROUP-%20C%20POSTS%20(COMBATISED)%20(NON%20GAZETTED-NON%20MINISTERIAL)%20IN%20BSF%20ENGINEERING%20SETUP%20FOR%20THE%20VACANCY%20YEAR%202024.pdf?rel=2024031601\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Group &lsquo;C&rsquo;</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://rectt.bsf.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1712308453-BSF SI & Constable Recruitment 2024 Online Form.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 09:14:13', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(292, 'Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Recruitment 2024', 'The Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board has announced recruitment for Senior Residents and Tutors in various medical colleges across the state', '<header class=\"entry-header\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt;\">Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Recruitment 2024</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online For 825 Tutor Posts Vacancy</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB) has announced recruitment for Senior Residents and Tutors in various medical colleges across the state. In this article, we&rsquo;ll delve into the details of this recruitment drive, eligibility criteria, application process, and frequently asked questions.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bihar-bcece-senior-resident-notification-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Bihar_BCECE_Senior_Resident_Notification_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Bihar BCECE Senior Resident Notification 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB) is responsible for conducting competitive exams for admissions to various professional courses in Bihar. It plays a crucial role in selecting candidates for medical, engineering, and other technical programs.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB) has unveiled a recruitment initiative for the role of Senior <span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\">Resident/Tutor,</span> offering 825 vacancies in the BCECEB Recruitment 2024. The notification was issued on April 4, 2024, via the official website at bceceboard.bihar.gov.in. Applications will be accepted from April 5 to April 25, 2024.<span id=\"Here_More_Vacancies\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-about-bihar-bceceb-senior-resident-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"About_Bihar_BCECEB_Senior_Resident_Recruitment_2024\"><strong>About Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Organization:</strong>&nbsp;Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB)</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name:&nbsp;</strong>Senior Resident/ Tutor</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Vacancy:&nbsp;</strong>825 positions</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Job Area:</strong>&nbsp;Bihar</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Notification Date:&nbsp;</strong>04 April 2024</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Mode:&nbsp;</strong>Online</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Starting Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>05 April 2024</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date of Application:</strong>&nbsp;25 April 2024</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date Of Correcting Application Form:</strong>&nbsp;26 April 2024</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website:</strong>&nbsp;bceceboard.bihar.gov.in</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bihar-bceceb-senior-resident-vacancy-details-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Bihar_BCECEB_Senior_Resident_Vacancy_Details_2024\"><strong>Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Vacancy Details 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Anatomy: 71</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Microbiology: 77</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Physiology: 70</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Radiation Therapy: 71</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Anesthesia: 127</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Biochemistry: 68</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">ENT Department: 58</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">FMT: 77</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PMR: 64</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Skin and Venereal Diseases: 69</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">TB and Chest: 73</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bihar-bceceb-senior-resident-eligibility-criteria-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Bihar_BCECEB_Senior_Resident_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\">Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Eligibility Criteria 2024</span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">40% of Senior Resident/Tutor positions will be allocated to candidates from the Bihar State Health Service cadre, while another 40% will be reserved for doctors who have completed their postgraduate degree course (under Residency Scheme) from medical colleges within the state. The remaining 20% of positions will be filled by doctors who have obtained their postgraduate degree (under residency scheme) from recognized institutions outside the state. The minimum educational requirement for Senior Resident/Tutor positions is a postgraduate degree in the respective subject. In the event of a shortage of qualified candidates, those with a diploma will also be considered, with their qualifications being equivalent to a postgraduate degree, although they will have a lower position in the merit list. Additionally, as per the teacher eligibility qualifications set by the Indian Medical Council, candidates with equivalent postgraduate degrees will also be considered eligible for selection.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-age-limit-for-bihar-bceceb-senior-resident-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Age_Limit_For_Bihar_BCECEB_Senior_Resident_Recruitment_2024\"><strong>Age Limit For Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age as On:</strong>&nbsp;01.08.2023</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Maximum Age:&nbsp;</strong>37 Years</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation As Per Rules</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bihar-bceceb-senior-resident-recruitment-application-fee-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Bihar_BCECEB_Senior_Resident_Recruitment_Application_Fee_2024\"><strong>Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Recruitment Application Fee 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UR/ EWS/ EBC/ BC/ SC/ ST/ DQ Category:&nbsp;</strong>Rs.2250/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Mode of Payment:&nbsp;</strong>Online</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bihar-bceceb-senior-resident-selection-process-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Bihar_BCECEB_Senior_Resident_Selection_Process_2024\"><strong>Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Selection Process 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Examination</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Interview</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bihar-bceceb-senior-resident-exam-pattern-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Bihar_BCECEB_Senior_Resident_Exam_Pattern_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Exam Pattern 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h5 id=\"h-written-examination\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Written_Examination\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Written Examination:</strong></span></h5>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1. The written exam is a crucial step in the selection process.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. It assesses candidates&rsquo; knowledge in relevant subjects.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3. The exam typically covers topics related to the MBBS syllabus.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">4. To prepare effectively:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Review your medical textbooks and notes.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Solve previous years&rsquo; question papers to understand the pattern.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take mock tests to improve time management and boost confidence.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 id=\"h-interview\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Interview\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Interview:</strong></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">After the written exam, shortlisted candidates will face an interview.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The interview evaluates communication skills, subject knowledge, and suitability for the role.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Be well-prepared to discuss your qualifications, experience, and passion for medical education.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5 id=\"h-document-verification\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Document_verification\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Document verification:</strong></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document verification ensures that candidates meet eligibility criteria and have submitted accurate information.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-how-to-apply-for-bihar-bceceb-senior-resident-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_To_Apply_For_Bihar_BCECEB_Senior_Resident_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How To Apply For Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Visit the official BCECEB website.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Check your eligibility based on the notification provided on the official website.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Online&rdquo; link or visit the website directly.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fill out the online application form on the official website.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Provide accurate details, including personal information, educational qualifications, and any other relevant data.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Attach scanned copies of essential documents, such as educational certificates, identity proof, and recent passport-sized photographs.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Make the payment through the online mode.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Review your application before final submission to ensure all information is correct.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Submit the application form.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Make sure to print a copy of your application form for future reference.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-dates-for-bihar-bceceb-senior-resident-vacancy-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates_For_Bihar_BCECEB_Senior_Resident_Vacancy_2024\"><strong>Important Dates For Bihar BCECEB Senior Resident Vacancy 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Notification Release:</strong>&nbsp;04 April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Starting Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>05 April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date of Application:</strong>&nbsp;25 April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date Fee Payment :</strong>&nbsp;26 April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Correction Date:&nbsp;</strong>26 April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Date :</strong>&nbsp;As per schedule</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-links\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-146ce0df960913ce1ca653f9ad3ef0ed\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-apply-online-visit-heredownload-notification-click-hereofficial-website-click-here\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Apply_Online_Visit_HereDownload_Notification_Click_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bceceboardapl.bihar.gov.in/bceceboardapl/senior_2024/bceceboard-senior/senior-registration#no-back-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Visit Here</a><br>Download Notification:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/pdf_Adv/ADV_SR24_03.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a><br>Official Website :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</div>', '1712309276-Bihar-BCECEB-Senior-Resident copy.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 09:27:56', NULL, NULL),
(293, 'Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024', 'Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024</span></span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content cf\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(248, 202, 198);\">Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024:</span>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;वे सभी युवक &ndash; युवतियां जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;हैदराबाद पुलिस अकादमी&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>अलग &ndash; अलग पदों&nbsp;</strong>पर&nbsp;<strong>सरकारी नौकरी&nbsp;</strong>पाना चाहते है तो हम, आपके लिए&nbsp;<strong>सरकारी नौकरी&nbsp;</strong>पाने का&nbsp;<strong>बेहतरीन अवसर&nbsp;</strong>लेकर आये है जिसके तहत हम, आपको विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>के बारे मे बतायेगे जिसकी पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त करने हेतु आपको हमारे साथ बने रहना होगा ताकि आप पूरी &ndash; पूरी&nbsp; जानकारी प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">यहां पर हम, आपको बताना चाहते है कि,&nbsp;<strong>Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>के तहत&nbsp;<strong>रिक्त कुल 18&nbsp; पदों पर भर्तियां की जायेगी&nbsp;</strong>जिसमे आप सभी आवेदक&nbsp;<strong>11 मार्च, 2024&nbsp;</strong>से लेकर&nbsp;<strong>भर्ती विज्ञापन जारी&nbsp;</strong>होने की तिथि से&nbsp;<strong>42वें दिन&nbsp;</strong>तक&nbsp; आवेदन करके&nbsp;<strong>नौकरी&nbsp;</strong>पाने का&nbsp;<strong>सुनहरा अवसर&nbsp;</strong>प्राप्त कर सकते है तथा</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आर्टिकल के अन्तिम चरण मे हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong> प्रदान करेगें ताकि आप इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Hyderabad_Police_Academy_Recruitment_2024_%E2%80%93_Overview\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024 &ndash; Overview</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 52.3519%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Name of the Academy</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 47.6082%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Hyderabad Police Academy&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 52.3519%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Name of the Article</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 47.6082%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 52.3519%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Who Can Apply?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 47.6082%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>All India Applicants Can Apply</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 52.3519%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No of Vacancies</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 47.6082%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>18 Vacancies On Various Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 52.3519%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 47.6082%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No Age Limit</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 52.3519%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 47.6082%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No Application Fees</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 52.3519%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Mode of Application</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 47.6082%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Offline</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 52.3519%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Detailed Information of Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184); width: 47.6082%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Please Read the Article Completely.</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%AC%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A6_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8_%E0%A4%85%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%88_%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%88_%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%B2_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%8B%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%82_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%97%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%94%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%97%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%85%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%88_%E2%80%93_Hyderabad_Police_Academy_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>&nbsp;Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>हैदराबाद पुलिस अकादमी&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नौकरी&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;पाने की चाहत रखने वाले सभी युवाओं सहित आवेदको का इस आर्टिकल मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;उत्साहवर्धक स्वागत&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करते हुए हम, आपको विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बतायेगे जिसकी पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी प्रदान करने के&nbsp; प्रयास करेगें ताकि आप निश्चिन्त होकर&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;पूरी भर्ती&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;जानकारी&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;प्राप्त कर सकें और&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;हैदराबाद पुलिस संस्थान&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नौकरी&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इस आर्टिकल मे हम, आपको विस्तार से ना केवल&nbsp;<strong>Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बतायेगे बल्कि हम, आपको विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;पूरी ऑफलाइन आवेदन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बतायेगे जिसकी पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त करने हेतु आपको हमारे साथ बने रहना होगा ताकि आप पूरी &ndash; पूरी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की जानकारी प्राप्त करके&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर सके तथा</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आर्टिकल के अन्तिम चरण मे हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong> प्रदान करेगें ताकि आप इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates_of_Hyderabad_Police_Academy_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates of Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px dashed rgb(194, 224, 244);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Events</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Dates</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Process Starts From</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>11th March, 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date of Application Submission</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>42nd Day From the Application Process Starts</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Post_Wise_Vacancy_Details_of_Hyderabad_Police_Academy_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Post Wise Vacancy Details of Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\