, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Language Instructor</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">02</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Stenographer Grade &ndash; I</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">05</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Staff Nurse</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">01</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancies</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>18 Vacancies</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Post_Wise_Educational_Qualification_For_Hyderabad_Police_Academy_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Post Wise Educational Qualification For Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center; width: 20.5709%;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of the Post</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); text-align: center; width: 79.4558%;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Required Qualification Details</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 20.5709%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Senior Scientific Assistant</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 79.4558%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">सभी युवाओ ने,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;मान्यता प्राप्त संस्थान&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;से&nbsp;<strong>Forensic Science or Physics or Chemistry or Toxicology or Zoology or Botany or Bio-Chemistry or Biology or DNA&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;मास्टर्स की डिग्री&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;हासिल की हो&nbsp; और</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>शैक्षणिक योग्यता&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की विस्तृत जानकारी हेतु आपको ध्यानपूर्वक&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती विज्ञापन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को पढ़ना होगा।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 20.5709%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Laboratory Technician</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 79.4558%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आवेदको ने, मान्यता प्राप्त संस्थान से&nbsp;<strong>B.Sc (Medical Lab Technology)&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;किया हो या</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आवेदको ने मान्यता प्राप्त संस्थान से&nbsp;<strong>B.Sc (Physics or Chemistry or Mathematics or Biology) with diploma (Medical lab Technology)&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;किया हो&nbsp; और</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>शैक्षणिक योग्यता&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की विस्तृत जानकारी हेतु आपको ध्यानपूर्वक&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती विज्ञापन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को पढ़ना होगा।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 20.5709%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Network Administrators</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 79.4558%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आवेदक ने,&nbsp;<strong>Science and Mathematic विषयो&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;से&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;12वीं पास&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;किया हो या</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">मान्यता प्राप्त संस्थान से&nbsp;<strong>Electronics and Communication or Information Technology&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;डिप्लोमा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;किया हो और</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>शैक्षणिक योग्यता&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की विस्तृत जानकारी हेतु आपको ध्यानपूर्वक&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती विज्ञापन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को पढ़ना होगा।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 20.5709%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Cameraman</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 79.4558%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">सभी आवेदको ने,&nbsp;<strong>cinematography&nbsp;</strong>मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;डिप्लोमा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;किया हो और</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आवेदक को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;कम्प्यूटर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;पर्याप्त ज्ञान&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;होना चाहिए आदि।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 20.5709%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Language Instructor</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 79.4558%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">उम्मीदवार ने, मान्यता प्राप्त संस्थान से&nbsp;<strong>Degree of bachelor education&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;प्राप्त किया हो।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 20.5709%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Stenographer Grade &ndash; I</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 79.4558%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Holding analogous post on a regular basis in the parent cadre or department</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">With six years of regular service in level-5 (Rs. 29200-92300) in the pay matrix or equivalent rendered after appointment thereto on regular basis in the parent cadre or department; or</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">With ten years &nbsp;of regular service in level-4 (Rs. 25500-92300) in the pay matrix or equivalent rendered after appointment thereto on regular basis in the parent cadre or department</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">विस्तृत व सम्पूर्ण जानकारी हेतु कृप्या भर्ती विज्ञापन को अवश्य पढ़ें।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 20.5709%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Staff Nurse</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250); width: 79.4558%;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Holding analogous post on a regular basis in the parent cadre or department</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">with five years regular service in the post rendered after appointment thereto on regular basis in levcl-6 (Rs.35400-112400) in the pay matrix or equivalent in the parent cadre or Department.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">विस्तृत व सम्पूर्ण जानकारी हेतु कृप्या भर्ती विज्ञापन को अवश्य पढ़ें।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_Online_In_Hyderabad_Police_Academy_Recruitment_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How to Apply Online In Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\">हमारे युवा व&nbsp; आवेदक जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;हैदराबाद पुलिस अकेडमी भर्ती 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना चाहते है उन्हें कुछ&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;स्टेप्स&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को फॉलो करना होगा जो कि, इस प्रकार से हैं &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;ऑफलाइन आवेदन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करने हेतु सबसे पहले आपको इसके&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.svpnpa.gov.in/static/gallery/docs/fc09c5a7758f47c098689dbbb9e94917.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">&nbsp;Official Advertisement Cum Application Form</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp; डाउनलोड करना होगा जो कि, इस प्रकार का होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">भर्ती विज्ञापन को डाउनलोड करने के बाद&nbsp; आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;पेज नंबर 12&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;पर आना होगा जहां पर आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एप्लीकेशन फॉर्म&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मिलेगा जो कि, इस प्रकार का होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">अब आपको इस&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;एप्लीकेशन फॉर्म&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;डाउनलोड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करके&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;प्रिंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;निकाल लेना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>प्रिंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;निकाल लेने के बाद&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आपको ध्यानपूर्वक, इस एप्लीकेशन फॉर्म&nbsp;</strong>को भरना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">मांगे जाने वाले सभी<strong>&nbsp;दस्तावेजों&nbsp;</strong>को&nbsp;<strong>स्व &ndash; सत्यापित&nbsp;</strong>करके&nbsp;<strong>एप्लीकेशन फॉर्म&nbsp;</strong>के साथ&nbsp;<strong>अटैच&nbsp;</strong>करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद आपको सभी&nbsp;<strong>दस्तावेजों सहित एप्लीकेशन फॉर्म&nbsp;</strong>को&nbsp;<strong>एक सफेद लिफाफे&nbsp;</strong>मे&nbsp;<strong>सुरक्षित&nbsp;</strong>रखना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;अन्त मे, आपको&nbsp;<strong>इस लिफाफे&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>को&nbsp;<strong>Assistant Director (Estt), SVP National Police Academy, Shivarampally, Hyderabad, 500 052&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के पते पर&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;11 मार्च, 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;से लेकर&nbsp;<strong>आगामी 42 दिनों&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के भीतर&nbsp;<strong>भेजना&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;होगा आदि।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">उपरोक्त सभी&nbsp; बिंदुओं की मदद से आप इस भर्ती मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर सकते है और&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नौकरी&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;प्राप्त करने का&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;सुनहरा अवसर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;प्राप्त कर सकते है।</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%95_%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B8\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>क्विक लिंक्स</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px dotted rgb(191, 237, 210);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Advertisement</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.svpnpa.gov.in/static/gallery/docs/fc09c5a7758f47c098689dbbb9e94917.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(191, 237, 210);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sctimst.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1712322346-Hyderabad Police Academy Recruitment 2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 01:05:46', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(294, 'BPSC Simultala Teacher Recruitment 2024', 'The Education Department, Government of Bihar, has released the BPSC Simultala Teacher Vacancy 2024 for 62 posts.', '<header class=\"entry-header\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt;\">BPSC Simultala Teacher Recruitment 2024</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online For School Teacher Vacancy</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Bihar Simultala Residential School has exciting opportunities for you! The school is inviting applications for the position of Teacher in various subjects. Read on to learn more about this recruitment drive and how you can be a part of this esteemed institution.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bpsc-simultala-teacher-recruitment-notification-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BPSC_Simultala_Teacher_Recruitment_Notification_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BPSC Simultala Teacher Recruitment Notification 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Below is the official notification for the BPSC Simultala Teacher Vacancy 2024. Candidates can access detailed information regarding eligibility, application link, and selection process via the provided link below. The application link for BPSC Simultala Teacher Vacancy 2024 will be active on the official website starting from April 25, 2024. Additionally, the direct PDF link for the BPSC Simultala Teacher Notification 2024 is available.<span id=\"Read_More_Vacancies\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bpsc-simultala-teacher-application-form-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BPSC_Simultala_Teacher_Application_Form_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BPSC Simultala Teacher Application Form 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Education Department, Government of Bihar, has released the BPSC Simultala Teacher Vacancy 2024 for 62 posts (Advt. No. 29/2024). The online application link will be active from April 25, 2024, to May 16, 2024. Detailed information regarding eligibility criteria, application link, selection procedure, and age limit for BPSC Simultala Teacher recruitment 2024 read further.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-about-bpsc-simultala-teacher-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"About_BPSC_Simultala_Teacher_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>About BPSC Simultala Teacher Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Oragnization:&nbsp;</strong>Bihar Public Service Commission</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Authority:&nbsp;</strong>Education Department Govt of Bihar</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Advt. No:&nbsp;</strong>29/2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>School:&nbsp;</strong>Simultala Residential School, Jamui</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name:&nbsp;</strong>Secondary and Higher Secondary Teacher</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Vacancy:&nbsp;</strong>62</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Job Area:&nbsp;</strong>Bihar</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Mode:&nbsp;</strong>Online</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Starting Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>25 April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>16 May 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website: .</strong>bpsc.bih.nic.in</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bpsc-simultala-teacher-vacancy-details-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BPSC_Simultala_Teacher_Vacancy_Details_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BPSC Simultala Teacher Vacancy Details 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-size: 12pt;\">The vacancies are distributed across various cities. Here are some of the cities where Axis Bank is hiring:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Secondary Teacher i.e. TGT:&nbsp;</strong>41</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Higher Secondary Teacher i.e. PGT:&nbsp;</strong>21</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Subjects Considered to be :</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mathematics</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Science</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">English</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Social Studies</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Hindi</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Physical Education</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bpsc-simultala-teacher-eligibility-criteria-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BPSC_Simultala_Teacher_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BPSC Simultala Teacher Eligibility Criteria 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h5 id=\"h-educational-qualification\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Educational_Qualification\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Educational Qualification:</strong></span></h5>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">For TGT Teacher:</span>&nbsp;</strong>Subjects for TGT include English, Hindi, Sanskrit, Physics, Mathematics, Chemistry, Biology, History, Geography, Political Science, Art &amp; Craft, Computer, Music, Dance, and Physical Education. Candidates must be graduates with a minimum of 55% marks and possess a B.Ed degree. Additionally, they should be qualified in Bihar TET/CTET and have at least 3 years of teaching experience as a TGT teacher in a higher secondary school.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><strong>For PGT Teacher:&nbsp;</strong></span>Subjects for PGT include Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, Botany, Zoology, History, Political Science, Geography, Economics, Sociology, Psychology, Civics, Home Science, Computer Science, Accounts, Business Studies, and Entrepreneurship. Candidates must hold a post-graduate degree in the relevant subject with at least 55% marks and possess a B.Ed degree. Additionally, they should have passed the Bihar TET or Central TET exam and have a minimum of 3 years of teaching experience as a PGT teacher in a higher secondary school.</span></p>\r\n<h5 id=\"h-age-limit\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Age_Limit\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit:</strong></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">As on 01 January 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum &ndash; 25 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum &ndash; 40 Years</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation : As per rules</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bpsc-simultala-teacher-recruitment-application-fee-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BPSC_Simultala_Teacher_Recruitment_Application_Fee_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BPSC Simultala Teacher Recruitment Application Fee 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>General / OBC / EWS &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Rs. 600/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SC / ST / PH &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Rs. 150/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Female (Bihar Domicile) &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;Rs. 150/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their exam fee through Online Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay the Exam Fee Through Offline Mode Only.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-bpsc-simultala-teacher-selection-process-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"BPSC_Simultala_Teacher_Selection_Process_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>BPSC Simultala Teacher Selection Process 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-size: 12pt;\">The selection process will involve three stages: a preliminary exam, a main examination, and an interview.</span></p>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-preliminary-examination\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Preliminary_Examination\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Preliminary Examination:</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Consists of 120 questions.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Time duration: 2 hours.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-main-examination\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Main_Examination\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Main Examination:</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Conducted in two shifts.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Each shift comprises questions totaling 300 marks.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Time duration: 2 hours per shift.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-interview-round\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Interview_Round\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Interview Round:</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Evaluation based on a scale of 100 marks.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-how-to-apply-for-bpsc-simultala-teacher-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_To_Apply_For_BPSC_Simultala_Teacher_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How To Apply For BPSC Simultala Teacher Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-follow-these-steps-to-submit-your-application\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span id=\"Follow_these_steps_to_submit_your_application\" style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\">Follow these steps to submit your application:</span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Visit the official website.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Look for the &ldquo;Recruitment&rdquo; section.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; button.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fill in the required details and upload your resume.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the application fee (if applicable).</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Submit your application before the deadline.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-dates-for-bpsc-simultala-teacher-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates_For_BPSC_Simultala_Teacher_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Dates For BPSC Simultala Teacher Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Starting Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>25 April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>16 May 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date For Fee Payment:&nbsp;</strong>16 May 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam date :</strong>&nbsp;May / June 2024</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-links\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-d7c7b9bbbdd37a5d5b924f1a48213c54\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-apply-online-visit-hereofficial-notification-check-hereofficial-website-click-here\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Apply_Online_Visit_HereOfficial_Notification_Check_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Visit Here</a><br>Official Notification:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/Notices/NB-2024-03-13-05.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Check Here</a><br>Official Website :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</div>', '1712323132-BPSC Simultala Teacher Recruitment 2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 01:18:52', NULL, NULL);
