(296, 'NEST Registration 2024', 'NEST Registration 2024 Online Apply Start, Eligibility & Application Fees – NEST 2024', '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>NEST Registration 2024&nbsp;</strong></h1>\r\n<hr>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.7745%; height: 36.8px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">Name of the Test</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.2574%; height: 36.8px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>National Entrance Screening Test&nbsp;(NEST)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.7745%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">Name of the Article</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.2574%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>NEST Registration 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.7745%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">Type of Article</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.2574%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Scholarship</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.7745%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">Who Can Apply?</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.2574%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">Every Eligible Applicant Can Apply.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.7745%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Last Date of Online Application?</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.2574%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;May 31, 2024 (midnight)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.7745%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Exam Mode</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.2574%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Computer Based Test ( CBT )</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.7745%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Timing Of Exam??</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.2574%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">9:00 AM &ndash; 12:30 PM &amp; 2:30 PM &ndash; 6:00 PM</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.7745%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">Detailed Information of&nbsp;<strong>NEST Registration 2024?</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.2574%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Please Read the Article Completely.</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span id=\"NEST_2024_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%8F_%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9F%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%B6%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%B6%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%81_%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%AC_%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%AC_%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%95_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%97%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9F%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%B6%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%94%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%88_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9F%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%B6%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B8_%E2%80%93_NEST_Registration_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>NEST 2024 के लिए रजिस्ट्रैशन प्रक्रिया शुरु, जाने कब से कब तक करना होगा रजिस्ट्रैशन और क्या है पूरा रजिस्ट्रैशन प्रोसेस &ndash; NEST Registration 2024?</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.4;\">हम, अपने इस आर्टिकल में अपन उन सभी मेधावी विद्यार्थियो को जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>National Entrance Screening Test&nbsp;(NEST)&nbsp;&nbsp;मे&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;दाखिला हेतु&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;प्रवेश परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की तैयारी कर रहे है तथा&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नेस्ट 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के जारी होने का इंतजार कर रहे है उन्हें हम, इस आर्टिकल की मदद से विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>NEST Registration 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; को लेकर तैयार&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिपोर्ट&nbsp;</strong> के बारे मे बतायेगे जिसकी पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त करने हेतु आपको हमारे साथ बने रहना होगा।</li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.4;\">यहां पर हम, आप सभी आवेदको को बताना चाहते है कि,&nbsp;<strong>NEST Registration 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;हेतु&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आपको ऑनलाइन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;फॉलो&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा जिसमे आपको कोई समस्या ना हो इसके लिए हम, आपको विस्तार से पूरी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रजिस्ट्रैशन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बतायेगे ताकि आप बिना किसी समस्या के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नेस्ट 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;हेतु&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर सके तथा</li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.4;\">अन्त, आर्टिकल के अन्तिम चरण मे हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong> प्रदान करेगें ताकि आप इसाी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Scheduled_Dates_and_Events_of_NEST_Registration_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Scheduled Dates and Events of NEST Registration 2024?</strong></h2>\r\n<hr>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Scheduled Events</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Scheduled Dates</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Registration / Online application opens</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>March 30, 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Online application closes</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>May 31, 2024 (midnight)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Download of admit card starts</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>June 15, 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Date of examination</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>June 30, 2024(Hours of examination: 9:00 AM &ndash; 12:30 PM &amp; 2:30 PM &ndash; 6:00 PM)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Announcement of results on NEST website</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>July 10, 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Category_Wise_Application_Fees_of_NEST_Registration_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Category Wise Application Fees of NEST Registration 2024?</strong></h2>\r\n<hr>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.9294%; height: 36.8px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><strong>Category</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3251%; height: 36.8px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.9294%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\">UR and OBC</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3251%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\">₹ 1,400 Rs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36.8px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 60.9294%; height: 36.8px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\">SC/ST/Divyangjan categories&nbsp;and for all female candidates</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3251%; height: 36.8px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\">₹ 700 Rs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span id=\"Required_Eligibility_For_NEST_Registration_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Required Eligibility For NEST Registration 2024</strong><strong>?</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">हमारे सभी विद्यार्थियो को कुछ योग्यताओं की पूर्ति करनी होगी जो कि, इस प्रकार से हैं &ndash;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Secures a position in the NEST merit list. Please refer to page 11 of this document for the rules of merit list preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Passed the XII standard board examination in the science stream in the years 2022 or 2023 or has appeared in 2024 from any recognised board in India.</li>\r\n<li>Secures at least 60% in aggregate in the XII standard board examination. For SC/ST/Divyangjan candidates, the requirement is 55%.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">उपरोक्त सभी योग्यताओं की पूर्ति के बाद आप सभी विद्यार्थी इस प्रवेश परीक्षा हेतु आवेदन कर सकते है।</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_Online_In_NEST_Registration_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>How to Apply Online In NEST Registration 2024?</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">हमारे सभी इच्छुक विद्यार्थी इस प्रवेश परीक्षा हेतु ऑनलाइन आवेदन कर सकते है जिसकी पूरी आवेदन प्रक्रिया कुछ इस प्रकार से हैं &ndash;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>NEST Registration 2024&nbsp;</strong>में ऑनलाइन आवेदन करने के लिए हमारे सभी विद्यार्थियो को सबसे पहले&nbsp;<strong>National Entrance Screening Test&nbsp;(NEST) की&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.nestexam.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Official Website&nbsp;</a></strong>के होम &ndash; पेज पर आना होगा जो कि, इस प्रकार का होगा &ndash;<hr></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><a title=\"Exam info blog nest home page image\" href=\"../../assets/files/NEST HOME PAGE IMAGE.webp\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-192075\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" title=\"NEST Registration 2024\" src=\"../../assets/files/NEST HOME PAGE IMAGE.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width: 541px) 100vw, 541px\" srcset=\"https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/7383-min.png 604w, https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/7383-min-287x300.png 287w, https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/7383-min-150x157.png 150w\" alt=\"NEST Registration 2024\" width=\"604\" height=\"631\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>होम &ndash; पेज पर आने के बाद आपको<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cdn3.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1834/88518/Registration.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Online Registration</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का विकल्प मिलेगा जिस पर आपको क्लिक करना होगा,</li>\r\n<li>क्लिक करने के बाद आपके सामने इसका&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;न्यू रजिस्ट्रैशन फॉर्म&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;खुल जायेगा जिसे आपको ध्यानपू्र्वक भरना होगा,</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><a title=\"Exam Info Blog nest 2024 apply online \" href=\"../../assets/files/nest form apply online.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-192076\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" title=\"NEST Registration 2024\" src=\"../../assets/files/nest form apply online.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width: 582px) 100vw, 582px\" srcset=\"https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/7384-min.png 1346w, https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/7384-min-300x141.png 300w, https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/7384-min-1024x482.png 1024w, https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/7384-min-768x362.png 768w, https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/7384-min-640x300.png 640w, https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/7384-min-150x71.png 150w\" alt=\"NEST Registration 2024\" width=\"1346\" height=\"634\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>इसके बादे आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;सबमिट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;ऑप्शन</strong>&nbsp;पर क्लिक करना होगा जिसके बाद आपको आपके&nbsp;<strong>रजिस्ट्रैशन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;स्लीप&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मिल जायेगी जिसे आपको&nbsp;<strong>प्रिंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर लेना होगा।</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span id=\"%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9F%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%AA_2_%E2%80%93_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9F%E0%A4%B2_%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%B2%E0%A5%89%E0%A4%97%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%82_%E0%A4%94%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%91%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%87%E0%A4%AE_%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%B5%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%82\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>स्टेप 2 &ndash; पोर्टल मे लॉगिन करें और ऑनलाइम आवेदन करें</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>पोर्टल पर सफलतापूर्वक पंजीकरण करने के बादे आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;पोर्टल मे लॉगिन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा,</li>\r\n<li>पोर्टल मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;लॉगिन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करने के बाद आपको&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://biharhelp.in/bihar-deled-admit-card-2024/\">&nbsp;APPLY NOW</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का विकल्प मिलेगा जिस पर आपको क्लिक करना होगा,</li>\r\n<li>क्लिक करने के बाद आपके सामने इसका आवेदन फॉर्म खुलेगा जिसे आपको ध्यान से भरना होगा</li>\r\n<li>मांगे जाने वाले सभी दस्तावेजो को स्कैन करके अपलोड करना होगा और</li>\r\n<li>अन्त में, आपको&nbsp;<strong>परीक्षा शुल्क का ऑनलाइन पेमेंट करके सबमिट के विकल्प पर क्लिक कर देना होगा और इसकी रसीद प्राप्त कर लेनी होगी आदि।</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>अन्त, इस प्रकार हमारे सभी विद्यार्थी इस प्रवेश परीक्षा हेतु आवेदन कर सकते है और&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;प्रवेश परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे हिस्सा लेने का<strong>&nbsp;सुनहरा अवसर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;प्राप्त कर सकते है।</p>\r\n<h2><span id=\"%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B7%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B7\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>निष्कर्ष</strong></h2>\r\n<p>अपने इस आर्टिकल मे, हमने अपने सभी मेधावी विद्यार्थियो को विस्तार से&nbsp;<a href=\"https://biharhelp.in/bihar-deled-admit-card-2024/\"><strong>NEST Registration 2024</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>की&nbsp;पूरी जानकारी व पूरी ऑनलाइन आवेदन प्रक्रिया की जानकारी प्रदान की ताकि आप सभी जल्द से जल्द अपना आवेदन कर सकें और इस प्रवेश परीक्षा की तैयारी कर सकें तथा</p>\r\n<p>अन्त, हम उम्मीद व आशा करते है कि, आपको हमारा यह आर्टिकल बेहद पसंद आया होगा जिसके लिए आप हमारे इस आर्टिकल को लाइक करेगे, शेयर करेगे और अपने विचार व सुझाव भी कमेंट करके सांक्षा करेगे।</p>\r\n<h2><span id=\"NEST_Exam_Form_2022_%E2%80%93_%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%82%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A3_%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B8\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>NEST Exam Form 2022 &ndash; महत्वपूर्ण लिंक्स</strong></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 100.027%;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong><br></strong>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://cdn3.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1834/88518/Registration.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Online Registration</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 37.8929%;\"><strong>Direct Link to Apply Online</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 62.1337%;\">\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://cdn3.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1834/88518/login.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><u>Already registered? Click here to Log-in</u></a></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 37.8929%;\"><strong>Official Advertisement</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 62.1337%;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.nestexam.in/docs/24/NEST2024_Brochure_Syllabus-v3.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">NEST 2024 Information Brochure &amp; Syllabus</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 37.8929%;\">Official Website</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 62.1337%;\"><a href=\"https://www.nestexam.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1712324386-NEST Registration 2024.webp', '17', 1, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 01:39:46', NULL, NULL),
(297, 'NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024', 'New India Assurance Company Limited (NIACL) has invited applications for the Assistant Posts in February 2024.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(251, 238, 184);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024</strong></span></h1>\r\n<h4 class=\"table-h4title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>(New India Assurance Company Limited (NIACL))</strong></span></h4>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">IMPORTANT DATES</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Examination &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;02 March 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">VACANCY DETAILS</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Name &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;NIACL Assistant Recruitment 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No of Posts &ndash;</strong>&nbsp;300 Posts</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">STATUS OF ADMIT CARD</span></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"table-centeralign\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Available</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3 class=\"table-titleunderline\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\">MODE OF EXAM</span></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online Examination</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<div id=\"text-160\" class=\"widget widget_text widget-shortcode area-submit-resume-inner-top \">\r\n<div class=\"textwidget\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"custom_html-2\" class=\"widget_text widget widget_custom_html widget-shortcode area-arbitrary \">\r\n<div class=\"textwidget custom-html-widget\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">New India Assurance Company Limited (NIACL) has invited applications for the Assistant Posts in February 2024. Check More Details on Now, The NIACL is going to organize the NIACL Assistant Prelims Exam 2024 on 02 March 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><u>NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">As per the official notification, it is to be hereby inform that the NIACL Assistant Prelims Exam 2024 will be conducted on 02 March 2024 &amp; the admit card link has been released few days before the examination. Candidates may download their NIACL Assistant Prelims Admit Card 2024 (Sarkari Result) from this page. For getting more information regarding NIACL Assistant Prelims Exam 2024, candidates need to maintain a frequent check on the Portal .</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Now, All the candidates are advised to maintain the decorum of Examination Hall &amp; be on time as their will be pre examination formalities over there. SarkariExam.com&nbsp; wishes all the very best to all candidates, Study well and practice as much as possible.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Instructions for Downloading the NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1. In order to download their NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024, Candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3. Candidates will be redirected to Login Page, Here they have to provide their following details-:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Registration No. / Login ID / Roll No.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Password / DOB</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Verification Code (if specified)</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">4. After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to download their NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">5. Candidates can also download their NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024 from official site of the NIACL.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"important-linkstable\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42); text-decoration: underline;\">Important Links</span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Download Pre Marks</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.newindia.co.in/recruitment/mark-sheets/assistant-recruitment-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Download Pre Result</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.newindia.co.in/assets/docs/recruitment/RECRUITMENT-OF-ADMINISTRATIVE-OFFICERS2023/Result%20of%20Tier%20I%20Exam%20-%20Assistant%20RE%202023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Download Pre Admit Card</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/niacljan24/oecla_febr24/login.php?appid=198e61b6393ffb5465d24a25853c41b8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Apply Online</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/niacljan24/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Download Notification</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.newindia.co.in/assets/docs/recruitment/RECRUITMENT-OF-ADMINISTRATIVE-OFFICERS2023/DETAILED%20ENGLISH%20ADVERTISEMENT%20-%20ASSISTANT%20RECRUITMENT%202023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Official website</span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"yellowbg\" style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.newindia.co.in/portal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CLICK HERE</a></span></h3>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1712324456-NIACL Assistant Prelims Result 2024.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 01:40:56', NULL, NULL),
(298, 'Axis Bank Recruitment 2024', 'Axis Bank, one of India’s leading private sector banks, has announced recruitment for Assistant positions in various cities.', '<header class=\"entry-header\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\">Axis Bank Recruitment 2024</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Apply Online For Assistant Posts (City Wise Vacancy)</span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2024-04-05T17:29:07+05:30\"></time></span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Axis Bank, one of India&rsquo;s leading private sector banks, has announced recruitment for Assistant positions in various cities. If you&rsquo;re interested in joining a dynamic team and contributing to the growth of a prestigious financial institution, read on!</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-axis-bank-recruitment-notification-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Axis_Bank_Recruitment_Notification_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Axis Bank Recruitment Notification 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The most recent notification for Axis Bank Recruitment 2024 has been unveiled on the National Career Service portal. This recruitment drive aims to Assistant positions. The total number of vacancies advertised in the Axis Bank Recruitment Notification for 2024 amounts to 31 posts. Interested and eligible candidates can apply on or before 30 April 2024.<span id=\"Read_More_Vacancies\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-axis-bank-application-form-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Axis_Bank_Application_Form_2024\"><strong>Axis Bank Application Form 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online applications for Advertisement Number Axis Bank Assistant Recruitment 2024 will be accepted starting from April 4, 2024, on the official website (ncs.gov.in). Eligible candidates are advised to carefully follow the provided instructions and complete the application process. Ensure your presence by submitting your application within the specified timeframe.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-about-axis-bank-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(45, 194, 107); font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"About_Axis_Bank_Recruitment_2024\"><strong>About Axis Bank Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Company Name:</strong>&nbsp;Majhi Pargana Welfare Society</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of Recruitment:&nbsp;</strong>Axis Bank Recruitment 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name:</strong>&nbsp;Assistant</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Vacancy:</strong>&nbsp;31</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Job Area:</strong>&nbsp;All India</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Mode:&nbsp;</strong>Online</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Starting Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>04 April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>31 May 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website:&nbsp;</strong>axisbank.com</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-axis-bank-vacancy-details-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Axis_Bank_Vacancy_Details_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Axis Bank Vacancy Details 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\">The vacancies are distributed across various cities. Here are some of the cities where Axis Bank is hiring:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mumbai</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Delhi</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Bangalore</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Chennai</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kolkata</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Hyderabad</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pune</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Ahmedabad</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Jaipur</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Lucknow</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-axis-bank-eligibility-criteria-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Axis_Bank_Eligibility_Criteria_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Axis Bank Eligibility Criteria 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Educational Qualification:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have completed their 12th grade.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The age limit must be between 18 and 30 years.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-axis-bank-vacancy-application-fee-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Axis_Bank_Vacancy_Application_Fee_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Axis Bank Vacancy Application Fee 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Gen/ OBC/ EWS/ :&nbsp;</strong>₹ 0/-</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SC/ ST/ PwD/:&nbsp;</strong>₹ 0/-</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-axis-bank-assistant-contact-details\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Axis_Bank_Assistant_Contact_Details\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Axis Bank Assistant Contact Details</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Content Person Name:</strong>&nbsp;HR TEAM</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Content Number:&nbsp;</strong>8910607067</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Email.Id:</strong>&nbsp;info.corporate08@gmail.com</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-axis-bank-assistant-job-description\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Axis_Bank_Assistant_Job_Description\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Axis Bank Assistant Job Description</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Axis Bank has announced recruitment for the position of Assistant, inviting applications from individuals who have completed their 12th grade. Applicants should be between the ages of 18 and 30 to be eligible for this recruitment. Additionally, candidates are required to possess good communication skills and basic computer knowledge. The selection process for this recruitment will involve interviews.</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-how-to-apply-for-axis-bank-assistant-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_To_Apply_For_Axis_Bank_Assistant_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How To Apply For Axis Bank Assistant Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Visit the official Axis Bank careers page.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Click on the &ldquo;Recruitment&rdquo; section.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Look for the Assistant recruitment notification.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Read the detailed advertisement carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Click on the &ldquo;Apply Now&rdquo; button.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fill in the required details, upload necessary documents, and submit your application.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-dates-for-axis-bank-recruitment-2024\" class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Dates_For_Axis_Bank_Recruitment_2024\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates For Axis Bank Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Starting Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>04 April 2024</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Last Date of Application:&nbsp;</strong>31 May 2024</span></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"h-important-links\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-e5ecb86ddb45a0308d98b540eaf6df95\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<h4 id=\"h-apply-online-visit-hereofficial-notification-check-hereofficial-website-click-here\" class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Apply_Online_Visit_HereOfficial_Notification_Check_HereOfficial_Website_Click_Here\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.axisbank.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Visit Here</a><br>Official Notification:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.axisbank.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Check Here</a><br>Official Website :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.axisbank.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h4>\r\n</div>', '1712325286-Axis-Bank-Recruitment-2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 01:54:46', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(299, 'DSSSB Answer Key 2024', 'DSSSB Answer Key 2024 Download PDF Link, Check for Various Posts Exam and File Objections', '<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li><strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024:&nbsp;</strong>वे सभी परीक्षार्थी व अभ्यर्थी जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>DSSSB&nbsp;</strong>द्धारा<strong>&nbsp;2 मार्च से लेकर 31 मार्च, 2024 के बीच&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे आयोेजित&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;अलग &ndash; अलग भर्ती परीक्षाओं&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को देने के बाद अपने &ndash; अपने&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के जारी होने का&nbsp;<strong>इंतजार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर रहे है तो आपके लिए धमाकेदार खुशखबरी है कि, आपके&nbsp;<strong>इंतजार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की&nbsp;<strong>घड़िया खत्म&nbsp;</strong>हो चुकी है क्योंकि&nbsp;<strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को जारी कर दिया गया है जिसकी पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी हम,&nbsp; आपको इस आर्टिकल मे प्रदान करेगें जिसके लिए आपको ध्यानपूर्वक इस आर्टिकल को पढ़ना होगा।</li>\r\n<li>यहां पर हम, आपको बताना चाहते है कि,&nbsp;<strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक व डाउनलोड करने के लिए आपको&nbsp; अपने साथ अपना&nbsp;<strong>Login Details&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को तैयार रखना होगा ताकि आसानी से&nbsp; अपने &ndash; अपने&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की&nbsp;</strong>को चेक कर सकें औऱ इसका पूरा &ndash; पूरा लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें तथा</li>\r\n<li>आर्टिकल के अन्तिम चरण मे हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong>प्रदान करेगें ताकि आप इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका ला्भ प्राप्त कर सकते है।\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024</strong></h2>\r\n<hr>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1601%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">Name of the Board</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8162%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Delhi Subordinate Services Selection Board (DSSSB)&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1601%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">Name of the Article</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8162%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1601%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Advertisement Number</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8162%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>06/22, 07/22, 01/24, 02/22, 07/22, 02/23, 01/23, 03/23</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1601%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Exam Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8162%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>02nd March, 2024 to 31st March, 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1601%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\">Type of Article</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8162%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Result</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1601%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Live Status of DSSSB Answer Key 2024?</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8162%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Released and Live To Check &amp; Download</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1601%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024 Release On?</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8162%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>05th April, 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18.4px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.1601%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Detailed Information of DSSSB Answer Key 2024?</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.8162%; height: 18.4px; border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Please Read The Article Article Completely.</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><span id=\"DSSSB_%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%85%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%97_%E2%80%93_%E0%A4%85%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%97_%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%82_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%B8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%AF%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%97%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%82_%E0%A4%9A%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%95_%E0%A4%B5_%E0%A4%A1%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%89%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%B2%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%A1_%E2%80%93_DSSSB_Answer_Key_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>DSSSB ने किया अलग &ndash; अलग भर्तियां का आंसर की जारी, जाने कैसे कर पायेगें चेक व डाउनलोड &ndash; DSSSB Answer Key 2024?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>इस आर्टिकल मे हम, आप&nbsp;सभी&nbsp;<strong>उम्मीदवारों&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;हार्दिक&nbsp;स्वागत&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना चाहते है जो कि,&nbsp; अपने &ndash; अपने&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>उत्तर कुंजी&nbsp;</strong>को चेक व डाउनलोड करना चाहते है&nbsp;उन्हें&nbsp;समर्पित इस आर्टिकल&nbsp;मे हम,&nbsp;आपको विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे बताना चाहते है जिसकी पूरी विस्तृत जानकारी प्राप्त करने हेतु आपको ध्यानपूर्वक इस आर्टिकल को पढना होगा।</p>\r\n<p>दूसरी तरफ हम, आपको बताना चाहते है कि, <strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>को चेक व डाउनलोड करने हेतु आपको&nbsp;<strong>ऑनलाइन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>को&nbsp;<strong>फॉलो&nbsp;</strong>करना&nbsp; होगा ताकि आप आसानी से&nbsp;<strong>आंसर की&nbsp;</strong>को चेक व डाउनलोड कर सके औऱ इसका पूरा &ndash; पूरा लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें तथा</p>\r\n<p>आर्टिकल के अन्तिम चरण मे हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong>प्रदान करेगें ताकि आप इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका ला्भ प्राप्त कर सकते है।</p>\r\n<h2><span id=\"How_To_Check_Download_DSSSB_Answer_Key_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>How To Check &amp; Download DSSSB Answer Key 2024?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>हमारे वे सभी परीक्षार्थी जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;अलग &ndash; अलगो पदों&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की / उत्तर कुंजी&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक करना चाहते है वे इन स्टेप्स को फॉलो करके&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक कर सकते है जो कि, इस प्रकार से हैं &ndash;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024&nbsp;</strong>को चेक व डाउनलोड&nbsp; करने के लिए सबसे पहले आपको इसके&nbsp;<strong><a title=\"Exam info blog dsssb official website\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/doit/tab-content/answer-keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&nbsp;Official Website</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;पर आना होगा जो कि, इस प्रकार&nbsp; का होगा &ndash;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><a title=\"exam info blog dsssb official image\" href=\"https://examinfo.blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"aligncenter\" title=\"DSSSB Answer Key 2024\" src=\"../../assets/files/dsssb_web_banner2.jpg\" alt=\"DSSSB Answer Key 2024\" width=\"1362\" height=\"379\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>होम &ndash; पेज पर आने के बाद&nbsp; आपको&nbsp;<a title=\"Exam info blog dsssb answer key pdf link\" href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1258/88054/login.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024</strong></a>&nbsp;का विकल्प मिलेगा जिस पर आपको क्लिक करना होगा,</li>\r\n<li>क्लिक करने के बाद आपके सामने इसका&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;खुल जायेगा जो कि, इस प्रकार का होगा &ndash;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/6030-min.png\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-182740\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" title=\"DSSSB Answer Key 2024\" src=\"../../assets/files/dsssb_web_login_page_image.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width: 541px) 100vw, 541px\" srcset=\"https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/6030-min.png 696w, https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/6030-min-300x274.png 300w, https://biharhelp.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/6030-min-150x137.png 150w\" alt=\"DSSSB Answer Key 2024\" width=\"696\" height=\"636\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>अब यहां पर आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;Login Details&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को दर्ज करना होगा और<strong>&nbsp;पोर्टल मे लॉगिन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा,</li>\r\n<li>पोर्टल मे&nbsp;<strong>लॉगिन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करने के बाद आपके सामने&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;इसका डैशबोर्ड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;खुल जायेगा,</li>\r\n<li>अब यहां पर आप जिस&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती परीक्षा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक करना चाहते है उस पर आपको क्लिक करना होगा औऱ</li>\r\n<li>अन्त मे, आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;सबमिट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>ऑप्शन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;पर क्लिक करना होगा जिसके बाद आपको&nbsp; आपका&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;दिखा दिया जायेगा जिसे आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;डाउनलोड&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करके&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;प्रिंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर लेना होगा आदि।</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>उपरोक्त सभी स्टेप्स को फॉलो करके आप इस किसी भी भर्ती के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक कर सकते है औऱ इसका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकते है।</p>\r\n<h2><span id=\"%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%B6\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>सारांश</strong></h2>\r\n<p>इस आर्टिकल मे हमने आपको विस्तार से ना केवल&nbsp;<a title=\"Exam info blog latest jobs\" href=\"https://examinfo.blog/lastest-jobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>DSSSB Answer Key 2024</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>के बारे मे बताया बल्कि हमने आपको विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को चेक करने की पूरी &ndash; पूरी प्रक्रिया के बारे मे बताया ताकि आप आसानी से अपने &ndash; अपने&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आंसर की</strong>&nbsp;को चेक कर सकें औऱ इसका लाभ प्राप्त कर सके तथा</p>\r\n<p>आर्टिकल के अन्तिम चऱण मे हम, आपसे उम्मीद करते है कि, आपको हमारा यह आर्टिकल बेहद पसंद आया होगा जिसके लिए आप हमारे इस&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आर्टिकल&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;लाईक, शेयर व कमेंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करेगें।</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Direct Link To Download DSSSB Answer Key 2024</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><a href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com//EForms/configuredHtml/1258/88054/login.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a>&nbsp;( Link Is Active Now )</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><a href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>ClicK Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '1712325369-DSSSB Answer Key 2024.webp', '16', 1, 'Y', '2024-04-05 00:00:00', '2024-04-05 01:56:41', NULL, NULL),
(300, 'Delhi Judicial Service Examination 2023 Admit Card', 'Delhi Judicial Service Exam Online Form 2023 : Delhi High Court DHC has issued an Judicial Service Examination Notification 2023.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(236, 202, 250);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"668\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(185, 106, 217); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>High Court of Delhi, New Delhi </strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Delhi High Court Judicial Service Exam Recruitment 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 196, 15); font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Delihi High Court Judicial Service Exam 2023 : &nbsp;Short Details of Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"344\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin : <strong>07/11/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>22/11/2023 upto 05:30 PM Only.</strong></span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee&nbsp;Last Date : <strong>22/11/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Prelim Exam Date : <strong>17 December 2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available :<strong> 12/12/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Available :<strong> 20/12/2023</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Available :<strong> 02/02/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Admit Card Available :<strong> 05/04/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"324\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">General <strong>: 1500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>400/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Fee Mode Only</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"668\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Delhi High Court Judicial Service Notification 2023 : <span style=\"color: red;\">Age Limit as on 01/01/2023</span></strong></span></em></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>NA</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>32 Years</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Delhi Judicial Service Exam 2023 Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"668\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: red;\"><strong>Delhi High Court Judicial Service Recruitment 2023 : <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details</span></strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong> Total 53 Post</strong><strong> &nbsp;</strong></span></span></em></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"172\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"54\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Gen</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"44\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SC</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>ST</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"64\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Delhi Judicial Service Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"172\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Delhi High Court Judicial Service Exam 2023</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"54\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">34</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"44\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">05</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">14</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"64\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">53</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"293\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Law (LLB) in Any Recognized University in India.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"668\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">How to Fill DHC Judicial Service Recruitment 2023 Online Form</span> </strong></em></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Delhi High Court DHC Latest Job Recruitment for Judicial Service Recruitment 2023 Batch Vacancies. Candidate Can Apply Between<strong> 07/11/2023 to 22/11/2023 Apply Online.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Delhi High Court Recruitment 2023.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(236, 202, 250);\" colspa