align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Download NTA JEEMAIN Syllabus 2024\" href=\"https://jeemain.nta.ac.in/images/syllabus-for-jee-main-2024-as-on-01-november-2023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here </a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 47.7339%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: indigo; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); width: 52.1966%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"NTA JEEMAIN Official Website 2024\" href=\"https://jeemain.nta.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">JEEMAIN Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1714143644-JEE MAINS Sessions II April 2024 Result.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-04-26 00:00:00', '2024-04-26 03:00:44', NULL, NULL),
(345, 'PMKISAN 18th installment release', 'PM-KISAN 18th installment release Your PM-KISAN status, including the status of your payments', '<h1 class=\"post-title\">PM to release 18th installment of PM-KISAN scheme</h1>\r\n<h2 class=\"post-summary\">Prime Minister Announces Release of 18th Installment of PM-KISAN Scheme The Prime Minister has officially announced the release of the 18th installment of the PM-KISAN scheme, a vital initiative aimed at providing financial support to farmers across India. This crucial update reinforces the government\'s commitment to enhancing agricultural development and ensuring that farmers receive timely assistance. The PM-KISAN scheme, which delivers direct cash transfers to eligible farmers, continues to play a significant role in alleviating economic pressures and promoting agricultural growth. In this latest installment, beneficiaries will receive [specific amount or details, if available], which will be directly deposited into their bank accounts. This step is part of the ongoing efforts to support rural livelihoods and boost the agricultural sector\'s sustainability. Stay informed about the benefits, eligibility criteria, and other important details of the PM-KISAN scheme as the government continues to prioritize farmer welfare and agricultural advancement.</h2>\r\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center post-details-meta mb-4\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"post-image\">\r\n<div class=\"post-image-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"show-on-page-load\">\r\n<div id=\"post-detail-slider\" class=\"post-detail-slider slick-initialized slick-slider\">\r\n<div class=\"slick-list draggable\">\r\n<div class=\"slick-track\">\r\n<div class=\"post-detail-slider-item slick-slide slick-current slick-active\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slick-index=\"0\" aria-hidden=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"post-detail-slider-item slick-slide\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-slick-index=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"img-fluid center-image\" src=\"https://tazblog.com/uploads/images/202408/image_870x_66b748de30508.webp\" alt=\"PM to release 18th installment of PM-KISAN scheme\" width=\"856\" height=\"570\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"post-detail-slider-nav\" class=\"post-detail-slider-nav\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"post-text mt-4\">\r\n<h1>18th Installment of PM-KISAN Scheme</h1>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prime Minister Narendra Modi released the 17th installment&nbsp;of the Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi (PM-KISAN) scheme on June 18, 2024, from Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh. Under this scheme, over ₹20,000 crore was transferred to the accounts of 9.26 crore farmers.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"pm-kisan-status\">PM Kisan Status</h2>\r\n<p>To check your pm kisan beneficiary status, follow these simple steps:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Visit Official Site</strong>: Go to the PM-KISAN portal at&nbsp;<a title=\"Pm Kisan Official Website\" href=\"https://pmkisan.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://pmkisan.gov.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Access \'Farmer\'s Corner\'</strong>: Click on the \'Farmer\'s Corner\' section found on the homepage.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Select \'Beneficiary Status\'</strong>: Choose the \'<a title=\"PM Kisan Beneficery Status Check\" href=\"https://pmkisan.gov.in/BeneficiaryStatus_New.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Know Your Status</a>\' option to proceed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Enter Required Details</strong>: Input either your Registration Number to search for your status.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Submit and View Status</strong>: Click on the \'Get OTP\' button and submit the received OTP on the registered mobile number. Your PM-KISAN status, including the status of your payments, will be displayed on the screen.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>', '1723450313-PM-Kisaan-18th-Kist-2024-min-1024x576.jpg', '17', 13, 'Y', '2024-08-12 00:00:00', '2024-08-12 08:11:53', NULL, NULL),
(346, 'SBI Hikes Lending Rate', 'The State Bank of India (SBI) has announced a hike in its lending rates', '<h1 class=\"title\">SBI Hikes Lending Rate: EMIs Increase for Borrowers Across Tenors</h1>\r\n<div class=\"post-summary\">\r\n<h2>The State Bank of India (SBI) has announced a hike in its lending rates across all tenors, leading to an increase in EMIs for borrowers. This change impacts home loans, auto loans, and personal loans, potentially raising monthly payments for many. In this update, we break down how the rate hike will affect your EMI, the reasons behind the decision, and what borrowers can do to manage the increased costs.</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"post-author-meta sp-left\"><a class=\"m-r-0\" href=\"https://tazblog.com/profile/technicalaman\"><img src=\"https://tazblog.com/uploads/profile/202408/avatar_4_66c182b032694.webp\" alt=\"TechnicalAman\"></a></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"post-meta\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"post-author-meta sp-left\"><a class=\"m-r-0\" href=\"https://tazblog.com/profile/technicalaman\">TechnicalAman</a></span>\r\n<div class=\"post-details-meta-date\"><span class=\"sp-left\">Aug 17, 2024&nbsp;-&nbsp;12:56</span><span class=\"sp-left sp-post-update-date\">Updated: Aug 17, 2024 - 13:02</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"post-details-meta-date\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"post-image\">\r\n<div class=\"post-image-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"show-on-page-load\">\r\n<div id=\"post-detail-slider\" class=\"post-detail-slider slick-initialized slick-slider\">\r\n<div class=\"slick-list draggable\">\r\n<div class=\"slick-track\">\r\n<div class=\"post-detail-slider-item slick-slide slick-current slick-active\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slick-index=\"0\" aria-hidden=\"false\"><img class=\"img-responsive center-image\" src=\"https://tazblog.com/uploads/images/202408/image_870x_66c05015b2eda.webp\" alt=\"SBI Hikes Lending Rate: EMIs Increase for Borrowers Across Tenors\">An informative graphic showing the State Bank of India (SBI) logo with a backdrop of rising interest rate charts and an upward arrow symbolizing increased EMIs. The image includes visual elements such as a calculator and loan documents, representing the impact on borrowers\' monthly payments. The graphic aims to convey the message of how the recent SBI rate hike will affect various types of loans and increase financial burdens for many borrowers.</div>\r\n<div class=\"post-detail-slider-item slick-slide\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-slick-index=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"img-responsive center-image\" src=\"https://tazblog.com/uploads/images/202408/image_870x_66c05015b2eda.webp\" alt=\"SBI Hikes Lending Rate: EMIs Increase for Borrowers Across Tenors\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"post-detail-slider-nav\" class=\"slider-nav post-detail-slider-nav\"><button class=\"prev slick-arrow slick-disabled\" aria-disabled=\"true\"></button>&nbsp;<button class=\"next slick-arrow\" aria-disabled=\"false\"></button></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"post-text\">\r\n<p><strong>New Delhi: State Bank of India, the country\'s biggest lender, has raised the Marginal Cost of Funds-based Lending Rate (MCLR) by 10 basis points (0.1 percentage point), across tenors, making most of the consumer loans costlier.</strong><br><br></p>\r\n<p>This is the third time in a row that the bank has increased MCLR. The benchmark one-year tenor MCLR, which is used to price most consumer loans such as auto and personal, is now pegged higher at 8.95 per cent against the earlier rate of 8.85 per cen...<br><br></p>\r\n<p>The three-year MCLR is 9.10 per cent, while the two-year is now 9.05 per cent, up 10 basis points. Among others, the rates of one-month, three-month and six-month tenors are in the range of 8.45-8.85 per cent. The MCLR on overnight tenor will be 8.2...<br><br></p>\r\n<p>Among others, the rates of one-month, three-month and six-month tenors are in the range of 8.45-8.85 per cent. The MCLR on overnight tenor will be 8.20 per cent against 8.10 per cent.<br><br></p>\r\n<p>The rate hike has come days after RBI kept its benchmark lending rate unchanged at 6.5 per cent for the ninth consecutive time earlier this month.</p>\r\n</div>', '1723965416-24856.jpg', '18', 13, 'Y', '2024-08-18 00:00:00', '2024-08-18 07:19:23', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(347, 'IBPS PO 2024 Online Application Deadline Extended to August', 'The Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS) has extended the application deadline for the Probationary Officer (PO) 2024 exam to August 28.', '<p><strong>IBPS PO 2024:</strong>&nbsp; क्या आप भी&nbsp;<strong>IBPS&nbsp;</strong>के तहत&nbsp;<strong>पंजाब नैशनल बैंक, SBI, UCO Bank और अन्य</strong><strong>&nbsp;बैंको&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>PO / MT&nbsp;</strong>की&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नौकरी&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;प्राप्त करके अपना&nbsp;<strong>करियर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;बनाना चाहते है उनके लिए हम,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;धमाकेदार भर्ती&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;लेकर आये है जिसके तहत हम, आपको इस लेख मे विस्तार से&nbsp;<strong>IBPS PO 2024</strong>&nbsp;के बारे में बतायेगे&nbsp; जिसके लिए आपको अन्त कत हमारे साथ बने रहना होगा ताकि आप पूरी जानकारी प्राप्त करके जल्द से जल्द इस भर्ती मे अप्लाई कर सकें और इसका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</p>\r\n<p>यहां पर हम, आपको बता दें कि,&nbsp;<strong>IBPS PO 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>के तहत&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;रिक्त कुल 4,455 पदों&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;पर भर्ती की जायेगी जिसके लिए&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;ऑनलाइन आ<a href=\"../../\">वे</a>दन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;1 अगस्त, 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;से शुरु कर दिया गाय है जिसमें आप सभी युवा आसानी से&nbsp;<strong>28 अगस्त, 2024 ( ऑनलाइन आवेदन की अन्तिम तिथि )&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;तक&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;अप्लाई&nbsp;</strong>कर सकते है तथा लेख के अन्त में हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong>प्रदान करेगे करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें तथा अपना&nbsp;<strong>करियर&nbsp;</strong> बना सकें।</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>IBPS PO 2024 &ndash; Overview</strong></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\">Name of the Institute</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Insitute of Banking Personnel&nbsp; Selection Board</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\">Name of the Article</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>IBPS PO 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\">Type of Article</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Latest Job</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\">Who Can Apply?</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>All India Applicants Can Apply</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Name of Post</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>PROBATIONARY OFFICERS/ MANAGEMENT TRAINEES</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>No of Vacancies</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>4,455 Vacancies</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Required&nbsp;</strong><strong>Qualification</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Graduation Passed</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Age Limit</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Minimum: 20 years Maximum: 30 years</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Mode of Application</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Online</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Online Application Starts From?</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>01st August, 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 36px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Last Date of Online Application?</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 36px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>28th August, 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.4152%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 62.5877%; height: 18px; padding: 0px;\"><a title=\"ibps\" href=\"https://www.ibps.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2><span id=\"IBPS_%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B2%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%93_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%88_%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8_%E0%A4%AC%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%95_%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%87_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%97%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A4%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%97%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%80_%E0%A4%94%E0%A4%B0_%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%88_%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%B5%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE_%E2%80%93_IBPS_PO_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>IBPS ने निकाली पी.ओ की नई भर्ती, जाने किस बैंक मे होगी कितनी होगी भर्ती और क्या है आवेदन प्रक्रिया &ndash; IBPS PO 2024?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>अपने इस आर्टिकल में हम, आप सभी&nbsp;युवाओं का&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;हार्दिक स्वागत&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना चाहते है जो कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;बैंकिंग सेक्टर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>करियर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;बनाना चाहते है और इसीलिए हम, आपको इस लेख मे विस्तार से&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>IBPS PO 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के बारे में बतायेगे जिसकी पूरी विस्तृ़त जानकारी प्राप्त करने के लिए आपको हमारे साथ बने रहना होगा ताकि आप पूरी &ndash; पूरी जानकारी प्राप्त कर सकें और&nbsp;&nbsp;ैनौकरी पाने का सुनहरा अवसर प्राप्त कर सकें।</p>\r\n<p><br><br><br></p>\r\n<p>साथ ही साथ हम, आपको बता दें कि,&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;IBPS PO 2024&nbsp;</strong>मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;हेतु&nbsp;<strong>अप्लाई&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करने के लिए आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;ऑनलाइन आवेदन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;अपनाते हुए&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;अप्लाई करना होगा जिसमे आपको कोई समस्या ना हो&nbsp; इसके लिए हम, आपको पूरी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की&nbsp;<strong>जानकरी प्रदान&nbsp;</strong>करेगे ताकि आप बिना किसी समस्या के इस&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;भर्ती&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;आवेदन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर सकें तथा</p>\r\n<p>लेख के अन्त में हम, आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong>प्रदान करेगे करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें तथा अपना&nbsp;<strong>करियर&nbsp;</strong> बना सकें।</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Time Line of IBPS PO Recruitment 2024?</strong></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"tb-r1\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.9336%; padding: 0px;\" width=\"60%\">Important Events</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 47.0688%; padding: 0px;\" width=\"40%\">Dates</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tb-r2\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.9336%; padding: 0px;\" width=\"60%\">Commencement of online registration of application</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 47.0688%; padding: 0px;\" width=\"40%\">01/08/2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tb-r1\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.9336%; padding: 0px;\" width=\"60%\">Closure of registration of application</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 47.0688%; padding: 0px;\" width=\"40%\">28/08/2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tb-r2\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.9336%; padding: 0px;\" width=\"60%\">Closure for editing application details</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 47.0688%; padding: 0px;\" width=\"40%\">28/08/2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tb-r1\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.9336%; padding: 0px;\">Last date for printing your application</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 47.0688%; padding: 0px;\">05/09/2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tb-r2\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.9336%; padding: 0px;\">Online Fee Payment</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 47.0688%; padding: 0px;\">01/08/2024 to 21/08/2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 class=\"mb-0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"CRP_PO_XIV_Tentative_Schedule_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>CRP PO XIV Tentative Schedule 2024</strong></h2>\r\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-striped\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"w-2\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Download of call letters for Pre-Exam Training</strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"w-2\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>September 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Conduct of Pre-Exam Training</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>September 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Download of call letters for Online examination &ndash; Preliminary</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>October, 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"bold\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Online Examination &ndash; Preliminary</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>October 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Result of Online exam -Preliminary</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>November 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Download of Call letter for Online examination &ndash; Main</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>November, 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"bold\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Online Examination &ndash; Main</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>November 2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Declaration of Result &ndash; Main</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>December 2024/ January 2025</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Conduct of interview</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>January/ February 2025</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 66.9484%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Provisional Allotment</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 33.0535%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>April 2025</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Various_Bank_Wise_Vacancy_Details_of_IBPS_PO_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Various Bank Wise Vacancy Details of IBPS PO 2024 ?</strong></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-style: solid; width: 100%; border-width: 1px; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Participating Bank</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>No of Vacancies</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>BANK OF BARODA</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>N R</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>BANK OF INDIA&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>885</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>BANK OF MAHARASHTRA&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>N R</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>CANARA BANK</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>750</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>CENTRAL BANK OF INDIA</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>2,000</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>INDIAN BANK</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>N R&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>INDIAN OVERSEAS BANK</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>260</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>PUNJAB NATIONAL BANK</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>200</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>PUNJAB &amp; SIND BANK</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>360</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>UCO BANK<br></strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>N R</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.4531px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>UNION BANK OF INDIA<br></strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.4531px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>N R</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 29.5625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 62.6779%; height: 29.5625px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Total Vacancies</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.3238%; height: 29.5625px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>4,455 Vacancies</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Category_Wise_Required_Application_Fees_For_ibps_po_application_form_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Category Wise Required Application Fees For ibps po application form 2024?</strong></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.223%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px;\"><strong>Category</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.7787%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px;\"><strong>Require Application Fees</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.223%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px;\"><strong>SC/ST/PwD candidates</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.7787%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px;\"><strong>Rs.&nbsp;175/- (inclusive of GST)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 45.223%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px;\"><strong>All Other Candidates</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 54.7787%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px;\"><strong>Rs. 850 /- (inclusive of GST)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>डायरेक्ट लिंक्स</strong></h2>\r\n<p><br><br><br></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; height: 0px; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 78.2951%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Official Website0</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 21.7068%; padding: 0px;\"><a title=\"ibps\" href=\"https://www.ibps.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 78.2951%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Direct Link To Apply Online</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 21.7068%; padding: 0px;\"><a title=\"ibpsonline\" href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/crppo14jul24/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 78.2951%; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Dirct&nbsp; Link To Download Official Advt.</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 21.7068%; padding: 0px;\"><strong><a title=\"Detailed-Notification_CRP-PO-XIV_final-1\" href=\"https://www.ibps.in/wp-content/uploads/Detailed-Notification_CRP-PO-XIV_final-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724399070-101715083741.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2024-08-23 00:00:00', '2024-08-23 07:48:29', NULL, NULL),
(348, 'DSSSB Answer Key PDF Download Check Your Results Now', 'Access the DSSSB answer key in PDF format to verify your exam results and evaluate your performance', '<p>Delhi Subordinate Services Selection Board (DSSSB) has released the answer key for recruitment to the various posts Candidates participating in the exam for these posts can see the answer keys by visiting the link given on dsssb.delhi.gov.in and can register objections regarding these answer keys. The facility to raise objections will be available from April 2024. All those candidates who appeared in DSSSB Answer Key March 2024 Exam can download through the official website of DSSSB dsssb.delhi.gov.in.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">DSSSB Answer Key 2024</h2>\r\n<h3><strong>(Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Board (DSSSB))</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>[DSSSB Answer Key for Various Post-Recruitment 2024]</strong></h4>\r\n<h3>DSSSB Answer Key 2024 Summary:</h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"48%\">Recruitment Board</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"52%\">Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Board (DSSSB)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"48%\">Post Name</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"52%\">Various Exam</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"48%\">DSSSB June Exam Answer Key</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"52%\">Available</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"48%\">Answer Key Status</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"52%\">Release</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"48%\">Exam Dates</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"52%\">10-30 June 2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"48%\">Category</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"52%\"><strong><a title=\"Examinfo.Blog\" href=\"../../\">Answer Key</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"48%\">Official Website</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" width=\"52%\"><strong><a title=\"DSSSB.DELHI.GOV.IN\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/\">DSSSB.DELHI.GOV.IN</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>DSSSB Latest Answer Key Notices 2024:</h3>\r\n<table border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th width=\"675\">Exam Name</th>\r\n<th width=\"134\">Release Date</th>\r\n<th width=\"151\">Download Answer Key Notice</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"675\">DISPLAY OF DRAFT ANSWER KEYS FOR ONLINE COMPUTER BASED EXAMINATION POST CODES- 78/14 &amp; 803/22</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">26 July 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"151\"><strong><a title=\"DSSSB\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/DSSSB/universal-tab/answerkey_2024_7_26_11_11_39_13092.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"675\">DISPLAY OF DRAFT ANSWER KEYS FOR ONLINE COMPUTER BASED EXAMINATION FOR VARIOUS EXAMINATIONS HELD FROM 10 JUNE TO 30 JUNE 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">05 July 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"151\"><strong><a title=\"DSSSB\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/DSSSB/universal-tab/scan20240705_0078.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"675\">DISPLAY OF FINAL ANSWER KEYS FOR ONLINE COMPUTER BASED EXAMINATION FOR VARIOUS EXAMINATIONS HELD IN MARCH 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">27 May 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"151\"><strong><a title=\"DSSSB\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/DSSSB/universal-tab/scan20240527_0040.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"675\">DISPLAY OF FINAL ANSWER KEYS FOR ONLINE COMPUTER BASED EXAMINATION FOR VARIOUS EXAMINATIONS HELD IN MARCH 2024 (for post codes 801/24 &amp; 802/24)</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">09 May 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"151\"><strong><a title=\"DSSSB\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/DSSSB/universal-tab/scan20240509_0007.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"675\">DISPLAY OF FINAL ANSWER KEYS FOR ONLINE COMPUTER BASED EXAMINATION FOR VARIOUS EXAMINATION HELD IN FEBRUARY 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">16 April 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"151\"><strong><a title=\"DSSSB\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/DSSSB/universal-tab/scan0089_2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"675\">DISPLAY OF DRAFT ANSWER KEYS FOR ONLINE COMPUTER BASED EXAMINATION FOR VARIOUS EXAMINATIONS HELD IN MARCH 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">05 April 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"151\"><strong><a title=\"DSSSB\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/DSSSB/universal-tab/scan0077.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"675\">DISPLAY OF DRAFT ANSWER KEYS FOR ONLINE COMPUTER BASED EXAMINATION FOR VARIOUS EXAMINATION HELD IN FEBRUARY 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">22 February 2024</td>\r\n<td width=\"151\"><strong><a title=\"DSSSB\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/DSSSB/universal-tab/scan20240222_0023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Exam Conducted By:</h3>\r\n<p>Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Board DSSSB Conducts Various Recruitment Exam in Every Year.</p>\r\n<h3>DSSSB Answer Key Fees:</h3>\r\n<p>No Application Fee to Download Answer Key.</p>\r\n<h3>Calculation of Estimated Scores using DSSSB Answer Key:</h3>\r\n<p>With the release of the provisional answer key, applicants can calculate their probable score. Follow the steps given below to calculate the expected score of DSSSB Recruitment 2024.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Download the answer key from the official website. Refer to the steps given in this article to download DSSSB Answer Key.</li>\r\n<li>Count the number of correct and incorrect answers marked in the answer sheet. Get the total number of correct and incorrect answers.</li>\r\n<li>Calculate the estimated marks with the help of the marking scheme for the recruitment. Candidates can use the formula given below to calculate their probable score.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>DSSSB Score = (Number of correct answers x Marks for correct answer) &ndash; (Number of wrong answers x Marks deducted for wrong answer)</p>\r\n<h3>How To Download DSSSB Answer Key 2024:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Step 1:</strong>&nbsp;Candidates first go to Delhi Visit the official website of Subordinate Services Selection Board (DSSSB) dsssb.delhi.gov.in.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 2:</strong>&nbsp;Click on the link &lsquo;OBJECTION MANAGEMENT LINK FOR DSSSB EXAMS HELD ON 06 to 18 March 2024&rsquo; given on the website.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 3:</strong>&nbsp;After clicking on the link<a href=\"https://www.sarkaridisha.com/dsssb-admit-card/\">,</a>&nbsp;a new page will open in front of the candidates.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 4:</strong>&nbsp;Candidate enter your application number, date of birth and click on the login button.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 5:</strong>&nbsp;DSSSB Answer Key will appear on the candidate&rsquo;s screen.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 6:</strong>&nbsp;Download the DSSSB Answer Key 2023 and also take a print out of it for future use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Important Links:</h2>\r\n<table border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr valign=\"TOP\">\r\n<td width=\"66%\"><strong>Download Answer Key 2024</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\"><strong><a title=\"configured\" href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1258/89400/login.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"TOP\">\r\n<td width=\"66%\"><strong>Download Answer Key Notice 2024</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\"><strong><a title=\"answer-keys\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/doit/tab-content/answer-keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"TOP\">\r\n<td width=\"66%\"><strong>DSSSB Admit Card 2024</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\"><a title=\"https://examinfo.blog/admit-card/\" href=\"../../admit-card/\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr valign=\"TOP\">\r\n<td width=\"66%\"><strong>Official Website</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"34%\"><strong><a title=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724471737-dsssb-answer-key-2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-24 00:00:00', '2024-08-24 03:55:37', NULL, NULL);
