 tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>प्रपत्र-3(1.1)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 68.3146%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"DLRS\" href=\"https://dlrs.bihar.gov.in/docs/Form/Bansawali_Dhakhal.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">वंशावली के आधार पर प्रत्येक उत्तराधिकारी का दखल</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 31.0861%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>प्रपत्र-3(2)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 68.3146%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"DLRS\" href=\"https://dlrs.bihar.gov.in/docs/Form/Yaddash_Panji.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">याद्दाश्त पंजी</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 31.0861%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>प्रपत्र-4</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 68.3146%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"DLRS\" href=\"https://dlrs.bihar.gov.in/docs/Form/Prapatra_4.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">गैर-सत्यापित/विवादग्रस्त भूमि की पंजी का प्रपत्र</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 31.0861%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>प्रपत्र-5</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 68.3146%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"DLRS\" href=\"https://dlrs.bihar.gov.in/docs/Form/Prapatra_5.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">खतियानी विवरणी</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 31.0861%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>प्रपत्र-6</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 68.3146%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"DLRS\" href=\"https://dlrs.bihar.gov.in/docs/Form/Prapatra_6.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">खेसरा पंजी का प्रपत्र</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 31.0861%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>प्रपत्र-7</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 68.3146%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"DLRS\" href=\"https://dlrs.bihar.gov.in/docs/Form/Prapatra_7.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">खानापुरी पर्चा का प्रपत्र</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.2px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 31.0861%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>प्रपत्र-8</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(230, 126, 35); width: 68.3146%; height: 23.2px; border-width: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 