"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Dates</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">SSC JE notification Release Date</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">March 28, 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">SSC JE online application form</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">March 28, 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">The last date to fill out the application form</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">April 18, 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">The last date and time to generate offline challan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">April 18, 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">The last date to make online payment</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">April 19, 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Offline payment through challan last date</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">To be announced</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">SSC JE online application correction and edit facility date</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">April 22 &amp; 23, 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Release of SSC JE 2024 admit card</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">27-05-2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">SSC JE Paper 1 exam date</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><del>June 4, 5 &amp; 6, 2024</del></span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><mark><strong>June 05, 06 &amp; 07, 2024</strong></mark></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">SSC JE Paper 1 provisional answer key release date</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">12-06-2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Raise Objections</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Till 15-06-2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">SSC JE final answer key Paper 1 release date</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">22nd August 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Result Release Date</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>20th August 2024</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Paper 1 scorecard release date</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>22nd August 2024 (18:00 Hours) to 05th September 2024 (18:00 Hours)</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Release of SSC JE hall ticket 2024 Paper 2</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">To be announced</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">SSC JE exam dates Paper 2</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">To be announced</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">SSC JE Paper 2 result</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">To be announced</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Declaration of SSC JE Final Result 2024</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"tbl-cell-border1\" style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">To be announced</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 id=\"toc_2\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span id=\"Instructions_to_Check_SSC_JE_Result_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Instructions to Check SSC JE Result 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Individuals who appeared for the SSC Junior Engineer recruitment exam can follow these simple instructions to check and download the SSC JE Result from the official website &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">First of all, individuals have to go to the official website of the Staff Selection Commission which is ssc.nic.in to check the results</span></li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">On the homepage of the SSC website, individuals have to click on the &ldquo;Result&rdquo; tab</span></li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Next on this webpage, you have to click on the &ldquo;JE&rdquo; tab</span></li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Further, click on the available link for Junior Engineer Exam Results PDF</span></li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">The SSC Junior Engineer Result PDF Link will appear on your screen</span></li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Check your Roll Number, Name, Father&rsquo;s Name, DOB, and rank in the SSC JE Result PDF</span></li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">You can also download the SSC JE Exam Result PDF for future reference.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><mark><strong>SSC JE Result 2024</strong></mark></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"SSC JE\" href=\"https://www.examinfo.blog.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Check Here for Mechanical &amp; Electrical</strong></a></span>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"SSC JE\" href=\"https://www.examinfo.blog.pdf\"><strong>Check Here for Civil</strong></a></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>SSC JE