></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"SSC JE\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://ssc.gov.in\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span id=\"SSC_Regional_Website\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><span id=\"SSC_Regional_Website\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>SSC Regional Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 100%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Regional Website</strong></span></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Direct Link of Websites</strong></span></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Eastern Region</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"sscer\" href=\"https://www.sscer.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Karnataka Kerala Region</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"ssckkr.kar.nic.