e: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Central Region</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"www.ssc-cr.org\" href=\"https://www.ssc-cr.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>North Western Region</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><a title=\"www.sscnwr.org\" href=\"https://www.sscnwr.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Northern Region</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><a title=\"sscsr.gov.in\" href=\"https://sscsr.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1724486248-SSC.webp', '13', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-24 00:00:00', '2024-08-24 08:08:12', NULL, NULL),
(351, 'SSC CGL Admit Card 2024 Your Gateway to Success', 'The SSC CGL admit card for 2024 is your ticket to accessing the results of the Combined Graduate Level exam', '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"SSC_CGL_Tier-I_Application_StatusAdmit_Card_2024_Declared_Now\" style=\"color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><strong>SSC CGL Tier-I Application Status/Admit Card 2024 Declared Now</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"subheading-byline\">SSC CGL Tier-I Application Status/Admit Card 2024 Declared Now: The Staff Selection Commission has recently invited online application forms for the combined graduate-level exam in 2024. All eligible and interested candidates can apply online for the SSC CGL Recruitment 2024 Online Form. they are given below in the important link section. The Staff Selection Commission releases the SSC CGL 2024 Notification on June 24, 2024, on the official website. The SSC CGL 2024 will be conducted in four tiers.</p>\r\n<h2><span id=\"Important_Dates\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Apply Online Start: June 24, 2024</li>\r\n<li>Last Date Of Registration: July 27,<strong>&nbsp;2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Fee Payment Online Last Date: <strong>July 28, 2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Date of &lsquo;Window for Application Form Correction&rsquo; and online payment of Correction Charges:&nbsp;<strong>10-08-2024 to 11-08-2024 (23:00)</strong></li>\r\n<li>Schedule of Computer-Based Examination (CBT-I):<strong> September 9, 2024, to September 26, 2024</strong></li>\r\n<li>Schedule of Paper-II (conventional): December 2024</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><span id=\"Application_Fee\">Application Fee</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>General/OBC/EWS Candidates: Rs. 100/-</li>\r\n<li>SC/ST/Female Candidates: Rs.00/-</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Mode:&nbsp;</strong>Fee can be paid through BHIM UPI, Net Banking, or by using Visa, Mastercard, Maestro, RuPay Credit or Debit card or in cash at SBI Branches by generating SBI Challan.</p>\r\n<h3><span id=\"Age_Limit_As_of_01-08-2024\">Age Limit As of 01-08-2024</span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Minimum Age:&nbsp;<strong>18 Or 20 Years.</strong></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Age:&nbsp;<strong>27, 30 Or 32 years</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Age Relaxation:</strong>&nbsp;<strong>As per Rules. (</strong><strong>Read the Official Notification For More Details.).</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span id=\"Education_Qualification\"><strong>Education Qualification</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates should have a Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree from the University or equivalent from a recognized board, university, or institution.</li>\r\n<li>Read the official full notification for more details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span id=\"Total_Vacancy_17727_Posts\">Total Vacancy: 17,727 Posts</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Vacancy Details</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Vacancies:</strong>&nbsp; Tentative vacancies: However, firm vacancies will be determined in due course. Updated vacancies, if any, along with post-wise &amp; category-wise vacancies, will be made available on the website of the Commission (https://ssc.gov.in&gt; For Candidates &gt; Tentative Vacancy) in due course.</p>\r\n<h4><span id=\"Pay_Scale_Selection_Mode\"><strong>Pay Scale &amp; Selection Mode</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Pay Scale:</strong>&nbsp;As per Posts (Read the official notification)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Selection Mode:</strong>&nbsp;As per the rules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5><span id=\"How_to_apply_for_SSC_CGL_Recruitment_2024\"><strong>How to apply for SSC CGL Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Step 1:</strong>&nbsp;Visit the&nbsp;<strong>official website of SSC</strong>, SSC.NIC.IN.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 2:</strong> The SSC homepage will appear, where you can enter your<strong>&nbsp;login credentials,</strong>&nbsp;solve the captcha, and log in.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 3:</strong>&nbsp;After you&rsquo;re logged in, you can move forward to&nbsp;<strong>Apply Now button (SSC CGL</strong>) under the exam tab.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 4:</strong>&nbsp;Go to the&nbsp;<strong>SSC CGL Exam tab</strong>&nbsp;and click on the Apply Now button.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 5:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;After this, you&rsquo;ll be led to the&nbsp;<strong>SSC CGL Exam Application Form, where</strong> you can fill in all the required documents and details and choose your exam center.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 6:</strong>&nbsp;Make sure the given&nbsp;<strong>details and documents</strong>&nbsp;are relevant and correct before submission. After the<strong>&nbsp;final submission,</strong>&nbsp;SSC will not let you change the details.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 7:</strong>&nbsp;You can move forward and upload the<strong>&nbsp;photograph and signature</strong>&nbsp;as per the requirement of SSC norms.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Step 8:</strong>&nbsp;Once all details are filled in, you can complete the application by paying the<strong>&nbsp;fees online.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 80%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 208.625px; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 100.004%; height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"2\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\">Important Links</span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 60.8011%; height: 20px;\"><strong>Status/Admit Card For CR Region (Bihar &amp; UP)&nbsp;<del>&gt;</del></strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 39.2031%; height: 20px;\"><a title=\"SSC CGL\" href=\"https://www.ssc-cr.org/cgl_tier_1_2024_1042.php?proceed=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 60.8011%; height: 20px;\"><strong>Other Region&nbsp;<del>&gt;</del></strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 39.2031%; height: 20px;\"><a title=\"SSC CGL\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/Portal/AdmitCard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 60.8011%; height: 20px;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 39.2031%; height: 20px;\"><strong><a title=\"SSC CGL\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/candidate-portal/one-time-registration/home-page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Registration</a> |<a title=\"SSC CGL\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&nbsp;Login</a></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 60.8011%; height: 20px;\"><strong>Last Date Notice</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 39.2031%; height: 20px;\"><a title=\"SSC CGL\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/api/attachment/uploads/masterData/NoticeBoards/IMPORTANT%20NOTICE_CGLE_2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 60.8011%; height: 20px;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 39.2031%; height: 20px;\"><a title=\"SSC CGL\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724494934-ssc-cgl-status-and-admit-card-2024.webp', '14', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-24 00:00:00', '2024-08-24 10:22:14', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(352, 'IBPS POMT 2024 Your Path to a Promising Banking Career', 'The IBPS PO/MT Recruitment 2024 offers a golden opportunity for aspiring candidates looking to embark on a rewarding career in the banking sector.', '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>IBPS PO/MT Recruitment 2024 Released Notification</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">IBPS PO/MT Recruitment 2024 Released Notification: बैंकिंग कार्मिक चयन संस्थान (IBPS) में प्रोबेशनरी ऑफिसर्स/ मैनेजमेंट ट्रेनी के पदों के लिए ऑनलाइन नोटिफिकेशन जारी किया है। इस भर्ती में कुल 4455 पदों पर भर्ती निकली हैं। हम बता दे की इस भर्ती में भाग लेने वाले अभ्यर्थीयों को Graduation डिग्री होना जरुरी है। जो भी उम्मीदवार आवेदन करना चाहते हैं वे आयोग के ऑफिसियल वेबसाइट www.ibps.in के माद्यम से ऑनलाइन आवेदन कर सकते हैं। इच्छुक उम्मीदवार 01 अगस्त 2024 से 28 अगस्त 2024 के बीच ऑनलाइन आवेदन कर सकते हैं।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">सभी पात्रता और इच्छुक उम्मीदवार नीचे दिए गए महत्वपूर्ण लिंक के माध्यम से ऑनलाइन आवेदन करने से पहले आधिकारिक पूर्ण अधिसूचना पढ़ सकते हैं। जो उम्मीदवार<strong>&nbsp;IBPS PO Recruitment</strong>&nbsp;अधिसूचना के माध्यम से पोस्ट किए जाने वाले पदों में रुचि रखते हैं, उन्हें https://www.ibps.in/crp-po-mt-xiii/ पर एक ऑनलाइन आवेदन जमा करना होगा।&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.4498%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Common Recruitment Process (CRP) for Recruitment of Probationary Officers / Management Trainees in Participating Banks (CRP PO/MT -XIV) Vacancy of 2025-26</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.1638%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Update</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.286%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>01 August 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.1638%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Recruitment Organization</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.286%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.1638%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of the Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.286%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Probationary Officers / Management Trainees&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.1638%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Title</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.286%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IBPS PO Recruitment 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.1638%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancy</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.286%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>4455 Posts</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.1638%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Apply Start Date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.286%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>01 August 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.1638%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Submission Last Date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.286%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>28 August 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.1638%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.286%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>www.ibps.in</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 35.1638%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Go To Home</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 64.286%; height: 20px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Bharatresult\" href=\"https://bharatresult.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Bharatresult.net</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"IBPS_POMT_Recruitment_2024_Released_Notification-2\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>IBPS PO/MT Recruitment 2024 Released Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Date\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Important Date</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online Apply Start Date:<strong>&nbsp;01 August 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Registration Last Date<strong>: 28 August 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date:&nbsp;<strong>28 August 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The last date for printing your application: is&nbsp;<strong>05 September 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available on:<strong>&nbsp;Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online Examination &ndash; Preliminary:<strong>&nbsp;October 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Date Of Main Examination:<strong>&nbsp;November 2024&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Declaration of Result &ndash; Main:&nbsp;<strong>December 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST/ PwBD &amp; Other candidates:&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 175/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General/ OBC Candidates:<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 850/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode:</strong>&nbsp;Pay the Application fee through a Debit card/ Credit Card/ Net Baking &amp; E-Challan etc. Online Apply Mode. Read the notification For More Details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"IBPS_Age_Limit_as_on_01082024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>IBPS Age Limit as on 01/08/2024</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum:<strong>&nbsp;20 years</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum:&nbsp;<strong>30 years</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आरक्षित श्रेणी के उम्मीदवारों को अधिकतम आयु सीमा में नियमानुसार छूट दी जाएगी।अधिक जानकारी के लिए आयोग की ऑफिशियल नोटिफिकेशन देखें।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IBPS PO Recruitment 2024</strong></span></h3>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Education_Qualification\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Education Qualification</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">A Degree (Graduation) in any discipline from a University recognised by the Govt. Of India or any equivalent qualification recognized as such by the Central Government.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The candidate must possess a valid mark sheet / Degree Certificate that is a graduate on the day registers and indicate the percentage of marks obtained in Graduation while registering online.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Read the Official Full Notification For More Details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"How_to_Apply_Online_IBPS_PO\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>How to Apply Online IBPS PO</strong></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">सबसे पहले आयोग की वेबसाइटhttps://www.ibps.in/ पर जाये।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">उपयोगकर्ता आईडी और पासवर्ड प्राप्त करने के लिए उम्मीदवार को पहले पंजीकरण विवरण भरकर खुद को पंजीकृत करना होगा।</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">उम्मीदवार को पंजीकृत ईमेल पते पर यूजर आईडी और पासवर्ड प्राप्त होगा।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Probationary Officer/ Management Trainee posts</strong>&nbsp;के लिए आवेदन पत्र पूरा करने के लिए उम्मीदवार यूजर आईडी और पासवर्ड के साथ लॉगिन कर सकते हैं।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">उम्मीदवार को सही नाम, जन्म तिथि, मोबाइल नंबर और ईमेल पता अपलोड करना होगा क्योंकि पंजीकरण पूरा होने के बाद इन विवरणों को बदला नहीं जा सकता है।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">अब आपको आवेदन शुल्क का ऑनलाइन भुगतान करना होगा ,तथा</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद आपकोे सबमिट के ऑप्शन पर क्लिक करना होगा</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">अब आपको आवेदन की रसीद का प्रिंटआउट ले लेना है ,और भविष्य के लिए सुरक्षित रख ले।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC Stenographer Vacancy 2024 स्टेनोग्राफर ग्रेड सी और डी के पदों पर बंफर भर्ती आवेदन शुरू</strong></span></p>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Link\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Important Link</strong></span></h5>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 28.2838%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 71.6555%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"ibpsonline\" href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/crppo14jul24/basic_details.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Registration</a>&nbsp;||&nbsp;<a title=\"ibpsonline\" href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/crppo14jul24/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Login</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 28.2838%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Main Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); width: 71.6555%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"ibpsonline\" href=\"https://www.ibps.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Official Link</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724496190-IBPS PO_MT Recruitment 2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-24 00:00:00', '2024-08-24 10:48:52', NULL, NULL),
(353, 'NDA NA Second Examination 2024 Admit Card Download Now', 'The NDA NA Second Examination 2024 Admit Card is your essential document for taking the next step toward a rewarding career in the defense services.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong>Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><strong>UPSC National Defense Academy &amp; Naval Academy Exam II 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin :&nbsp;<strong>15/05/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<strong>&nbsp;04/06/2024&nbsp;</strong><strong>upto 6:00 PM only</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment&nbsp;Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>04/06/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Form:&nbsp;<strong>05-11 June 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Held on :&nbsp;<strong>01/09/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available :&nbsp;<strong>23/08/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC :&nbsp;<strong>100/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST :&nbsp;<strong>0/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Net Banking, Debit Card, Credit Card and Offline Fee Mode Through e-challan.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPSC NDS II Eligibility 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Army Wing :</strong>&nbsp;Passed /Appearing 10+2 Exam in Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Airforce &amp; Naval Wing :</strong>&nbsp;Passed /Appearing 10+2 Exam with Physics &amp; Math Subjects</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPSC NDA II Age Limit 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Not be Born Before&nbsp;<strong>: 02/01/2006</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Not be Born After<strong>&nbsp;: 01/01/2009</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per NDA II Exam Notification 2024 Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UPSC NDA II Exam 2024 :&nbsp;Vacancy Details Total : 404 Post</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Army :&nbsp;208&nbsp;| Navy :&nbsp;42&nbsp;| Airforce :&nbsp;120&nbsp;|&nbsp;Naval Academy :&nbsp;34</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\"><center></center>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill NDA II Exam Online Form 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Photo Instruction :</strong>&nbsp;The photograph of the candidate should not be more than 10 Days old and the&nbsp;<strong>name of the candidate</strong>&nbsp;and the<strong>&nbsp;date of taking the photograph</strong>&nbsp;should also be&nbsp;<strong>written</strong>&nbsp;on the&nbsp;<strong>photograph</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">One time registration has become necessary for all the applications of Union Public Service Commission, so all the candidates will be able to apply only after OTR.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Union Public Service Commission UPSC NDA II Recruitment 2024. Candidate Can Apply Between&nbsp;<strong>15/05/2024 to 04/06/2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the NDA II Notification Before Apply the&nbsp;Recruitment&nbsp;Application Form in NDA Apply Online 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Admission Entrance Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Admit Card 2024\" href=\"https://upsconline.nic.in/eadmitcard/admitcard_NDAII_2024/admit_card.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Correction / Edit Form</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Correction Form 2024\" href=\"https://upsconline.nic.in/upsc/OTRP/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"Apply Online UPSC NDA II Registration 2024\" href=\"https://upsconline.nic.in/upsc/OTRP/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Notification 2024\" href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/sites/default/files/Notif-NDA-II-2024-engl-150524F.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPSC NDA II Official Website\" href=\"http://upsc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>UPSC Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724497199-NDA-ADMIT-CARD-2024.webp', '14', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-24 00:00:00', '2024-08-24 10:59:59', NULL, NULL),
(354, 'IWAI 2024 Recruitment Multiple Posts Available', 'Unlock your potential with the Inland Waterways Authority of India (IWAI) as they announce their diverse recruitment drive for 2024.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94);\" border=\"1\" width=\"741\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Inland Waterways Authority of India (IWAI)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Inland Waterways IWAI Various Post Recruitment 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"401\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin&nbsp;<strong>: 16/08/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :&nbsp;<strong>21/09/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<strong>&nbsp;21/09/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date&nbsp;<strong>: As Per Schedule</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available<strong>&nbsp;: Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Gen/OBC/EWS :&nbsp;<strong>500/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SC / ST : 200/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IWAI Various Post Notification 2024 :&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Age Limit as on 21/09/2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>25-35 Years (Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation Extra as per Inland Waterways Authority of India IWAI Recruitment Rules 2024.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IWAI Various Post Recruitment 2024 : &nbsp;</strong><strong>Vacancy Details Total : 38 Post</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IWAI Various Post Eligibility</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Multi Tasking Staff (MTS)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">11</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 10th Matric Exam Passed from Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;18-25 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Accounts Officer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">5</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Bachelor Degree in Degree in Commerce from recognized university with 3 years experience&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong>&nbsp;Degree in Commerce from a recognized University with Inter ICWA/Inter CA.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;Max 30 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Hydrographic Surveyor (AHS)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BE / B.Tech Engineering Degree in Civil Engineering with 3 Year Experience.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;Max 35 Years</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More Eligibility Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">License Engine Driver</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 10th Matric Exam from Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Certificate of competency as License Engine Driver</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Know Swimming</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp; Max 30 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Dredge Control Operator</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">5</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 10th Matric Exam from Any Recognized Board in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Certificate of competency as Driver 1st class with 10 years\' experience&nbsp;<strong>OR</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Diploma in Mechanical Engineering with 1 Year Experience.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Should Knowledge of swimming.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;Max 30 Year</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More Eligibility Read the Notification .</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Store Keeper</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Class 10th Matric Exam with 5 years experience.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;Max 25 Year</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Master 2nd Class</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Certificate of competency as Master 2nd Class</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Should Know swimming.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;Max 35 Years</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More Details Read the Notification</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Staff Car Driver</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Valid Driving License with 2 Year Experience.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;Max 30 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Master 3rd Class</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Certificate of competency as Master 3rd Class (Sarang).</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Should Know swimming.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;Max 30 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Technical Assistant (Civil/Mechanical/Marine Engineering/Naval Architecture)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">4</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BE / B.Tech Degree in Related Trade OR Diploma in Related Trade with 3 Year Experience.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;Max 30 Years.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"227\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Director (Engg)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"397\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BE / B.Tech Engineering Degree in Civil/Mechanical from a recognized Institute in India.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Age Limit :</strong>&nbsp;Max 35 Years</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IWAI Various Post Exam 2024 :&nbsp;Exam District Details</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Delhi / NCR, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai, Guwahati, Patna and Kochi.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill IWAI Various Post Online Form 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Inland Waterways Authority of India IWAI MTS, Junior Account Officer, Store Keeper &amp; Other Various Post Recruitment 2024. Candidate Can Apply Between&nbsp;<strong>16/08/2024 to 21/09/2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in IWAI Various Post Recruitment 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Columns Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"741\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"364\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"378\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online IWAI Various Post Registration 2024\" href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1258/90206/Index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724508395-IWAI Various Post Recruitment 2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-24 00:00:00', '2024-08-24 02:06:35', NULL, NULL),
(355, 'GATE 2025 Exam Key Details and Preparation Tips', 'Get ready for the GATE 2025 exam with our comprehensive guide! Discover essential information about exam dates, eligibility criteria,and application procedures.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 117.338px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 117.338px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering (GATE 2025)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Conducted By : Indian Institute of Technology IIT Roorkee</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 224.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 224.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin :<strong>&nbsp;28/08/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online Phase I :&nbsp;<strong>26/09/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online Phase II<strong>&nbsp;(Extended Period)</strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;<strong>07/10/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date :<strong>&nbsp;01-02, 15-16 February 2025</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available :<strong>&nbsp;Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Result Declared :&nbsp;<strong>March 2025</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 224.625px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS :&nbsp;<strong>1800/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH :&nbsp;<strong>900/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female :&nbsp;<strong>900/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Phase II with Late Fees:</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC / EWS :&nbsp;<strong>2300/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST / PH :&nbsp;<strong>1400/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female :&nbsp;<strong>1400/-</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 142.225px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 142.225px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>GATE 2025 Eligibility</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Passed / Appearing B.E / B.Tech / B.Pharm / B.Arch / B.Sc. Research / B.S. M.Sc. / MA / MCA / M.E. / M.Tech / Dual Degree / Integrated Courses</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">For Complete Details See Brochure</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 142.225px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>GATE Photo Instruction</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Good Quality Latest Passport Size Color Photo&nbsp; with White Background.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Face Should Occupy at Least 75% of Photograph</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 123.025px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 123.025px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Instruction of Thumb Impression</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Draw Rectangular Box 3 cm X 5 Cm on A4 Size, Mark Your Left Thumb Impression within Draw Box</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 123.025px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Instruction of Signature</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Draw Rectangular Box 2 Cm X 7 CM on&nbsp; A4 Size Paper, Sign Within Draw Box on Black / Blue Pen in Running Hand.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 219.825px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 219.825px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill IIT GATE 2025 Online Form</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Indian Institute of Technology IIT Roorkee Are Issued Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the GATE 2025 Candidate Can Apply Online for&nbsp;<strong>28 August 2024 to 26 September 2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the IIT GATE 2025 Application Form in Sarkari Result Admission Section.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 203.825px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 203.825px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IIT GATE 2025 Exam Cities Details</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IIT Kanpur : UP -</strong>&nbsp;Aligarh, Prayagraj (Allahabad), Bareilly, Gorakhpur, Jhansi , Kanpur, Lucknow, Varanasi<strong>, MP -&nbsp;</strong>Bhopal, Gwalior, Jabalpur, Sagar, Satna.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IIT Roorkee : Haryana -</strong>&nbsp;Ambala &amp; Kurukshetra,&nbsp;<strong>Himachal Pradesh -</strong>&nbsp;Bilaspur, Hamirpur, Kangra, Mandi, Shimla-Solan,&nbsp;<strong>Punjab -</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Amritsar, Bathinda, Jalandhar, Ludhiana, Mohali-Chandigarh, Patiala, Pathankot ,&nbsp;<strong>Uttar Pradesh -</strong>&nbsp;Ghaziabad, Meerut, Moradabad, Muzaffarnagar, NOIDA, Saharanpur ,&nbsp;<strong>Uttarakhand -</strong>&nbsp;Dehradun, Haldwani, Roorkee.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>IIT Delhi : Haryana&nbsp;</strong>Faridabad, Gurugram, Hisar,&nbsp;<strong>Jammu and Kashmi</strong>r Jammu-Samba, Srinagar,&nbsp;<strong>Ladakh</strong>: Leh,&nbsp;<strong>Madhya Pradesh&nbsp;</strong>Indore, Ujjain ,<strong>&nbsp;New Delhi -</strong>&nbsp;New Delhi ,&nbsp;<strong>Rajasthan -</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Ajmer, Alwar, Bikaner, Jaipur, Jodhpur, Kota, Sikar, Udaipur ,&nbsp;<strong>Uttar Pradesh -</strong>&nbsp;Greater NOIDA, Mathura.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">For Other IIT Exam Cities Details Read the GATE 2025 Information Brochure</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful and important links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"GATE 2025 Registration\" href=\"https://gate2025.iitr.ac.in/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Link Activate 28/08/2024</a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download Information Brochure</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"GATE 2025 Information Brochure PDF Download\" href=\"https://gate2025.iitr.ac.in/doc/download/GATE2025_InformationBrochure.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Download GATE Syllabus</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"GATE 2025 Syllabus PDF Download\" href=\"https://gate2025.iitr.ac.in/exam-papers-and-syllabus.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>GATE 2025 Syllabus</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 68.625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"305\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 68.625px;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\" GATE 2025 Conducted Website\" href=\"https://gate2025.iitr.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>GATE 2025 Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724509182-GATE-Exam-2025.webp', '17', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-24 00:00:00', '2024-08-24 03:27:31', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(356, 'AACCC Counselling 2024 Complete Guide and Key Insights', 'Prepare for AACCC Online Counselling 2024 with our detailed guide. Learn about the counselling process, registration steps, and essential deadlines.', '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>AACCC Online Counselling 2024 </strong></span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>आयुर्वेदिक कॉलेजों के लिए काउंसेलिंग 28 अगस्त से</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">AACCC Online Counselling 2024: आयुष प्रवेश केंद्रीय परामर्श समिति (एएसीसीसी) ने शुक्रवार देर शाम अपनी वेबसाइट पर नोटिफिकेशन जारी कर होम्योपैथी तथा यूनानी मेडिकल कॉलेज में प्रवेश के लिए ऑनलाइन काउंसलिंग शेड्यूल घोषित कर दिया है. एलन कैरियर इंस्टीट्यूट के कैरियर काउंसलिंग एक्सपर्ट पारिजात मिश्रा ने बताया कि प्रथम काउंसलिंग का रजिस्ट्रेशन प्रोसेस 28 अगस्त से 2 सितम्बर 2024 तक चलेगा.</span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Table of Contents</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<nav>\r\n<ul class=\"ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 \">\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">AACCC Online Counselling 2024 आयुर्वेदिक कॉलेजों के लिए काउंसेलिंग 28 अगस्त से</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">AACCC Online Counselling 2024 Important Date</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">AACCC Online Counselling 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">सीटों के आवंटन के लिए ऑनलाइन काउंसलिंग</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">AACCC काउंसलिंग हेतु ऑनलाइन रजिस्ट्रेशन कैसे करें ?</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">AACCC Important Link</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</nav></div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इस दौरान विद्यार्थियों को अपनी आयुष, होम्योपैथी तथा यूनानी कॉलेजों की च्वाइस को अपनी इच्छा अनुसार भरना होगा. योग्य एवं इक्छुक अभ्यर्थी 28 अगस्त से 02 सितम्बर तक&nbsp;रजिस्ट्रेशन करा सकते हैं। इसके लिए विद्यार्थियों को निर्धारित फीस का भुगतान भी करना होगा. जोकि ऑनलाइन डेबिट कार्ड, क्रेडिट कार्ड एवं इंटरनेट बैंकिंग के माध्यम से किया जा सकेगा.</span></p>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>AACCC Admission and eCounselling Services for Session 2024-25</strong></span></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>AACCC Online Counselling 2024 Important Date</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">प्रथम काउंसलिंग का रजिस्ट्रेशन प्रोसेस 28 अगस्त से 2 सितम्बर 2024 तक चलेगा।&nbsp; 2 सितंबर को च्वाइस लॉकिंग, 3 सितंबर 2024 से 4 सितम्बर 2024 को सीट अलॉटमेंट प्रोसेस एवं चयनित विद्यार्थियों को 5 सितम्बर 2024 को सीट अलॉटमेंट लेटर जारी कर दिया जायेगा। विद्यार्थियों को 6 सितंबर 2024 से 11 सितम्बर 2024 के मध्य आवंटित कॉलेज में अपने दस्तावेजों एवं फीस के साथ रिपोर्टिंग करनी होगी।</span></p>\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>AACCC Online Counselling 2024</strong></span></h3>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>सीटों के आवंटन के लिए ऑनलाइन काउंसलिंग</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">सभी पात्र उम्मीदवार जो NEET (UG)-2024 परीक्षा में उत्तीर्ण हुए हैं और स्नातक (BAMS/BSMS/BUMS/BHMS/B. Pharm-ITRA.) पाठ्यक्रमों में प्रवेश के इच्छुक हैं, उन्हें सूचित किया जाता है कि सत्र 2024-25 के लिए सरकारी, सरकारी सहायता प्राप्त, डीम्ड विश्वविद्यालयों, केंद्रीय विश्वविद्यालयों और राष्ट्रीय संस्थानों के तहत AIQ सीटों के लिए काउंसलिंग आयुष प्रवेश केंद्रीय परामर्श समिति (AACCC), आयुष मंत्रालय, भारत सरकार द्वारा आयोजित की जाएगी।</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">एएसीसीसी-यूजी काउंसलिंग में भाग लेने के लिए, उम्मीदवारों को एएसीसीसी की आधिकारिक वेबसाइट (<a title=\"AACCC Online Counselling  2024\" href=\"https://aaccc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://aaccc.gov.in</a>&nbsp;) पर खुद को पंजीकृत करना आवश्यक है।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">कृपया ध्यान दें कि काउंसलिंग शुल्क में गैर-वापसीयोग्य पंजीकरण शुल्क और वापसीयोग्य सुरक्षा जमा राशि शामिल है, जिसका भुगतान अभ्यर्थियों को अपनी श्रेणी और काउंसलिंग के चयन के अनुसार पंजीकरण के समय करना होगा।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">कृपया काउंसलिंग शुल्क जब्त होने की स्थिति के लिए यूजी सूचना बुलेटिन 2024 में रिफंड से संबंधित अक्सर पूछे जाने वाले प्रश्नों को देखें।</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>AACCC काउंसलिंग हेतु ऑनलाइन रजिस्ट्रेशन कैसे करें ?</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">सबसे पहले आधिकारिक वेबसाइट पर https://aaccc.gov.in/ जायेंगे।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद र<strong>जिस्टर्ड ईमेल एवं पासवर्ड</strong>&nbsp;द्वारा&nbsp;<strong>लाग-इन</strong>&nbsp;करेंगे।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">फिर&nbsp;<strong>रिजल्ट एवं रैंक</strong>&nbsp;को&nbsp;<strong>सत्यापित</strong>&nbsp;करना पड़ेगा।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">अब&nbsp;<strong>नामांकन</strong>&nbsp;के लिए&nbsp;<strong>विश्वविद्यालयों</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>चयन</strong>&nbsp;करेंगें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">कॉलेजों को&nbsp;<strong>वरीयता क्रम में व्यवस्थित</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">चुने गए महाविद्यालयों की&nbsp;<strong>पुन: जांच</strong>&nbsp;करनी करेंगे, फिर उसे&nbsp;<strong>सेव</strong>&nbsp;करेंगे.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इसके बाद ऑनलाइन रजिस्ट्रेशन<strong>&nbsp;शुल्क का भुगतान</strong>&nbsp;करेंगें।</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>सफलता पूर्वक</strong>&nbsp;<strong>शुल्क का भुगतान</strong>&nbsp;करने के&nbsp;<strong>बाद</strong>&nbsp;अब उस पेज का&nbsp;<strong>फाइनल प्रिंट आउट</strong>&nbsp;<strong>डाउनलोड</strong>&nbsp;कर लें</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>इस प्रकार बिहार बी.एड काउंसलिंग के लिए रजिस्ट्रेशन की प्रक्रिया पूरी हो जाएगी।</strong></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h5>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>AACCC Important Link</strong></span></h5>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 20px; width: 38.9633%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Online Counselling</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 20px; width: 60.9968%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"AACCC Online Counselling 2024\" href=\"https://aaccc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Link Active on 28 August</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 20px; width: 38.9633%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Information Bulletin</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 20px; width: 60.9968%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"AACCC Online Counselling 2024 \" href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s3653ac11ca60b3e021a8c609c7198acfc/uploads/2024/08/2024082396.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 20px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 20px; width: 38.9633%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94); height: 20px; width: 60.9968%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"AACCC Online Counselling 2024\" href=\"https://aaccc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724510552-AACCC Online Counselling 2024.webp', '17', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-24 00:00:00', '2024-08-24 03:30:50', NULL, NULL),
(357, 'RBI 90 Quiz 2024 Registration Opens for Exciting Challenge', 'Join the RBI 90 Quiz 2024 and test your knowledge in this engaging competition.', '<header>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">RBI क्विज मे हिस्सा लेकर 6 लाख से 10 लाख रुपये का नकद पुरस्कार जीते, Free Certificate</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">जाने इस पोस्ट में क्या क्या है</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<nav>\r\n<ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024 &ndash; Overview</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">RBI क्विज मे हिस्सा लेकर ₹ 6 लाख से लेकर ₹ 10 लाख रुपयो का नकद पुरस्कार जीते, जाने क्या है क्विज और पार्टिसिपेट करने की प्रक्रिया &ndash; RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024?</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">How to Participate Online In RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024?</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">निष्कर्ष</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</nav></div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024:</strong>&nbsp;क्या आप भी&nbsp;<strong>आर.बी.आई 90 क्विज 2024&nbsp;</strong>मे&nbsp;<strong>पूछे गये सवालों</strong>&nbsp;का<strong>&nbsp;सवालों&nbsp;</strong>का&nbsp;<strong>जबाव&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;देकर&nbsp;<strong>₹ 6 लाख</strong>&nbsp; से लेकर&nbsp;<strong>₹ 10 लाख&nbsp;</strong><strong>रुपयो&nbsp;</strong>के&nbsp;<strong>नकद पुरस्कार&nbsp;</strong>के साथ&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;हाथो &ndash; हाथ सरकारी सर्टिफिकेट&nbsp;</strong>जीतने का सुनहरा अवसर प्राप्त करना चाहते है है तो हम, आपके लिए&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;सुनहरा&nbsp; अवसर&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;लेकर आये है जिसके तहत हम आपको&nbsp;<strong>RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024</strong>&nbsp;के बारे में बतायेगे।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आपको बता दें कि,&nbsp;<strong>RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024 Online&nbsp;</strong>से&nbsp;शुुरु कर दिया गया है जिसमे आप सभी प्रतिभागी आसानी से&nbsp;<strong>आर.बी.आई. 90 क्विज रजिस्ट्रैशन 2024</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के तहत मिलने वाले&nbsp;<strong>सरकारी सर्टिफिकेट</strong>&nbsp; के साथ ही साथ&nbsp;<strong>₹ 6 लाख से लेकर ₹ 10 लाख&nbsp; रुपयो&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;नकद पुरस्कार जीत कर</strong>&nbsp;इसका लाभ प्राप्त&nbsp; कर सकते है तथा</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आर्टिकल के अन्त मे हम आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong> प्रदान करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024 &ndash; Overview</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>क्विज का नाम</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>आर्टिकल का प्रकार</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Latest Update</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>कौन भाग ले सकता है?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>देश का प्रत्येक नागरिक भाग ले सकते है।</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>पुरस्कार</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>₹ 6 Lakh ₹ 10 Lakh&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Detailed Information of RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024?</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Please Read The Article Completely.</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>RBI क्विज मे हिस्सा लेकर ₹ 6 लाख से लेकर ₹ 10 लाख रुपयो का नकद पुरस्कार जीते, जाने क्या है क्विज और पार्टिसिपेट करने की प्रक्रिया &ndash; RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024?</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">अपने इस आर्टिकल मे हम, आप सभी पाठको सहित स्टूडेंट्स का&nbsp;<strong>हार्दिक स्वागत करना चाहते&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;है और आपको अपने इस आर्टिकल की मदद से विस्तारपूर्वक&nbsp;<strong>RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Online Free</strong>&nbsp;के बारे मे&nbsp;बतायेगें जिसके लिएओ आपको अन्त तक हमारे बने रहना होगा ताकि आप इस क्विज की पूरी जानकारी प्राप्त कर सके औऱ इसका लाभ&nbsp; प्राप्त सकें जिसके लिए आपको हमारे साथ अन्त तक बने रहना होगा ताकि आप पूरी &ndash; पूरी जानकारी प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आपको बता दें कि,&nbsp;<strong>RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024</strong>&nbsp;मे हिस्सा लेने के लिए आप सभी को&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;ऑनलाइन प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;को अपनाना होगा जिसमें आपको कोई समस्या ना हो इसके लिए हम आपको पूरी&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;प्रक्रिया&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;की&nbsp;<strong>बिंदुवार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;जानकारी प्रदान करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से इस&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;क्विज&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>हिस्सा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;ले सके औऱ</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आर्टिकल के अन्त मे हम आपको&nbsp;<strong>क्विक लिंक्स&nbsp;</strong> प्रदान करेगे ताकि आप आसानी से इसी प्रकार के आर्टिकल्स को प्राप्त करके इनका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकें।</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Participate Online In RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024?</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>आर.बी.आई 90 क्विज 2024&nbsp;</strong>मे&nbsp;<strong>हिस्सा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;लेने के लिए आप सभी प्रतिभागियो को इन स्टेप्स को फॉलो करना होगा जो कि, इस प्रकार से हैं &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024&nbsp;</strong>करने के लिए सबसे पहले आपको इसके<a title=\"RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024\" href=\"https://www.rbi90quiz.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>&nbsp;Direct Link To Apply Online&nbsp;</strong></a>के लिंक पर क्लिक करना होगोा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">क्लिक करने के बाद आपके सामने इसका&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;क्विज पेज&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;खुुल जायेगा जहां पर आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;<a title=\"RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024\" href=\"https://www.rbi90quiz.in/students/register\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Student Registration</a>&nbsp;</strong>का विकल्प मिलेगा जिस पर आपको क्लिक करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">क्लिक करने के बाद आपके सामने इसकाी&nbsp;<strong>स्टूडेंट रजिस्ट्रैशन फॉर्म&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;खुलेगा जिसे आपको ध्यानपूर्वक भरना होगा जिसके बाद&nbsp;<strong>आपको लॉगिन डिटेल्स&nbsp;</strong>मिल जायेगा जिसकी मदद से आपको पोर्टल मे&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;लॉगिन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करना होगा,</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">पोर्टल मे<strong>&nbsp;लॉ़गिन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;करने के बाद&nbsp;<strong>Participate&nbsp;</strong>के विकल्प पर क्लिक करना होगा जिसके बाद&nbsp;<strong>क्विज&nbsp;</strong>शुरु हो जायेगा जिसमे आपको ध्यानपूर्वक पूरा करना होगा और</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">अन्त मे, आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;सबमिट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;के&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;ऑप्शन&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;पर क्लिक करना होगा जिसके बाद आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;स्लीप&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मिल जायेगा जिसे आपको&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;प्रिंट&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;कर लेना होगा।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">उपरोक्त सभी स्टेप्स को फॉलो करके आप सभी युवा आसानी से इस&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;क्विज&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे&nbsp;<strong>हिस्सा&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;ले पायेगे औऱ इस&nbsp;<strong>क्विज&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;का लाभ प्राप्त कर पायेगे।</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>निष्कर्ष</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">इस आर्टिकल मे हमने आपको विस्तार से ना केवल&nbsp;<strong>RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024&nbsp;</strong>के बारे&nbsp;मे बताया बल्कि हमने&nbsp; आपको&nbsp;<strong>&rdquo; आर.बी.आई 90 क्विज रजिस्ट्रैशन 2024 &rdquo;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे हिस्सा लेने&nbsp; की पूरी प्रक्रिया के बारे&nbsp; मे बताया ताकि आप इस&nbsp;<strong>क्विज&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;मे हिस्सा ले सके और इस प्रतियोगिता मे बेहतर प्रदर्श करके&nbsp;<strong>₹ 10 लाख रुपयो का नकद पुरस्कार&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;जी सकें तथा</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">आर्टिकल के अन्त में हमें उम्मीद है कि, आपको हमारा यह आर्टिकल बेहद पसंद आया होगा जिसके लिए आप हमारे इस आर्टिकल&nbsp;को लाइक, शेयर व कमेंट करेगे।</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Direct Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94); margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024\" href=\"https://quiz.mygov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Direct Link to Paricipate In RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024\" href=\"https://www.rbi90quiz.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1724512029-RBI 90 Quiz Registration 2024.webp', '17', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-24 00:00:00', '2024-08-24 03:33:18', NULL, NULL);
