.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Read the Notification Before Applying the Recruitment Application Form in Railway Board Junior Engineer JE &amp; Other Various Post Exam 2024 Under CEN Advt No. 03/2024 Exam Online Form 2024.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Check and collect all the documents: eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, and Details.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Kindly Ready the scan document related to the Entrance entrance form: Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before submitting the Application form, you must check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Take A printout of Final Submitted Form.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1353.35px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"753\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful and important links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 935.113px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"350\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 418.237px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"403\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Apply Online RRB JE CEN 03/2024 Registration\" href=\"https://www.rrbapply.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 935.113px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"350\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 418.237px; border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"403\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Indian Railway Official Website\" href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Indian Railway Official Website</a></strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724548015-Apply Online RRB JE CEN 03_2024 Registration.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-25 00:00:00', '2024-08-25 01:06:55', NULL, NULL),
(359, 'UP NEET 2024 Counseling  Secure Your Medical Career', 'Register now for UPNEET 2024 counseling to take the next step towards a successful medical career.', '<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 80%; border-spacing: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Director General Medical Education and Training, Uttar Pradesh</span></h2>\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UP NEET UG Online Counseling | Registration | Choice Filling 2024</strong></span></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Dates (First Round)</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Begin :&nbsp;<strong>20/08/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Registration :&nbsp;<strong>24/08/2024 upto 11 AM Only.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Registration Fee Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>24/08/2024 upto 02 PM Only</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Merit List Released :&nbsp;<strong>24/08/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Choice Filling: :<strong>24-29 August 2024 upto 11 AM</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Seat Allotment Result :&nbsp;<strong>30/08/2024</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration Fees :</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC :&nbsp;<strong>2000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH <strong>: 2000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Security Fees :</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Govt. Medical/Dental Colleges/Institutes/State Universities : <strong>30,000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Private Medical Colleges/Institutes/State Universities :&nbsp;<strong>2,00,000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Private. Dental Colleges/Institutes/State Universities :&nbsp;<strong>1,00,000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through a debit card, Credit Card, or Banking Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"309\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UP NEET UG 2024 Eligibility</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Qualified for NTA NEET 2024 Exam</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">High School and Intermediate Exams Passed in Uttar Pradesh</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Domicile Certificate in UP.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"307\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UP NEET UG Age Limit</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>17 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate Born On or Before :&nbsp;<strong>31/12/2007</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UP NEET UG 2024 Admission Details</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For College Wise Seat Details, You Must Read the Notification</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How to Fill UP NEET Online Counseling Registration 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OBC &amp; EWS Certificate Must be Issued After April <strong>1, 2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online counseling of Uttar Pradesh NEET&nbsp; UG Admission 2024 will<strong> start on August 20, 2024.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Those who want to get admission in the medical college of Uttar Pradesh Domicile Candidates and have passed NEET examination conducted by NTA can register for the Uttar Pradesh NEET in online counseling.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">For More details, please Read the UP NEET UG Counseling Notification.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"616\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Some Useful and important links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"306\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"310\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UPNEET 2024 Counseling Registration\" href=\"https://upneet.gov.in/RegistrationUG/candidateLoginUG.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Registration</strong></a>: <a title=\"UPNEET 2024 Counseling Login\" href=\"https://upneet.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Login</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"306\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"310\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"UP NEET Official Website\" href=\"https://upneet.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>UP NEET Official Website</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '1724548768-UPNEET 2024 Counseling Registration.webp', '15', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-25 00:00:00', '2024-08-25 01:19:28', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(360, 'NVIDIA GenAI Internship Innovate With Us', 'Join the Nvidia Generative AI Internship to gain hands-on experience in cutting-edge AI technology and contribute to innovative projects.', '<div><header>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Nvidia Generative AI Internship For Computer Science Students [Stipend Upto Rs. 30k; Many Locations]: Apply Now 2024</span></h1>\r\n</header></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The&nbsp;<strong>Nvidia&nbsp;Generative AI&nbsp;Internship</strong>&nbsp;presents an exceptional opportunity for computer science students eager to immerse themselves in the rapidly evolving field of artificial intelligence. With a stipend of up to ₹30,000 per month, this internship is designed to attract talented individuals who are passionate about generative AI and its transformative potential across various industries.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">As part of this internship, participants will engage in hands-on projects that leverage cutting-edge technologies, enhancing their programming skills in languages such as Python, Java, and C++. Interns will work alongside industry experts, gaining invaluable insights into the practical applications of generative AI while contributing to innovative solutions that address real-world challenges.</span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Table of Contents</span></h2>\r\n<nav>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">About the Nvidia</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Role &amp; Responsibilities for Generative AI Internship</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Eligibility Criteria</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Preferred Skill Sets</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Other Benefits of Generative AI Internship</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Stipend</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">How do Apply?</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</nav></div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">This program not only aims to equip students with technical expertise but also fosters a collaborative environment where creativity and problem-solving thrive. Whether you are interested in machine learning, natural language processing, or computer vision, the Nvidia Generative AI Internship offers a platform to explore these domains and develop your skills further.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>About the Nvidia</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">NVIDIA (NASDAQ: NVDA) has been at the forefront of accelerated computing since its foundation in 1993. The GPU, which the business invented in 1999, revolutionized computer graphics, spurred the development of the metaverse and stimulated the expansion of the PC gaming market. With its data center-scale offerings, NVIDIA is now a full-stack computing firm that is revolutionizing the market.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We are looking to hire an energetic intern for an exciting and fun role at NVIDIA. We craft outstanding compilers that realize the potential of&nbsp;<strong><a title=\"Nvidia&nbsp;Generative AI&nbsp;Internship\" href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/networking/products/data-processing-unit/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NVIDIA&rsquo;s DPUs&nbsp;</a></strong>designed for the world&rsquo;s largest&nbsp;<strong>Generative AI&nbsp;</strong>Data centers. We need you to design, develop and tune optimizing compilers based on Clang and LLVM for our latest Data Processing Unit (DPU) accelerators. These compilers are key for the performance of Generative AI, HPC and other performance-critical software deployed on NVIDIA Data centers, on the cloud and at supercomputing computing centres around the world.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">In this role, you will solve critical problems while working alongside an outstanding engineering team with vision in Compiler technology and systems software, doing what you enjoy! Our compiler organisation makes its mark on every CPU, GPU, DPU and SoC product that NVIDIA builds. Would you like to be part of this outstanding organisation?</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Role &amp; Responsibilities for Generative AI Internship</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Work with a geographically distributed team to understand, modify and improve DPU Compiler SW at NVIDIA.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Contribute new features and optimization techniques.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Develop compiler software that accelerates critical real-time applications.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Be part of a team that is at the center of production AI, HPC and data center technologies.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pursuing BS or MS degree in Computer Engineering, Computer Science, or related degree</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Compiler-related course work or project experience.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Strong hands-on C++ programming skills</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Excellent verbal and written communications skills</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Eager to learn new technologies and compiler optimization techniques</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Preferred Skill Sets</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Familiarity with industry-standard compiler infrastructure such as GCC or LLVM.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Other Benefits of Generative AI Internship</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">With highly competitive salaries and a comprehensive benefits package,&nbsp;<strong>NVIDIA&nbsp;</strong>is widely considered to be one of the technology world&rsquo;s most desirable employers. We have some of the most brilliant and talented people on the planet working for us and, due to unprecedented growth, our world-class engineering teams are expanding fast. If you&rsquo;re a creative and autonomous engineer with a genuine passion for technology, we want to hear from you. We are an equal-opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Stipend</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Average Nvidia Intern salary: } ₹30,414 &ndash; ₹31,722</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Note: Stipend details are taken from&nbsp;<strong><a title=\"Nvidia&nbsp;Generative AI&nbsp;Internship\" href=\"https://www.ambitionbox.com/salaries/nvidia-salaries/intern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a></strong>!</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>How do Apply?</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Interested candidates can directly apply for<strong>&nbsp;Nvidia&nbsp;Generative AI Internship</strong>&nbsp;For&nbsp;Computer Science Students through&nbsp;<strong><a title=\"Nvidia&nbsp;Generative AI&nbsp;Internship\" href=\"https://nvidia.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/NVIDIAExternalCareerSite/job/India-Bengaluru/CPU-Compiler-Intern_JR1986210\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">this link</a></strong>.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"Nvidia&nbsp;Generative AI&nbsp;Internship\" href=\"https://nvidia.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/NVIDIAExternalCareerSite/job/India-Bengaluru/CPU-Compiler-Intern_JR1986210\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click here to view the official notification of the CPU Compiler Internship at Nvidia.</a></strong></span></p>\r\n</div>', '1724550145-Nvidia Generative AI Internship.webp', '18', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-25 00:00:00', '2024-08-25 01:42:25', NULL, NULL),
(361, 'SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024 Update Now', 'Don\'t miss the chance to rectify errors in your SSC Stenographer application. Access the correction window and ensure accurate submission for 2024.', '<header class=\"entry-header cf\">\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024&nbsp;</span></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Apply From Here: Steno Application Form Correction Links</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">जाने इस पोस्ट में क्या क्या है</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<nav>\r\n<ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024 Overview</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024: Online Apply From Here</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024 Dates</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Procedure to Apply for SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Selection Procedure</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Important Links</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</nav></div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024:&nbsp;</strong>कर्मचारी चयन आयोग द्वारा SSC स्टेनो आवेदन पत्र सुधार के लिए विंडो 27 अगस्त (00:01 बजे) और 28 अगस्त 2024 (23:00 बजे) को खुलने जा रही है। जो व्यक्ति पहले से भरे गए विवरणों में बदलाव या सुधार करना चाहते हैं, वे आधिकारिक रूप से सक्रिय होने के बाद&nbsp;<strong>SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024</strong> के लिए लिंक प्राप्त कर सकते हैं। SSC स्टेनो सुधार विंडो के लिए सीधा लिंक 27 अगस्त 2024 को यहाँ उपलब्ध होगा।</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024 Overview</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 60%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(35, 111, 161);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Conducting organization</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Staff Selection Commission</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:44\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:26\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Notification release</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"3:28-3:42\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>July 26, 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"4:1-4:50\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"4:1-4:30\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>application closing date</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"4:32-4:48\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>August 17, 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:57\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:31\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Computer-Based Test (CBT)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"5:33-5:55\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">October-November 2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:36\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:16\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Name</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"6:18-6:34\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Stenographer 2024</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:60\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:15\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Category</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"7:17-7:58\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Window</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:175\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:31\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Status of Correction Window</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"8:33-8:173\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">To Be Activated Soon</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:72\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:18\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Pattern</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"9:20-9:70\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Two stages: CBT (online) and Skill Test (offline)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:36\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:25\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Mode</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"12:27-12:34\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:72\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:21\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Selection Process</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-sourcepos=\"13:23-13:70\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Computer-Based Test and Skill Test</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">ssc.gov.in</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"SSC_Stenographer_Correction_Window_2024_Online_Apply_From_Here\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024: Online Apply From Here</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Staff Selection Commission is going to activate the online window for application form correction from August 27th (00:01 Hours) to August 28th, 2024 (23:00 Hours). You can change or correct the details in the already-filled application forms through Correction Window. Individuals can correct their application form only in online mode within the given time. The commission will not accept any request for change, correction, or modification in application form after the deadline is over, and the commission will not entertain the SSC Steno Correction form in Post, Fax, email, by hand, etc.</span></p>\r\n<h2><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"SSC_Stenographer_Correction_Window_2024_Dates\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024 Dates</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 70%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(126, 140, 141);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Events</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Dates</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Release</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>26 July 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online application form release date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>26 July 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">last date for submission of application form</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>17 August 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date to Pay Application Fees</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>18 August 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Window for Application Form</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>27 August (00:01 Hours) and 28 August 2024 (23:00 Hours)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit card release date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>To Be Announced</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>October-November 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Provisional Answer Key Release Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>To Be Announced</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Raise Objections</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>To Be Announced</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Final Answer Key Release Date</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>To Be Announced</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Result declaration</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\" width=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>To Be Announced</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Procedure_to_Apply_for_SSC_Stenographer_Correction_Window_2024\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Procedure to Apply for SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">अपने SSC Steno Application Form&nbsp;<strong>मे करेक्शन&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; करने हेतु आपको कुछ स्टेप्स को फॉलो करना होगा जो कि, इस प्रकार से हैं &ndash;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024&nbsp;</strong>के तहत अपने&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;Application Form&nbsp;</strong>मे&nbsp;<strong>Correction&nbsp;</strong>अर्थात् सुधार करने के लिए सबसे पहले आप सभी SSC&rsquo;s&nbsp;<strong>आधिकारीक वेबसाइट&nbsp;</strong>के होम&nbsp; &ndash; पेज पर आना होगा जो कि, जो इस प्रकार का होगा &ndash;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">On this homepage, individuals have to log in by entering their username and password in the provided space</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">After entering the details, click on the &ldquo;Login&rdquo; tab</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">This will direct you to the next web page</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Here, you have to click on the &ldquo;Apply&rdquo; tab</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Next, read the available instructions carefully and click on accept option</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Now your SSC Steno Correction Form will appear on your screen</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">I read the <strong>Correction Form&nbsp;</strong>carefully and made the changes.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Upload your scanned documents, if required, in the prescribed format</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the correction fees of Rs. 200 for the first time and if you are applying for correction the second time, then pay Rs. 500 as fees</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">At last, submit the correction form and also keep a copy of it for your future reference</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">अन्त, इस प्रकार आप सभी आसानी से अपने &ndash; अपने&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;SSC Steno आवेदन फॉर्म&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;में सुधार कर सकते है और इसका लाभ प्राप्त कर सकते है।</span></p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Selection_Procedure\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Selection Procedure</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The Selection of eligible individuals for the available SSC Steno Vacacies will be based on their performance in</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Computer-Based Test</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Skill Test</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"Important_Links\" class=\"ez-toc-section\"></span><strong>Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 60%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(35, 111, 161);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC Steno Correction Window</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"SSC Stenographer 2024\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/api/attachment/uploads/masterData/NoticeBoards/Notice%20dt.%2023-08.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SSC Steno Notification 2024</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"SSC Stenographer 2024\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/api/attachment/uploads/masterData/NoticeBoards/Notice_of_steno_2024_07_26.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a title=\"SSC Stenographer 2024\" href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1724635875-SSC Stenographer Correction Window 2024 .webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-26 00:00:00', '2024-08-26 01:31:15', NULL, NULL),
(362, 'PGCIL Recruitment 2024Apply for Exciting Career Opportunity', 'Explore the latest job openings at Power Grid Corporation of India Limited (PGCIL) and kickstart your career with a dynamic and reputable organization.', '<header>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PGCIL Recruitment 2024 Apply For Various Posts&nbsp;</span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PGCIL Recruitment 2024 Online Form : पावर ग्रिड कॉर्पोरेशन ऑफ इंडिया लिमिटेड ने अप्रेंटिस पदों के लिए रजिस्ट्रेशन प्रक्रिया शुरू कर दी है। इच्छुक अभ्यर्थी आयोग की वेबसाइट powergrid.in पर जाकर आवेदन प्रक्रिया पूरा कर सकते हैं। इस भर्ती में कुल 1000+ पदों पर योग्य अभ्यर्थियों का चयन किया जाना निर्धारित हैं। जिसका आधिकारिक नोटिफिकेशन आयोग की वेबसाइट द्वारा जारी कर दिया गया है। इस भर्ती में भाग लेनेवाले सभी पात्र/इच्छुक उम्मीदवार 20 अगस्त 2024 से 08 सितम्बर 2024 के बीच ऑनलाइन आवेदन कर सकते हैं।</span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Table of Contents</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<nav>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PGCIL Recruitment 2024 Apply For Various Posts&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PGCIL Recruitment 2024 Online Form Important Date</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PGCIL Recruitment 2024 Age Limit&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PGCIL Recruitment 2024 Online Form Qualification</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PGCIL Vacancy Details</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PGCIL Selection Process:</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PGCIL Pay Scale</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Important Link</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</nav></div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">सभी पात्रता और इच्छुक उम्मीदवार नीचे दिए गए महत्वपूर्ण लिंक के माध्यम से ऑनलाइन आवेदन करने से पहले आधिकारिक पूर्ण अधिसूचना पढ़ सकते हैं। जो उम्मीदवार PGCIL Recruitment अधिसूचना 2024 के माध्यम से पोस्ट किए जाने वाले पदों में रुचि रखते हैं, उन्हें powergrid.in पर एक ऑनलाइन आवेदन जमा करना होगा।</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PGCIL Recruitment 2024 Online Form Important Date</strong></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online Apply Start Date:<strong>&nbsp;20 August 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Last Date:<strong>&nbsp;08 September 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available<strong>: Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date:<strong>&nbsp;Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General/ OBC/ EWS Candidates:&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 00/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST/PWD Candidates:&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 00/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode:</strong>&nbsp;Pay the Application fee through a Debit card/ Credit Card/ Net Baking &amp; E-Challan etc. Online Apply Mode. Read the notification For More Details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PGCIL Recruitment 2024 Age Limit&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age:&nbsp;<strong>18 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age:&nbsp;<strong>28 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation: As per Rules. Read the official full notification for more details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PGCIL Recruitment 2024 Online Form Qualification</strong></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BE/B.Tech/B.Sc (Engineering) degree in Electrical, Electronics, Civil, and Computer Science from a recognized university.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Vacancy Wise Qualification.&nbsp;Read the official full notification for more details</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PGCIL Vacancy Details</strong></span>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 25%; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(35, 111, 161);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of the Post</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancy</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apprentice</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1000+</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h5><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PGCIL Selection Process:</strong></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Selection will be done on a merit basis.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Read the official full notification for more details</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>PGCIL Pay Scale</strong></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Salary: Rs 40000 to 45000 per month (Basic Pay), along with other allowances will also be available.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Read the official full notification for more details.</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Link</strong></span>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 60%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"PGCIL \" href=\"https://webapps.powergrid.in/newintranet/login.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Direct Link</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Notification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"PGCIL \" href=\"https://www.powergrid.in/rolling-advertisement-for-enagagement-of-apprentices\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Download Now</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"PGCIL \" href=\"https://www.powergrid.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Main Link</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1724636957-PGCIL Recruitment 2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-26 00:00:00', '2024-08-26 01:49:17', NULL, NULL),
(363, 'BMC Vacancy 2024 Join Our Team and Make a Difference', 'Be a part of the Brihanmumbai Municipal Corporation (BMC) team and contribute to the betterment of Mumbai.', '<header>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">BMC Vacancy 2024 Online Form Apply For Executive Assistant 1846 Posts, 81000/- per month salary</span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BMC Vacancy 2024 Online Form</strong></span></h1>\r\n</header>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BMC Vacancy 2024 Online Form : बृहन्मुंबई महानगरपालिका (BMC) ने एग्जीक्यूटिव असिस्टेंट सहित अन्य पदों पर भर्ती निकाली है। इस भर्ती के लिए&nbsp;इच्छुक&nbsp;उम्मीदवार ऑफिशियल वेबसाइट&nbsp;<strong>portal.mcgm.gov.in</strong>&nbsp;पर जाकर अप्लाई कर सकते हैं।&nbsp;इस भर्ती में कुल&nbsp;<strong>1846 पदों</strong>&nbsp;पर योग्य अभ्यर्थियों का चयन किया जाना निर्धारित हैं। जिसका आधिकारिक नोटिफिकेशन आयोग की वेबसाइट द्वारा जारी कर दिया गया है। इस भर्ती में भाग लेनेवाले सभी पात्र/इच्छुक उम्मीदवार&nbsp;<strong>20 अगस्त 2024 से 09 सितम्बर 2024</strong>&nbsp;के बीच ऑनलाइन आवेदन कर सकते हैं।</span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Table of Contents</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<nav>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BMC Vacancy 2024 Online Form</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BMC Vacancy 2024 Online Form Important Date</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BMC Recruitment 2024 Age Limit&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;BMC Recruitment 2024 Online Form Qualification</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">BMC 2024 Vacancy Details</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Selection Process:</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Pay Scale</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Important Link</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</nav></div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">सभी पात्रता और इच्छुक उम्मीदवार नीचे दिए गए महत्वपूर्ण लिंक के माध्यम से ऑनलाइन आवेदन करने से पहले आधिकारिक पूर्ण अधिसूचना पढ़ सकते हैं। जो उम्मीदवार BMC Recruitment अधिसूचना 2024 के माध्यम से पोस्ट किए जाने वाले पदों में रुचि रखते हैं, उन्हें powergrid.in पर एक ऑनलाइन आवेदन जमा करना हो</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BMC Vacancy 2024 Online Form Important Date</strong></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Online Apply Start Date:<strong>&nbsp;20 August 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Last Date:<strong>&nbsp;09 September 2024</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card Available<strong>: Before Exam</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date:<strong>&nbsp;Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General/ OBC/ EWS Candidates:&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC/ST/PWD Candidates:&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 900/-</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode:</strong>&nbsp;Pay the Application fee through a Debit card/ Credit Card/ Net Baking &amp; E-Challan etc. Online Apply Mode. Read the notification For More Details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BMC Recruitment 2024 Age Limit&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age:&nbsp;<strong>18 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age:&nbsp;<strong>38 Years.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation: As per Rules. Read the official full notification for more details.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;BMC Recruitment 2024 Online Form Qualification</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have passed 10th from a recognized board.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Vacancy Wise Qualification. Read the official full notification for more details</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>BMC 2024 Vacancy Details</strong></span></h4>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 40%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(52, 73, 94);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Name of the Post</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Vacancy</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Executive Assistant</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1846</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h5><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Selection Process:</strong></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>The Selection process consists of (1) a Written test and (2) a Skill test.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Skill test.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Read the official full notification for more details</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Written test:&nbsp;</strong>The written test of 90 minutes duration will be conducted with 80 multiple choice questions carrying one mark for each correct answer. There will be a negative mark of 0.33 for each wrong answer. The syllabus of the written test shall be curriculum and the test will be conducted in such a way that the theoretical and practical knowledge of the candidate is tested covering both the breadth and depth of the&nbsp;prescribed curriculum.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Skill test:</strong><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Based on the performance in the written test, candidates will be shortlisted for the skill test in a 1:5 ratio with a minimum of 10 candidates. The skill test will be purely on a &lsquo;go-no-go&rsquo; basis and marks obtained in the skill test will not be considered for selection.</span></p>\r\n<br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Pay Scale</strong></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Executive Assistant Salary</strong>:&nbsp; Rs. 25,500-81,100 (Pay Matrix-M15 + applicable allowances)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Read the official full notification for more details.</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important Link</strong></span></h2>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 60%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border: 2px solid rgb(126, 140, 141);\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"BMC Vacancy 2024\" href=\"https://portal.mcgm.gov.in/irj/portal/anonymous\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Link Active</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Notification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"BMC Vacancy 2024\" href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com//per/g01/pub/726/EForms/image/ImageDocUpload/12/1113152940247967827083.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Download Now</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 2px; border-color: rgb(126, 140, 141);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a title=\"BMC Vacancy 2024\" href=\"https://portal.mcgm.gov.in/irj/portal/anonymous\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Main Link</strong></a></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>', '1724683309-BMC Vacancy 2024.webp', '1', 10, 'Y', '2024-08-26 00:00:00', '2024-08-26 02:41:49', NULL, NULL),
(364, 'Saripodhaa Sanivaaram release date', '\"The Allure of Saripodhaa Sanivaaram: What You Need to Know\"  Discover the captivating world of Saripodhaa Sanivaaram, a 2024 Indian Telugu-language film direct', '<h1>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram is a 2024 Indian Telugu-language</h1>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram</strong>&nbsp;is a 2024 Indian Telugu-language film directed by Vivek Athreya.</li>\r\n<li>The movie features a compelling storyline with notable performances by Nani and SJ Suryah.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>While the film has received praise for its engaging first half and mesmerising interval block, some viewers have noted that the runtime feels a bit lengthy. Fans and critics alike are discussing the film&rsquo;s impact, with particular attention to its ratings and release date. Whether you&rsquo;re interested in&nbsp;<em>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram</em>&nbsp;reviews, the performances of Nani and Suryah, or the film&rsquo;s overall reception, this latest Telugu release offers a mix of drama and entertainment.</p>\r\n<h2>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram release date</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram</strong>&nbsp;is a 2024 Indian Telugu-language film directed by&nbsp;<a title=\"the-allure-of-saripodhaa-sanivaaram\" href=\"https://tazblog.com/the-allure-of-saripodhaa-sanivaaram-what-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vivek Athreya</a>. The movie was officially released on&nbsp;29 August 2024, bringing a fresh narrative to Telugu cinema. Fans of Nani and SJ Suryah eagerly awaited this release, and the film\'s debut has generated significant buzz. With its launch,&nbsp;<em>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram</em>&nbsp;marks an important addition to the 2024 film slate, combining engaging performances with a captivating storyline. For those interested in the latest Telugu releases, this film offers a notable mix of drama and entertainment.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>\"The Allure of Saripodhaa Sanivaaram: What You Need to Know\"</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Discover the captivating world of&nbsp;<em>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram</em>, a 2024 Indian Telugu-language film directed by Vivek Athreya. This film has garnered attention for its engaging narrative and standout performances by Nani and SJ Suryah. Despite some feedback about its slightly lengthy runtime, the movie has been praised for its intriguing first half and a mesmerising interval block.</p>\r\n<p>In this review, we delve into what makes&nbsp;<em>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram</em>&nbsp;a must-watch, including its release date, key plot points, and the critical reception. Whether you&rsquo;re curious about the film\'s rating, its unique elements, or what to expect, this guide provides all the essential insights to enhance your viewing experience.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4><strong>\"The Allure of Saripodhaa Sanivaaram: What You Need to Know\"</strong></h4>\r\n<p><em>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram</em>, a 2024 Indian Telugu-language film directed by Vivek Athreya, has intrigued&nbsp;<a title=\"saripodhaa-sanivaaram\" href=\"https://tazblog.com/the-allure-of-saripodhaa-sanivaaram-what-you-need-to-know\">a</a>udiences with its unique narrative and stellar cast. This film features Nani and SJ Suryah in lead roles, delivering performances that have been widely praised. While some reviews mention that the film\'s runtime is a bit lengthy, the first half and the interval block stand out as highlights, captivating viewers with their engaging content and dramatic twists.</p>\r\n<p>In this guide, explore the key aspects of&nbsp;<a title=\"allure-of-saripodhaa\" href=\"https://tazblog.com/the-allure-of-saripodhaa-sanivaaram-what-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Saripodhaa Sanivaaram</em></a>&mdash;from its release date and plot overview to its critical reception and audience reactions. Discover why this film is creating buzz and what makes it a noteworthy addition to the Telugu cinema landscape.</p>', '1724915794-images.jpg', '18', 13, 'Y', '2024-08-29 00:00:00', '2024-08-29 07:16:34', NULL, NULL);
