0, 0, 0); width: 4.50689%; height: 50px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>49</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 209.812px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.9431%; height: 209.812px;\" colspan=\"16\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 class=\"JlqpRe\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"JCzEY tNxQIb\"><span class=\"CSkcDe\">How to fill out a CISF form?&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Recruitment Online Form 2024</span></strong></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Central Industrial Security Force (CISF) Constable Male Recruitment 2024. Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>31/08/2024 to 30/09/2024.</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Photo Instruction : </strong>Candidate has to upload his/her latest passport photo and should have the<strong> date of photograph.</strong> Photograph should not be more than 03 months old.</li>\r\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in CISF India Latest Jobs 2024.</li>\r\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document - Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\r\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form - Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\r\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\r\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.8125px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 99.9431%; height: 67.8125px;\" colspan=\"16\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 67.8125px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 50.7084%; height: 67.8125px;\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"365\">\r\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\r\n</td