†à¤µà¤¶à¥à¤¯à¤• à¤¦à¤¸à¥à¤¤à¤¾à¤µà¥‡à¤œ&zwnj;</strong></h3>\r\n<p>à¤‘à¤¨à¤²à¤¾à¤‡à¤¨ à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤•à¤°à¤¤à¥‡ à¤¸à¤®à¤¯ à¤¨à¤¿à¤®à¥à¤¨à¤²à¤¿à¤–à¤¿à¤¤ à¤¦à¤¸à¥à¤¤à¤¾à¤µà¥‡à¤œà¥‹à¤‚ à¤•à¥€ à¤†à¤µà¤¶à¥à¤¯à¤•à¤¤à¤¾ à¤¹à¥‹à¤—à¥€:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>à¤†à¤§à¤¾à¤° à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¥à¤¡</strong> (à¤ªà¤¹à¤šà¤¾à¤¨ à¤ªà¤¤à¥à¤° à¤•à¥‡ à¤°à¥‚à¤ª à¤®à¥‡à¤‚)à¥¤</li>\r\n<li><strong>à¤¸à¥à¤¥à¤¾à¤¯à¥€ à¤¨à¤¿à¤µà¤¾à¤¸ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤®à¤¾à¤£ à¤ªà¤¤à¥à¤°à¥¤</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>à¤¸à¥à¤¨à¤¾à¤¤à¤• à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤®à¤¾à¤£ à¤ªà¤¤à¥à¤°/à¤…à¤‚à¤•à¤ªà¤¤à¥à¤°à¥¤</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>à¤¬à¥ˆà¤‚à¤• à¤ªà¤¾à¤¸à¤¬à¥à¤•</strong> (à¤œà¤¿à¤¸à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤–à¤¾à¤¤à¤¾ à¤¸à¤‚à¤–à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤”à¤° IFSC à¤•à¥‹à¤¡ à¤¹à¥‹)à¥¤</li>\r\n<li>à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¿à¤•à¤¾ à¤•à¤¾ <strong>à¤«à¥‹à¤Ÿà¥‹ à¤”à¤° à¤¹à¤¸à¥à¤¤à¤¾à¤•à¥à¤·à¤°à¥¤</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ”¹ <strong>à¤‘à¤¨à¤²à¤¾à¤‡à¤¨ à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤•à¥à¤°à¤¿à¤¯à¤¾</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>à¤šà¤°à¤£ 1: à¤†à¤§à¤¿à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¤¿à¤• à¤µà¥‡à¤¬à¤¸à¤¾à¤‡à¤Ÿ à¤ªà¤° à¤œà¤¾à¤à¤‚</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>à¤µà¥‡à¤¬à¤¸à¤¾à¤‡à¤Ÿ à¤²à¤¿à¤‚à¤•:</strong> <a href=\"https://medhasoft.bih.nic.in/\">https://medhasoft.bih.nic.in</a></li>\r\n<li>à¤¹à¥‹à¤®à¤ªà¥‡à¤œ à¤ªà¤° &ldquo;à¤¸à¥à¤¨à¤¾à¤¤à¤• à¤›à¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤° à¤ªà¤‚à¤œà¥€à¤•à¤°à¤£&rdquo; à¤ªà¤° à¤•à¥à¤²à¤¿à¤• à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>à¤šà¤°à¤£ 2: à¤ªà¤‚à¤œà¥€à¤•à¤°à¤£ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚</strong></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>à¤…à¤ªà¤¨à¤¾ à¤¨à¤¾à¤®, à¤®à¥‹à¤¬à¤¾à¤‡à¤² à¤¨à¤‚à¤¬à¤°, à¤ˆà¤®à¥‡à¤² à¤†à¤ˆà¤¡à¥€, à¤†à¤§à¤¾à¤° à¤¨à¤‚à¤¬à¤° à¤”à¤° à¤…à¤¨à¥à¤¯ à¤†à¤µà¤¶à¥à¤¯à¤• à¤œà¤¾à¤¨à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¥€ à¤­à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n<li>à¤®à¥‹à¤¬à¤¾à¤‡à¤² à¤ªà¤° à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤¾à¤ªà¥à¤¤ OTP à¤•à¥‡ à¤®à¤¾à¤§à¥à¤¯à¤® à¤¸à¥‡ à¤¸à¤¤à¥à¤¯à¤¾à¤ªà¤¨ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n<li>à¤ªà¤‚à¤œà¥€à¤•à¤°à¤£ à¤ªà¥‚à¤°à¤¾ à¤•à¤°à¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¬à¤¾à¤¦ à¤²à¥‰à¤—à¤¿à¤¨ à¤µà¤¿à¤µà¤°à¤£ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤¾à¤ªà¥à¤¤ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h4><strong>à¤šà¤°à¤£ 3: à¤²à¥‰à¤—à¤¿à¤¨ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>à¤ªà¤‚à¤œà¥€à¤•à¥ƒà¤¤ à¤ˆà¤®à¥‡à¤² à¤”à¤° à¤ªà¤¾à¤¸à¤µà¤°à¥à¤¡ à¤•à¤¾ à¤‰à¤ªà¤¯à¥‹à¤— à¤•à¤°à¤•à¥‡ à¤µà¥‡à¤¬à¤¸à¤¾à¤‡à¤Ÿ à¤ªà¤° à¤²à¥‰à¤—à¤¿à¤¨ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>à¤šà¤°à¤£ 4: à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤«à¥‰à¤°à¥à¤® à¤­à¤°à¥‡à¤‚</strong></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>à¤µà¥à¤¯à¤•à¥à¤¤à¤¿à¤—à¤¤ à¤”à¤° à¤¶à¥ˆà¤•à¥à¤·à¤¿à¤• à¤œà¤¾à¤¨à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¥€ à¤­à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n<li>à¤¬à¥ˆà¤‚à¤• à¤–à¤¾à¤¤à¤¾ à¤µà¤¿à¤µà¤°à¤£ à¤¦à¤°à¥à¤œ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h4><strong>à¤šà¤°à¤£ 5: à¤¦à¤¸à¥à¤¤à¤¾à¤µà¥‡à¤œà¤¼ à¤…à¤ªà¤²à¥‹à¤¡ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>à¤¸à¤­à¥€ à¤†à¤µà¤¶à¥à¤¯à¤• à¤¦à¤¸à¥à¤¤à¤¾à¤µà¥‡à¤œ à¤¸à¥à¤•à¥ˆà¤¨ à¤•à¤° à¤…à¤ªà¤²à¥‹à¤¡ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>à¤šà¤°à¤£ 6: à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤œà¤®à¤¾ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&ldquo;à¤¸à¤¬à¤®à¤¿à¤Ÿ&rdquo; à¤¬à¤Ÿà¤¨ à¤ªà¤° à¤•à¥à¤²à¤¿à¤• à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n<li>à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤¸à¤«à¤²à¤¤à¤¾à¤ªà¥‚à¤°à¥à¤µà¤• à¤œà¤®à¤¾ à¤¹à¥‹à¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¬à¤¾à¤¦ à¤ªà¤¾à¤µà¤¤à¥€ à¤ªà¥ƒà¤·à¥à¤  (Acknowledgment Page) à¤•à¤¾ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤¿à¤‚à¤Ÿà¤†à¤‰à¤Ÿ à¤²à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ”¹ <strong>à¤®à¤¹à¤¤à¥à¤µà¤ªà¥‚à¤°à¥à¤£ à¤¤à¤¿à¤¥à¤¿à¤¯à¤¾à¤‚</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤•à¥€ à¤…à¤‚à¤¤à¤¿à¤® à¤¤à¤¿à¤¥à¤¿: <span style=\"background-color: rgb(251, 238, 184);\">07- Jan -2025</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ”¹ <strong>FAQs</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>à¤®à¥à¤–à¥à¤¯à¤®à¤‚à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥€ à¤•à¤¨à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤‰à¤¤à¥à¤¥à¤¾à¤¨ à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ à¤•à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤¹à¥ˆ?</li>\r\n<li>à¤•à¤¨à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤‰à¤¤à¥à¤¥à¤¾à¤¨ à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ à¤•à¥‡ à¤²à¤¿à¤ à¤•à¥Œà¤¨ à¤ªà¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤° à¤¹à¥ˆ?</li>\r\n<li>à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¤à¤¹à¤¤ à¤•à¤¿à¤¤à¤¨à¥€ à¤°à¤¾à¤¶à¤¿ à¤®à¤¿à¤²à¤¤à¥€ à¤¹à¥ˆ?</li>\r\n<li>à¤®à¥à¤–à¥à¤¯à¤®à¤‚à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥€ à¤•à¤¨à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤‰à¤¤à¥à¤¥à¤¾à¤¨ à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ à¤•à¥‡ à¤²à¤¿à¤ à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤•à¥ˆà¤¸à¥‡ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚?</li>\r\n<li>à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ à¤•à¥€ à¤…à¤‚à¤¤à¤¿à¤® à¤¤à¤¿à¤¥à¤¿ à¤•à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤¹à¥ˆ?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ”¹ <strong>à¤¨à¤¿à¤·à¥à¤•à¤°à¥à¤·</strong></h3>\r\n<p>à¤®à¥à¤–à¥à¤¯à¤®à¤‚à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥€ à¤•à¤¨à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤‰à¤¤à¥à¤¥à¤¾à¤¨ à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ à¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤° à¤¸à¤°à¤•à¤¾à¤° à¤•à¥€ à¤à¤• à¤•à¥à¤°à¤¾à¤‚à¤¤à¤¿à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¥€ à¤ªà¤¹à¤² à¤¹à¥ˆà¥¤ à¤‡à¤¸ à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ à¤•à¤¾ à¤‰à¤¦à¥à¤¦à¥‡à¤¶à¥à¤¯ à¤¬à¤¾à¤²à¤¿à¤•à¤¾à¤“à¤‚ à¤•à¥‹ à¤‰à¤šà¥à¤š à¤¶à¤¿à¤•à¥à¤·à¤¾ à¤•à¥‡ à¤²à¤¿à¤ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¥‹à¤¤à¥à¤¸à¤¾à¤¹à¤¿à¤¤ à¤•à¤°à¤¨à¤¾ à¤”à¤° à¤‰à¤¨à¥à¤¹à¥‡à¤‚ à¤†à¤¤à¥à¤®à¤¨à¤¿à¤°à¥à¤­à¤° à¤¬à¤¨à¤¾à¤¨à¤¾ à¤¹à¥ˆà¥¤ à¤ªà¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤° à¤¬à¤¾à¤²à¤¿à¤•à¤¾à¤à¤‚ à¤œà¤²à¥à¤¦ à¤¸à¥‡ à¤œà¤²à¥à¤¦ à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚ à¤”à¤° à¤‡à¤¸ à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ à¤•à¤¾ à¤²à¤¾à¤­ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤¾à¤ªà¥à¤¤ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤</p>\r\n<p><strong>à¤†à¤§à¤¿à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¤¿à¤• à¤²à¤¿à¤‚à¤•:</strong> <a href=\"https://medhasoft.bih.nic.in/\">https://medhasoft.bih.nic.in</a></p>', '1735969361-Bihar-Kanya-utha-Yojana-Online-2025.webp', '18', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-04 00:00:00', '2025-01-04 05:42:41', 'Approved', 'à¤¬à¤¿à¤¹à¤¾à¤° à¤®à¥à¤–à¥à¤¯à¤®à¤‚à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥€ à¤•à¤¨à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤‰à¤¤à¥à¤¥à¤¾à¤¨ à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ 2024-25: à¤¸à¥à¤¨à¤¾à¤¤à¤• à¤¬à¤¾à¤²à¤¿à¤•à¤¾à¤“à¤‚ à¤•à¥‹ â‚¹50,000 à¤ªà¥à¤°à¥‹à¤¤à¥à¤¸à¤¾à¤¹à¤¨ à¤°à¤¾à¤¶à¤¿à¥¤ à¤ªà¤¾à¤¤à¥à¤°à¤¤à¤¾, à¤¦à¤¸à¥à¤¤à¤¾à¤µà¥‡à¤œà¤¼, à¤”à¤° à¤‘à¤¨à¤²à¤¾à¤‡à¤¨ à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤•à¥à¤°à¤¿à¤¯à¤¾ à¤œà¤¾à¤¨à¥‡à¤‚à¥¤,à¤®à¥à¤–à¥à¤¯à¤®à¤‚à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥€ à¤•à¤¨à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤‰à¤¤à¥à¤¥à¤¾à¤¨ à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ 2024 | â‚¹50,000 à¤•à¥‡ à¤²à¤¿à¤ à¤‘à¤¨à¤²à¤¾à¤‡à¤¨ à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚,à¤®à¥à¤–à¥à¤¯à¤®à¤‚à¤¤à¥à¤°à¥€ à¤•à¤¨à¥à¤¯à¤¾ à¤‰à¤¤à¥à¤¥à¤¾à¤¨ à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾ à¤•à¥‡ à¤²à¤¿à¤ à¤‘à¤¨à¤²à¤¾à¤‡à¤¨, à¤†à¤µà¥‡à¤¦à¤¨ à¤•à¥ˆà¤¸à¥‡ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚ à¤¸à¥à¤¨à¤¾à¤¤à¤• à¤¬à¤¾à¤²à¤¿à¤•à¤¾à¤“à¤‚ à¤•à¥‡ à¤²à¤¿à¤ â‚¹50,000 à¤¯à¥‹à¤œà¤¨à¤¾, Kanya Utthan Yojana Registration Process Documents required for Kanya Utthan Yojana Bihar'),
(377, 'PM-KISAN 19th Installment 2025: Check Status, Date, and Updates', 'Know all about the PM-KISAN 19th installment for 2025. Check eligibility, beneficiary status, important dates, and how to update details for timely payment.', '<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi (PM-KISAN) Yojana: 19th Installment Update 2025</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi (PM-KISAN) Yojana is a flagship scheme launched by the Government of India to provide financial assistance to farmers across the country. Under this scheme, eligible farmers receive an annual income support of â‚¹6,000 in three equal installments. The 19th installment for the year 2025 is eagerly awaited by beneficiaries. In this article, we will provide complete details about the 19th installment, including eligibility criteria, how to check the status, and the steps to ensure you receive the benefit.</p>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ”¹ <strong>What is PM-KISAN Yojana?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The PM-KISAN scheme was launched in February 2019 to provide direct income support to small and marginal farmers. It aims to supplement the financial needs of farmers for agricultural and allied activities, ensuring their financial independence and sustainability.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Annual Support:</strong> Farmers receive â‚¹6,000 per year in three equal installments of â‚¹2,000 each.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT):</strong> The amount is directly credited to the beneficiary&rsquo;s bank account.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Coverage:</strong> Small and marginal farmers owning up to 2 hectares of cultivable land.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ”¹ <strong>19th Installment of PM-KISAN (2025)</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The 19th installment is expected to be disbursed in Feb-<strong>2025]</strong>. Beneficiaries should ensure their details are updated to avoid delays.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Dates:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Installment Period:</strong> [Exact period, e.g., April-July 2025]</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Expected Disbursement Date:</strong> Feb-2025</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Over 11 crore farmers are expected to benefit.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>The installment will be credited to the registered bank accounts through DBT.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ”¹ <strong>Eligibility Criteria for PM-KISAN</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">To receive the benefits of PM-KISAN, farmers must meet the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Ownership of Land:</strong> The applicant must own cultivable land.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Farming Activity:</strong> Must be actively involved in agricultural activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Aadhaar Linking:</strong> Aadhaar must be linked with the PM-KISAN portal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Exclusions:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Institutional landholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Government employees and pensioners (excluding Class IV/multi-tasking staff).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Professionals like doctors, engineers, and lawyers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ”¹ <strong>Steps to Check 19th Installment Status</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Farmers can easily check their installment status online through the PM-KISAN portal. Here&rsquo;s a step-by-step guide:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol data-spread=\"true\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Visit the Official Website:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Go to the PM-KISAN portal: <a href=\"https://pmkisan.gov.in\">https://pmkisan.gov.in</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Click on &ldquo;Beneficiary Status&rdquo;:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>On the homepage, select the &ldquo;Beneficiary Status&rdquo; option.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Enter Your Details:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Enter your Aadhaar number, bank account number, or mobile number.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Click on &ldquo;Get Data.&rdquo;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>View Status:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Your installment status will be displayed, including payment details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ”¹ <strong>Steps to Update Beneficiary Details</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">To avoid delays or rejections in receiving the 19th installment, farmers should ensure their information is accurate and up-to-date. Follow these steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol data-spread=\"true\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Update Aadhaar Details:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Visit the nearest CSC (Common Service Center) or update details online at <a href=\"https://pmkisan.gov.in\">https://pmkisan.gov.in</a>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Link Bank Account with Aadhaar:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Ensure your bank account is linked with your Aadhaar number.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Check Land Records:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Verify your land ownership records to ensure they match the PM-KISAN database.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ”¹ <strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>1. When will the 19th installment be credited?</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The 19th installment is expected to be credited in <strong>[Feb-2025].</strong></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>2. How can I check my name in the beneficiary list?</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Visit the official PM-KISAN portal and use the &ldquo;Beneficiary List&rdquo; feature to check your name.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>3. What should I do if my installment is not credited?</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Check your status on the PM-KISAN portal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Contact your local agriculture office for assistance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>4. Can new farmers apply for PM-KISAN?</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Yes, new eligible farmers can register on the official portal.</p>\r\n<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;</h3>', '1735970181-pm-kisan-samman-nidhi.webp', '18', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-04 00:00:00', '2025-01-04 05:56:21', 'Approved', 'PM-KISAN 19th Installment 2025,  Pradhan Mantri Kisan Yojana,  PM Kisan Beneficiary List 2025,  PM Kisan Status Check,How to check, PM Kisan 19th Installment status online,  PM Kisan Samman Nidhi Yojana installment date 2025,  Update Aadhaar details for PM Kisan scheme');
