(379, 'RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II Recruitment 2024: Apply Online for 2129 TGT Posts', 'Explore the latest RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II Recruitment 2024 for 2129 TGT posts. Get complete details on eligibility, exam pattern, important dates, and the online application process. Don\'t miss this teaching opportunity in Rajasthan!', '<h3>Rajasthan RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II (TGT) Teacher Recruitment 2024: Apply Online for 2129 Posts</h3>\r\n<p>The Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC) has announced the much-awaited <strong>Senior Teacher Grade II (TGT) Teacher Recruitment 2024</strong> for 2129 vacancies. This is a golden opportunity for aspiring educators looking to make a career in teaching. In this article, we provide all the essential details, including important dates, eligibility criteria, application process, and more.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h4>Highlights of RPSC Senior Teacher Recruitment 2024</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Recruitment Authority</strong>: Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Post Name</strong>: Senior Teacher Grade II (TGT)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Vacancies</strong>: 2129</li>\r\n<li><strong>Application Mode</strong>: Online</li>\r\n<li><strong>Job Location</strong>: Rajasthan</li>\r\n<li><strong>Official Website</strong>: <a href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/\">rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Important Dates</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Event</th>\r\n<th>Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Notification Release Date</td>\r\n<td>January 2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Online Application Start Date</td>\r\n<td><strong>26/12/2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td><strong>24/01/2025</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Exam Date</td>\r\n<td><strong>As per Schedule</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Vacancy Details</h3>\r\n<p>The recruitment is for Senior Teacher (Grade II) across various subjects. Below is the tentative subject-wise breakup of vacancies:</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Subject</th>\r\n<th>Vacancies</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Hindi</td>\r\n<td>500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>English</td>\r\n<td>400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Mathematics</td>\r\n<td>300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Science</td>\r\n<td>350</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Social Science</td>\r\n<td>350</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Sanskrit</td>\r\n<td>200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Urdu</td>\r\n<td>29</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Punjabi</td>\r\n<td>10</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total</td>\r\n<td>2129</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Eligibility Criteria</h3>\r\n<h4>1. Educational Qualification:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>For Hindi, English, Mathematics, Sanskrit, Urdu, and Punjabi</strong>: Graduation or equivalent in the concerned subject with at least 50% marks along with a Degree/Diploma in Education (B.Ed/DELEd).</li>\r\n<li><strong>For Science</strong>: Graduation in Science (Physics, Chemistry, or Biology) with a minimum of 50% marks and a Degree/Diploma in Education.</li>\r\n<li><strong>For Social Science</strong>: Graduation in History, Geography, Economics, Political Science, or Sociology with a minimum of 50% marks and a Degree/Diploma in Education.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>2. Age Limit (as of the application closing date):</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Minimum Age</strong>: 18 years</li>\r\n<li><strong>Maximum Age</strong>: 40 years</li>\r\n<li>Age relaxation is applicable as per government norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Application Fee</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Category</th>\r\n<th>Application Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>General</td>\r\n<td>INR 350</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>OBC/MBC (Non-Creamy Layer)</td>\r\n<td>INR 250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>SC/ST</td>\r\n<td>INR 150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>PwD/Family Income Below 2.5 Lakhs</td>\r\n<td>INR 150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>How to Apply Online for RPSC Senior Teacher Recruitment 2024</h3>\r\n<p>Follow the steps below to successfully apply online:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Visit the official RPSC website: <a href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/\">rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li>Click on the \"Apply Online\" link under the <strong>Senior Teacher Grade II Recruitment 2024</strong> section.</li>\r\n<li>Register yourself using a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li>Fill in the online application form with personal, educational, and professional details.</li>\r\n<li>Upload the required documents, including a scanned photograph and signature.</li>\r\n<li>Pay the application fee through online payment modes such as Net Banking, Credit/Debit Card, or UPI.</li>\r\n<li>Review your application form and submit it.</li>\r\n<li>Download and print the application form for future reference.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Selection Process</h3>\r\n<p>The selection process will consist of the following stages:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Written Examination</strong>: Objective-type test based on the relevant subject and general knowledge.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Document Verification</strong>: Shortlisted candidates will be called for verification of documents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Final Merit List</strong>: Based on performance in the written exam and eligibility criteria.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Exam Pattern</h3>\r\n<p>The written examination will be conducted in two papers:</p>\r\n<h4>Paper-I: General Knowledge</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Subjects</strong>: History, Geography, Polity, and Culture of Rajasthan; Current Affairs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Marks</strong>: 200</li>\r\n<li><strong>Duration</strong>: 2 hours</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Paper-II: Subject Knowledge</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Subjects</strong>: Concerned subject based on the syllabus of Graduation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Marks</strong>: 300</li>\r\n<li><strong>Duration</strong>: 3 hours</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Important Links</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/677aba08-0080-800b-b1a4-b7dc38ea67ce\">Download Official Notification</a> <em>(Link to be updated)</em></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/677aba08-0080-800b-b1a4-b7dc38ea67ce\">Apply Online</a> <em>(Link to be updated)</em></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/677aba08-0080-800b-b1a4-b7dc38ea67ce\">RPSC Previous Year Question Papers</a> <em>(Link to be updated)</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Preparation Tips</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Understand the syllabus and exam pattern thoroughly.</li>\r\n<li>Focus on Rajasthan-specific topics for Paper-I.</li>\r\n<li>Practice previous year&rsquo;s question papers to get an idea of the exam format.</li>\r\n<li>Enroll in online mock tests for time management and accuracy.</li>\r\n<li>Refer to standard books and study material for in-depth preparation.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Final Words</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II Recruitment 2024</strong> is an excellent opportunity for those aspiring to work in the teaching sector in Rajasthan. Make sure to stay updated with the official website for notifications regarding the application start date and other details. Prepare diligently and aim for success.</p>\r\n<p>For more updates and study materials, keep visiting <strong><a href=\"https://www.examinfo.blog/\">www.examinfo.blog</a></strong>.</p>', '1736097012-teacher recruitment in Rajasthan, India.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-05 00:00:00', '2025-01-05 17:10:12', 'Approved', 'RPSC Senior Teacher Recruitment 2024, RPSC TGT Teacher Vacancy 2024, RPSC 2129 Teacher Posts, Rajasthan Teacher Recruitment 2024, Apply Online RPSC 2024, RPSC Teacher Eligibility, RPSC Exam Pattern 2024, Rajasthan Teacher Jobs'),
(380, 'RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II Recruitment 2024: Apply Online for 2129 TGT Posts', 'Explore the latest RPSC Senior Teacher Grade II Recruitment 2024 for 2129 TGT posts. Get complete details on eligibility, exam pattern, important dates, and the online application process. Don\'t miss this teaching opportunity in Rajasthan!', '<h3>Rajasthan Board REET 2024: Apply Online for Level I and II Exam 2025</h3>\r\n<p>The Rajasthan Board of Secondary Education (RBSE) has officially announced the <strong>REET 2024 (Rajasthan Eligibility Examination for Teachers)</strong> for Level I and Level II. This highly anticipated exam will be conducted in 2025 to recruit eligible candidates for teaching positions in primary and upper primary schools across Rajasthan. In this article, we provide all essential details, including application process, eligibility criteria, important dates, and preparation tips to help you excel in the exam.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Highlights of REET 2024</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Exam Name</strong>: Rajasthan Eligibility Examination for Teachers (REET) 2024</li>\r\n<li><strong>Conducting Body</strong>: Rajasthan Board of Secondary Education (RBSE)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Posts</strong>: Level I (Primary Teacher) and Level II (Upper Primary Teacher)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Application Mode</strong>: Online</li>\r\n<li><strong>Job Location</strong>: Rajasthan</li>\r\n<li><strong>Official Website</strong>: <a href=\"https://rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in/\">rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Important Dates</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Event</th>\r\n<th>Date</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Notification Release Date</td>\r\n<td>January 2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Start of Online Applications</td>\r\n<td>16/12/2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td>15/01/2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admit Card Release</td>\r\n<td>19/02/2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Exam Date</td>\r\n<td>27/02/2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Result Declaration</td>\r\n<td>To Be Announced</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Eligibility Criteria</h3>\r\n<h4>Level I (Primary Teacher: Classes 1 to 5)</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Educational Qualification</strong>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Senior Secondary (or equivalent) with at least 50% marks and a 2-year Diploma in Elementary Education (D.El.Ed).</li>\r\n<li>OR Senior Secondary with at least 45% marks and a 2-year Diploma in Elementary Education as per NCTE regulations.</li>\r\n<li>OR Senior Secondary with at least 50% marks and a 4-year Bachelor of Elementary Education (B.El.Ed).</li>\r\n<li>OR Graduation and a 2-year Diploma in Elementary Education.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Level II (Upper Primary Teacher: Classes 6 to 8)</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Educational Qualification</strong>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Graduation and a 2-year Diploma in Elementary Education.</li>\r\n<li>OR Graduation with at least 50% marks and a 1-year Bachelor in Education (B.Ed).</li>\r\n<li>OR Graduation with at least 45% marks and a 1-year B.Ed as per NCTE regulations.</li>\r\n<li>OR Senior Secondary with at least 50% marks and a 4-year B.A/B.Sc.Ed or B.A.Ed/B.Sc.Ed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Age Limit</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Minimum Age</strong>: 18 years</li>\r\n<li><strong>Maximum Age</strong>: 40 years</li>\r\n<li>Age relaxation is applicable as per government norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Application Fee</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Category</th>\r\n<th>Level I or Level II</th>\r\n<th>Both Levels</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>General/OBC</td>\r\n<td>INR 550</td>\r\n<td>INR 750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>SC/ST/PwD</td>\r\n<td>INR 350</td>\r\n<td>INR 550</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>How to Apply for REET 2024</h3>\r\n<p>Follow these steps to apply online:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Visit the official RBSE website: <a href=\"https://rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in/\">rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li>Click on the \"REET 2024 Application\" link.</li>\r\n<li>Register yourself with a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li>Log in and fill in the application form with personal, educational, and contact details.</li>\r\n<li>Upload scanned copies of your photograph and signature as per the prescribed format.</li>\r\n<li>Pay the application fee through online modes like UPI, Net Banking, or Debit/Credit Card.</li>\r\n<li>Review your application and submit it.</li>\r\n<li>Download and print the application form for future reference.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Exam Pattern</h3>\r\n<h4>Level I (Primary Teacher)</h4>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Subject</th>\r\n<th>Questions</th>\r\n<th>Marks</th>\r\n<th>Duration</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Child Development and Pedagogy</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>2.5 hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Language I (Hindi/English)</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Language II (Hindi/English)</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Mathematics</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Environmental Studies</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Total</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>150</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>150</strong></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Level II (Upper Primary Teacher)</h4>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Subject</th>\r\n<th>Questions</th>\r\n<th>Marks</th>\r\n<th>Duration</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Child Development and Pedagogy</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>2.5 hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Language I (Hindi/English)</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Language II (Hindi/English)</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Mathematics &amp; Science OR Social Studies</td>\r\n<td>60</td>\r\n<td>60</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Total</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>150</strong></td>\r\n<td><strong>150</strong></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Preparation Tips</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Understand the syllabus thoroughly and focus on high-weightage topics.</li>\r\n<li>Develop a study schedule and allocate time for each subject.</li>\r\n<li>Practice previous years\' question papers to get familiar with the exam pattern.</li>\r\n<li>Join mock tests to enhance time management and accuracy.</li>\r\n<li>Use NCERT books and standard study materials for conceptual clarity.</li>\r\n<li>Stay updated on Rajasthan&rsquo;s history, culture, and geography for REET-specific topics.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Important Links</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/677aba08-0080-800b-b1a4-b7dc38ea67ce\">Official Notification</a> <em>(To be updated)</em></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/677aba08-0080-800b-b1a4-b7dc38ea67ce\">Apply Online</a> <em>(To be updated)</em></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/677aba08-0080-800b-b1a4-b7dc38ea67ce\">REET Previous Year Question Papers</a> <em>(To be updated)</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>Why Choose REET 2024?</h3>\r\n<p>Qualifying REET 2024 not only opens doors to a prestigious teaching career in Rajasthan but also ensures job security and growth opportunities in the education sector. With over thousands of teaching positions available, this is a golden opportunity for aspiring teachers to make their dreams a reality.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p>For more updates and guidance, visit <strong><a href=\"https://www.examinfo.blog/\">www.examinfo.blog</a></strong>. Stay tuned for notifications and detailed study resources!</p>', '1736097586-REET 2024 Exam. The image includes the Rajasthan Board of Secondary Education (RBSE) lo.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-05 00:00:00', '2025-01-05 17:19:46', 'Approved', 'RPSC Senior Teacher Recruitment 2024, RPSC TGT Teacher Vacancy 2024, RPSC 2129 Teacher Posts, Rajasthan Teacher Recruitment 2024, Apply Online RPSC 2024, RPSC Teacher Eligibility, RPSC Exam Pattern 2024, Rajasthan Teacher Jobs'),
(381, 'SBI Junior Associates Recruitment 2024: Apply Online for 13,735 Customer Support and Sales Posts', 'Apply online for SBI Junior Associates Recruitment 2024 with 13,735 vacancies for Customer Support and Sales roles. Check eligibility, exam pattern, application process, and preparation tips for this prestigious banking opportunity.', '<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">State Bank of India (SBI) Junior Associates Recruitment 2024: Apply Online for 13,735 Posts</h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The State Bank of India (SBI) has released the notification for the recruitment of <strong>Junior Associates (Customer Support and Sales)</strong> for 2024. This is an excellent opportunity for aspiring candidates seeking a career in the banking sector. With a total of <strong>13,735 vacancies</strong>, SBI offers a prestigious and rewarding career. Here, we provide complete details about the recruitment process, including eligibility, important dates, application process, and preparation tips.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Highlights of SBI Junior Associates Recruitment 2024</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Organization</strong>: State Bank of India (SBI)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Post Name</strong>: Junior Associates (Customer Support and Sales)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Vacancies</strong>: 13,735</li>\r\n<li><strong>Job Location</strong>: Across India</li>\r\n<li><strong>Application Mode</strong>: Online</li>\r\n<li><strong>Official Website</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.sbi.co.in/\">www.sbi.co.in</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Important Dates</h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; margin-left: 40px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px; padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 60.7009%; 