 can be found in the official notification.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Eligibility Criteria</h3>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Educational Qualification</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must have a <strong>graduation degree</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university or equivalent qualification.</li>\r\n<li>Final-year students may also apply, provided they produce proof of passing by the specified date.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Age Limit (as of 01.04.2024)</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Minimum Age</strong>: 20 years</li>\r\n<li><strong>Maximum Age</strong>: 28 years</li>\r\n<li>Age relaxation is applicable as per government norms for reserved categories.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Application Fee</h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; margin-left: 40px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Category</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Fee</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">General/OBC/EWS</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">INR 750</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">SC/ST/PwD</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Nil</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">How to Apply for SBI Junior Associates Recruitment 2024</h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Follow these steps to apply online:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Visit the official SBI website: <a href=\"https://www.sbi.co.in/\">www.sbi.co.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li>Click on the \"Careers\" section and find the Junior Associates Recruitment link.</li>\r\n<li>Register yourself by providing a valid email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li>Fill in the application form with personal, educational, and professional details.</li>\r\n<li>Upload required documents, including scanned photographs and signatures, as per the prescribed format.</li>\r\n<li>Pay the application fee through online modes such as Net Banking, UPI, or Debit/Credit Card.</li>\r\n<li>Verify all details and submit the application.</li>\r\n<li>Download and print the application form for future reference.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Selection Process</h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The selection process consists of the following stages:</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">1. Preliminary Examination</h4>\r\n<table style=\"height: 144px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; margin-left: 40px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px; padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 37.9009%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Subject</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 24.1983%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Questions</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 14.5773%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Marks</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 23.3236%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Duration</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px; padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.9009%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">English Language</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.1983%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">30</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5773%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">30</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.3236%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">20 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px; padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.9009%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Numerical Ability</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.1983%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">35</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5773%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">35</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.3236%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">20 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px; padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.9009%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Reasoning Ability</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.1983%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">35</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5773%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">35</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.3236%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">20 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px; padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.9009%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Total</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 24.1983%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>100</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5773%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>100</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.3236%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>1 hour</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">2. Main Examination</h4>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; margin-left: 40px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Subject</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Questions</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Marks</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Duration</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">General/Financial Awareness</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">50</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">50</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">35 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">General English</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">40</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">40</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">35 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Quantitative Aptitude</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">50</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">50</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">45 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">Reasoning Ability &amp; Computer Aptitude</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">50</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">60</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\">45 minutes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Total</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>190</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>200</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>2 hours 40 minutes</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">3. Language Proficiency Test (LPT)</h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Candidates must qualify in the local language test for the state they are applying to.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Salary and Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Basic Pay</strong>: INR 19,900 (Pay Scale: INR 17,900-47,920)</li>\r\n<li>Additional benefits include DA, HRA, medical allowance, and other perks as per banking norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Preparation Tips</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Understand the Syllabus</strong>: Familiarize yourself with the exam pattern and syllabus.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Practice Mock Tests</strong>: Take online mock tests to improve time management and accuracy.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Focus on Weak Areas</strong>: Identify weak subjects and allocate extra time for them.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Read Current Affairs</strong>: Stay updated with the latest financial and general knowledge.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Use Standard Study Material</strong>: Refer to recommended books and online resources.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Important Links</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/677aba08-0080-800b-b1a4-b7dc38ea67ce\">Official Notification</a> <em>(To be updated)</em></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/677aba08-0080-800b-b1a4-b7dc38ea67ce\">Apply Online</a> <em>(To be updated)</em></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/677aba08-0080-800b-b1a4-b7dc38ea67ce\">SBI Junior Associates Previous Year Question Papers</a> <em>(To be updated)</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Why Join SBI as a Junior Associate?</h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">SBI is India&rsquo;s largest public sector bank, offering a stable and secure career with numerous growth opportunities. As a Junior Associate, you will gain valuable experience in banking operations and customer handling, making it an excellent starting point for a successful banking career.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Stay updated with all the latest information about SBI Junior Associates Recruitment 2024 by visiting <strong><a href=\"https://www.examinfo.blog/\">www.examinfo.blog</a></strong> regularly. Don&rsquo;t miss this opportunity to join India&rsquo;s premier banking institution!</p>', '1736098357-_cb03db73-e05c-4697-a067-9d1f347b987a.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-05 00:00:00', '2025-01-05 17:33:08', 'Approved', 'SBI Junior Associates Recruitment 2024, SBI Clerk Recruitment 2024, Apply Online for SBI 2024, SBI 13735 Junior Associates Vacancies, SBI Clerk Eligibility 2024, SBI Exam Pattern 2024, Banking Jobs in India 2024, SBI Clerk Preparation Tips');
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(382, 'Apply for Madhya Pradesh State Service Exam SSE MPPSC Pre Recruitment 2025 â€“ 158 Posts', 'Apply online for the MPPSC 2025 State Service Exam (SSE) to secure one of 158 posts. Get all details including eligibility, application process, important dates, and more.', '<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Madhya Pradesh State Service Exam SSE MPPSC Pre Recruitment 2025 &ndash; Apply Online for 158 Posts</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Madhya Pradesh Public Service Commission (MPPSC) is inviting applications for the <strong>State Service Exam (SSE) MPPSC Pre Recruitment 2025</strong>. This prestigious exam offers a golden opportunity for aspiring civil servants in Madhya Pradesh. With <strong>158 vacancies</strong> available across various administrative posts, this is a chance for candidates to serve the state government and contribute to its growth.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Overview of MPPSC 2025 State Service Exam (SSE)</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>MPPSC State Service Exam 2025</strong> aims to select eligible candidates for a range of posts in various administrative departments of Madhya Pradesh. The <strong>MPPSC Prelims</strong> exam is the first stage of selection, followed by the <strong>Mains Exam</strong> and an <strong>Interview</strong>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Exam Highlights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Name of Exam:</strong> Madhya Pradesh State Service Exam 2025</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Posts:</strong> 158</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mode of Application:</strong> Online</li>\r\n<li><strong>Official Website:</strong> <a target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">MPPSC Official Website</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria for MPPSC 2025</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Before applying for the MPPSC SSE Exam, ensure that you meet the eligibility requirements.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Age Limit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Minimum Age: 21 years</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Age: 40 years</li>\r\n<li>Relaxation in age for reserved categories (SC/ST/OBC) as per government norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Qualification:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates should have a <strong>Bachelor&rsquo;s degree</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university or institution.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Nationality:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Must be a citizen of India.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>How to Apply for MPPSC 2025 Online</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">To apply for the MPPSC 2025 exam, follow these simple steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Visit the Official MPPSC Website:</strong> Go to <a target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">mppsc.nic.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Register for an Account:</strong> Click on the \"Apply Online\" link to register.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Fill Out the Application Form:</strong> Enter all necessary details including personal information, education, etc.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Upload Documents:</strong> Upload your photograph, signature, and other required documents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pay the Application Fee:</strong> The fee varies by category. (General: â‚¹500, SC/ST/OBC: â‚¹250)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Submit the Application:</strong> Review all details and submit your form.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Print Your Application:</strong> Take a printout for future reference.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Dates for MPPSC 2025</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Start Date of Application:</strong> January 10, 2025</li>\r\n<li><strong>Last Date to Apply Online:</strong> February 10, 2025</li>\r\n<li><strong>MPPSC Prelims Exam Date:</strong> March 15, 2025</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Selection Process for MPPSC 2025</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The selection process for MPPSC 2025 includes the following stages:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Prelims Exam:</strong> A screening test consisting of objective-type questions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mains Exam:</strong> A descriptive exam that tests in-depth knowledge.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Interview:</strong> A personality test for shortlisted candidates.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Tips for Preparing for MPPSC 2025</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">To increase your chances of success in the MPPSC 2025, here are some preparation tips:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Understand the Syllabus:</strong> Familiarize yourself with the syllabus and exam pattern.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Study Materials:</strong> Use recommended books and resources for MPPSC.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Practice Mock Tests:</strong> Regularly practice with mock exams to improve speed and accuracy.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Stay Updated:</strong> Keep track of current affairs, as they are a crucial part of the exam.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>MPPSC 2025</strong> is a highly competitive exam that opens up various administrative opportunities in Madhya Pradesh. By following the application steps, staying on top of deadlines, and preparing strategically, you can increase your chances of success.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Apply now for the <strong>158 posts</strong> available in the MPPSC 2025 recruitment and take the first step toward a rewarding career in civil services!</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">For more updates, stay tuned to <strong>ExamInfo.blog</strong> for all the latest information regarding exam dates, study materials, and tips.</p>', '1736099426-_6fa30299-b1ec-46c8-a1af-771b7130873f.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-05 00:00:00', '2025-01-05 17:50:26', 'Approved', 'MPPSC 2025, Madhya Pradesh State Service Exam, SSE MPPSC Pre Recruitment, MPPSC Apply Online, MPPSC Eligibility, MPPSC Prelims Exam 2025, MPPSC 158 Posts'),
(383, 'RRB Group D Recruitment 2025: Apply Online Now â€“ Eligibility, Dates, and Application Process', 'Stay updated with the latest RRB Group D Recruitment 2025! Learn about the eligibility criteria, important dates, and step-by-step application process to secure your spot. Apply online now and kickstart your career with Indian Railways.', '<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Railway RRB Group D Recruitment 2025: Apply Online for Vacancies Now!</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Railway Recruitment Board (RRB) has officially released the notification for <strong>RRB Group D Recruitment 2025</strong>. This is a golden opportunity for aspirants seeking a secure and prestigious government job in the Indian Railways. In this article, we will provide you with a comprehensive guide on the application process, eligibility criteria, important dates, and tips to ace the RRB Group D exam.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>RRB Group D Recruitment 2025 Overview</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The RRB Group D Recruitment process is designed to fill a variety of positions, including track maintainers, helpers, assistants, and other posts in Level 1 of the 7th CPC Pay Matrix. Below are the key highlights of the recruitment drive:</p>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Category</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Recruitment Authority</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Name of Post</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Group D (Level 1) Posts</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Total Vacancies</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">[To Be Announced]</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Application Mode</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Official Website</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a href=\"http://www.rrb.gov.in/\">www.rrb.gov.in</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Key Dates</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Notification Release Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Online Application Start Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>23-01-2025</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Last Date to Apply</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong class=\"red\">22-02-2025</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Admit Card Release</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Examination Dates</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Candidates must meet the following eligibility requirements to apply for RRB Group D posts:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Minimum qualification: Class 10th or ITI from NCVT/SCVT-recognized institutions.</li>\r\n<li>Equivalent qualification as per RRB norms is also acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Age Limit</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Minimum Age: 18 years</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Age: 33 years (age relaxation applicable for reserved categories).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Nationality</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Applicants must be Indian citizens.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>How to Apply for RRB Group D Recruitment 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Follow these simple steps to successfully submit your online application:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Visit the Official Website</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Go to the official RRB portal: <a href=\"http://www.rrb.gov.in/\">www.rrb.gov.in</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Find the Application Link</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Look for the \"RRB Group D Recruitment 2025\" notification in the latest updates section.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Register Yourself</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Complete the one-time registration using your valid email ID and phone number.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Fill in the Application Form</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Enter your personal details, educational qualifications, and preferences.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Upload Required Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Attach scanned copies of your photograph, signature, and supporting documents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Pay the Application Fee</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Use online payment methods to pay the fee (category-wise charges apply).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Submit and Print</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Review the application form carefully and submit it. Take a printout for future reference.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Exam Pattern and Syllabus</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The RRB Group D examination consists of the following stages:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Computer-Based Test (CBT):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>General Science</li>\r\n<li>Mathematics</li>\r\n<li>General Intelligence &amp; Reasoning</li>\r\n<li>General Awareness and Current Affairs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Physical Efficiency Test (PET):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must meet the physical fitness standards specified by the RRB.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Document Verification and Medical Examination:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Shortlisted candidates will undergo document verification and a medical fitness test.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Tips to Crack RRB Group D Exam 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Understand the Exam Pattern</strong><br>Familiarize yourself with the syllabus and distribution of marks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Practice Mock Tests</strong><br>Regularly attempt mock tests to improve speed and accuracy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Time Management</strong><br>Divide your study hours wisely among all subjects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Stay Updated</strong><br>Keep yourself informed about current affairs and Railway-related developments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Why Choose a Career in Indian Railways?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Indian Railways is one of the largest employers in the world, offering a stable career with excellent growth opportunities. Group D jobs come with attractive salaries, allowances, and job security.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Official Notification</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.rrb.gov.in/\">Click Here</a></li>\r\n<li><strong>Apply Online</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.rrb.gov.in/\">Direct Link</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>RRB Group D Recruitment 2025</strong> is an excellent opportunity for individuals aspiring for a government job in Indian Railways. Ensure that you fulfill the eligibility criteria and submit your application before the deadline. Start your preparation early to secure a place in this competitive examination.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">For the latest updates and preparation tips, stay tuned to <a href=\"../../\">ExamInfo.blog</a>.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><em><strong>Handling multiple papers?</strong></em></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Speed up your research with Sider! Our AI-powered sidebar features 10+ one-click tools including a more advanced Search Agent, ChatPDF, context-aware utilities and more to help you work smarter and faster.<br><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4aSnMXa\">Level up your research game here</a></p>', '1736103414-(RRB).webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-05 00:00:00', '2025-01-05 18:56:54', 'Approved', 'RRB Group D Recruitment 2025, RRB Group D Apply Online, RRB Group D Eligibility Criteria, RRB Group D Application Dates, RRB Group D Online Application Process'),
(384, 'OPSC Civil Service Exam 2025: Notification, Application Process, and Key Details', 'OPSC Civil Service Exam 2025, including the official notification, eligibility criteria, application process, and important dates. Stay prepared to secure your future with Odisha Public Service Commission.', '<div>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>OPSC Civil Service Exam 2025: Notification, Application Process, and Key Details</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>Odisha Public Service Commission (OPSC)</strong> has officially announced the <strong>OPSC Civil Service Exam 2025</strong> notification for aspiring candidates. This is a prime opportunity for individuals seeking prestigious administrative positions in the state of Odisha. Below, we provide a detailed guide on eligibility criteria, application process, key dates, and preparation tips to help you get started.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Overview of OPSC Civil Service Exam 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The OPSC Civil Service Examination is conducted annually to recruit candidates for various administrative positions in the state, including Odisha Administrative Service (OAS), Odisha Police Service (OPS), and Odisha Revenue Service (ORS).</p>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Feature</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Conducting Body</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Odisha Public Service Commission (OPSC)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Exam Name</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">OPSC Civil Service Exam 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Exam Level</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">State-Level</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Application Mode</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Official Website</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a href=\"https://www.opsc.gov.in/\">www.opsc.gov.in</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 46.7304%; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 32.6832%; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 46.7304%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Notification Release Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 32.6832%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 46.7304%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Application Start Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 32.6832%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">10/01/2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 46.7304%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Last Date to Apply</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 32.6832%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">10/02/2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 46.7304%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Prelims Exam Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 32.6832%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 46.7304%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Mains Exam Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 32.6832%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must hold a bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline from a recognized university.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Age Limit</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Minimum Age: 21 years</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Age: 32 years (age relaxation as per category norms).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Nationality</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Applicants must be Indian citizens.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Number of Attempts</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>General Category: 6 attempts</li>\r\n<li>SC/ST: Unlimited attempts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Vacancies</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The OPSC will announce the total number of vacancies in the official notification. These positions are distributed across various services, including OAS, OPS, and ORS.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Application Process</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">To apply for the OPSC Civil Service Exam 2025, follow these steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Visit the Official Website</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Go to <a href=\"https://www.opsc.gov.in/\">www.opsc.gov.in</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Register Online</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Click on the \"New Registration\" link, enter your details, and create login credentials.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Fill the Application Form</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Log in with your credentials and fill out the application form with accurate details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Upload Required Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Upload scanned copies of your photograph, signature, and necessary documents as per specifications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Pay the Application Fee</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Use online payment methods to pay the prescribed fee (category-wise charges apply).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Submit and Print</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Double-check your application, submit it, and take a printout for future reference.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Exam Pattern</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The OPSC Civil Service Exam consists of three stages:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Preliminary Exam</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Objective type with two papers (General Studies Paper I &amp; II).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Main Exam</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Descriptive type covering a range of subjects including essay, optional subjects, and general studies.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Personality Test (Interview)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Assessment of communication skills, personality, and overall suitability for administrative roles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Preparation Tips</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Understand the Syllabus</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Go through the official syllabus thoroughly to identify key topics.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Regular Practice</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solve previous years&rsquo; question papers and take mock tests.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Focus on Current Affairs</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stay updated with daily news, especially issues related to Odisha.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Join Coaching or Study Groups</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Collaborate with peers or join reputed coaching institutes for structured preparation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Why Choose OPSC Civil Services?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The OPSC Civil Service Exam offers aspirants a chance to contribute significantly to state administration while enjoying job security, a respectable salary, and ample growth opportunities.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Official Notification</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.opsc.gov.in/\">Click Here</a></li>\r\n<li><strong>Apply Online</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.opsc.gov.in/\">Direct Link</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>OPSC Civil Service Exam 2025</strong> is your gateway to a rewarding career in public service. Ensure you meet the eligibility criteria and submit your application before the deadline. Start preparing early to maximize your chances of success.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">For the latest updates and preparation resources, stay tuned to our blog!</p>\r\n</div>', '1736104212-Odisha.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-05 00:00:00', '2025-01-05 19:10:12', 'Approved', 'OPSC Civil Service Exam 2025, OPSC 2025 Notification, OPSC Application Process, OPSC Eligibility Criteria, Odisha Civil Services 2025'),
(385, 'HDFC Relationship Manager Recruitment 2024: Apply Online Now', 'HDFC Bank invites applications for the Relationship Manager Recruitment 2024. Learn about eligibility criteria, key dates, and the step-by-step online application process. Start your career journey with one of Indiaâ€™s leading banks today!', '<div>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>HDFC Relationship Manager Recruitment 2024: Apply Online Now!</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">HDFC Bank, one of India\'s leading private sector banks, has released the notification for the <strong>HDFC Relationship Manager Recruitment 2024</strong>. This recruitment drive is a fantastic opportunity for individuals seeking a dynamic career in the banking sector. Below, we provide you with all the details, including eligibility criteria, application steps, and other essential information.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Overview of HDFC Relationship Manager Recruitment 2024</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Feature</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Organization</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">HDFC Bank</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Relationship Manager</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Total Vacancies</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">[To Be Announced]</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Application Mode</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Job Type</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Full-Time</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Work Location</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Across India</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Official Website</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a href=\"https://www.hdfcbank.com/\">www.hdfcbank.com</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Key Dates</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Notification Release Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">December 2023</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Application Start Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>30-12-2024</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Last Date to Apply</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">07/02/2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Interview/Selection Date</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must have a <strong>Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree</strong> in any discipline from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li>MBA/PGDM or equivalent qualifications in finance, marketing, or relevant fields are preferred.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Experience</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Prior experience in banking, sales, or relationship management will be an added advantage.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Age Limit</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Minimum: 21 years</li>\r\n<li>Maximum: 35 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Skills Required</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Strong communication and interpersonal skills</li>\r\n<li>Ability to build and maintain customer relationships</li>\r\n<li>Knowledge of financial products and banking processes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Roles and Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">As a Relationship Manager at HDFC Bank, you will be responsible for:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Building and maintaining relationships with high-value customers.</li>\r\n<li>Advising clients on financial products and services based on their needs.</li>\r\n<li>Meeting sales targets for banking products, including loans, credit cards, and investments.</li>\r\n<li>Resolving customer queries and providing excellent service.</li>\r\n<li>Collaborating with internal teams to ensure client satisfaction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>How to Apply for HDFC Relationship Manager Recruitment 2024</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Follow these steps to complete your application:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Visit the Official Website</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Navigate to <a href=\"https://www.hdfcbank.com/careers\">www.hdfcbank.com/careers</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Search for Job Openings</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Look for \"Relationship Manager Recruitment 2024\" in the Careers section.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Register and Login</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Create an account with a valid email ID and login to access the application form.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Fill in the Application Form</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Enter your personal details, educational qualifications, and work experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Upload Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Attach your updated resume, photograph, and supporting documents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Submit the Application</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Review your form and submit it online. Take a printout for future reference.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Selection Process</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The recruitment process for HDFC Relationship Manager typically includes:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Initial Screening</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Applications are reviewed to shortlist eligible candidates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Personal Interview</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Shortlisted candidates will be invited for an interview to assess their skills and suitability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Final Selection</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Based on performance in the interview, candidates will receive an offer letter.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Perks and Benefits</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Competitive salary and performance-based incentives</li>\r\n<li>Health insurance and other employee benefits</li>\r\n<li>Professional development and growth opportunities</li>\r\n<li>Work-life balance in a supportive work environment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Why Choose HDFC Bank?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">HDFC Bank is a pioneer in providing excellent banking services and career opportunities. Working as a Relationship Manager here allows you to grow professionally, contribute to customer satisfaction, and be part of one of the most reputed banking institutions in India.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Official Notification</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.hdfcbank.com/careers\">Click Here</a></li>\r\n<li><strong>Apply Online</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.hdfcbank.com/careers\">Direct Link</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>HDFC Relationship Manager Recruitment 2024</strong> is a promising opportunity for professionals looking to make a mark in the banking sector. Ensure you meet the eligibility criteria and submit your application promptly. Start preparing for the selection process to secure your place in this esteemed organization.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">For the latest updates and career tips, stay tuned to our blog!</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"></div>', '1736104873-hdfc.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-05 00:00:00', '2025-01-05 19:21:13', 'Approved', 'HDFC Relationship Manager Recruitment 2024, HDFC Bank Careers 2024, Relationship Manager Job Application, HDFC Recruitment Online Form, HDFC Relationship Manager Eligibility'),
(386, 'Railway RRB Technician Exam City Check 2024: Step-by-Step Guide', 'Find out how to check your Railway RRB Technician Exam City for 2024. This guide covers the step-by-step process, key dates, important documents, and preparation tips to ensure a hassle-free exam experience.', '<h1 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Railway RRB Technician Exam City Check 2024: Complete Guide</h1>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Railway Recruitment Board (RRB) conducts the Technician Exam to recruit skilled professionals for Indian Railways. For the 2024 session, the process of checking the exam city and other key details is a crucial step for aspirants. This article covers everything you need to know about the <strong>RRB Technician Exam City Check 2024</strong> and offers essential tips for preparation.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>How to Check RRB Technician Exam City 2024?</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The exam city information helps candidates plan their travel and stay during the examination period. Follow these steps to check your allotted exam city:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Visit the Official RRB Website</strong>:<br>Navigate to your respective regional RRB website, such as <strong>rrbcdg.gov.in</strong> or <strong>rrbsecunderabad.nic.in</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Look for the &ldquo;Exam City and Date Intimation&rdquo; Link</strong>:<br>This link will usually be featured on the homepage under the &ldquo;Latest Announcements&rdquo; section.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Enter Your Credentials</strong>:<br>Use your <strong>Registration Number</strong> and <strong>Date of Birth (DOB)</strong> to log in.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Access the Exam City Details</strong>:<br>Once logged in, you&rsquo;ll find the exam city, date, and session details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Download the Intimation Slip</strong>:<br>Save and print the slip for reference during travel arrangements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Key Dates for RRB Technician Exam City Check 2024</strong></h2>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; width: 26.8151%; height: 90px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; width: 37.0832%; height: 18px;\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; width: 46.0443%; height: 18px;\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 37.0832%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Release of Exam City Link</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 46.0443%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2024 (Tentative)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 37.0832%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Download of Admit Cards</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 46.0443%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4 days before the exam</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 37.0832%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Exam Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 46.0443%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">February-March 2024 (Tentative)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Make sure to regularly check the official website for updates.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Why is the Exam City Check Important?</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Knowing your exam city in advance offers several benefits:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Travel Planning</strong>: Book transportation and accommodation early to avoid last-minute hassles.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Stress Reduction</strong>: Helps you focus on preparation rather than logistics.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Admit Card Readiness</strong>: Ensure you have all the documents ready before the journey.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Documents Required for Exam Day</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Carry these essential documents to the examination center:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Admit Card</strong>: Print your admit card after downloading it.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Photo ID Proof</strong>: Such as Aadhar Card, Passport, or Driving License.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Passport-Sized Photographs</strong>: Keep 2-3 recent photographs, identical to the one uploaded during the application.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Tips for Last-Minute Preparation</strong></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Revise Key Topics</strong>: Focus on subjects like <strong>General Intelligence</strong>, <strong>Mathematics</strong>, <strong>General Science</strong>, and <strong>Technical Abilities</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Practice Mock Tests</strong>: Take RRB-specific mock tests to improve speed and accuracy.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Stay Updated</strong>: Keep track of current affairs, especially railway-related news.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Time Management</strong>: Use a timer while solving questions to build time efficiency.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">1. <strong>When will the exam city link be activated?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The link is expected to be activated in January 2024. Visit the official website regularly for updates.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">2. <strong>What if I forget my registration number?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Retrieve it using the &ldquo;Forgot Registration Number&rdquo; option available on the login page.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">3. <strong>Can I change my exam city after allotment?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">No, the exam city allotted by RRB cannot be changed under any circumstances.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Links</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Here are the official RRB websites for reference:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>RRB Allahabad</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.rrbald.gov.in/\">www.rrbald.gov.in</a></li>\r\n<li><strong>RRB Chennai</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.rrbchennai.gov.in/\">www.rrbchennai.gov.in</a></li>\r\n<li><strong>RRB Secunderabad</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.rrbsecunderabad.nic.in/\">www.rrbsecunderabad.nic.in</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Staying informed about the exam city and date is vital for every RRB Technician aspirant. By following the steps mentioned above and keeping track of key updates, you can ensure a smooth examination experience. Prepare diligently, stay confident, and aim for success!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1736180839-a666871e-87b4-42fa-892d-dc54133e6aaf.webp', '14', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-06 00:00:00', '2025-01-06 16:27:19', 'Approved', 'RRB Technician Exam City 2024, Railway Technician Exam City Check, RRB Exam City Allotment, RRB Technician Admit Card 2024, RRB Technician Exam Date, How to check RRB exam city, RRB Technician travel tips.');
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(387, 'NTA CUET PG 2025: Apply Online Form, Eligibility, and Exam Details', 'Get detailed insights about the NTA Common University Entrance Test (CUET) PG 2025, including application form details, eligibility criteria, exam pattern, and important dates. Follow the step-by-step guide to apply online and prepare effectively for', '<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>NTA Common University Entrance Test (CUET) PG 2025: Apply Online Form</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>Common University Entrance Test Postgraduate (CUET PG) 2025</strong>, conducted by the National Testing Agency (NTA), is a pivotal examination for aspirants seeking admission to postgraduate programs in participating universities across India. If you\'re planning to apply, here\'s a comprehensive guide covering essential details, application steps, and important dates to ensure your preparation is seamless.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Overview of CUET PG 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The CUET PG is designed to streamline postgraduate admissions by providing a single, standardized platform for universities and students alike. With a wide array of participating universities, CUET PG enables students to focus on their desired academic pursuits without the hassle of multiple entrance exams.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Conducting Authority:</strong> National Testing Agency (NTA)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Exam Mode:</strong> Computer-Based Test (CBT)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Participating Institutions:</strong> Over 100 central, state, and private universities</li>\r\n<li><strong>Programs Offered:</strong> Master&rsquo;s Degree Courses across disciplines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Dates for CUET PG 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Dates</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Release of Notification</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025 (Tentative)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Start of Online Application</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">March 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Correction Window</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">March 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Admit Card Release</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">April 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Examination Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">May 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Result Declaration</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">June 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Before applying, ensure you meet the following eligibility criteria:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Qualification:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must have completed or be appearing for the final year of their undergraduate degree in a relevant field.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Age Limit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>No specific age limit. However, age requirements of the university you are applying to must be adhered to.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Minimum Marks:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>General Category: Minimum 50% in undergraduate program</li>\r\n<li>Reserved Categories: Relaxation as per NTA norms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>How to Apply for CUET PG 2025?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Follow these steps to complete your application online:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Visit the Official Website:</strong><br>Go to the NTA CUET PG portal at <a href=\"https://nta.ac.in\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">nta.ac.in</a> or <a target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">cuet.nta.nic.in</a>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Registration:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Click on the &ldquo;New Registration&rdquo; button.</li>\r\n<li>Fill in basic details like name, date of birth, email ID, and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li>Create a password and note down the system-generated application number.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Filling the Application Form:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Login using the application number and password.</li>\r\n<li>Enter academic qualifications, exam center preferences, and course details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Upload Documents:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passport-sized photograph (recent, as per specifications)</li>\r\n<li>Scanned signature</li>\r\n<li>Category certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li>Undergraduate mark sheets (if available)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Payment of Application Fee:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>General Category: â‚¹800</li>\r\n<li>Reserved Categories (SC/ST/PwD): â‚¹400</li>\r\n<li>Pay via debit/credit card, UPI, or net banking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Submit Application Form:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Review all details carefully.</li>\r\n<li>Submit the form and take a printout for future reference.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Exam Pattern and Syllabus</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The CUET PG 2025 exam will consist of multiple-choice questions (MCQs) designed to assess subject knowledge, analytical skills, and reasoning ability.</p>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Sections</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Number of Questions</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Marks</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Duration</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Subject-Specific</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">75</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">300</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">2 hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">General Awareness</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">25</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">100</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Key Benefits of CUET PG</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Uniform Admissions Process:</strong> Simplifies the application process for multiple universities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Wide Reach:</strong> Enables access to over 100 participating universities across India.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Standardized entrance test ensuring merit-based admissions.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Preparation Tips</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Understand the Syllabus:</strong> Download the CUET PG syllabus from the official website and create a study plan.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mock Tests:</strong> Practice regularly with NTA mock tests to familiarize yourself with the exam pattern.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Time Management:</strong> Allocate sufficient time for each subject and revise consistently.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Stay Updated:</strong> Regularly visit the official website for updates and announcements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The CUET PG 2025 is a golden opportunity for postgraduate aspirants to secure admissions in top-tier universities. Start your application early, follow the official guidelines, and prepare diligently to ace the exam.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">For more updates, keep checking the official NTA CUET PG portal.</p>', '1736276825-338222a4-d1dd-4b8a-a8f9-75269ebd7e56.webp', '15', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-07 00:00:00', '2025-01-07 19:07:05', 'Approved', 'CUET PG 2025, NTA CUET PG Application Form, CUET PG Online Registration, CUET PG 2025 Exam Details, CUET PG 2025 Eligibility, Common University Entrance Test PG Postgraduate Admission 2025, NTA Entrance Test for PG, How to Apply CUET PG 2025, CUET PG Syllabus and Pattern'),
(388, 'Navodaya Vidyalaya Class IX Admissions 2025: Apply Online Form, Eligibility, and Exam Guide', 'Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti (NVS) Class IX Admissions 2025, including application details, eligibility criteria, important dates, and the exam pattern. Follow the step-by-step guide to apply online and prepare for the Lateral Entry Admission Test.', '<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti (NVS) Class IX Admissions 2025: Apply Online Form</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti (NVS)</strong> has released the official notification for <strong>Class IX Admissions 2025</strong> through the <strong>Lateral Entry Admission Test</strong>. This program offers meritorious students the opportunity to join Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalayas (JNVs), known for their quality education and holistic development approach. If you\'re planning to apply, here\'s everything you need to know about eligibility, application procedures, and key dates.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Overview of NVS Class IX Admissions 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Navodaya Vidyalayas are government-run residential schools that aim to provide high-quality education to talented students from rural areas. Admission to Class IX is conducted through a competitive <strong>Lateral Entry Test</strong>, which evaluates a student\'s aptitude and potential.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Conducting Body:</strong> Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti (NVS)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Admission Level:</strong> Class IX (9th)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mode of Examination:</strong> Offline (OMR-based test)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Medium of Examination:</strong> English and Hindi</li>\r\n<li><strong>Application Mode:</strong> Online</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Dates for NVS Class IX Admissions 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Notification Release</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Online Application Start</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">February 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Admit Card Release</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">March 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Exam Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">April 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Result Declaration</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">June 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Before applying, ensure you meet the following eligibility requirements:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Qualification:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Students must be studying in Class VIII during the academic year 2024&ndash;2025 in a recognized school in the district where the JNV is located.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Age Limit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Students must be born between <strong>May 1, 2009, and April 30, 2013</strong> (both dates inclusive).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Residency Requirement:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must be residents of the district where the JNV is situated.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Previous Enrollment in JNV:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Students already admitted to JNV are not eligible for the Lateral Entry Test.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>How to Apply for NVS Class IX Admissions 2025?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Follow the steps below to complete the online application process:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Visit the Official Website:</strong><br>Go to the Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti\'s admission portal at <a href=\"https://navodaya.gov.in\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">https://navodaya.gov.in</a>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Registration:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Click on the &ldquo;Class IX Lateral Entry Admission 2025&rdquo; link.</li>\r\n<li>Register using basic details such as name, date of birth, email ID, and mobile number.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Fill the Application Form:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Log in with the generated credentials.</li>\r\n<li>Provide details about the current school, district, and personal information.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Upload Documents:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Scanned passport-sized photograph</li>\r\n<li>Scanned signature of the candidate</li>\r\n<li>Proof of date of birth (birth certificate)</li>\r\n<li>Class VIII academic record</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Submit the Form:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Review the application form carefully and submit it.</li>\r\n<li>Download and print a copy of the confirmation page for future reference.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Exam Pattern and Syllabus</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>Lateral Entry Admission Test</strong> for Class IX is designed to assess a student&rsquo;s skills in core subjects.</p>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; width: 25.4902%; height: 126px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); width: 24.594%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Subject</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); width: 16.2649%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Questions</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); width: 9.61538%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Marks</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); width: 14.4231%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Duration</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 24.594%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mathematics</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 16.2649%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 9.61538%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 14.4231%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 24.594%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">General Science</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 16.2649%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 9.61538%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 14.4231%; height: 36px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 24.594%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">English</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 16.2649%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 9.61538%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 14.4231%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 24.594%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hindi</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 16.2649%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 9.61538%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 14.4231%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 24.594%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Total</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 16.2649%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>100</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 9.61538%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>100</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; width: 14.4231%; height: 18px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2.5 Hours</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Preparation Tips for NVS Class IX Admissions</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Understand the Syllabus:</strong><br>Focus on Class VIII-level Mathematics, Science, English, and Hindi topics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Practice Previous Papers:</strong><br>Solve previous years&rsquo; question papers to understand the exam pattern.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Mock Tests:</strong><br>Take regular mock tests to build speed and accuracy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Time Management:</strong><br>Allocate dedicated time for each subject during preparation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Key Benefits of Joining Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalayas</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Holistic Education:</strong> High-quality education emphasizing academics, sports, and co-curricular activities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Affordable:</strong> Free education, boarding, and lodging for all admitted students.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Equal Opportunity:</strong> Special focus on rural and underserved students.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The NVS Class IX Admission 2025 is a golden opportunity for deserving students to receive quality education in a nurturing environment. Start your application process early and prepare diligently to excel in the entrance test. For the latest updates, visit the official NVS website.</p>', '1736277436-4da011b8-2047-4d35-afa6-4a3cbfda0292.webp', '15', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-07 00:00:00', '2025-01-07 19:17:16', 'Approved', 'NVS Class IX Admissions 2025, Navodaya Vidyalaya Admission Form 2025, Class 9 Admission in JNV, How to Apply for NVS Class IX 2025, NVS Lateral Entry Test 2025, JNV Admission for Class 9th, NVS Admission Eligibility 2025, Navodaya Vidyalaya Entrance Exam 2025, NVS Class IX Syllabus and Exam Pattern, Navodaya Vidyalaya Online Registration 2025'),
(389, 'UP DELEd 2024 Round I Online Counseling Registration: Step-by-Step Guide', 'UP DELEd 2-Year Course Admissions 2024 Round I Online Counseling, including important dates, eligibility criteria, and registration steps. Follow this detailed guide to complete the counseling process and secure admission in teacher training institut', '<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh UP DELEd 2-Year Course Admissions 2024: Round I Online Counseling Registration</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>Uttar Pradesh Diploma in Elementary Education (UP DELEd)</strong> is a highly sought-after two-year teacher training program for aspiring educators in the state. The <strong>UP DELEd Admissions 2024 Round I Online Counseling</strong> process has commenced, providing candidates the opportunity to register and secure admissions in reputed teacher training institutes. This article covers all the essential details about the counseling process, important dates, and step-by-step registration guidance.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Overview of UP DELEd 2024 Admissions</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>UP DELEd</strong> program, previously known as <strong>BTC (Basic Training Certificate)</strong>, prepares candidates for teaching roles in primary and upper primary schools. The admission process is managed by the <strong>Exam Regulatory Authority, Uttar Pradesh</strong>, and counseling is conducted in multiple rounds.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Conducting Body:</strong> Exam Regulatory Authority, Uttar Pradesh</li>\r\n<li><strong>Course Duration:</strong> 2 Years</li>\r\n<li><strong>Admission Mode:</strong> Online Counseling</li>\r\n<li><strong>Official Website:</strong> <a href=\"http://updeled.gov.in\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">updeled.gov.in</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Dates for UP DELEd 2024 Round I Counseling</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; width: 21.3037%; height: 180px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); width: 52.8724%; height: 18px;\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); width: 25.8861%; height: 18px;\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.8724%; height: 36px;\">Online Registration Start Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 25.8861%; height: 36px;\">January 2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.8724%; height: 36px;\">Last Date for Registration</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 25.8861%; height: 36px;\">February 2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.8724%; height: 36px;\">Choice Filling and Locking</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 25.8861%; height: 36px;\">February 2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.8724%; height: 36px;\">Seat Allotment Result</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 25.8861%; height: 36px;\">February 2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px; height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 52.8724%; height: 18px;\">Reporting to Allotted Institute</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 25.8861%; height: 18px;\">March 2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><em>Note: Dates are tentative and subject to official confirmation.</em></p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria for UP DELEd Counseling</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Candidates who wish to participate in the counseling process must meet the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Qualification:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A bachelor&rsquo;s degree in any discipline with a minimum of 50% marks (45% for reserved categories).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Age Limit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Minimum: 18 years</li>\r\n<li>Maximum: 35 years (Age relaxation as per UP Government norms).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Entrance Examination:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must have qualified for the UP DELEd Entrance Exam 2024 and obtained a valid merit rank.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>How to Register for UP DELEd Round I Counseling 2024?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Follow these steps to register for Round I of the UP DELEd Counseling process:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Visit the Official Website:</strong><br>Go to the UP DELEd portal at <a href=\"http://updeled.gov.in\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">updeled.gov.in</a>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Login/Registration:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Click on the \"Counseling Registration\" link.</li>\r\n<li>Login using your credentials (registration number and password).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Fee Payment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pay the counseling registration fee online via debit/credit card, net banking, or UPI.</li>\r\n<li>Save the payment receipt for future reference.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Choice Filling and Locking:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Select your preferred training institutes from the list.</li>\r\n<li>Lock your choices to finalize the submission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Submit and Download:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Review the form before submitting it.</li>\r\n<li>Download the confirmation page and take a printout.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Seat Allotment Process</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Merit-Based Allotment:</strong><br>Seats are allocated based on the candidate&rsquo;s rank in the UP DELEd Entrance Exam and the preferences submitted during the choice-filling stage.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Allotment Result:</strong><br>Candidates can check the seat allotment result on the official website by logging into their account.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Reporting to Institutes:</strong><br>After allotment, candidates must report to the allotted institute with the required documents for verification.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Documents Required for Admission</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>UP DELEd Entrance Exam Admit Card and Scorecard</li>\r\n<li>Counseling Registration Slip</li>\r\n<li>Class 10th and 12th Mark Sheets</li>\r\n<li>Bachelor&rsquo;s Degree Certificate and Mark Sheet</li>\r\n<li>Caste Certificate (if applicable)</li>\r\n<li>Domicile Certificate</li>\r\n<li>Identity Proof (Aadhar Card, Voter ID, etc.)</li>\r\n<li>Passport-Sized Photographs</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Key Benefits of UP DELEd Course</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Career in Teaching:</strong> Completion of the course enables candidates to apply for teaching roles in primary and upper primary schools.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Professional Development:</strong> Focuses on child pedagogy, classroom management, and teaching methodologies.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Government Job Opportunities:</strong> Opens doors to secure teaching jobs in government schools.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Preparation Tips for Counseling and Admission</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Document Readiness:</strong> Ensure all required documents are complete and verified.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Choice Prioritization:</strong> Select institutes based on your preferences and rank.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Stay Updated:</strong> Regularly check the official website for updates and announcements.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>UP DELEd Counseling 2024</strong> is a crucial step for candidates aspiring to pursue a career in teaching. By following the registration guidelines and preparing necessary documents in advance, you can secure admission to a reputed teacher training institute. Stay focused, and ensure timely completion of the counseling process to kickstart your journey in the field of education.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">For more details, visit the official website <a href=\"http://updeled.gov.in\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">updeled.gov.in</a>.</p>', '1736277811-94060820-e843-44eb-a501-9008ee12eda0.webp', '15', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-07 00:00:00', '2025-01-07 19:23:31', 'Approved', 'UP DELEd 2024 Admissions, UP DELEd Online Counseling, Uttar Pradesh DELEd Round I Registration, UP DELEd Counseling Process 2024, UP BTC 2024 Admissions, UP DELEd Entrance Exam Counseling, How to Apply for UP DELEd 2024, DELEd Counseling Dates 2024, Teacher Training Admission UP, UP DELEd Choice Filling'),
(390, 'Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025: Download Your BSEB Intermediate Hall Ticket', 'The Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) has released the admit cards for the Class 12 practical exams, scheduled from January 10 to 20, 2025. School heads can download the admit cards from the official website and distribute them to students. The a', '<div>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025: Download, Dates, and Key Details</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) is set to release the Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025. Students eagerly preparing for their Intermediate examinations should be aware of the release date, download procedure, and critical instructions regarding their admit cards. This article provides detailed information to help you navigate the admit card process seamlessly.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Overview of Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The admit card is a mandatory document for all students appearing in the Bihar Board 12th exams. Without it, students will not be allowed to sit for their examinations. The admit card serves as proof of registration and provides essential details like exam dates, roll number, and the designated examination center.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Dates for Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Release of Admit Card</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025 (Tentative)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Final Exams Start Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">February 2025 (Expected)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The board will issue the admit cards on its official portal: <a target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">biharboardonline.bihar.gov.in</a>. Students are advised to stay updated and download the admit card as soon as it becomes available.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Steps to Download Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Here is the step-by-step guide to downloading your admit card:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Visit the Official Website</strong>: Open <a target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">biharboardonline.bihar.gov.in</a> in your browser.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Navigate to the Admit Card Section</strong>: Click on the \"Intermediate Admit Card 2025\" link available on the homepage.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Login Credentials</strong>: Enter your registration number, school code, and date of birth as required.</li>\r\n<li><strong>View and Verify Details</strong>: Check all the information displayed on the admit card.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Download and Print</strong>: Save the admit card and print multiple copies for safety.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Details Mentioned on the Admit Card</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025 includes the following details:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Name of the Student</li>\r\n<li>Roll Number</li>\r\n<li>Registration Number</li>\r\n<li>School Name</li>\r\n<li>Subject-wise Exam Dates and Timings</li>\r\n<li>Exam Center Address</li>\r\n<li>Instructions for the Exam Day</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Ensure all details are accurate. In case of discrepancies, contact your school authorities immediately.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Key Instructions for Students</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Carry the Admit Card</strong>: Always bring the admit card to the exam center along with a valid ID proof.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Follow Exam Timings</strong>: Reach the center at least 30 minutes before the reporting time mentioned.</li>\r\n<li><strong>No Restricted Items</strong>: Avoid carrying any electronic gadgets, calculators, or unauthorized material.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Stationery Requirements</strong>: Bring your own pens, pencils, and other required items.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>What to Do If You Face Issues?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">If students encounter problems downloading their admit cards, they can approach their respective schools or contact the BSEB helpline for guidance. Ensure you resolve issues well in advance to avoid last-minute stress.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>FAQs about Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>1. When will the Bihar Board 12th admit card 2025 be released?</strong><br>The admit card is expected to be released in January 2025.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>2. Can I change my exam center after the admit card is issued?</strong><br>No, changes in the exam center are not allowed once the admit card is issued.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>3. What should I do if there is an error on my admit card?</strong><br>Contact your school authorities immediately to correct the error.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025 is a crucial document for all Intermediate students. Make sure to download it as soon as it is released and check it for accuracy. Proper preparation and adherence to the guidelines will ensure a smooth exam experience.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">For the latest updates, stay tuned to the official Bihar Board website and this page. Wishing all students the best of luck for their exams!</p>\r\n</div>', '1736434845-Bihar-Board-12th-Admit-Card-2025.webp', '14', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-09 00:00:00', '2025-01-09 15:00:45', 'Approved', 'Bihar Board 12th Admit Card 2025, BSEB Intermediate Hall Ticket 2025, Bihar Board Inter Admit Card Download, BSEB 12th Exam Admit Card, Bihar Board Class 12 Admit Card Release Date'),
(391, 'Gram Panchayat New Vacancy 2025: Apply for Panchayati Raj Jobs Today!', 'Gram Panchayat Vacancies for 2025! Multiple posts under the Panchayati Raj system are open for recruitment, including Gram Sevak, Clerk, and Junior Engineer positions. Apply now to contribute to rural development. Check eligibility, important dates, ', '<div>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Gram Panchayat New Vacancy 2025: Latest Recruitment Updates and Application Process</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Gram Panchayats play a vital role in rural development and governance, offering various government job opportunities at the grassroots level. The <strong>Gram Panchayat New Vacancy 2025</strong> notification has brought exciting opportunities for candidates aspiring to serve in roles like Panchayat Secretary, Assistant, and Development Officers. This article provides in-depth information about the vacancies, eligibility criteria, application process, and important dates.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Overview of Gram Panchayat New Vacancy 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Gram Panchayat recruitment drives are conducted annually to fill critical positions for effective administration and development in rural areas. These jobs not only offer stability and growth but also provide an opportunity to contribute to society.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Key highlights of the Gram Panchayat New Vacancy 2025:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Posts Available</strong>: Panchayat Secretary, Village Development Officer, Junior Engineer, Data Entry Operator, and more.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Job Type</strong>: Government (Permanent/Contractual based on post).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Application Mode</strong>: Online and Offline (depending on the state).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Salary Range</strong>: â‚¹15,000 to â‚¹50,000 per month (based on position and qualifications).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Release of Notification</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Application Start Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">February 2025 (Tentative)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">March 2025 (Tentative)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Examination/Interview Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">April-May 2025 (Expected)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">To apply for Gram Panchayat jobs, candidates must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Qualification</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>10th/12th Pass</strong>: For entry-level roles like Data Entry Operators or Assistants.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Graduate/Postgraduate</strong>: For higher posts like Panchayat Secretary and Engineers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Age Limit</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Minimum: 18 years</li>\r\n<li>Maximum: 40 years (Relaxation for SC/ST/OBC/PwD as per government norms).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Additional Skills</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Computer proficiency for data-related roles.</li>\r\n<li>Experience in governance or development sectors is a plus.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>How to Apply for Gram Panchayat New Vacancy 2025?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Follow these steps to complete your application process:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Visit the Official Website</strong>: Each state releases its Panchayat job notifications on their respective government portals. Example: <a href=\"http://www.panchayat.gov.in/\">www.panchayat.gov.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Locate the Recruitment Section</strong>: Click on the &ldquo;Recruitment&rdquo; or &ldquo;Careers&rdquo; tab.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Download Notification</strong>: Read the detailed advertisement carefully to ensure eligibility.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Fill Out the Application Form</strong>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Online: Fill in personal details, upload required documents, and submit.</li>\r\n<li>Offline: Download the form, fill it out, and send it to the specified address.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pay Application Fee</strong>: Submit the fee through the preferred mode (if applicable).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Keep a Copy</strong>: Save or print the application form for future reference.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Selection Process</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The selection process for Gram Panchayat vacancies generally includes the following stages:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Written Examination</strong>: Objective-type questions on general knowledge, English, mathematics, and specific skills.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Skill Test/Practical Test</strong>: For posts requiring technical expertise or computer skills.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Interview/Personality Test</strong>: Final round for assessing candidates\' suitability for the role.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Why Apply for Gram Panchayat Jobs?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Stability</strong>: Government jobs offer long-term career security.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Opportunity to Contribute</strong>: Direct involvement in rural development and governance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Growth Prospects</strong>: Regular promotions and career advancement opportunities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>FAQs About Gram Panchayat New Vacancy 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Q1: When will the Gram Panchayat New Vacancy 2025 be released?</strong><br>The notifications are expected in January-February 2025.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Q2: Can I apply for multiple posts in the same recruitment cycle?</strong><br>Yes, if you meet the eligibility criteria for each post.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Q3: Is there an age relaxation for reserved categories?</strong><br>Yes, age relaxation is provided as per government norms.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The <strong>Gram Panchayat New Vacancy 2025</strong> offers a golden opportunity for individuals aiming for a stable government job in rural administration. Ensure you regularly check official notifications and complete the application process well before the deadline.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">For the latest updates on Gram Panchayat vacancies, stay tuned to trusted platforms like <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-kZ0eYXlJe-scholar-gpt/c/677fe2e7-3ac0-800b-99b9-8753c8da0355\">examinfo.blog</a>.</p>\r\n</div>', '1736435619-64f5263e-b7d5-43a4-9be0-c22e805f0873.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-09 00:00:00', '2025-01-09 15:13:39', 'Approved', 'Gram Panchayat Vacancy 2025, Panchayat Recruitment 2025, Gram Panchayat Jobs 2025, Rural Development Jobs 2025, Panchayati Raj Vacancies 2025, Gram Sevak Recruitment 2025, Gram Panchayat Online Application 2025');
