(392, 'Bihar Librarian Vacancy 2025: Apply Now for Latest Library Jobs', 'Bihar Librarian Vacancy for 2025. Find complete details on eligibility, application dates, exam patterns, and more. Donâ€™t miss this opportunity to secure your dream job as a librarian in Bihar!', '<h1 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Bihar Librarian Vacancy 2025: Apply Now for Upcoming Library Positions</h1>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Are you aspiring to become a librarian in Bihar? Exciting opportunities await as the <strong>Bihar Librarian Vacancy 2025</strong> notification is expected to be released soon. This guide will provide you with comprehensive information about the upcoming vacancies, eligibility criteria, application process, and preparation tips.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ“š <strong>Overview of Bihar Librarian Vacancy 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The Bihar government is planning to announce librarian vacancies for various public libraries, colleges, and educational institutions. The recruitment drive aims to fill librarian posts to enhance the state\'s library services and promote education.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Conducting Authority</strong>: Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Post Name</strong>: Librarian</li>\r\n<li><strong>Vacancies Expected</strong>: Approximately 200+ (subject to official notification)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Application Mode</strong>: Online</li>\r\n<li><strong>Official Website</strong>: <a target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">bpsc.bih.nic.in</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ“ <strong>Important Dates</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"margin-left: 40px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Tentative Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Notification Release</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">February 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Online Application Start</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">March 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">April 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Exam Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">June 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Result Announcement</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-left: 40px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">August 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ“– <strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Bachelor&rsquo;s or Master&rsquo;s degree in Library Science or Information Science.</li>\r\n<li>UGC NET in Library and Information Science is desirable.</li>\r\n<li>Relevant work experience (preferred for higher positions).</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Age Limit</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Minimum Age</strong>: 21 years</li>\r\n<li><strong>Maximum Age</strong>: 37 years (General category)</li>\r\n<li>Relaxation for SC/ST/OBC and other categories as per government rules.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ’¼ <strong>How to Apply</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Visit the official website of <strong>BPSC</strong>: <a target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">bpsc.bih.nic.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li>Look for the \"Bihar Librarian Recruitment 2025\" notification under the latest updates.</li>\r\n<li>Click on \"Apply Online\" and register using your basic details.</li>\r\n<li>Fill out the application form, upload required documents, and pay the application fee.</li>\r\n<li>Submit the application and download the confirmation for future reference.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ“‹ <strong>Selection Process</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The recruitment process for Bihar Librarian Vacancy 2025 will include the following stages:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Written Examination</strong>: Tests knowledge of library science, general awareness, and reasoning.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Interview</strong>: Evaluates personality, communication skills, and subject expertise.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Document Verification</strong>: Ensures the authenticity of submitted qualifications and certifications.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ† <strong>Preparation Tips</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Understand the Syllabus</strong>: Focus on core topics like library management, cataloging, indexing, and information technology in libraries.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Solve Previous Year Papers</strong>: Analyze question trends to understand the exam pattern.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Stay Updated</strong>: Follow current events and advancements in library science.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mock Tests</strong>: Regularly practice mock exams to improve speed and accuracy.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ”” <strong>Why Apply for Bihar Librarian Post?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Attractive salary as per 7th Pay Commission.</li>\r\n<li>Opportunities for career growth and skill enhancement.</li>\r\n<li>Contribution to educational and cultural development in Bihar.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ“Œ <strong>Key Points to Remember</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keep all necessary documents (educational certificates, photo, ID proof) ready.</li>\r\n<li>Double-check your application form for accuracy before submission.</li>\r\n<li>Stay updated with the official website for any changes or updates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">ðŸ–‡ï¸ <strong>FAQs</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>1. When will the notification for Bihar Librarian Vacancy 2025 be released?</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">The notification is expected in February 2025.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>2. Can final-year students apply?</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Yes, if they can provide proof of passing the degree before the final document verification.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>3. Is there an application fee?</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Yes, the fee will be mentioned in the official notification.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">By following the tips and guidelines provided in this article, candidates can successfully apply and prepare for the Bihar Librarian Vacancy 2025. Stay tuned for updates, and start your preparation today!</p>\r\n<hr style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>CTA</strong>: For more updates on government job notifications, bookmark <a href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\">ExamInfo Blog</a> and stay ahead in your career journey.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;</p>', '1736437124-887142c4-685f-43ab-abb8-bb5b28417365.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-09 00:00:00', '2025-01-09 15:38:44', 'Approved', 'Bihar Librarian Vacancy 2025, Bihar Library Jobs, Librarian Recruitment 2025, Bihar Librarian Notification, Apply Librarian Jobs 2025'),
(393, 'PM Vishwakarma Yojana 2025: â‚¹15,000 Toolkit Assistance Scheme', 'PM Vishwakarma Yojana 2025, offering â‚¹15,000 in financial assistance for toolkits to empower artisans and craftsmen. Learn about eligibility, application processes, and benefits under this transformative scheme aimed at enhancing traditional skills', '<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<p>Here&rsquo;s an SEO-optimized article for the topic <strong>PM Vishwakarma Yojana Toolkit: â‚¹15,000</strong>, tailored to rank on Google for your website:</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h1>PM Vishwakarma Yojana Toolkit 2025: Get â‚¹15,000 Financial Assistance</h1>\r\n<p>The <strong>PM Vishwakarma Yojana Toolkit</strong> is a flagship scheme launched by the Government of India to support artisans and craftsmen in preserving traditional skills. Under this scheme, eligible beneficiaries can receive financial assistance of â‚¹15,000 for purchasing toolkits to enhance their livelihood and productivity. This initiative aligns with the government&rsquo;s vision of promoting self-reliance and boosting the economy.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŒŸ <strong>What is PM Vishwakarma Yojana?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Launched in 2023 by Prime Minister Narendra Modi, the <strong>PM Vishwakarma Yojana</strong> focuses on empowering individuals involved in traditional crafts and trades, including carpenters, blacksmiths, goldsmiths, cobblers, and other artisans. The scheme not only offers financial aid for toolkits but also provides skill training, certification, and market support to improve their income and economic status.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ’° <strong>Toolkit Assistance of â‚¹15,000</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Under the scheme, a one-time <strong>grant of â‚¹15,000</strong> is provided to eligible artisans for purchasing advanced tools and equipment required in their trade. This toolkit support is designed to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Improve efficiency and quality of work.</li>\r\n<li>Enable artisans to adopt modern techniques.</li>\r\n<li>Enhance income potential.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ› ï¸ <strong>Who Can Benefit?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>PM Vishwakarma Yojana Toolkit</strong> targets individuals engaged in traditional trades, including but not limited to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Carpenters</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Blacksmiths</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Goldsmiths</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Cobbler/Leather Workers</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Weavers and Embroiderers</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Potters</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Stone Sculptors and Masons</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“ <strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To avail of the â‚¹15,000 toolkit assistance, beneficiaries must fulfill the following requirements:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Age Limit</strong>: 18&ndash;50 years.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Trade Involvement</strong>: Must belong to a traditional artisan family or community.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proof of Identity</strong>: Aadhaar card, caste certificate, or other valid documents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Bank Account</strong>: Active bank account linked to Aadhaar.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Training</strong>: Enroll in skill-upgradation training under the scheme.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸš€ <strong>How to Apply for PM Vishwakarma Yojana Toolkit?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Follow these steps to apply for the toolkit assistance:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Visit the Official Portal</strong>: Go to the scheme\'s official website or mobile app (details will be updated soon).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Register Yourself</strong>: Provide basic details like name, trade, and Aadhaar-linked mobile number.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Submit Required Documents</strong>: Upload proof of trade and identity documents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Verification</strong>: The application will be verified by the nodal officer.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Grant Approval</strong>: Once approved, the â‚¹15,000 amount will be directly credited to your bank account.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“‹ <strong>Documents Required</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Aadhaar card (linked to mobile number).</li>\r\n<li>Proof of trade (certificate or declaration).</li>\r\n<li>Caste/community certificate (if applicable).</li>\r\n<li>Bank account details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“ˆ <strong>Benefits of PM Vishwakarma Yojana Toolkit</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Skill Development</strong>: Beneficiaries will undergo training to enhance their skills.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Financial Support</strong>: A grant of â‚¹15,000 to purchase toolkits.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Market Linkage</strong>: Help in connecting with buyers and promoting products.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Increased Income</strong>: Better tools lead to higher productivity and earnings.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ–‡ï¸ <strong>FAQs on PM Vishwakarma Yojana Toolkit</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>1. Who can apply for the â‚¹15,000 toolkit assistance?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Individuals engaged in traditional trades such as carpentry, pottery, or weaving can apply.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>2. Is there an online application for the scheme?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Yes, applications can be submitted online through the official portal or app.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>3. Can existing beneficiaries apply again?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>No, the â‚¹15,000 grant is a one-time assistance per beneficiary.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŒŸ <strong>Why PM Vishwakarma Yojana is a Game-Changer?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The PM Vishwakarma Yojana empowers India&rsquo;s artisans and craftsmen by:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reviving traditional skills.</li>\r\n<li>Promoting self-reliance under the \"Atmanirbhar Bharat\" initiative.</li>\r\n<li>Boosting rural and small-scale economies.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ”” <strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>PM Vishwakarma Yojana Toolkit</strong> is a commendable step towards recognizing and supporting the backbone of India&rsquo;s artisanal heritage. If you&rsquo;re an artisan or craftsman, don&rsquo;t miss this golden opportunity to receive â‚¹15,000 for upgrading your tools and enhancing your livelihood.</p>\r\n<p>Stay tuned for updates and ensure you apply on time to secure the benefits!</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><strong>CTA</strong>: For the latest government schemes and updates, bookmark <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-kZ0eYXlJe-scholar-gpt/c/677fea79-50b0-8006-929c-af5aa97c4bb1\">ExamInfo Blog</a> and stay informed about opportunities to grow your career and business.</p>\r\n</div>', '1736437634-9bed5ad5-dfc5-4b4d-8a98-296d1e53cc68.webp', '18', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-09 00:00:00', '2025-01-09 15:47:14', 'Approved', 'PM Vishwakarma Yojana 2025, â‚¹15000 Toolkit Scheme, PM Vishwakarma Scheme, Vishwakarma Toolkit Assistance, Government Support for Artisans 2025, Skill Development Scheme 2025'),
(394, 'Central Bank Peon Vacancy 2025: Recruitment for 10th Pass Candidates', 'Apply for Central Bank Peon Vacancy 2025! Openings for 10th pass candidates with great benefits and career growth opportunities. Check eligibility, application dates, and selection process.', '<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<p>Here\'s an SEO-optimized article tailored for the topic <strong>Central Bank Peon New Vacancy 2025</strong> to rank well on Google for your website:</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h1>Central Bank Peon New Vacancy 2025: Apply for Latest Openings</h1>\r\n<p>Are you looking for a government job in the banking sector? The <strong>Central Bank of India</strong> has announced its <strong>Peon New Vacancy 2025</strong>, providing a golden opportunity for individuals seeking a stable and secure career. This article covers all the essential details, including eligibility, application process, and key dates for the recruitment process.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ¦ <strong>Overview of Central Bank Peon Vacancy 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Central Bank of India</strong> is set to recruit eligible candidates for <strong>Peon posts</strong> across multiple branches in India. These vacancies are ideal for those seeking entry-level jobs in banking without advanced qualifications.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Organization Name</strong>: Central Bank of India</li>\r\n<li><strong>Post Name</strong>: Peon</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Vacancies</strong>: Expected 500+ (to be confirmed in the official notification)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Application Mode</strong>: Online</li>\r\n<li><strong>Job Location</strong>: Across India</li>\r\n<li><strong>Official Website</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.centralbankofindia.co.in/\">centralbankofindia.co.in</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ—“ï¸ <strong>Important Dates</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Tentative Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Notification Release</td>\r\n<td>February 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Online Application Start</td>\r\n<td>March 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td>April 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Admit Card Release</td>\r\n<td>May 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Exam Date</td>\r\n<td>June 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Result Announcement</td>\r\n<td>July 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“– <strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must have passed <strong>10th grade (Matriculation)</strong> from a recognized board.</li>\r\n<li>Higher qualifications (e.g., graduate or postgraduate degrees) are <strong>not required</strong> and may disqualify the applicant.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Age Limit</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Minimum Age</strong>: 18 years</li>\r\n<li><strong>Maximum Age</strong>: 28 years</li>\r\n<li>Age relaxation is applicable for SC/ST/OBC/PH candidates as per government rules.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Other Requirements</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Basic knowledge of reading and writing in the local language.</li>\r\n<li>Candidates must reside in the district where the job is located.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ’¼ <strong>Job Responsibilities of a Peon</strong></h3>\r\n<p>As a <strong>Peon in the Central Bank of India</strong>, your responsibilities will include:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Supporting daily banking operations.</li>\r\n<li>Handling clerical tasks like delivering documents and assisting in routine office activities.</li>\r\n<li>Maintaining cleanliness and upkeep of the office.</li>\r\n<li>Assisting bank staff in day-to-day operations.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ’° <strong>Salary and Benefits</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The Central Bank Peon position offers a <strong>monthly salary of â‚¹18,000 to â‚¹22,000</strong>, along with additional benefits such as:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Provident Fund (PF)</li>\r\n<li>Gratuity</li>\r\n<li>Health Insurance</li>\r\n<li>Leave allowances</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“ <strong>How to Apply for Central Bank Peon Vacancy 2025?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Follow these steps to complete your application:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Visit the Official Website</strong>: Go to <a href=\"https://www.centralbankofindia.co.in/\">centralbankofindia.co.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Register</strong>: Click on the &ldquo;Recruitment&rdquo; section and register using your email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Fill the Application Form</strong>: Provide your personal details, educational qualifications, and other required information.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Upload Documents</strong>: Attach scanned copies of your photo, signature, and educational certificates.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Submit Application Fee</strong>: Pay the application fee (if applicable) via online payment modes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Download Confirmation</strong>: Save and print the application form for future reference.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ› ï¸ <strong>Selection Process</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The recruitment process for <strong>Central Bank Peon Vacancy 2025</strong> will include the following stages:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Written Examination</strong>: Objective-type questions on basic English, reasoning, and general awareness.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Document Verification</strong>: Verification of eligibility and educational qualifications.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Medical Fitness Test</strong>: Ensuring the candidate meets health requirements.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“‹ <strong>Documents Required for Application</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>10th-grade mark sheet and certificate.</li>\r\n<li>Government-issued ID proof (Aadhaar card, voter ID, etc.).</li>\r\n<li>Caste certificate (if applicable).</li>\r\n<li>Domicile certificate for the state/district.</li>\r\n<li>Passport-sized photographs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŽ¯ <strong>Preparation Tips for the Exam</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Understand the Exam Pattern</strong>: Focus on basic-level questions on reasoning, general awareness, and mathematics.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Practice Previous Year Papers</strong>: Analyze the type of questions asked in earlier exams.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Stay Updated</strong>: Follow daily current affairs to score well in the general awareness section.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Time Management</strong>: Practice mock tests to improve speed and accuracy.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ”” <strong>Why Choose Central Bank Peon Job?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Stable Government Job</strong>: Offers job security and regular income.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Growth Opportunities</strong>: Promotions and internal exams for career advancement.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Work-Life Balance</strong>: Ideal for individuals seeking a stress-free work environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ–‡ï¸ <strong>FAQs on Central Bank Peon Vacancy 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>1. Can I apply if I have completed graduation?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>No, this vacancy is specifically for candidates with a maximum qualification of 10th grade.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>2. Is there an application fee?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Yes, the fee details will be mentioned in the official notification.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>3. What is the job location?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The job location will be in the candidate&rsquo;s respective district or nearby branches.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŒŸ <strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Central Bank Peon New Vacancy 2025</strong> is an excellent opportunity for 10th-pass candidates to secure a government job. Make sure to check the official website for updates and complete your application within the stipulated time. Start your preparation early to increase your chances of selection!</p>\r\n<p>For more details, bookmark <strong>ExamInfo Blog</strong> and stay ahead with the latest government job notifications.</p>\r\n<hr></div>', '1736437997-87a8847c-4ace-4b80-87c3-85acf6e11c71.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-09 00:00:00', '2025-01-09 15:53:17', 'Approved', 'Central Bank Peon Vacancy 2025, Central Bank Recruitment 2025, Peon Jobs 2025, Central Bank Peon Job for 10th Pass, Government Jobs 2025, Central Bank Job Notification'),
(395, 'Pan Card 2.0: How to Apply and Benefits', 'Pan Card 2.0 is here! Discover the upgraded version of the Pan Card with advanced features. Learn how to apply online and explore its benefits for secure and efficient transactions.', '<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h1>Pan Card 2.0: The Next-Generation Identity Tool</h1>\r\n<p>The <strong>Pan Card 2.0</strong> is the latest innovation by the Indian Government aimed at making financial transactions and identity verification more secure, efficient, and accessible in the digital age. This upgraded version of the traditional PAN (Permanent Account Number) card introduces advanced features, integrating cutting-edge technology with enhanced usability.</p>\r\n<p>If you&rsquo;re curious about what makes <strong>Pan Card 2.0</strong> unique and how it will impact your financial life, this article covers everything from its features to the application process.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŒŸ <strong>What is Pan Card 2.0?</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>Pan Card 2.0</strong> is the revamped version of the traditional PAN card, incorporating digital features like QR codes, NFC (Near Field Communication) technology, and tamper-proof elements. It ensures easier verification, reduced fraud, and faster transactions, marking a significant step towards India\'s digital transformation.</p>\r\n<p>The upgraded PAN card is linked seamlessly with Aadhaar and supports instant authentication across financial and government platforms.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“‹ <strong>Key Features of Pan Card 2.0</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Embedded QR Code</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Contains encrypted details like name, date of birth, and PAN number for quick scanning and verification.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>NFC-Enabled</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Allows contactless transactions and data sharing with authorized devices.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Tamper-Proof Design</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made with advanced materials to prevent duplication and fraud.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Digital Integration</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Linked with Aadhaar, making verification processes more seamless and efficient.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Instant Issuance</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pan Card 2.0 can be generated digitally within minutes through e-KYC verification.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Multi-Purpose Usability</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Serves as a financial and identity verification tool for banking, taxation, and government services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“ <strong>Why Do You Need Pan Card 2.0?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The introduction of <strong>Pan Card 2.0</strong> is a game-changer for individuals and businesses alike:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Enhanced Security</strong>: Reduces fraud and identity theft through encrypted data and tamper-proof design.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Faster Transactions</strong>: Simplifies the process of financial transactions, especially for online platforms.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Convenience</strong>: Instant issuance and digital accessibility make it user-friendly.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mandatory for Compliance</strong>: Just like the traditional PAN, it is essential for filing income tax returns, opening bank accounts, and other financial activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ› ï¸ <strong>How to Apply for Pan Card 2.0?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Applying for <strong>Pan Card 2.0</strong> is easy and can be done online or offline. Here&rsquo;s a step-by-step guide:</p>\r\n<h4><strong>Online Process</strong></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Visit the official <strong>NSDL</strong> or <strong>UTIITSL</strong> website.</li>\r\n<li>Select the option for \"Pan Card 2.0 Application.\"</li>\r\n<li>Fill in your personal and contact details.</li>\r\n<li>Upload the required documents (Aadhaar card, proof of address, and proof of identity).</li>\r\n<li>Pay the application fee via online modes like UPI, debit/credit card, or net banking.</li>\r\n<li>Complete e-KYC authentication using Aadhaar-linked OTP.</li>\r\n<li>Download your digital Pan Card 2.0 or wait for the physical card to be delivered.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h4><strong>Offline Process</strong></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Visit your nearest PAN facilitation center.</li>\r\n<li>Submit the Pan Card 2.0 application form with required documents.</li>\r\n<li>Pay the application fee in cash or via other accepted methods.</li>\r\n<li>Collect the acknowledgment receipt for tracking your application status.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ–‡ï¸ <strong>Documents Required</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Aadhaar card (for e-KYC and address proof).</li>\r\n<li>Passport-size photograph.</li>\r\n<li>Proof of date of birth (birth certificate, 10th-grade certificate, etc.).</li>\r\n<li>Identity proof (passport, voter ID, or driving license).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ”” <strong>Benefits of Pan Card 2.0</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Universal Identity Tool</strong>: Acts as a single point of identity verification across government and financial platforms.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Eco-Friendly</strong>: Digital issuance reduces paper wastage.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Time-Saving</strong>: Instant PAN generation speeds up processes like account opening and IT returns filing.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Global Usability</strong>: Accepted for overseas financial transactions and compliance.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“‰ <strong>How is Pan Card 2.0 Different from the Traditional PAN Card?</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; width: 29.02%; height: 126px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 20.5194%; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Feature</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.5002%; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Traditional PAN Card</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.1526%; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Pan Card 2.0</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 20.5194%; height: 18px;\"><strong>Design</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.5002%; height: 18px;\">Simple printed card</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.1526%; height: 18px;\">Tamper-proof advanced design</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 20.5194%; height: 18px;\"><strong>Verification</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.5002%; height: 18px;\">Manual</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.1526%; height: 18px;\">Digital with QR code</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 20.5194%; height: 18px;\"><strong>Usability</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.5002%; height: 18px;\">Limited to financial services</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.1526%; height: 18px;\">Multi-purpose (taxation, ID)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 20.5194%; height: 18px;\"><strong>Technology</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.5002%; height: 18px;\">Basic</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.1526%; height: 18px;\">QR Code, NFC-enabled</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 20.5194%; height: 36px;\"><strong>Issuance Time</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 36.5002%; height: 36px;\">Takes days</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.1526%; height: 36px;\">Instant digital issuance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“ˆ <strong>Who Should Upgrade to Pan Card 2.0?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Existing PAN Holders</strong>: Upgrade to access the advanced features of Pan Card 2.0.</li>\r\n<li><strong>First-Time Applicants</strong>: Automatically issued Pan Card 2.0 when applying for a new PAN.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Businesses</strong>: Essential for compliance with GST and income tax regulations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ–‡ï¸ <strong>FAQs on Pan Card 2.0</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>1. Is it mandatory to upgrade to Pan Card 2.0?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>No, but it is highly recommended for better usability and security.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>2. Can I use my old PAN card?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Yes, the traditional PAN card remains valid, but upgrading is beneficial.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>3. What is the cost of Pan Card 2.0?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The fees are expected to be nominal and similar to the traditional PAN card issuance fee.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŒŸ <strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Pan Card 2.0</strong> is a revolutionary step toward making financial systems more robust, secure, and user-friendly. With its advanced features, it simplifies transactions and enhances identity verification processes. Whether you&rsquo;re an individual or a business, upgrading to Pan Card 2.0 ensures you stay ahead in the digital age.</p>\r\n<p>Apply today and experience the future of financial identity management!</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><strong>CTA</strong>: Stay updated on government schemes and innovations by bookmarking <strong>ExamInfo Blog</strong> and never miss an important update.</p>\r\n<hr></div>', '1736438476-2fd923bb-c208-4ea7-b33b-14fb4f775814.webp', '18', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-09 00:00:00', '2025-01-09 16:01:16', 'Approved', 'Pan Card 2.0, Apply for Pan Card 2.0, Benefits of Pan Card 2.0, Digital Pan Card, Pan Card New Version, Pan Card 2.0 Online Application'),
(396, 'NSP Scholarship 2025: Step-by-Step Online Application Guide', 'how to apply online for the NSP Scholarship 2025 through the National Scholarship Portal. This comprehensive guide covers eligibility criteria, the application process, and key benefits to help you secure financial aid for your education.', '<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h1>NSP Scholarship 2025: Apply Online and Secure Your Future</h1>\r\n<p>The <strong>National Scholarship Portal (NSP)</strong> is a one-stop solution for students seeking financial assistance for their education. Every year, the Government of India provides a variety of scholarships through the NSP to support deserving students from economically weaker sections. The <strong>NSP Scholarship 2025</strong> is now open for applications, offering an easy and seamless online process to apply.</p>\r\n<p>This article will guide you through the eligibility criteria, application process, and key details for <strong>NSP Scholarship 2025</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŒŸ <strong>What is NSP Scholarship?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>National Scholarship Portal</strong> is an initiative by the Government of India to provide financial support to students at all levels of education&mdash;school, college, and university. Scholarships under NSP are funded by central and state governments and other organizations, ensuring transparency and efficiency in the distribution of funds.</p>\r\n<p>The NSP aims to reduce dropout rates by enabling students from underprivileged backgrounds to continue their education.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ—“ï¸ <strong>Important Dates for NSP Scholarship 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Start of Online Applications</td>\r\n<td>January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td>March 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Document Verification Deadline</td>\r\n<td>April 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Disbursement of Scholarships</td>\r\n<td>June 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“ <strong>Eligibility Criteria for NSP Scholarship 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To apply for the NSP Scholarship, students must fulfill the following criteria:</p>\r\n<h4><strong>1. Academic Level</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Scholarships are available for students in Class 1 to PhD.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum <strong>50% marks</strong> in the previous academic year (varies by scheme).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>2. Family Income</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Family income should not exceed â‚¹2.5 lakh annually for most schemes.</li>\r\n<li>Income criteria may vary for state-specific and minority scholarships.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>3. Categories Covered</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>SC, ST, OBC, and Minority students.</li>\r\n<li>General category students under specific income slabs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>4. Other Criteria</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The applicant must be a regular student in a recognized institution.</li>\r\n<li>Scholarships are not applicable for distance education programs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ–‡ï¸ <strong>Documents Required</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Before applying, ensure you have the following documents:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Aadhaar Card or Enrollment ID.</li>\r\n<li>Income Certificate (issued by a competent authority).</li>\r\n<li>Caste Certificate (for SC/ST/OBC students).</li>\r\n<li>Previous Academic Marksheet.</li>\r\n<li>Bank Passbook (with account linked to Aadhaar).</li>\r\n<li>Domicile Certificate.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ’» <strong>How to Apply Online for NSP Scholarship 2025?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Here&rsquo;s a step-by-step guide to applying for the NSP Scholarship 2025:</p>\r\n<h4><strong>Step 1: Visit the Official Portal</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Go to the <strong>National Scholarship Portal</strong>: <a href=\"https://scholarships.gov.in/\">scholarships.gov.in</a>.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>Step 2: Register as a New User</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Click on the <strong>&ldquo;New Registration&rdquo;</strong> button.</li>\r\n<li>Read and accept the instructions before proceeding.</li>\r\n<li>Provide basic details like name, date of birth, and mobile number to create a profile.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Step 3: Login and Complete the Application</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Use your registration ID and password to log in.</li>\r\n<li>Fill out the application form with personal, academic, and contact details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Step 4: Upload Documents</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Scan and upload all required documents in the specified format.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Step 5: Submit and Track Application</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Verify the details before submitting the application.</li>\r\n<li>Use the NSP portal to track your application status.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŽ“ <strong>Popular Schemes Under NSP Scholarship 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Pre-Matric Scholarships</strong>: For students in Classes 1&ndash;10 from minority communities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Post-Matric Scholarships</strong>: For students in Classes 11&ndash;12 and undergraduate levels.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Merit-Cum-Means Scholarships</strong>: For professional and technical course students.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Top-Class Education Scheme</strong>: For SC/ST students in premier institutions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Scholarships for Girls</strong>: Special schemes for female students to encourage education.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“ˆ <strong>Benefits of NSP Scholarship</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Financial Assistance</strong>: Covers tuition fees, maintenance, and other expenses.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Transparency</strong>: Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT) ensures no middlemen.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Wide Coverage</strong>: Scholarships for all levels, from primary to PhD.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ease of Access</strong>: Single portal for multiple scholarships.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ”” <strong>Why Should You Apply for NSP Scholarship 2025?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>NSP Scholarship</strong> provides a lifeline to students who wish to continue their education but face financial difficulties. By applying for this scholarship, students can:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Focus on their studies without worrying about expenses.</li>\r\n<li>Gain access to better resources and educational opportunities.</li>\r\n<li>Contribute to their family&rsquo;s economic upliftment through education.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ–‡ï¸ <strong>FAQs on NSP Scholarship 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>1. What is the last date to apply for NSP Scholarship 2025?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The last date to apply is <strong>March 2025</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>2. Can I apply for more than one scholarship under NSP?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>No, students can apply for only one scholarship at a time.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>3. When will the scholarship amount be credited?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The amount will be disbursed directly into the student&rsquo;s bank account by <strong>June 2025</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>4. Is Aadhaar mandatory for application?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Yes, Aadhaar is required for authentication and DBT.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŒŸ <strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>NSP Scholarship 2025</strong> is a valuable initiative to support students in achieving their academic dreams. Don&rsquo;t miss this opportunity to secure financial assistance for your education. Start your application process today on <a href=\"https://scholarships.gov.in/\">scholarships.gov.in</a>.</p>\r\n<p>For more updates on scholarships and educational opportunities, bookmark <strong>ExamInfo Blog</strong> and stay informed!</p>\r\n</div>', '1736439122-d1b236b7-35e9-448b-a530-e12cbe3b9bc7.webp', '18', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-09 00:00:00', '2025-01-09 16:12:02', 'Approved', 'NSP Scholarship 2025, Apply for NSP Scholarship 2025, National Scholarship Portal 2025, NSP Online Application Process, Scholarship Eligibility 2025, Benefits of NSP Scholarship, Scholarship Guide 2025');
INSERT INTO `post` (`post_id`, `title`, `sort_details`, `description`, `post_img`, `category`, `author`, `postStatus`, `post_date`, `last_update`, `remarks`, `post_keywords`) VALUES
(397, 'Indian Army SSC Technical Recruitment 2025 (381 Posts)', 'Apply online for the Indian Army SSC Technical Recruitment 2025. With 381 vacancies available, explore the eligibility criteria, application process, and benefits of joining the Indian Army as a technical officer.', '<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><hr>\r\n<h1>Indian Army SSC Technical Recruitment 2025: Apply Online for 381 Posts</h1>\r\n<p>The <strong>Indian Army</strong> has announced the recruitment for <strong>Short Service Commission (SSC) Technical posts</strong> for both men and women. This is a golden opportunity for engineering graduates who aspire to serve the nation in a technical role. With <strong>381 vacancies</strong> available, candidates can now apply online for <strong>Indian Army SSC Technical 2025</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>This article provides complete details about eligibility, the application process, important dates, and more.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŒŸ <strong>Indian Army SSC Technical 2025 Overview</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Conducting Authority</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\">Indian Army</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">SSC (Technical)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Total Vacancies</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">381</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Application Mode</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Job Location</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Across India</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Official Website</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a href=\"https://joinindianarmy.nic.in/\">joinindianarmy.nic.in</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ—“ï¸ <strong>Important Dates</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Notification Release</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Online Application Start Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">February 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">SSB Interview Dates</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">March&ndash;April 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Final Merit List</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">June 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“ <strong>Vacancy Details</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; width: 23.3893%; height: 72px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 49.613%; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Category</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.6833%; height: 18px; background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Vacancies</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 49.613%; height: 18px;\">SSC (Tech) Men</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.6833%; height: 18px;\">307</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 49.613%; height: 18px;\">SSC (Tech) Women</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.6833%; height: 18px;\">33</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 49.613%; height: 18px;\">Widows of Defence Personnel</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.6833%; height: 18px;\">1 (Technical) + 40 (Non-Tech)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“– <strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>1. Educational Qualification</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must have completed <strong>B.E./B.Tech</strong> in the relevant engineering discipline from a recognized university.</li>\r\n<li>Final-year students can also apply, provided they submit proof of passing by the course commencement date.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>2. Age Limit</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>SSC (Tech) Men and Women</strong>: 20&ndash;27 years as of October 1, 2025.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Widows of Defence Personnel</strong>: Maximum age limit is 35 years.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>3. Marital Status</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Only unmarried candidates are eligible for SSC Technical posts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>4. Physical Standards</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must meet the physical and medical standards specified by the Indian Army.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ’» <strong>How to Apply Online for Indian Army SSC Technical 2025?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Follow these steps to complete your application process:</p>\r\n<h4><strong>Step 1: Registration</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visit the official website: <a href=\"https://joinindianarmy.nic.in/\">joinindianarmy.nic.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li>Click on &ldquo;<strong>Officers Entry Apply/Login</strong>&rdquo; and register with your email ID and mobile number.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Step 2: Fill the Application Form</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Login using your credentials.</li>\r\n<li>Complete the online application form with personal, academic, and contact details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Step 3: Upload Documents</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Upload scanned copies of your photograph, signature, and educational certificates in the prescribed format.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Step 4: Submit Application</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Double-check all details and submit the form.</li>\r\n<li>Download the acknowledgment for future reference.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ› ï¸ <strong>Selection Process</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The selection process for Indian Army SSC Technical Recruitment 2025 involves the following stages:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Shortlisting of Applications</strong>: Based on academic performance, applications are shortlisted for the next stage.</li>\r\n<li><strong>SSB Interview</strong>: A five-day selection process to evaluate personality, leadership skills, and technical knowledge.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Medical Examination</strong>: Candidates must clear medical fitness standards specified by the Indian Army.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Final Merit List</strong>: Prepared based on SSB performance and medical fitness.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ“‹ <strong>Documents Required</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Ensure you have the following documents ready for the application process:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Class 10th and 12th mark sheets for proof of date of birth.</li>\r\n<li>B.E./B.Tech degree or provisional certificate.</li>\r\n<li>Aadhaar card or other valid ID proof.</li>\r\n<li>Recent passport-sized photograph.</li>\r\n<li>NCC Certificate (if applicable).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ’° <strong>Pay Scale and Benefits</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Selected candidates will receive:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Stipend During Training</strong>: â‚¹56,100 per month.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pay Scale After Commission</strong>: â‚¹56,100&ndash;â‚¹1,77,500 per month (as per 7th Pay Commission).</li>\r\n<li>Additional allowances for transport, uniform, and field service.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Lifetime Pension</strong> after completing 10 years of service.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŽ¯ <strong>Preparation Tips for SSC Technical Recruitment</strong></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Understand the SSB Process</strong>: Familiarize yourself with the SSB interview stages, including psychological tests, group discussions, and personal interviews.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Stay Updated</strong>: Follow current affairs, especially defence-related topics.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Focus on Fitness</strong>: Meet the Indian Army\'s physical standards by maintaining a regular fitness routine.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Practice Problem Solving</strong>: Enhance your technical and logical reasoning skills.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mock Interviews</strong>: Practice with friends or professionals to build confidence.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ”” <strong>Why Join the Indian Army as SSC Technical?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Prestige and Honor</strong>: Serving in the Indian Army is a matter of pride.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Career Growth</strong>: Opportunities for promotion and specialization.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Financial Stability</strong>: Attractive pay and benefits, including post-retirement perks.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Leadership Development</strong>: Build lifelong leadership and decision-making skills.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸ–‡ï¸ <strong>FAQs on Indian Army SSC Technical Recruitment 2025</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>1. Can final-year students apply for SSC Technical posts?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Yes, final-year students can apply, provided they submit proof of passing by October 1, 2025.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>2. Is there an application fee?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>No, the application process for Indian Army SSC Technical posts is free of cost.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>3. What is the training period for SSC Technical officers?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The training period is <strong>49 weeks</strong> at the Officers Training Academy (OTA), Chennai.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>4. Is there a reservation for women candidates?</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Yes, a total of 33 vacancies are reserved for women candidates under SSC Technical.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3>ðŸŒŸ <strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Indian Army SSC Technical Recruitment 2025</strong> offers a prestigious career for engineering graduates who dream of serving the nation. With <strong>381 posts available</strong>, this is your chance to join one of the most respected organizations in the country.</p>\r\n<p>Apply online at <a href=\"https://joinindianarmy.nic.in/\">joinindianarmy.nic.in</a> and take the first step toward a fulfilling career.</p>\r\n<p>For more updates on government job notifications, bookmark <strong>ExamInfo Blog</strong> and stay ahead in your career journey.</p>\r\n</div>', '1736439817-4c3612ec-f483-48e1-858f-f44c8e6d9daa.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-09 00:00:00', '2025-01-09 16:23:37', 'Approved', 'Indian Army SSC Technical Recruitment 2025, Apply Online for SSC Technical 2025, Indian Army SSC 381 Vacancies, SSC Technical Jobs 2025, Indian Army Officer Recruitment 2025, Army Technical Officer Jobs'),
(398, 'AIIMS Group B & C Recruitment 2024: Apply Online for 4591 Posts', 'The All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS) has announced the Common Recruitment Examination (CRE) for 2024, offering 4591 vacancies in Group B and Group C positions across various AIIMS institutions and central government hospitals. Eligible', '<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3><strong>AIIMS Common Recruitment Exam (CRE) 2024: Apply Online for Group B &amp; Group C Posts (4591 Vacancies)</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS) has announced the <strong>AIIMS Common Recruitment Exam (CRE) 2024</strong>, inviting online applications for a total of <strong>4591 vacancies</strong> across <strong>Group B and Group C posts</strong>. This is a golden opportunity for candidates seeking prestigious positions in healthcare and administration at AIIMS.</p>\r\n<p>Let&rsquo;s explore the details of this recruitment drive, including key dates, eligibility criteria, and the application process.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Highlights of AIIMS Recruitment 2024</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Conducting Body</strong>: All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Name of Examination</strong>: AIIMS Common Recruitment Exam (CRE)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Post Categories</strong>: Group B and Group C</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Vacancies</strong>: 4591</li>\r\n<li><strong>Application Mode</strong>: Online</li>\r\n<li><strong>Job Location</strong>: Various AIIMS Institutes across India</li>\r\n<li><strong>Official Website</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.aiimsexams.ac.in/\">www.aiimsexams.ac.in</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Important Dates</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Notification Release Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2024</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Online Application Start</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>To be announced</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Last Date to Apply</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>To be announced</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Admit Card Release Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>To be announced</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Exam Date</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>To be announced</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Vacancy Details</strong></h3>\r\n<p>AIIMS has categorized these 4591 vacancies into <strong>Group B and Group C posts</strong>. Here&rsquo;s an overview of the roles available:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Group B Posts</strong>: Medical Laboratory Technologist, Assistant Nursing Superintendent, Technical Assistant, and others.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Group C Posts</strong>: Stenographer, Lower Division Clerk (LDC), and other non-technical posts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Detailed post-wise vacancies and reservations will be provided in the official notification.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>Educational Qualifications</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Group B Posts</strong>: Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or relevant diploma in the respective field from a recognized institution.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Group C Posts</strong>: Class 10th/12th pass with required typing or technical skills for specific roles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>Age Limit</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The minimum age is <strong>18 years</strong>, and the maximum varies based on the post (generally between <strong>27-35 years</strong>).</li>\r\n<li>Age relaxation is applicable as per government norms for SC/ST/OBC/PWD candidates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Application Process</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Follow these steps to apply for AIIMS Recruitment 2024:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Visit the Official Website</strong>: Go to <a href=\"https://www.aiimsexams.ac.in/\">www.aiimsexams.ac.in</a>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Registration</strong>: Click on the \"AIIMS CRE 2024 Recruitment\" link and complete the registration process with your basic details.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Filling Application Form</strong>: Log in with your credentials, fill in all mandatory fields, and upload necessary documents like a photograph, signature, and educational certificates.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment of Application Fee</strong>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>General/OBC: â‚¹1500</li>\r\n<li>SC/ST/PwD: â‚¹1200</li>\r\n<li>Payment can be made via online modes such as UPI, net banking, or credit/debit cards.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Submit Application</strong>: Double-check all details before final submission. Save a copy of the application form for future reference.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Selection Process</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The selection process includes the following stages:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Written Examination</strong>: Objective-type questions based on the post\'s domain and general aptitude.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Skill Test</strong> (if applicable): For positions like stenographer or typist.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Document Verification</strong>: Shortlisted candidates will need to present their original documents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Final Merit List</strong>: Based on performance in the written exam and skill test (if any).</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Exam Pattern</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The written examination pattern will include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>General Awareness</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Quantitative Aptitude</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>English Language</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Domain-Specific Questions</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Details of the syllabus and exam duration will be available in the official notification.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Benefits of Joining AIIMS</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Working at AIIMS offers unparalleled benefits:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Competitive salary as per the <strong>7th Pay Commission</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Opportunities for professional growth in the healthcare sector.</li>\r\n<li>Job security with additional perks like health insurance and retirement benefits.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aiimsexams.ac.in/\">Official Notification (To be updated)</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aiimsexams.ac.in/\">Apply Online (To be updated)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The AIIMS Common Recruitment Exam 2024 is a fantastic opportunity for individuals looking to build a career in one of India&rsquo;s most esteemed healthcare institutions. With 4591 vacancies, candidates from various educational backgrounds can secure a position that aligns with their skills and aspirations. Don&rsquo;t miss this chance&mdash;stay tuned to the official AIIMS website for updates and start preparing now!</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><em>For more updates on government exams and recruitment, stay connected with <a href=\"../../\">ExamInfo Blog</a>.</em></p>\r\n<hr></div>', '1736670770-bec9847a-4317-4e42-89e3-fae749bb0e46.webp', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-12 00:00:00', '2025-01-12 08:32:50', 'Approved', 'AIIMS recruitment 2024, AIIMS Group B jobs, AIIMS Group C vacancies, AIIMS CRE 2024, AIIMS online application 2024'),
(399, 'Indian Army NCC Special Entry Scheme 58th Course Recruitment 2025', 'The Indian Army invites applications for the NCC Special Entry Scheme 58th Course, commencing in October 2025. This recruitment offers opportunities for both men and women, including wards of battle casualties, to join as Short Service Commission Off', '<div style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<h3><strong>Indian Army NCC Special Entry Scheme 58th Course Recruitment 2025: Apply Now!</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Indian Army</strong> has announced the <strong>NCC Special Entry Scheme 58th Course (April 2025)</strong> for unmarried male and female candidates, including wards of battle casualties of Army personnel. This is a prestigious opportunity for NCC cadets to serve as officers in the Indian Army.</p>\r\n<p>Below is a detailed overview of the recruitment process, eligibility, and application details in a <strong>tabular format</strong> for better understanding.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Indian Army NCC Special Entry Scheme 2025: Overview</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th><strong>Feature</strong></th>\r\n<th><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Organization</strong></td>\r\n<td>Indian Army</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Course Name</strong></td>\r\n<td>NCC Special Entry Scheme 58th Course</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Total Vacancies</strong></td>\r\n<td>55 (50 for NCC Men, 5 for NCC Women)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Application Mode</strong></td>\r\n<td>Online</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Job Location</strong></td>\r\n<td>Across India</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Training Academy</strong></td>\r\n<td>Officers Training Academy (OTA), Chennai</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Official Website</strong></td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.joinindianarmy.nic.in/\">www.joinindianarmy.nic.in</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Important Dates</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Event</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Date</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Notification Release</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Online Application Start</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">January 2025 (Exact date TBD)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Last Date to Apply</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">February 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>SSB Interview</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">March - April 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Course Commencement</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">April 2025</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Category</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Nationality</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Indian</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Age Limit</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">19 to 25 years (as of April 2025)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Graduate from a recognized university with at least 50% marks (aggregate in all years). Final-year students can also apply.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>NCC Certificate</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Should hold a minimum <strong>â€˜Bâ€™ Grade</strong> in NCC â€˜Câ€™ Certificate.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Physical Standards</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">As per Indian Army guidelines.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Vacancy Details</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Category</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Number of Vacancies</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>NCC Men</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\">50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>NCC Women</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\">5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Application Process</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Step</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217);\"><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>1</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Visit the official Indian Army website: <a href=\"https://www.joinindianarmy.nic.in/\">www.joinindianarmy.nic.in</a>.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>2</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Click on the link for \"NCC Special Entry Scheme 58th Course\".</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>3</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register yourself using a valid email ID and mobile number.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>4</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete the online application form by providing personal and educational details.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>5</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Upload scanned copies of your photograph, signature, and relevant documents.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>6</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submit the application and take a printout for future reference.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Selection Process</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Stage</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"background-color: rgb(206, 212, 217); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Shortlisting of Applications</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Candidates will be shortlisted based on their academic performance and NCC â€˜Câ€™ certificate grade.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>SSB Interview</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Shortlisted candidates will be called for the SSB interview. The interview consists of two stages: psychological tests, group tasks, and a personal interview.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Candidates who clear the SSB interview will undergo a medical fitness test.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Final Merit List</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Prepared based on the performance in the SSB interview and medical examination.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Training and Stipend</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Training Duration</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Location</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Officers Training Academy (OTA), Chennai.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Duration</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">49 weeks.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Stipend</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">â‚¹56,100 per month during the training period.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Perks of Joining the Indian Army via NCC Special Entry</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Benefit</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Salary & Allowances</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Competitive pay scale as per 7th CPC.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Prestigious Career</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Opportunity to serve as an officer in the Indian Army.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Job Security</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Lifetime job security with post-retirement benefits.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Adventure Opportunities</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Access to exciting activities like mountaineering, paragliding, and more.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Key Links</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Link</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>URL</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Official Notification</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a href=\"https://www.joinindianarmy.nic.in/\">To be updated</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a href=\"https://www.joinindianarmy.nic.in/\">To be updated</a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The Indian Army NCC Special Entry Scheme 58th Course is a dream opportunity for dedicated NCC cadets aspiring to serve the nation as officers. With a streamlined selection process and numerous perks, this recruitment is a stepping stone to a prestigious and fulfilling career.</p>\r\n<p>Stay updated with <a href=\"https://www.tazblog.com/\">TazBlog</a> for more details on government job notifications, exam tips, and preparation strategies!</p>\r\n<hr></div>', '1746991534-NCC-55-Special-Entry-Scheme-Notification-Indian-Army-OTA-Chennai-APPLY-NOW-2-1024x576.jpg', '1', 1, 'Y', '2025-01-12 00:00:00', '2025-01-12 09:06:49', 'Approved', 'Indian Army recruitment 2025, NCC Special Entry 58th Course, Short Service Commission, Army jobs for NCC certificate holders, Defence jobs 2025');
